window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2701,"title":"Chapter 2701: Chapter 2700 {WEAK}! II","paragraphs":["2700 [WEAK]! II","The potential of all beings under the light-years long domain of Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority was unleashed.","Geniuses and those with unique Mutated Souls unveiled themselves- especially those who had their Aspects of Existence and Realms altered under Noah's hands!","Noah's main body viewed all of this calmly as even though beings like Henry and Lilith caught his eyes with their vibrantly shining wills, Noah's figure was already beside the Andromeda Cleaver.","[The 17th Havenly Boundary Layer of Andromeda has been attained!]","He was right in front of the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity as he couldn't grasp it with his hands.","So long as one didn't attain Extremity, they couldn't equip an Armament of Extremity!","'That is also a reality I want to shatter...'","His thoughts were wild and filled with tyranny as when he looked at the Andromeda Cleaver, his gaze towards it was a special one!","When he looked at this pristine treasure, his thought was a very simple one.","He was wrong.","He had underestimated the effects of his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage by a small margin, even though he analyzed and theorized how stupendous the extent of its effects would be.","But he was still in his mindset where the boons of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage were things he could already do effortlessly!","He still held a semblance of bias.","He knew his lineage would be transformative for others, but he had underestimated just how much.","He now knew this because after the actions of the Havenly Moon Clan trading a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity for Blood Sources, the Unrecorded Histories that Oraculum was viewing were currently buzzing with craziness as from them, Noah saw possibilities of another Armament of Extremity...maybe even two!","This...was not something Noah would have expected just hours ago.","And yet so many things had changed now as he was more confident than ever in breaking the Unscalable Wall of Extremity!","Once he did this, he would possess Eyes of Extremity and a Soul of Extremity.","Would he still not be capable of even grasping an Armament of Extremity then?","Noah didn't know for sure as it seemed the utilization of Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures was absolute, but regardless- the possible unfolding reality was a grand one.","He had a lot of ideas and things he had done over the last months.","But the Blood Source and the Infernal Havenly Commerce? They were undoubtedly one of his most Quintessential ones as they were about to usher in shocking changes.","But like all changes that had occurred before, none of them would have come to fruition had it not been for himself...and for the choices he made.","At this moment, he proceeded with his preparations to scale an unscalable wall as the first step was something he had sent out some time ago- 34 False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER to be exact!","34 Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER for 34 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities.","They crossed space and time through his will and blood as at this moment, he initiated their advancement and eruption in the hidden spatial domain that contained the main body of Seer Amestris and the affected Avernus Extremities!","—","[With this, we've lost the support and gained the ire of a potentially Zenith Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity in exchange for the eradication of a unique threat. He won't do anything against us, but this whole ordeal has been a great blow to the Avernus Clan. And the effects are still in their infancy as we have yet to handle the issue of the Blood Sources that all clans and Inheritances are doing everything to obtain.]","The voice of Seer Amestris was calm as her eyes were glazed with a golden purple light- as if she were piercing into the very veil of the Vitalis Annals of Extremity!","She could see a great deal of chaos still on the way as-","BZZT!","Her gaze instantly changed as she looked below.","DUM!","A heavy and foreboding sound of drums calling for destruction and death could be heard echoing out.","She felt an eruption of a disturbance on the bodies of all Tier 1 Avernus Extremities below as their deep healing state of recovery was disturbed, with Seer Amestris seeing everything that occurred in slow motion as her authority surged towards those closest to her!","She saw the somewhat stable Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures on the bodies of these Extremities flicker, and then opportunistically- the Rune Scripture that was protecting an area of a churning storm of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities...it buzzed before it was his by something and shattered!","The moment this occurred, it was as if a balloon had been popped.","...!","[No...!]","A sorrowing cry could be heard.","The storm of Vacuous and Vitalis exploded out at this gap along with the Records of the Avernus Extremity, a heavy and irreversible sense of instability caused as in other directions, the stable state of protection and homeostasis they had built was utterly destroyed as in succession, more of their Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures began to break down one after another, the deadly will Pathogenicity climbing across their Records gaining deeper and unchanging access!","This didn't occur with a single Tier 1 Avernus Extremity- but all 34 of them.","[Ow..!]","[HO!]","[NO!]","Seer Amestris' eyes flickered.","Booming shouts of shock and unwillingness exploded out as in rapid succession, all 34 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities were faced with perforations across their Aspects of Existence as their deepest Records were breached!","Deep within the Virion that affected them, the light of Quintessence and Lotra shone as their existence began to be broken down and turned into something else entirely.","Even when the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity Authority from Seer Amestris reached the Extremities closest to her...she could only wrap her Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures around them protectively as by this point...","BOOM!","It was too late.","Their records were heavily breached.","Their Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures lost their golden glow as Lotra rapidly wrapped around them.","When their very identity as an Extremity was breached and their Hyperversal Extremity Authority was broken down, they lost their sense of sense as everything around them was sucked into the core of their eroded records before it exploded out into a shower of stellar dust!","DUM!","A drum wrang out as if it foretold and ascertained the death of the first Tier I Avernus Extremity.","And in succession...","DUM! DUM! DUM!","Booming drums of valor and victory were disseminated one after another as the very Hyperversal Extremity Authority of 34 existences was broken down and devoured, with their bodies exploding into stellar dust right after.","It was a maddening scene that caused Seer Amestris' eyes to radiate a profound killing light!","It was a scene that caused the bodies of the Tier 2 and Tier 3 Avernus Extremities who were nearby to begin trembling!","Because the stellar dust of 34 Tier 1 Avernus Extremities moved as if it had a will- forming into shocking runic strokes that read out a single word.","The word caused booming anger to rise in the eyes of Seer Amestris while the figures of the remaining affected Avernus Extremities began to shake.","The stellar dust of the decimated Tier 1 Avernus Extremities read...","[WEAK]!","...!"]},{"number":2702,"title":"Chapter 2702: Chapter 2701 Unprecedented! A Tier 2 Falls! I","paragraphs":["2701 Unprecedented! A Tier 2 Falls! I","Weak!","This was what the remnants of stupendously powerful Hyperversal Extremities made up as their bodies were utterly eviscerated!","As the one behind it let them know in a taunting and shocking fashion with a single word.","The Seer of Avernus had gazed at this unfolding reality as her eyes burned with great anger.","While the remaining Tier 3 and Tier 2 Avernus Extremities had entirely different reactions.","When they saw their compatriots die to the storms of Vitalis and Vacuous Authorities, the same storms inside of them now felt all that much more menacing as at this moment,from the depths of their hearts..they began to feel an unfamiliar and extremely rare emotion.","They were Hyperversal Extremities.","They had taken concepts to their utmost extremes and because of this, they were awarded a stupendous form of power.","Due to such a power for a great deal of years, this emotion was not one that they were familiar with!","This emotion was something they rarely felt since they attained such a high level of authority...but on this day- they felt fear!","Because of their level of authority, they were able to deduce many, many things. They looked at how all of them were affected by the pathogenic authority over a day ago, and they looked at how now, all of the Tier 1 Avernus Extremities had simultaneously perished due to it.","It was instant and organized, with the will of their enemy acting at once.","Many of them theorized that their enemy had not been able to do exactly what he had just done now when he first affected them.","They theorized he could not kill the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities a day ago, and yet now, he had taken all of them out in an instant!","What if hours from now or days from now, he also did to the Tier 2 and Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities what he just did to their lower level compatriots?","Such a thought filled them with immense fear.","It was to the extent that a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity rose up with a face of desperation and floated below the feet of Seer Amestris, his voice coming out in a ragged tone","[Please, get it out. Whatever means you have to use...whatever dangers there are, please just get it out!]","...!","He was a Hyperversal Extremity. And yet at this moment, none of that grandeur could be seen on his face.","He was the first one to show such desperation, but most of the other affected Avernus Extremities were feeling the same thing!","The Seer of Avernus watched the stellar remnant dust of their forces fade away along with the single word of [WEAK], and her eyes became decisive as her hand flashed out to grasp the head of the Tier 2 Extremity in front of her.","BOOM!","Her authority seethed out and barreled into the very existence of the being before her as she tested the methodology that she only theorized on this Extremity.","The problem they were affected with was one that allowed a Pathogenic Authority to enter their existence and permeate across their records. Every time they tried to purge it out, it spread elsewhere as they could only try their best to stop its spread while dealing with the storms of authorities inside of them.","So, all of those affected were put in a constant state of fighting off damaging storms and the action of stopping the spread of the Pathogenic Authority was barely achieved with the remaining Will that they had.","What Seer Amestris sought to do was actually very simplistic.","She's simply had to purge every part that was affected by this pathogenic will, including any records it may have already spread to!","Records...that may include the person's identity, their concepts, or even their very core!","It was basically what one would do if they were seeking to kill an Extremity. The process would literally be her killing a large part of this being in order to save him!","As for what effect it would have on the existence thereafter?","This was the part that they would have to see.","HUM!","Her authority surged like a tide as it instantly enveloped and blanketed every single record of the Extremity that had the Pathogenic Authority attaching to, and at the same time, she isolated the various parts of his existence that already had storms of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities.","Her power wrapped around everything in an intricate manner as with the low shout...","...!","A glorious purple light flashed.","The fantastical power of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity showed itself as in an instant, 60% of the body of the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity before her was sectioned off into multiple pieces and thrown off meters away!","The sectioned-off parts exploded in a storm of Vacuous and Vitalis Authorities as soon after, an immense silence descended.","The Seer of Avernus looked at what remained of the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity, her authority filling the carved out and sectioned parts of this being as she sought to heal his soul and stabilize his nearly erased records.","In exchange for entirely removing the pathogenic will that had spread into this being, she had to erase over 60 percent of the Extremity Rune Scriptures that made him!","Over half of his Boundaries and Dynamis of Extremity.","Over millions of years worth of memories, and even portions of his identity!","After it was done and her Authority stabilized his soul, her voice rang out with caution.","[Andros.]","She called out the name of the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity, and this being...","did not even raise their head.","They stared forward blankly as their eyes were blinking constantly, almost as if they were questioning and wondering who he was and what they were doing!","[Andros!]","The Seer of Avernus called out again as this being finally turned to gaze at her with her outburst of authority, but his eyes were blank and without much luminescence.","At this moment, everyone in the surroundings could feel the authority of this being regress from Tier 2 and head to Tier 1!"]},{"number":2703,"title":"Chapter 2703: Chapter 2702 Unprecedented! A Tier 2 Falls! II","paragraphs":["2702 Unprecedented! A Tier 2 Falls! II","A regression from Tier 2 and into a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity!","At this moment in time whether it was because he had lost so much of himself, or whether the process was just that excruciating- this formally powerful Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity actually remained mute and only stared forward as if he were maimed.","And he may forever remain this way.","The scene was a dreadful one to see as it made the Tier 3 and the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities affected by the pathogenic will howl out in indignation and unwillingness!","Extremity Ariana bellowed out with utmost rage while on the side, the figure of Extremity Blue actually held the most calm out of all affected Extremities here.","She floated with majesty and contained anger as she gazed at the actions of the Seer of Avernus, as well as what the results were.","Her eyes burned with such measured calm and wrath that one would almost think she wasn't among those affected. As if she didn't have a raging storm inside of her right now!","But at this moment, her eyes shone with a radiant glow of blue.","It was the cerulean light of Lunacy.","When a lot of beings faced unprecedented peril, they likely fell under the pressure with their mind and defenses, breaking down until ultimately- whatever they faced devoured them to oblivion.","But there were a select few beings who refused to be ground down by a danger that would have been granted to them True Death, their wills denying such a reality as if strong enough, they could bring about an unexpected result!","At this moment, after watching the actions of Seer Amestris, Extremity Blue came to a shocking decision.","Her soul and will turned inwards as she gazed at all the parts of her that the pathogenic authority had spread into as an instant later...","BZZT!","The remnant parts of her unaffected authority moved with shocking brilliance.","In her body, there were a few Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures that were radiating the blue light of Lunacy!","At this moment, they all moved under her command as they began cleaving over 50 percent of her very Recorded Existence!","Over 50% of her concepts, of her boundaries, of her Dynamis!","She cleaved out everything affected with decisiveness and fervor as she let it all go.","She carved out multiple Obsidian Extremity Rune Scriptures that made up more than 9 concepts she had taken to Extremity and 11 Golden Extremity Rune Scriptures that represented even more concepts that she brought to extremity. All of their records were tainted by the pathogenic authority as she cleaved it all out and spat it on the space before her.","Her mind and soul buzzed at such an action as at this moment, she felt incomplete.","The concepts of extremity in her body that were sectioned into multiple pieces seemed ready to break down and destroy her completely!","And at such a juncture, the Crimson Extremity Rune Scriptures of Lunacy moved as they intentionally destroyed what remained of every single other concept in her body!","Every other concept that she brought to extremity and whatever remained of it as the light of Lunacy didn't just destroy...but it devoured over 20 concepts, or what remained of them, that Extremity Blue had brought to Extremity!","She devoured the Dynamis she had forged, her foundation, Meridians...even memories of her past self.","She truly and completely let Lunacy run rampant and devour every other part of her that was fractured and threatening to break down.","It was such a shocking action that the Seer of Avernus gazed in her direction in a stupor.","Because as the light of Lunacy devoured and devoured, the power of Extremity Blue actually began to grow.","The action she took to solve the unprecedented peril she was in supremely agreed with the concept of Lunacy as a shocking effect was brought to fruition.","The few Crimson Extremity Rune Scriptures of Lunacy that she had pulsed while radiating a powerful light- rapidly beginning to proliferate and increase in number!","And a blinding crimson radiance that only a few existences could see erupted around her as the pristine light of Lunacy was being elevated!","KA!","KA!","Howling cries of madness could be heard resounding in the surroundings as even the Aeonic Annals of Extremity reacted in a shocking turn of events, dozens of Crimson Extremity Rune Scriptures blooming around Extremity Blue's destroyed body.","They were elevating everything about her as the destroyed parts began to heal, her aura beginning to move like a beast as at this moment, it already arrived at the Zenith of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity and as more Crimson Extremity Rune Scriptures of [LUNACY] appeared...this shocking aura spilled over.","It blazed like an ever-incandescent blue sun as it sought to grasp a realm above it, and it almost seemed to have taken all the steps there as it was on the precipice of Tier 4!","On the Precipice!","But even with this grand change, it only blazed brightly and stopped there as it couldn't fully step into this glorious stage.","It was only half a step into the Fourth Gradation of Extremity.","[OOOH!]","But even this was enough as Extremity Blue bellowed out her anger and desperation, the bid she had taken working in the end as at this moment, her figure could be seen.","A blue dress of pure Lunacy formed around her as her snow-white hair carried tendrils of blue. A deep and exotic sense of wildness emanated from her deeply blue eyes that radiated utmost contained rage, these eyes visibly burning with flames as her figure began to move while she cried out with valor!","[Noah! Fucking! Osmont!]","BOOM!","With a blinding flash of light, she broke the barrier of the isolated domain Seer Amestris had enacted, her figure moving like a shooting star as she weaved across space in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution- her destination set as she fearlessly surged towards the Obsidian Saurischian Havenly Archipelago.","She left behind shocked Avernus Extremities that a moment later, a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity who had seen what Extremity Blue had done became ecstatic as he sought to do the same thing.","He used his most powerful authority right away to begin cleaving off his own records of Extremity and existence as this scene was quickly noticed by Seer Amestris!","[You...wait!]","BOOM!","Before she could continue speaking, the cleaved records of this being burst with instability as with over 60% of his existence cleaved, the concepts of Extremity couldn't continue holding off other parts of the storm that this being wasn't able to entirely remove as instantly....","[Ah...!]","His soul cried out as it began to splinter, only to be finished out and have its remnant record entirely destroyed by the storms of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities!","[...]","What one person had done and was successful with did not necessarily mean another person could also do and gain the same result.","This lesson was instilled again as Seer Amestris shook her head with great frustration, seeing a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity fall as gloriously, the light of Quintessence and Lotra wrapped around the last remnants of his records!","A Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity!","—","[An unprecedented feat!]","Inside the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, near the Andromeda Cleaver.","Noah's main body was surprised at the unfolding events as Extremity Blue's transformation was unexpected, and what occurred thereafter was even more unexpected.","The True Death of a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity!","This, and the action of reaping the lives of 34 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities caused an unprecedented change as the Records of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity were flung open in the skies above- but this time, it wasn't droves of Vitalis or Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities that were surging out!"]},{"number":2704,"title":"Chapter 2704: Chapter 2703 Unprecedented! A Tier 2 Falls! III","paragraphs":["2703 Unprecedented! A Tier 2 Falls! III","The Records of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity split open!","Such an action was a rarity as even the opening of the Records was astonishing in itself- and it was mainly to show the grandeur of unprecedented records!","It was as if recording down a new history was enriching and worthy of recognition for the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","Depending on the feat, any myriad of unknown honorariums could come out as when it came to this subject, very few beings could say they were knowledgeable on all the things that astonishing existences were granted over the eons.","A strengthening and elevation of a concept, soul, body, or origin, or the granting of a certain authority, or a baptism of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority were some ofthe most commonly known honorariums among those in the Vitalis Havens of Extremity.","Now, there was another type of honorarium that could be added to the list as above the purple domain of the Havenly Authority of Andromeda, a rift of records bloomed as from it...descended a dim white gold scroll!","[....?]","Noah blinked while gazing at this with doubt as if it wasn't Vitalis or Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities...it should be something much grander, right?","So what exactly was this?","HUUM!","at its appearance though, the surrounding realities instantly calmed and became docile- including the Havenly Authority of Andromeda in the surroundings!","The wild tendrils of Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Andromeda actually became exceedingly still as if they held a sense of reverence or fear towards this Scroll.","Accompanying its eerie descent, its prompts exploded with fanfare.","[A Quintessential Achievement!]","[You are the first in Recorded History to decimate the Records of a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity and grant them True Death before attaining Extremity!]","[An Unprecedented Feat!]","[You are the First in the Recorded History of the Vitalis Annals of Extremity to grant True Death to a large number of Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities before attaining Extremity!]","[You are the Second in the Recorded History of the Vacuous Annals of Extremity to grant True Death to a large number of Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities before attaining Extremity!]","[The Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art has been attained!]","...!","The achievements were grand.","Noah gazed at them with shining eyes as he was the first in Recorded History to kill a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity, but what was more shocking was that when it came to killing over 34 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities...he wasn't the first one to do so in the Vacuous Annals of Extremity!","The records he had access to had been greatly expanded as with this, the number of information and existences Noah could be compared to had grown.","It seemed there was a terrifying existence in the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains as the feats of killing an Extremity before they became one themselves...they repeated it a large number of times with great success!","But...just how many did they kill, and what number would Noah have to reach to attain an unblemished record in this honorarium as well?","It was a question he didn't have the answer to, but his eyes kept on being locked to the white gold scroll of magisterial light that caused all authorities to be reined in and turned docile.","It descended until it was inches before Noah's eyes, and with it being so close- even his main body buzzed as the authorities within him reacted in a unique manner!","His hand reached out towards this dazzling scroll as it radiated a light that branded itself into him, waves of information exploding into his mind!","[[The Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art]:: A Modus Operandi meant for existences that have attained Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Middle Grade Gradation of Extremity at the very least, with versions and variations of it found in the Havenly Archipelagos of the Supernal Havens of Extremity for those capable of obtaining them. This particular Modus Operandi has been modified to fit the needs and means of the existence worthy of a Quintessential Honorarium. Its purpose is to process, refine, and purify all forms of authority by compressing them into a Planalith Krystallos- a type of singularity that is outwardly as small as 5 inches, but inwardly as vast as billions of Light Years. The pure authorities found in nature are raw, unrefined, and not nearly as compatible for the absorption and assimilation into existences. The Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos makes it capable of refining any authority into a singular refined core that will express the most profound effect upon consumption. Normally, Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures are required for the art of refining any Authority into a Planalith Krystallos as it is a field where Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities are able to navigate in, with the Planalith Krystallos mainly being refined authorities at the realm of Hyperversal Extremities...]","[...For the True Emperor of Quintessence, this Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art allows you to utilize Units of Vitalis or Vacuous Hyperversal Authority to a limited extent in the refinement of other authorities. The uses of refined authorities packed into Planalith Krystallos can go as far as aiding one to traverse the Awakenings of Hyperversal Existential Authorities, the traversal of the Gradations of Extremity, or even the endless search of what may lie beyond Extremity. With this Golden Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities cannot yet be refined by you unless you attain Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures. The cost of utilizing this Modus Operandi is high as it is questionable whether you can even successfully complete a single refinement of an authority...","...!","A shocking piece of work that Noah had to read multiple times over to make sure he didn't miss anything...and that he gauged this Art before him accurately with just what it could do!","The biggest clue to its majesty was the fact that existences at Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity were the ones who could even begin to utilize this fantastical Modus Operandi, with versions of it even being accessible in the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","Since Noah had not seen anything like this in the Saurischian Archipelago he was currently moving in while talking to the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity that reigned his authority over this Archipelago, he could only assume that it was something to be found in the Crimson Havenly Archipelagos towards the depths of the Supernal Haven of Dissolution!"]},{"number":2705,"title":"Chapter 2705: Chapter 2704 Unprecedented! A Tier 2 Falls! IV","paragraphs":["2704 Unprecedented! A Tier 2 Falls! IV","What was most astonishing about the Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art was just what their products could do.","Traverse the Gradations of Extremity...and even through the Awakenings!","Because how frequently could an existence perform one astonishing feat after another to gain baptisms of Vitalis or Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities?","For the masses, they had to rely on other things as if there were truly powerful Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities in the Seven Aeonic Havens...then they were likely utilizing some form of a Modus Operandi like this to refine Vitalis Planalith Krystallos and utilize them to go through Awakenings.","Of course, this was something that even Noah couldn't do right now.","He couldn't refine Vitalis or Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities as he could only use them to refine other authorities currently.","But since the purpose of the refined products of this Modus Operandi were to aid existences that had already achieved Extremity...what results would Noah gain when he refined other authorities?","What if he refined Quintessence? Or Manadynamics? Or Loot? Or the Havenly Boundaries?","Could he even refine the authorities of Dynamis of Extremity? And what would they even grant?","The questions and possibilities buzzing in his mind were many as he paid attention to the last sentence of the description of the Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art.","The cost of such an art was so high that his reserves of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities may not even be able to bear it.","For this, it only caused Noah's competitive and tyrannical will to rouse as his body began to buzz.","So what if it was a Modus Operandi that Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities may have the power to utilize?","What if it was something for those already on the Gradations of Extremity?!","Since he had obtained it, he would make it work for him as it was only a matter of time before he figured out its intricacies...and just what shocking effects they would bring.","In his blazing thoughts of majesty, other prompts began to descend as Lotra and Quintessence hauled in bountiful loot from the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities and 34 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity","[1x Remnant Obsidian Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity has been attained.]","[1x Tier 2 Singularity Crystal of the Record of Extremity has been attained!]","[1x Tier 2 Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Radon has been attained.]","[34x Singularity Crystal of the Records of Extremity have been attained!]","[The Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Babit has been attained.]","[The Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Kyle has been attained.]","[The Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Emily has been....]","[34x Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writs of Extremity have been attained.]","...!","An unprecedented influx of loot came as the death of a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity granted many things, but the sheer numerical advantage of killing 34 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities granted even more!","It was so much so that out of the descending Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writs of Extremity, three pairs of sets of 10 began to blaze with golden radiance as they were pulled towards each other.","[The Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writs of Extremity are merging to form a single full Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity.]","Noah's eyes were bright as he looked at 10 pages of dazzling light coming together to form a single glorious Writ of Extremity!","A Writ that could be granted to an existence to bring a Planar Boundary to Extremity.","He was about to gain three of them as he already had Oraculum illuminate the path forward on how he could best use these!","The single attack against the Avernus Extremities had brought in so many things that Noah had to digest, with him moving his time table on Apexification forward even more as with the Loot he just gained, he would be able to feed the Sporos III of Extremity with abundance and bring forward the next Ash Tree of Gradation.","When this and other factors were met, Apexification would proceed as he would break down an Unscalable Wall of Extremity!","But between this...the effects of his actions with the Avernus Extremities continued to propagate.","This was because at the same time that Noah came across his ecstatic loot and recognition, another being who had also caused the Aeonic Annals of Extremity to ring out praise had arrived light years near the grand image of the Obsidian Saurischian Havenly Archipelago!","It was none other than Extremity Blue as the actions she had taken had granted her a terrifying opportunity, and at the same time, a sense of danger.","This was because she literally devoured and assimilated everything into Lunacy.","Before, she had other concepts tying her down as they kept her grounded and somewhat stable.","But she took them all away as what was left behind...was only Lunacy!","And she truly followed this concept to the Extreme as no sane being would choose to do what she was doing right now.","Yet in a state of magisterial Lunacy, none of this nattered.","The only thing in her eyes...","[Noah! Fucking! Osmont!]","It remained Noah.","His actions blinded her as rage spilled out along with Hyperversal Extremity Authority that was right on the precipice of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","She scanned the whole Archipelago light years away of all of its beings in a matter of seconds, she located Noah's figure that was walking with the only Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity on this Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago.","Her eyes burned with a fierce light of Blue as even though she saw such a being beside him...even though her might as an Extremity should have been able to tell her many things...she gritted her teeth as the light of Lunacy flashed.","In her very being, Lunacy took the lead as Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of LUNACY churned and cycled across her existence, her hand striking out as above the Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago, a massive glow of blue flourished as a light years long Extremity Rune Scripture that read [LUNACY] bloomed and descended!","Rationality would not win over Lunacy.","She followed what comprised most of her Existence currently as she attacked her obsession freely, not caring about any consequences that would come after that!"]},{"number":2706,"title":"Chapter 2706: Chapter 2705 Deterioration! Refinement! I","paragraphs":["2705 Deterioration! Refinement! I","It had been over a day since Noah's initial display of power, with his control over Vitalis Hyperversal Authority being shown as at that time- it was enough to make people think he had undergone his Second Vitalis Awakening.","Though at that time, he only had Primitive Vitalis Manipulation and was of the First Vitalis Awakening!","But it was still enough for the Havenly Master of the Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago to pay attention to him.","He was officially stripped of his identity as an Underdweller as he emanated the glow of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage, and any existences in the Supernal Havens of Extremity who had undergone Vitalis Awakening were a precious resource!","This was even more so for those who had undergone their Second Vitalis Awakening as they were commonly genius Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities, or those at the stage of Tier 3 or 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","An Apex Aeonic Lifeform being in this state though? It was unheard of!","[You've had some time to think it over...what will your choice be? Even the forces of the Supernal Havens of Extremity will soon set off and be embroiled in the ensuing chaos. I can write a Recommendation for you to enter the Havenly Hyperversal Gauntlet of Gradation in the Supernal Haven of Helios. It is a treasured domain born under the warping of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority and the nearby spacetime continuum. It allows Entities and Treasures from Recorded History to appear within as it is also filled with great peril and unknown dangers, but the Genius Extremities of our Supernal Havens are sent there when they seek to traverse the Gradations of Extremity at a faster pace. It is truly meant to cut down on hundreds or thousands of years of hard work...so long as you can survive the Gauntlet of Gradation. Spots are limited in order to keep the shocking concentration of authority and treasures within, but you will be able to take a slot so long as you prove yourself.]","...!","The Havenly Hyperversal Gauntlet of Gradation!","It was a place that eliminated the factor of time- reducing it by a great deal and allowing genius Existences to more smoothly traverse the Gradations of Extremity.","These were the words that the Havenly Master of this Archipelago was telling Noah before a moment later...","They both turned their heads up towards a certain direction. And soon after...","BOOM!","The space above the gorgeous obsidian island with its flowing waterfalls of Dissolution split as a massive spinning Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of LUNACY appeared.","It held a crimson halo around it, and yet the scripture itself was filled with a majestic blue glow as even though it threatened to cover the whole Archipelago, its authority was focused like a needle towards a single being!","The Havenly Master of the Archipelago saw this as his eyes opened with brilliant anger, a harrumph coming from him as he pressed his index finger up.","A single finger.","And yet in the next moment, a crimson light of Extremity flashed as from a swirling Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture, an illusory finger of Titanic stature and size bloomed as it pressed on the descending Scripture of Lunacy!","The single illusory finger was endlessly light years wide as it instantly shattered the blinding glow of Lunacy, continuing to go further up as the expression of Extremity Blue changed rapidly.","[Ya!]","She bellowed out with fervor as shockingly, the massive illusory finger continued to barrel towards her and arrived on moments- with her body erupting and releasing an endless sea of blue that the massive finger sank into.","BOOM!","The endlessly blue sea of Lunacy churned as it was split apart and destroyed into streams of innumerable rivers, the figure of Extremity Blue manifesting far off on the side from one cerulean stream as crimson gold blood flowed freely from her eyes.","She looked to be in a terrible state after facing the counterattack of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity of the Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago as his voice boomed out at this moment!","[You dare? A measly Clan from the Nether Havens of Extremity dares to be so bold as to attack with the intent to decimate a whole Archipelago?!]","His voice boomed out like a thunderclap as in the region above, Extremity Blue's bleeding eyes still burned with utmost hatred as she didn't falter.","The light of Lunacy bloomed again as this time, her whole body radiated the spinning of a myriad of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures as a moment later, she exploded into billions of strands of water droplets that spread out to cover the whole Archipelago, this water drops coming down like an endless rain as even though there were billions of water drops...Extremity Blue's soul and existence was only hidden in a single one!","And the billions of other drops of water all carried the terrifying corrosive power of a being on the precipice of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","To try and pick her out amidst all of these water drops...should be impossible as it should give Blue some time to get closer to the one she wanted to kill.","[OSMONT!]","The billions of water droplets all bellowed out as they thundered down with utter disregard for the Havenly Master.","And this being turned exceedingly cold as his body glowed with authority, his two palms rising in front of his chest as he brought them together.","In the space above where innumerable water drops were raining down, two massive illusory palms formed as they pressed from left and right, squeezing together and evaporating all the water drops they came in contact with in a shocking show of power as they crashed towards each other speedily, eradicating every single drop of water until...","BZZT!","A single drop of water remained as it came to struggle between the incoming pressure of two palms!","[Ya!]","Extremity Blue's raging bellow came out as she transformed from the water drop, her eyes unwilling as she was outclassed by this Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity on all sides!","And now, his massive illusory hands threatened to crush her between them as she burned every ounce of authority she had to stop them from clamping her out of existence.","This gave birth to a figure of a dazzling gorgeous crazy woman stuck between two illusory palms, her hands stretched left and right as her bountiful chest trembled from the shocking pressure!","And the Havenly Master didn't relent as he brought his palms ever closer, intending to squash this being and decimate their records!","[Sigh.]","...!","At such a time, the reality playing out and being recorded fluctuated.","The gaze of the Havenly Master became stern as at this moment, the blaring aura of another Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity appeared!"]},{"number":2707,"title":"Chapter 2707: Chapter 2706 Deterioration! Refinement! II","paragraphs":["2706 Deterioration! Refinement! II","The blazing aura to appear was from none other than Seer Amestris, with her power being so unique that even though her figure couldn't be seen anywhere, her authority had already permeated in the surroundings.","It weaved through the massive illusory hand in the skies and around Extremity Blue's rageful figure that was holding the palms at bay- the very Record being etched down in this region somehow being altered as a crimson light wrapped around Extremity Blue...and whisked her away!","...!","The scene was an ecstatic one as it finished just as quickly as it began.","BOOM!","The two illusory palms clasped onto each other while smashing into nothingness as Extremity Blue was forcefully taken away- this being now showing a great level of strength as she was able to withstand the attacks of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity!","An Extremity that after repelling her effortlessly, his resonant voice filled with majesty boomed out.","[You think you can come, attack, and go as please?! Your so-called Avernus Clan will not have a good time in these Supernal Havens of Extremity! Anyone of you even daring to enter any Archipelagos of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage will be killed on sight!]","...!","His voice spread out to all like a declaration!","The forces of some Inheritances and four of the Seven Clans that already had their people arrive on the Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago all heard it!","They gazed at each other in shock as they quickly began to spread this information to their forces.","Just what was the Avernus Clan doing? They first offended whoever was behind the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources, and now they blatantly offended the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage by attacking an Archipelago? And behind it all, their target was Noah Osmont?","\"Is this the same Noah Osmont who declared a War of Annihilation with them and the Singularity Overseers?\"","An Extremity from the Havenly Moon Clan discussed with another as when they looked at it, it seemed that the Avernus Clan was too active!","After their conflict with Osmont, even the Singularity Overseers had been lying low as no major moves were made from them.","But the Avernus Clan...many major things were centered around them as they currently took the limelight with conflicts and what seemed like really bad decisions!","The words of the Havenly Master that thundered out made it known.","The Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineages on this floating landmass heard these words.","And Noah himself...heard the words that barred the Avernus Clan from certain Archipelagos and welcomed them with utmost profundity!","The first phase of his machination against the Avernus Clan was Isolation.","Isolate them from the support and strength of other forces, and now...they were even becoming isolated from the opportunities of the Supernal Havens of Extremity!","Noah didn't predict the actions that Extremity Blue would take, nor that she could have survived his Hyperversal Anomalous Virion the way that she did and have it grant her an elevation of power.","But what he was looking forward to was how other beings would combat his Virion as when he looked at the methods they used against it...he could then improve his Virion even more!","Currently, he had seen Seer Amestris cleave out the affected parts of an existence- any records that may have been affected as thereafter, their fate had half a chance on remaining who they were before the cleaving.","To improve it...he would now make it so that his Virions strictly target the Records of the Concepts of Extremity that an existence had!","If the concepts that gave them power had to be cleaved out...nothing would remain to protect them as their deaths would be guaranteed.","So from every angle, he looked at what occurred as opportunities and boons for him!","With a smile, he turned towards the enraged figure of the Havenly Master as he spoke out calmly- as if what had just occurred wasn't even involving him.","\"I'll take you up on the Recommendation of the Havenly Hyperversal Gauntlet of Gradation in the Supernal Haven of Helios.\"","...!","An opportunity that was meant for beings to quickly traverse through the Gradations of Extremity!","Of course, he who hadn't even attained Extremity would seek it.","Since he had many different parts of his soul stretched out across the Nether and Supernal Havens, they would all be put to work as the few days deadline to grasp Extremity...would surely be cut short as he didn't even expect to need a full 7 days!","At this very moment as he agreed to prove himself to enter something known as the Havenly Hyperversal Gauntlet of Gradation, his Main Body deployed the remaining False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER as their destination was in the booming battle between Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Legions.","He had reaped the lives of 34 Tier 1 Extremities and even one at a Tier 2, and it was now time to collect on the Virions he had cultivated in the Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities!","With their Loot and the Loot he had gained so far...the Sporos III of Extremity was bound to be taken to maturity as at that point, the grandeur of a Quintessential Apexification would bloom.","Then, there were his other bodies stretched out with the identities of the 9th Infernal Lord of the Infernal Havenly Commerce as at this moment, some of them welcomed personages of the Seven Clans who came to trade with abundance- with Oraculum buzzing in his mind as he could sense a possibility of trades involving something even grander than the Andromeda Cleaver!","And then...there was the wonder that was Xiaomi.","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, his main body was flipping through the records of the Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement while watching over her figure that he had now given the Tier 2 Singularity Crystal of the Record of Extremity and Tier 2Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of the Tier 2 Extremity he had inadvertently killed.","These records were useful even to him, with Xiaomi being allowed to see them first as her Foundation that was conducive to elevating Ruin and other concepts of Chaos to Extremity...it began to tremble at this moment after she experienced the formation and death of Extremity for both Tier 1 and Tier 2 existences!","She saw the beginnings, and then the ends of these powerful existences.","Noah didn't even have to give her the Records of the other 34 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities.","At this moment, her existence began to tremble as she felt like she had arrived at the precipice of a grand achievement!"]},{"number":2708,"title":"Chapter 2708: Chapter 2707 Deterioration! Refinement! III","paragraphs":["2707 Deterioration! Refinement! III","The Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos!","It was initially a foundation only meant to elevate RUIN to Extremity at the fastest possible time, but after Noah and Quintessence became involved, this Foundation became something even grander as it included other Sources of Chaos as well.","The holder of this foundation had absorbed the Records of birth and death of Extremity of two beings.","One at Tier 1, and another at Tier 2. She saw how they formed their first Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, and how their very existence was altered because of it.","She also saw how they lost all of their Rune Scriptures before they died.","This cycle of beginnings and endings of Extremity had pushed her ever closer towards the 18th Boundary Layer of RUIN as in front of her- ever glorious prompts rose!","[You are nearing the extreme of RUIN!]","...!","Her body was floating not too far from the light years domain of the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Andromeda being given off by the Andromeda Cleaver, and profoundly crimson tendrils of Ruin were swirling around her in an ecstatic and erratic manner.","[An Astonishing Feat in the works! If you are capable of scaling the wall of Extremity, you will be one of the few in Recorded History to have achieved Extremity of a concept in a short period of time!]","...!","The prompts that appeared before her were ones that Noah also saw through his connection and system, and he could see any of the prompts of his Vassals with ease if he wished.","But Xiaomi's prompts...they showed the terrifying grandeur of the Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos as since she began on the path of Extremity, Xiaomi would enter the ranks of beings who took a truly short period of time to achieve Extremity!","Noah didn't doubt that in Recorded History, beings who held different variations of Innate Pellucid Foundations were among the many who achieved Extremity in a short period of time.","But even when it came to such a feat...Noah was bound to break it as the time that has passed from when he first expanded his concepts towards Extremity...it had only been a matter of weeks!","Since he stepped into the Abecedarian Sacrarium of the Learnean Lineage, it had only been a matter of weeks as not even a full month had passed.","Who in Recorded History had achieved Extremity in less than a month since the time they first expanded their concept?","A light of tyranny flashed over Noah's eyes while thinking of this, with his thoughts of brilliance focusing on the next set of prompts that flashed by Xiaomi.","[An infinitesimally small distance is left between the 17th Boundary Layer of Ruin and the Extremity Layer of Ruin!]","[The infinitesimally small distance is one that others may never cross throughout their lives. Your soul and understanding of Ruin is critical in crossing this distance and attaining Extremity.]","WAA!","An infinitesimally small distance.","It demarcated those with power and those with not!","It showed those who had grasped Extremity and those who would forever be far from it.","As for Xiaomi...Noah knew she would likely cross this gulf within the day or two!","But even this seemed too long.","Noah looked at the figure of Xiaomi which had a determined expression with its own exotic charm as he pondered.","Oraculum burned brightly in his mind as after many computations, his will turned towards the Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art.","Oraculum told him that if he wanted to nudge her to achieve Extremity even faster, he could experiment with this method!","And so, Noah breathed in while taking a seated position in space.","His mind was buzzing with authorities as he called out lightly.","[Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art]","HUUM!","He felt his Innate Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians vibrate as the authorities within were roused!","And in front of his eyes...","A blue illusory square panel appeared as towards its center, there was a golden bordered illusory triangle that had on each side runic etchings!","They read [Planalith Krystallos Refinement].","As Noah looked at the simple display before him, a prompt rose that him which authority he would like to refine.","And when such a prompt came, he spoke simply.","\"Ruin.\"","...!","The golden box pulsed as a single crimson point of light bloomed, with the borders of the illusory display then beginning to disappear until before Noah's eyes, there was only this single Singularity of crimson light!","The beginnings of a Planalith Krystallos!","[The Ruin Planalith Krystallos has begun to be forged.]","[The Process of refining the concept of Ruin would lead to a product normally capable of aiding an existence across the Gradations of Extremity!]","[Since no Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures are available to carry out the refinement, Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities may be utilized in a limited extent to continue the processing, refining, and purifying of the Ruin Planalith Krystallos.]","His Innate Meridians that were pulsing this whole time began to churn as their strong streams burned, the crimson point of Planalith Krystallos beginning to spit rapidly as from all around, Ruin was called forth!","In all forms, potency, and concentration, all of Ruin surged into this single point of Singularity as they underwent a heavy baptism- a process of refinement!","After Noah's reserves of Vitalis and Vacuous began to burn, the singularity of Ruin before Noah spun ever faster as a wondrous process began.","It wasn't something that he could finish so quickly at this stage as when he saw the process of the spinning Ruin Planalith Krystallos, he knew that it would take some time- even by his standards!","An hour passed after the Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art was activated for the first time.","At this point, the Singularity before Noah had condensed into a terrifyingly powerful crystalline circular stone that caused the surrounding authorities to stall and falter!","It was the treasure that was as small as mere inches outside, but spanned billions of light years within.","It was something that normally, only Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities could forge.","Now, what product would Noah have when he was doing all this before he even achieved Extremity?!"]},{"number":2709,"title":"Chapter 2709: Chapter 2708 Deterioration! Refinement! IV","paragraphs":["2708 Deterioration! Refinement! IV","The refinement of Noah's first Planalith Krystallos was proceeding smoothly, the major thing he was watching being the expenditure of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities and how much he was recovering as it continued to burn up every second.","Although he couldn't say with absolute confidence, he could see that it would likely drain all of his reserves of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities just to complete this single Ruin Planalith Krystallos- and this was with him regenerating these authorities as it meant his current reserves weren't enough!","This was how ridiculous utilizing the Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art as even a being of the Second Awakenings like him had trouble with it.","But he proceeded steadily as at the end of the road...there was going to be nothing else other than Extremity.","Instead, he places his focus elsewhere as this process continued, a part of his will turning towards his ongoing war with the Avernus Clan!","His machinations were deep as after a day, he had already made multiple moves against the Avernus Clan.","In the Nether Haven of Oceanus.","Within a cluster of Minor Havens surrounded by dazzling purple swirling formations that would protect and alert the Avernus Clan of any intruders.","In a Minor Haven known as the Brightlac Haven, a group of Tier 3 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities sat in a Command Post of this Haven as they talked in grim tones regarding recent events.","Purple thrones floated in a stellar space as these Avernus Extremities looked at each other while speaking.","[More bad news and good news from the Supernal Haven of Dissolution...our brethren have begun dying to the Pathogenic Authority released by Osmont. The good news is that Esteemed Blue has touched upon the door of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.]","...!","A Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity spoke as her gaze was a grim one even with such good news!","[Tier 4?!]","Others rose in shock and happiness as such a thing as it meant their Clan was that much more secure.","Each Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity was the backbone of the Seven Clans as the more of them, the better.","So why was her gaze still grim?","The one who had spoken sighed as she continued.","[Unfortunately, her first action after arriving at the doors of Tier 4 was to attack Osmont who was under the protection of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage- under a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity. Now because of that, all of our forces are barred from entering all Archipelagos under the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage, which greatly dampers our progress into the Supernal Havens of Extremity...]","...!","The news shocked those hearing it for the first time as they sat back on their thrones and sighed.","[First the Blood Sources, now this...]","The heads of the Tier 3 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities shook as they thought about everything that had occurred so far.","Just where did it all begin to go wrong?","[Our might is unblemished as nobody would even dare to utter our name if not with reverence, now...there have been scuffles between our Scions and Elders with even dredges of people from Inheritances- not even the Seven Clans, and we lost in those scuffles!]","...!","Normally, no inheritance would ever dare to even besmirch the grandeur of Avernus. And yet over the past day, their people moved about as normal, and when it came to receiving the same level of respect from others as before...it did not happen!","Their Apex Aeonic Scions disagreed with the Scions of a middle-tier Inheritance at best, and yet their people lost in the ensuing conflict.","It was because of nothing else other than the fact that the other side had the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, and they did not!","This thought caused their minds to turn sour as these beings remained silent on their thrones.","[...Well-]","HUUM!","One had begun trying to lighten up the mood when all of their gazes suddenly changed, their faces turning to gaze towards a certain direction in their Brightlac Haven as their figures disappeared soon after!","This was because they had felt an ascension of life from Apex to Extremity in a region of this Haven, with all of them moving across space to stop a bright mountain surrounded by waves of purple mist, their eyes joyful as they disappeared again to enter this mountain and appear within a domain in its depths.","This was the Lilac Converging Mountain in their Brightlac Haven that was the abode of their Scions to cultivate in, so the change of life from Apex to Extremity they had just felt was astounding news as in their memory, they held a few candidates who had been stuck at the 17th Boundary Layer for a few hundred or thousands of years without success in breaking through!","They came to ascertain who had made this achievement as when they appeared, they saw a group of twice a dozen Scions rising up in shock and...","worry?","The moment they felt the aura of Tier 2 and Tier 3 Elders of the Avernus Clan behind them, their faces actually became ashen and filled with more worry as they surrounded a single being who had just formed their first Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture, the gaze of this woman blank as she uttered out with slight fear!","[I...I didn't mean to. I really didn't. It just...happened.]","...!","Shocking words came from her that baffled the newly appearing Extremities as they soon realized something was wrong.","She didn't mean to step away from the 17th Layer and enter Extremity? Just what could allow such a thing?","In their confusion, they spread their wills out as their gazes suddenly changed.","This was because from the body of the newly advanced Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity and the twice a dozen other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms around her...","they felt a Havenly glow they had only seen around other beings that had attained something they could not!","And not just that, but on the feet of this group, there were over a hundred glimmering crimson gold round Blood Sources that finally came under their gaze.","...!","[Preposterous!]","[You...you all!]","Their happy moods turned extremely sour as they bellowed out, the scene in front of them foreshadowing the shocking and chaotic times to come for the Avernus Clan!"]},{"number":2710,"title":"Chapter 2710: Chapter 2709 With a Thought, Hundreds of Extremities Fall! I","paragraphs":["2709 With a Thought, Hundreds of Extremities Fall! I","The Tier 2 and Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Avernus Elders began to bellow out while releasing their authorities in anger, especially a dashing woman at Tier 3 who looked at the newly advanced Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity that was her disciple.","This being almost kneeled on the ground under the pressure, but her new lineage shockingly cried out and denied such a motion as she kept standing while speaking absentmindedly.","[Master...I was stuck at the 17th Layer for a thousand years now. Nothing worked no matter which Treasures you provided for me! I...I only wanted to advance forward, Master.]","Her gaze was one of conflict and happiness at the same time as shockingly, this whole group of disciples here had renounced the Avernus Clan and taken the Blood Sources to attain the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage!","[Rubbish! Where did you even find all of these Blood Sources?!]","Her Master still bellowed out in reply as the newly advanced Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity gazed at the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms around her before she spoke in a low voice.","[...they just appeared in front of Lily and Sabo in a cluster as they were patrolling outside...]","...!","Their gazes turned sour.","They just appeared?","It was very clear that their enemies were throwing them at their feet to tempt them and cut off their allegiances to the Avernus Clan!","The anger in the hearts of the Tier 3 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities was abundant as before they could release it, the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms around them who radiated a Havenly glow began speaking.","[We beg for your understanding, Esteemed Elders. But..all of us have already created an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity each in the last hour. We...we are progressing faster than ever before as our souls now tell us Extremity is only a matter of time! If...if Elders also take these Blood Sources, I believe you can traverse across the Gradations of Extremity that much faster. The path of Extremity is a long one as it cares not for allegiances. What is the Avernus Clan in the face of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity? Or even the impossible Tier 5?]","BOOM!","The instant this Scion finished speaking, a heavy force smashed into him that threw him back while spitting out blood, his figure smashing onto a wall behind as a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity had flung their hand forward at his shocking words!","But the words...boomed and repeated in their minds over and over again.","What was a clan in the face of Extremity?","If they could traverse across the Gradations of Extremity with speed again, if they could...","Many possibilities bloomed as an immense silence descended in this space.","The Tier 3 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities still seemed to be filled with anger, but their eyes now held a different light as they started at the over 100 Blood Sources radiating a pristine glow at the feet of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","The glow seemed so supremely tempting as they couldn't take their eyes off of it, these Extremities beginning to look at each other as they sought to understand what each of them was thinking!","They didn't know that from the eyes of the newly advanced Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity, Noah's will watched all of these events silently as he continued to delve and probe deeper into the destruction of the Avernus Clan.","After their continued isolation, more and more of their own people would renounce and leave them as soon...the phase of indeterminate chaos and destruction of the Clan from within would start!","—","Everything was proceeding on the path Noah foresaw as while he was systematically breaking one of the Seven Clans, his other bodies continued their tasks without a shred of worry.","At this moment, his Reified Source of Quintessence was about to take on another monumental task as while adorning the Vacuous Infernal I Entity Form, he commanded and led Apex Vacuous Lifeforms towards his other body of Alexander- gaining more and more kills over the last day.","What he did with even more fervor was the infection of the Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities located in nearby Savior's Arks- with the number of Extremities who silently had Noah's Virion inside of them now exceeding a thousand!","Currently, the battle between the Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Legions felt like a meat grinder of moments of calmness and turbidity, and then instant eruptions of deadly attacks that ground down and decimated millions of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and a few Extremities.","Gradually, both sides revealed their Tier 3 and 4 Hyperversal Extremities and the power they held, each one getting their opposing combatants as currently, even Emperor Shao was reigned in by a terrifying Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity taking on their Vacuous Infernal III Entity Form- an existence that had undergone the Third Vacuous Awakening!","He seemed to be made up of pure Aurora of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as he was supported by two other Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity to counter Emperor Shao and his attacks.","The whole battlefield now seemed to be a deadly period of calm before the storm as both sides seemed ready to erupt with a new action that could change the entire landscape of the battle.","For Noah, none of this mattered as his will had already released 167 False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER onto 167 affected Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities!","167.","This number was utterly staggering to mention in terms of Extremities, and even more so when talking about killing them.","They were stretched out over five Hyperversal Savior's Arks as some already had the Virion actively destroying their bodies, while others did not have it active just yet!","At this moment, Noah's eyes released a light of coldness as the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER rose from inside the bodies of the Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities who are taken out of commission and moved towards the center of the Savior's Ark to find against the storms of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities.","They silently appeared as with precision and deadly sharpness, they located the weakest and most compromising area to attack as a moment later, Noah gave the command.","And...","BOOM!","It was like bombs were set off en masse as a shocking chain reaction began!"]},{"number":2711,"title":"Chapter 2711: Chapter 2710 With a Thought, Hundreds of Extremities Fall! II","paragraphs":["2710 With a Thought, Hundreds of Extremities Fall! II","The False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER were activated!","On over 28 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities, their expressions changed as they bellowed out with horror- their swirling layers of Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures becoming perforated as the action instantly destabilized the little protection they put together against the storms of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities.","And the moment one part of their defenses was perforated, the Virion didn't let go of this chance as it spread madly. It spread across their Records of Extremity, their memories, lifeforce, and their very souls!","More and more perforations occurred as within moments, all of these Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities fell into a deadly spiral as their records were now being eaten up uncontrollably!","Lotra and Quintessence raged within them as they began to claim everything, this situation quickly becoming discerned by those around them as their Authorities erupted out to support.","But this was the moment where Noah's eyes flashed with the most brilliance as from the over 1,000 Extremity affected by his Virions and yet they had remained inactive this whole time...","[Oh!]","[No!]","BOOOM!","The Virions were all activated simultaneously as hundreds of Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities found themselves facing an unprecedented storm inside of them!","As for the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities...the moment this authority reached a sufficient devouring of their records, they had their protective domain of Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures be perforated as they were put on a path of no return.","[This...!]","DUM! DUM! DUM!","Drums of victory and glory began to resound across the battlefield as the reality that was playing out was an alarming one that caused many beings to draw sharp breaths.","This was because by the dozens, Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities began to fall one after another in an unprecedented fashion!","Throughout multiple arks, their bodies were destroyed from within as they ultimately exploded in a shower of authority and dust.","...!","DUM!","And the drums in the surroundings only became more fervent as the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions took a deadly blow, with their forces watching with crimson eyes filled with rage as within moments, over 100 Tier I Vacuous Extremities perished!","DUM!","When this number reached 167, it finally stopped.","But this was only in the number of deaths.","Over 10 nearby Hyperversal Savior's Arks were currently in disarray as all of their Extremities were affected by the now active Virions, their battle power being reduced and becoming negligible as when the Vitalis Hyperversal Legions saw this, their forces moved to attack with glee!","They wanted to take this chance to deal heavy damage while these beings couldn't protect themselves with the same strength as before.","A shocking level of chaos erupted as a single being watched all of it unfold with a sharp gaze.","He activated over 1000 Virions at once as all of these Extremities were now in a precarious position, the Tier 1s not being able to defend themselves against other attacks if they wanted to focus on stopping the spread of the Virion as because they were still attacked by their enemies who wanted to use this opportunity...","[NO!]","They bellowed out in despair as after they were forced to take on the attack of a Tier 1 Vitalis Extremity, their inward defense weren't kept active as perforation began to appear around their Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, and their bodies ultimately became devoured by a raging storm after!","Like this...even though Noah didn't use the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER, there were still over a dozen more Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities that began dying due to their enemies taking this chance to attack them with even more fervor, and this number only began to rise.","Tier 2 and Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities could still protect themselves somewhat against those wishing to use this moment to destroy them, but Noah was still lucky with one Tier 2 Vacuous Extremity who was instantly attacked by a sharp flaming arrow simmering with Hyperversal Extremity Authority from his enemy who held a brilliant crimson bow, multiple of their Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures being destroyed as the Viriok used this chance to spread irreversibly- the eyes of this Tier 2 Vacuous Extremity becoming extreme horrified and unwilling as he began to be swallowed up by the heavy storms of the Virion!","And so far, none of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities seemed to be in precarious positions as they retreated quickly.","Multiple Hyperversal Savior's Arks were forced to pull back at this moment as all of their Extremities were nearly taken out of service!","And all of this...was a single move done by one existence.","It was a shocking development of the battlefield as from a far distance, the eyes of Emperor Shao are radiating a bright flight as his eyes blazed to see through the truth, the storms of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities confirming everything he saw on the records of the Avernus Clan!","His will barreled out as he sought to locate the being who could affect the battle this much before he had even achieved Extremity.","Even this thought of him not achieving Extremity began to be questioned as...","could any being that had not grasped Extremity even be capable of doing this?","This was the thought in Emperor Shao's mind as even while his will surged out, he couldn't find anything about Noah Osmont.","With the opportunistic counterattacks of the Vitalis Hyperversal Legions, more and more of the affected Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities began to fall as in addition to the 165 Noah personally acted against, dozens more began to gradually fall!","And the ken responsible for it all...his soul was buzzing with a glorious light as his Vaults of Quintessence were accepting truly magisterial waves of Loot.","And in his mind, astonishing prompts cascaded.","[You have destroyed the True Records of over 200 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities!]","[A Quintessential Achievement!]","[The distinction of the Extremity Despoiler has been elevated to Extremity II Despoiler.]","...!"]},{"number":2712,"title":"Chapter 2712: Chapter 2711 With a Thought, Hundreds of Extremities Fall! III","paragraphs":["2711 With a Thought, Hundreds of Extremities Fall! III","Extremity Despoiler!","The first time Noah gained this, it was a tool that allowed him to forge the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER- something that could actually break the authority of a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity.","An elevation of this distinction was bound to be something grand, with Noah's eyes filtering across waves of information and prompts of Loot at this moment as he looked for the information of Extremity II Despoiler.","Before that, the loot from another Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity falling and the over 200 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities came in glorious waves.","[1x Remnant Obsidian Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity has been attained.]","[1x Tier 2 Singularity Crystal of the Record of Extremity has been attained!]","[1x Tier 2 Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Cabulan has been attained.]","[208x Singularity Crystal of the Records of Extremity have been attained!]","[The Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Zed has been attained.]","[The Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Johanna has been attained.]","[The Singularity Crystal of the True Death Record of Yan has been....]","[208x Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writs of Extremity have been attained.]","[200 Remnant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writs of Extremity are merging to form 20 full Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity!]","With every successive move Noah made, his progression and things he could do only became that much more explosive as currently, he had the ridiculous grandeur of 23 Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writs of Extremity when he added those gained from the Avernus Extremities loot.","23 tools that could birth 23 Extremities that held Planar Boundaries!","The mere stage of Extremity was so pristine and hard to reach that with his lineage and Loot he was accumulating even before he achieved Extremity...it felt like Noah was violating the sacred pathway of Extremity with everything he was doing.","And this was bound to be even truer as he finally looked at the description of Extremity II Despoiler.","[Extremity II Despoiler]:: A distinction and title that 9 beings share across Recorded History- something obtained before they entered the folds of Extremity. While 9 beings share this distinction, the True Emperor of Quintessence is the only one among them in Recorded History to have already achieved the purpose of the Extremity II Despoiler before he attained Extremity. The purpose of Extremity II Despoiler is to ultimately aid one in relating the life of a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity, with it allowing you to condense a False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity II Rune Scripture of [DESPOILER]. This False Extremity II Rune Scripture of Despoiler requires 300,000 Units of either Vitalis or Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, along with immense reserves of resources, Soul Values, and authority to condense as no average existence standing before the cusp of Extremity is capable of condensing it. A Single False Extremity II Rune Scripture of [DESPOILER] is capable of piercing a protective Golden or Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture on the body of a Hyperversal Extremity...","A glorious distinction that granted an even grander authority for Noah to wield!","One that others received...but were nowhere near as grand as him.","His gaze left the battlefield that had become increasingly chaotic due to him, the will of his Main Body coming into focus again as in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven- the mountains of loot from the prompts appeared within his Vaults of Quintessence.","There was more than enough Loot to have the Sporos III of Extremity achieve maturity, but Noah's full focus was currently not on this!","It was on the dazzling round, smooth, and deeply crimson Krystallos that had finished its refinement after draining him of all of the reserves of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities and more over the past half day.","The instant it was completed...","BZZT!","It vibrated and released an oppressive authority that pressed on all beings here!","Those who were withstanding the pressure of the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Andromeda being given off by the Andromeda Cleaver were stopped in their tracks by this oppressive authority.","It was something that was in the realm of Extremity!","It was truly only 5 inches wide, but the being who refined it knew that billions of light years worth of processed, refined, and purified authority of Ruin lay inside of it.","When one grasped this Krystallos to absorb or assimilate into their existence, Noah didn't doubt that they would reach the 17th Boundary Layer of Ruin even before a hundredth of its essence was used up.","His eyes were luminous as even when he reached out towards it- he could fully grasp this Krystallos that he had forged himself!","His will went towards it as its details rose up.","[Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos]:: The first refined Planalith Krystallos from the True Emperor of Quintessence who is seeking to become the Extremity of Quintessence. It is Low Grade in nature due to the Refiner not having enough experience with his Art and the absence of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures in its forging. It is something that could normally only be refined and utilized by those in the Gradations of Extremity. Its foundation was built from Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities and not Hyperversal Extremity Authorities through Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures. Because of this, it is only 1% effective for elevating the Extremity of Ruin across the First Gradation of Extremity to the Third Gradation of Extremity. It has no effectiveness on the Fourth Gradation of Extremity or above as only a Middle Grade or High Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos may be effective for such a stage. If an existence below the folds of the Gradations of Extremity is capable of assimilating the essence of the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos, they will have glimpses of the Extremity of Ruin as if this concept is inclined and truly compatible with their existence, this Krystallos will aid them in forming their first Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture. It is unknown and debatable whether the True Emperor of Quintessence himself can utilize this Krystallos to break across the Unscalable Wall of Ruin, which even if he does- it is even more debatable whether his concepts that are considered Dead Paths would follow this ascension to Extremity with just this advancement. Through the Refinement of this Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos, your proficiency in the Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art has increased by 1%. A proficiency of 100% will elevate your capabilities to a higher grade and increase the chances of refining higher grades of Planalith Krystallos....","...!","A wondrous product came to be.","Noah's smile was devilish as he stared at it, its description revealing a world of possibilities as for now- it only confirmed that Xiaomi would now be attaining Extremity very soon!"]},{"number":2713,"title":"Chapter 2713: Chapter 2712 The Process of Extremity! I","paragraphs":["2712 The Process of Extremity! I","A Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos!","It was Noah's first product with the Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art as the moment it was done, it was actually given a grading while he received a percentage proficiency.","The more authorities he refined, the faster his rate of refinement would be, and the higher the grades of profundity of the Planalith Krystallos would be!","Noah gazed at the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos before him that floated in space and the oppressive pressure it released, its aura that was making others feel suffocated exerting a sort of a pull towards Xiaomi as her eyes fluttered open to gaze at it longingly at this moment.","Noah beckoned towards her as her body floated over, and he went above even this as he gazed at the depths of the light years long domain where his people were overcoming the limitations and strengths of their souls to get ever closer to the Andromeda Cleaver.","[Come. Come observe the process of Extremity.]","...!","He called them all over in such a shocking manner as Aurelia and Orion trembled- these beings who had always thought Extremity would be far, far from their grasp having their common sense once more shattered when Noah spoke about it so freely!","As if he could decide when and where Extremity would arrive.","Others wouldn't even be able to know if it would come for them in a thousand or a million years, and yet he called them over to observe the Process of Extremity!","They didn't tarry as they allowed the repulsive Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Andromeda to push them back, a few hundred figures very quickly coming out of the domain and circling Noah and Xiaomi figures.","This includes Hyperion and other Enders of Extremity, in addition to Henry, Barbatos, Kazuhiko, and other prominent Vassals.","They circled around Noah and Xiaomi as with a thundering voice, the True Emperor of Quintessence spoke!","\"For others, Extremity is distant and forever out of reach. For us...it is merely a matter of time. The concept achieving Extremity today is Ruin- with the Foundation of Xiaomi being extremely conducive to Sources of Chaos as with a little push, Extremity will be within her grasp. Experience and feel it to the best of your abilities, and I will display what I see with my eyes for you all to see.\"","Yes!","Even though they were gazing and observing the process, none of them were like Noah who held Eyes of Extremity that could observe Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures or understand just how the authority of Extremity flowed!","So at this moment, an illusory screen of light appeared with grand stature above them, displaying the scene of the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos and the figure of Xiaomi as it was subtly different compared to what the rest of them saw.","Thereafter, Noah nodded towards Xiaomi who breathed out any worries or nervousness.","The gazes of many beings seemed to disappear and fall out of the picture as before her, there was only the dazzling crimson colored Planalith Krystallos and the figure of Noah.","She would have never imagined her current position just days ago, and here she was now.","She didn't forget the one who made all of it possible as when she floated ever closer to the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos, she gazed towards Noah and bowed down deeply before she rose again and instantly thrust her hand out towards the smooth and round Planalith Krystallos in front of her!","BZZT!","Tendrils of crimson light began to surge on its surface as Xiaomi could not fully reach and grasp it.","But these tendrils of Ruin began to be pulled by her one by one, landing on her stellar obsidian skin as the moment they did so...","GONG! GONG!","It was like the sound of heavy booming metals reverberating out with every strand landing on her!","And the moment she came in contact with the tendrils emanating from the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos, her body drank all of it in as instantly, dazzling crimson flames of Ruin erupted all over her body.","Flames that coalesced and roared with purpose as above her head...the beginnings of a dazzling runic ecriture began to be forged.","\"Ya!\"","Xiaomi bellowed out with ferocity as she became inches away from the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos, even more tendrils of refined and pure Ruin entering her existence as the precipice she had arrived at- the infinitesimally small distance that she had not yet been able to cross...she was slowly bridging this gap and arriving at the other side!","HUUM!","The surroundings resonated and turned wild as above them, seething waves of Ruin and other Sources of Chaos began to gather.","The Aletheian Haven of Apollyon rumbled as the Natural Law of Entropy and other Sources of Chaos rose in cheering majesty.","The stellar obsidian hourglass figure of Xiaomi became ever more resplendent and magnificent as her bearing became even more graceful, a halo of red light covering her as her dark stellar hair waved madly!","She looked like a holy Infernal princess from ancient times that others could only stare at from afar.","And in front of her gaze, dazzling prompts began to rise.","[A distance of unfathomable proportions has been crossed forcefully with a profound treasure.]","[Extremely Pure and Refined Authority of Ruin has assimilated into your existence and connected the 17th Boundary Layer to the 18th Boundary Layer.]","[You have arrived at the Extremity Boundary Layer of Ruin!]","...!","BOOM!","An explosion of Ruin bloomed as in a shocking show of utter majesty, the stellar obsidian palm of Xiaomi came to grasp and wrap around the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos!","She was able to grasp an object meant for Extremities as it felt like she was holding onto a billowing and roaring crimson sun, her small figure trembling as she once more released a valiant shout.","[Ya!]","The shout this time was filled with authority.","Hyperversal Extremity Authority!"]},{"number":2714,"title":"Chapter 2714: Chapter 2713 The Process of Extremity! II","paragraphs":["2713 The Process of Extremity! II","Above Xiaomi, the runic scripture shone with a blinding light as letters were forged rapidly by an influx of billions of light years of Ruin from the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos, very quickly releasing an obsidian glow and grandeur of a Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture that read...","[RUIN]!","The process caused the 17th Boundary Layer of Ruin within Noah's own existence to vibrate and begin dancing crazily as he continued to observe the prompts that only appeared in front of Xiaomi.","[You are stepping on the ever glorious path of the Gradations of Extremity.]","[The Extremity of Ruin is acting as the base of your Existence.]","[So long as Ruin persists, so will your existence.]","BOOM!","Billowing might exploded out as a fully forged Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of RUIN appeared, swirling with might and grandeur as it floated onto Xiaomi's body and released a terrifying devouring force- a force that devoured her Origin and Soul entirely!","Her body and foundation became like a husk with nothing in it- all signs of life fading from her as only the Extremity Rune Scripture of RUIN was ever radiant.","And then an instant later, an even more domineering strand of soul began to be released from the Extremity Rune Scripture of RUIN, a soul of an entirely different being as it filled up the empty body and foundation to cause it to transform into an entirely different form of life!","Cellular structure was broken down and reforged to the singular atoms as more and more strands of an Extremity Soul radiated from the Extremity Rune Scripture of RUIN, along with a restructured Origin of Extremity that was born on the basis of RUIN.","A pulse of shocking power then emanated from Xiaomi's body as from a lifeless husk, a glorious and mighty Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Ruin began to surge from her.","In the far distance, one being watched this scene with stellar tears falling out of his eyes as if it was something out of his wildest imagination.","It was the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar.","He watched his daughter ascend to a stage even he had not neared yet as when he saw her unmatched and holy aura, his heart trembled as no sign of madness could be seen from him.","Only unbelievable happiness.","This was his daughter!","She was sick and dying weeks ago as now, everything was entirely reversed as she gained a sense of longevity and wonder that even he paled in comparison to.","And now, she forged the way forward for the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","For the domain of the one being who made it all possible.","His gaze couldn't help but linger on the glorious visage of Noah whose own body had begun terrifically dancing with tendrils of Ruin.","On Xiaomi, the change continued as more and more of her soul was returned into her body as something entirely new, every part of it radiating Extremity and majesty as it was tinted with a crimson glow.","Her eyes opened with utmost power and ferocity as then, she grasped the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos that had shrunk by a third in her hands ever tighter.","And...","BOOM!","An influx of light years of pure and refined RUIN was pulled into her as beside the single Extremity Rune Scripture of RUIN, another one began to be forged and was completed a moment later- with a third Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of RUIN beginning to be formed soon after!","[You are traversing the First Gradation of Extremity.]","[The Quality of your Concept of Extremity granted an Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture at the onset, with its advancement into a Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture guaranteed as you enter the next Gradations of Extremity.]","[You have accomplished an astounding achievement of skipping over Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures entirely and beginning your traversal of the Gradations of Extremity with an Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture!]","[An Astounding Achievement!]","Her figure was like a blazing obsidian sun that some of the hundreds of beings surrounding her and Noah had to look away from.","She ate up the extremely pure and refined authority within the Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos as her Hyperversal Extremity Authority only became more and more dense, very quickly beginning to exceed any normal Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity as more and more Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of Ruin were born on her body!","When the number of Extremity Rune Scriptures reached 9...","WAA!","A glaring aura rose as another prompt appeared before her.","[You have attained the Zenith of the First Gradation of Extremity.]","[Your soul and very existence require nourishment and refinement from the established Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of Ruin before you can step on the Second Gradation of Extremity.]","...!","An unprecedented glow of power covered her as she released an aura even more terrifying than average Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities.","And yet she was only at the Zenith of the First Gradation of Extremity!","The glow around her was maddeningly glorious and enticing as she opened her eyes soon after, the surrounding space becoming painted obsidian ever so briefly as of her might covered everything.","Her hands unfurled to reveal a Planalith Krystallos that was dim and clear, now seeming like a transparent round and smooth stone that held nothing within it.","An air of profundity and stupendous might circled around her as Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Ruin burned all around her, every part of her still undergoing changes as 9 blinding Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures began to swirl protectively around her figure.","At every moment, they released their authority to infuse and refine her very existence as she grew stronger every second!","The scene of her glory was shown by Noah on the illusory screen as the eyes of the hundreds of beings around them shone, watching the scene of Scriptures they had never seen before as their hearts palpated due to it.","\"Extremity can be unreachable and forever in the dreams of others...or as easy as breathing for some. Remember this scene as you seek Extremity- a scene that will be repeated a few times today.\"","As he spoke, Noah's gaze pointed above where another figure of him could be seen.","It was the Reified Wealdian Source of Vitalistic who currently held 23 Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writs of Extremity.","23 authorities that would have a being with a Planar Boundary achieve Extremity!","The eyes of the Vassals flickered with brilliance as they became focused on the Reified Wealdian Source of Vitalistic, with Noah's main body coming to gaze at the graceful and pure visage of Xiaomi who radiated Hyperversal Extremity Authority as with a wave of his hands, their figures disappeared.","After fluctuations of the spacetime continuum, they reappeared in the depths of the Apollyon Aletheian Haven as Noah's voice thundered out around Xiaomi.","[How close are you with the other Sources of Chaos?]","After one domino fell, others would follow.","This was especially so for a holder of the Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos!","With a dazzling smile that caused her astonishing figure to radiate even more brilliance, she replied.","[Within the day, I should be able to take one or two of the other Sources of Chaos to Extremity. It will be even faster if I get more of those Planalith Krystallos...but that can come later. You wanted to feel Extremity closely, yes?]","As she spoke, her eyes breezed over the tens of other promptsshe had seen of her Aspects of Existence and her foundation. One prompt was particularly brilliant.","[You have attained the Gradation of Ruined Chaos Extremity Foundation. Dual Cultivation with any existence carrying Sources of Chaos will increase their and your rate of progression towards Extremity and the traversal across the Gradations of Extremity by 10,000,000%!]","[The traversal across the Gradations of Extremity, refinement of your Existence, and the formation of your Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures will accelerate when Dual Cultivating and resonating with the authorities of the True Emperor of Quintessence.]","A myriad of prompts like these had risen in her mind as more continued to come, her graceful figure shining with a powerful light as she instantly disappeared from her position and pounced on the True Emperor of Quintessence.","He had been taking the lead during their discussions of Extremity in the past, but would he still be able to have the upper hand even now?!","With a glimmer of brilliance, a discussion of Extremity began in the depths of the Apollyon Aletheian Haven as near the Aletheian Havens of the Havenly Authorities, other Vassals stared at the Reified Wealdian Source of Vitalistic as yet another round of majesty was about to unveil itself!"]},{"number":2715,"title":"Chapter 2715: Chapter 2714 A Twist of Fate! I","paragraphs":["The astonishing scene that had just occurred has been branded into the souls of all, with astonishing effects of course being felt by Xiaomi, but Noah also made great gains!","And the gains only continued to pour in as he began dual cultivating with a genius Zenith First Gradation of Extremity.","When he had met The Adjudicator of Dissolution and bathed in her residual aura of Hyperversal Extremity Authority, he had promised himself to experience Extremity in an even closer sense.","Now, he had done just this as while he discussed Extremity with Xiaomi and felt her Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of Ruin closely, the prompts that showed his own gains from her Advancement showed themselves.","{An existence under your banner has achieved Extremity mainly through your aid and guidance!}","{You are the Third in Recorded History to elevate another being to Extremity before achieving Extremity yourself.}","{You have earned the distinction of Guider of Extremity.}","{The concept taken to Extremity by your Vassals is closely connected to your Source of Ruin. Under the authority of Guider of Extremity, all concepts you aid others in traversing to Extremity can have their False Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures forged by you through the utilization of pure Soul Values and Mana Values. Only 100 False Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures can be built from any one concept, with the capability of building False Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures only becoming possible if the aided concept in your Vassal attains the ranking of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture.}","...!","Noah's eyes had opened wide at this prompt as it thundered down an explosive and heavy ability!","When he attained Extremity II Despoiler, he could forge False Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER in addition to the Golden Tier ones from before, but all of these required heavy reserves of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities as it took a long time to make them, and they always drained him at the end of the day.","But due to the distinction of Guider of Extremity and the fact that he aided his Vassals to achieve Extremity in a concept...he could utilize Mana and Soul Values to enact up to 100 False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures!","He could enact a hundred from Xiaomi currently, and if he guided multiple other concepts on other Vassals to Extremity...he could stack more and more.","When he had hundreds of False Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures ready to be deployed on the battlefield to Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities affected by his Virions...what would they be able to do but tall en masse?!","HUUM!","His Aspects of Existence shone brightly as his body was filled with multiple wild and utterly reality breaking authorities, with the discussion occurring with Xiaomi also coming with its own boons.","{You are closely experiencing the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Ruin within your Dual Cultivating partner.}","{In this state, you can forge the False Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of Ruin with 80% less resource requirements.}","{Increased forging of the False Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of Ruin and close interaction of the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Ruin through Dual Cultivation will eventually allow you to take the infinitesimally small step towards the Extremity Layer of Ruin. Such an action is a pathway of achieving Extremity, but it is recommended that you stop its advancement if it does occur as this pathway isn't enough to trigger Extremity in Quintessence- no matter the authority expressed by your Extremity Meridians.}","\"...\"","The requirements of the concepts considered Dead Paths continued to be just as restrictive.","The elevation of a concept much lower than them- even if they were the same Crimson Consummate Boundaries...","would not trigger their advancement to Extremity with all 81 Boundaries in Noah's Meridians!","Even at the Crimson Consummate level, Quintessence was much, much greater than Ruin.","And then...there was Noah's task of taking them to the ranking of Quintessential Zenith which would theoretically make these concepts even harder to elevate to Extremity, but the rewards and power from it would be that much more obscene.","Quintessence...had to be the first concept that Noah brought to Extremity.","He couldn't do it any other way, or this pathway would forever remain a dead pathway!","But even with such a massive wall before him, Noah was unfettered and free as he knew in his heart what he could and could not achieve.","And Extremity in Quintessence...would be in his grasp soon!","BOOM!","Immense Authority erupted from him as during his discussion of Extremity with Xiaomi, he raised his right hand up and caused the emergence of dense threads of Ruin that when mixed with his Quintessential Hyperversal Mana and Soul Values- vibrant False Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of Ruin began to be forged.","His partner in the discussion of Extremity refocused her eyes at this scene as she blinked at the scene of Extremity Rune Scripture being forged by him, questioning whether she was the one who achieved Extremity or him!?","Waves of authority converged and bloomed in abundance as more tools were added under Noah's belt.","Meanwhile, in addition to the Records of Extremity and Writs of Extremity, he had still been getting thousands of prompts of him receiving the Golden Hyperversal Bones of Gradation, Obsidian Hyperversal Bones of Gradation, and the Hyperversal Marrow Soul Singularities every time his Virion ravaged the affected Extremities and brought them towards true death.","All this loot piled up into a mountain and then became an even bigger mountain after being processed by Ruination, and it was then directed towards the Sporos III of Extremity as this maddening seed surged towards full maturity.","The time for the next tier of the Ash Tree of Gradation to be born was nearing as at that juncture- Apexification would be underway! While this time became ever closer, Noah continued increasing his authority as he currently held 23 complete Writs of Extremity in his hands that represented the true deaths of 230 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities.","His Reified Wealdian Source of Vitalistic held them while looking at his people near the light years domain of the Andromeda Cleaver, a bright light crossing through his eyes as he was about to select a few specific beings that through the twist of fate- were one of the few existences in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven who held Planar Boundaries!"]},{"number":2716,"title":"Chapter 2716: Chapter 2715 A Twist of Fate! II","paragraphs":["The Reified Wealdian Source of Vitalistic was filled with a deep flow of green as the 23 Writs of Extremity in his hands drew in the eyes of all Vassals here.","His face was resonant as it boomed out while looking at everyone.","\"It was the destiny and fate for some to achieve Extremity faster than others, but the main thing that will distinguish how far you go up the Gradations of Extremity isn't whether you attained Extremity sooner than others- it is ultimately the concepts taken to Extremity. Watch the processes that will continue to occur and prepare yourselves for when you take your own concepts to Extremity.\"","WAA!","The light of Oraculum shone as he spoke, his Vassals feeling a gaze of scrutiny as Noah looked at every single one while continuing to speak.","\"Kazuhiko, recall your Vitalistic Clones and merge the gains that have been made. Utilize these...\"","As Noah spoke, he waved his hands to release a cluster of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity that could smoothly elevate Boundaries to the 17th Layer!","\"Utilize these to take your Planar Boundary of Darkness to the 17th Layer as thereafter...you will utilize this Writ to achieve Extremity in it.\"","...!","Most, or really nearly all of Noah's people were affected by him as their concepts were mainly at the Consummate level, with very few even having Innate ranked concepts!","And there were even fewer with Planar ranked concepts as those who held such concepts...they had expanded themselves as they were attached to a part of them that they wished to bring to Extremity.","Kazuhiko had expanded his own concept of Darkness that bathed his Katana as his eyes trembled at the opportunity, nodding with a blank gaze as a moment later- a verdant clone of him reappeared and merged into his body as he glowed with a radiant light, his hands beginning to absorb the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity around him speedily!","Treasures such as these...Noah had in abundance after collecting so many things through the Infernal Havenly Commerce.","When it came to elevating a Planar Boundary to the 17th Layer? This was even easier due to the low ranking of the concept!","After Kazuhiko, Noah continued to wave his hands out and cause bundles of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity to appear in front of a few specific beings.","\"Dr. Hall...take your Planar Boundary of Stomatology and bring it to Extremity.\"","...!","This unique Doctor had continued to expand his own concepts after he had Noah's aid in elevating Medicine and other concepts that were at the Consummate ranking after Noah touched them.","Stomatology was something Dr. Hall had expanded himself on a whim as it now gave him a chance to take it to Extremity!","Noah didn't stop with this as he continued.","\"Shadow Guard Night...take your Planar Boundary of the Scribe and elevate it to Extremity.\"","WAA!","In a far, distant corner behind the visage of a calm Adelaide who turned towards her with a smile, the figure of a certain Shadow Guard was dazed as a cluster of Loot appeared before her.","She considered herself a minor being in the grand scheme of things as she recorded in her Diary the intricacies of things not commonly mentioned in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","The mundane lives when the True Emperor of Quintessence and his son were farming Spiritual Herbs with his mother- Amelia Osmont. The times when the True Emperor of Quintessence cooks grand feasts in paradisiacal domains where the sandy gold essence of dreams falls like a waterfall from the vibrant skies as Barbatos, Athena, Ophelia, Katelyn, and many others swim in royal seas shimmering with Avalon.","The intricate order and balance of the Enders of Extremity and how sad it makes her that the Infinite Hyperversal Haven secludes them in their own Aletheian Havens. How great would it be if they all took on human forms and joined them in their mundane and laid back adventures?","She recorded all of this in her Diary as eventually, she had an epiphany and expanded the Boundary of the Scribe herself- which made it even easier for her to see and record the Events occurring in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","But she never would have expected such an action from her to lead to this.","Adelaide patted her back to wake her out of her stupor as her gaze became firm, her hands moving forward and taking the opportunity presented before her!","The will of the True Emperor of Quintessence didn't linger as he continued to call out others.","\"Maximilian...take your Planar Boundary of the Shattered Emperor and elevate it to Extremity.\"","...!","The figure of another existence trembled in shock as a cluster of Loot appeared before him.","Who was he? He was the Learnean Lineage Emperor who had failed Apexification and was only going to meet an absolute end!","After his fate was entirely changed and his realm and very existence were altered by the True Emperor of Quintessence, he had expanded the concept of the Shattered Emperor to represent his past self as he would have never expected the ultimate result to be this.","And the voice of the True Emperor of Quintessence continued.","\"Cthulhu...take your Planar Boundary of Aether and elevate it to Extremity.\"","A humanoid form of a Chthonian radiated a purple light of glory at such words as even more Existences were mentioned!","\"Athena...take your Planar Boundary of the Inquisitor and elevate it to Extremity.\"","\"Guinevere...take your Planar Boundary of the Connate Beast and elevate it to Extremity.\"","One being after another was called out as each one felt more shocked than the other, with Noah's gaze then going to another corner where a being radiating an intense crimson light was floating isolated and alone.","He gazed at her while pausing as after a moment, his voice continued to thunder out.","\"Lilith, take your Planar Boundary of Hatred and elevate it to Extremity.\"","...!","The eyes of the Daughter of Hatred opened wide.","The Defiler of Souls saw a cluster of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity as well as a brilliant Golden Absolute Hyperversal Writ of Extremity floating in front of her in a shocking twist of fate as she reacted quickly, her gaze moving up to meet the eyes of the being who had shaken her past self and then given her this shocking opportunity as...","His gaze had already moved away.","He didn't linger on her any longer than he had lingered on all the others.","As if he treated her the same, as if there was no need for any special distinction.","Lilith could feel the faraway gazes of Morgana and Guinevere land on her at this opportunity, but she didn't even gaze back as her eyes became even more stern and filled with power.","With many thoughts rising and falling in her mind, her hand reached out as she grasped onto the Loot before her and began undergoing a stupendous change!"]},{"number":2717,"title":"Chapter 2717: Chapter 2716 One by one!","paragraphs":["\"Kraken, take your...\"","\"Anna...\"","\"Ezekiel...\"","\"Aurelia...\"","\"Eowyn...take your Planar Boundary of the Dreamer and elevate it to Extremity.\"","\"Tiamat...take your Planar Boundary of the Draconic Ruler and elevate it to Extremity.\"","One name after another was called as a bountiful opportunity presented itself to some destined beings, all of them taking it fully as those mentioned first had already devoured the Aeonic Treasures of Extremity to take their Planar Boundaries to the 17th Layer- their hands already grasping the Writ of Extremity in front of them!","Kazuhiko was the first as the Writ of Extremity in front of him was ripped open, an oppressive and absolute authority erupting from it that surged into his very being.","His dark hair wavered in this stellar region as he grasped his katana with his right hand, his face rising up and bellowing out pure Darkness a moment later as a dazzling Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of DARKNESS began to form above him.","His soul and origin would then be taken into this Rune Scripture and be reborn under the grandeur of Extremity, his body broken down and reformed to attain an Extremity Body soon after as all of his Aspects of Existence would display and fully attain Extremity!","Under the eyes of all, yet another process of Extremity was seen as if they held any talent and genius, they could use this to gaze upon the profundities of Extremity and forge their own path- or at the very least make it very easy for themselves when they were also given the resources to take them towards Extremity with their higher ranked concepts.","After Kazuhiko, the others all followed in sequential order they were granted the Loot before, with this order only being broken after Maximilian began his transformation as on the side...","BOOM!","Space shuddered above the visage of the Dimensional Deceiver as a blinding Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of HATRED bloomed.","It radiated a power much more grandiose than those before her as it seemed to resonate with her very soul!","Others expanded their Planar Boundaries based on a memory they reminisce about or simply to explore and experiment.","She had expanded Hatred because it was a part of her life since the very beginning. She was entrenched in hatred and knew it very deeply as at the time of her ascension into an Extremity Lifeform, it resonated with her soul!","Instead of taking on the grandeur of a Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture, half of it was tainted with an Obsidian light as it swallowed up her Aspects of Existence- leaving behind a shell that brimmed with life again soon after and even went further to split and enlarge, the devilish form of the Defiler of Souls descending in its full glory as demonic horns rose on either side of her head, a jewel-like third eye opening on her forehead while a flaming crown of Hyperversal Extremity Authority burned above her.","She seemed like an exotic demoness coming to life as her eyes radiated a profound light of power, her soul burning under the grandeur of Hatred as this was the only concept she would focus on next besides Hatred- the concept of the Soul!","Her advancement was watched by all as she spurred on all the chosen others, with a glorious reality playing out in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven at this moment as fated Vassals stepped on the Gradations of Extremity one after another.","Their glory was their own to witness as in the outside spacetime continuum, reality moved on.","A war raged between Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Legions.","The Seven Clans and Inheritances delved deeper into the Supernal Havens of Extremity to establish themselves and attain grand opportunities.","The Seven Clans...apart from the Avernus Clan who were faced with a great deal of challenges at this moment.","This was because within their own bases in different Havens, some of their own Extremities had renounced their allegiance to the Avernus Clan and taken the Blood Sources that granted the Heavenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage- many of them deserting their old posts after that as on the rare chance they were found out by other Avernus Extremities...they were still able to leave and fight their way out as they now expressed much greater power than their counterparts!","But the situation was disheartening for both of them as even though they renounced the Avernus Clan and would no longer be involved with it, they had still spent the majority of their lives with this force and made many memories.","They gave it all up for the chance to ascend ever higher across the Gradations of Extremity, with Apex Aeonic Lifeforms doing this for a chance to attain Extremity.","Ever so rapidly, waves of chaos and discourse were spreading across the bases of the Avernus Clan in all Seven Havens!","Another half a day passed.","It was now 2 days since the True Emperor of Quintessence was notified by the authority that defined him that he had seven days to attain Extremity in it or forever lose this path.","At such a juncture, something worthy of note began playing out within the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","Past a few Golden Havenly Archipelagos that were nearest to the misty wall of Dissolution that the Vein Rifts led to.","Atop a golden dreamy floating island, one of the bases of the Infernal Havenly Commerce could be seen. It was bustling with tens of thousands of Existences moving atop it in an orderly manner, each one ready to trade and barter to get as many Blood Sources as they could. The largest numbers were Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, but a few hundred were Hyperversal Extremities that ranged from Tier 1 to Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","At this moment, the gazes of many rapidly changed as they sensed the descent of an aura much greater than any of these here- an aura filled with infinite heat and majesty as from above, a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity descended with 100 other lower ranked Extremities following behind him!"]},{"number":2718,"title":"Chapter 2718: Chapter 2717 The Hyperversal Bow of Helios! I","paragraphs":["All of them were adorned in crimson robes that had a blinding golden infinity symbol etched behind their backs, the gazes of many people changing as they uttered in hushed tones.","{A major force from the Infinite Extremity...isn't that the Esteemed Infinity Scorcher in the lead?}","...!","Infinity Scorcher.","The Extremity of Flames.","The Extremity of Heat.","The Extremity of Ignition.","He held many titles like this as he was one of the Four Hyperversal Tier 4 Extremities publicly known by other forces!","He walked with majesty as his hair shone like crimson flames, his fair skin tainted with a red hue from blistering heat all around him as he seemed like a man in his prime.","A single crimson horn being circled by hundreds of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures could be seen on the center of his forehead, the Extremities behind him holding their own variations as they stepped towards the main trading area of the Infernal Havenly Commerce, many beings making way!","Within moments, the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity came before Noah's figure as they looked at each other serenely.","The crimson robes of the Infinity Scorcher wave majestically as his voice was deep when he spoke.","{We seem to be seeking after the same type of Extremity.}","His eyes were gazing at the crimson infinity symbol etched on the Golden robes adorned by Noah, and the striking similarity it had with the crimson robes adorned by the Infinity Scorcher and those behind him that had a golden infinity symbol!","One was crimson and the other was gold, but both represented infinity.","Noah smiled at the words of this being while nodding.","{Perhaps. But you didn't come here just for that.}","His eyes were filled with mystery and majesty as he spoke, the crimson hair of the Infinity Scorcher pulsing with light as this being squinted his eyes and nodded, waving his hands to reveal a blinding halcyon light that caused many beings to avert their eyes.","When they refocused, their hearts trembled as they felt the contained pressure and majesty of an Armament of Extremity appear in front of the Infinity Scorcher!","Not a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity, but a genuine one that radiated pristine glory as it pulsed with a halo of a crimson gold light- its identity being none other than the Hyperversal Bow of Helios that Noah had seen closely before in the Infinite Oni Haven!","Currently, the blazing Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Helios that would be raging around it for thousands of light years was contained within it as the hands of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity pulsed with Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of FLAMES.","It didn't have a preset barrier like the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity Noah had traded with the Havenly Moon Clan that contained its authority as the pure might of an Extremity holding it reigned in its blazing majesty.","Receiving this would now be a challenge as another Extremity had to grasp it in order for it to exchange hands!","Noah's eyes twinkled as he looked at the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity who thrust his hand holding out the Hyperversal Bow of Helios.","{It's only a Low Grade Armament of Extremity, but I wonder if it can be exchanged for enough Blood Sources?}","The wondrous treasure was placed forward for Noah to take, the eyes of many beings twinkling at this scene as he didn't even rise himself.","Instead, he waved his hands as behind him, a rift that was veiled by an overabundance of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority split apart space as it connected to another spacetime entirely, with the crimson light of Oraculum flashing briefly as from it- the sharp aura of a Hyperversal Extremity walked out!","Her body shone with a stellar obsidian glow as her curves and blessed figure could be the object of envy for trillions of beings, her powerful aura of a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity emanating from her as she carried a golden treasure cache in her hands that was labeled with {LOOT} atop it.","The aura of hundreds of Millions of Blood Sources spilled out from this treasure chest maddeningly as the souls of all beings nearby felt nourished, the figure of Xiaomi stepping out of the rift with it as with a smile, she placed the chest on the feet of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity!","She then patted her hands as she was the one to reach out and accept the Hyperversal Bow of Helios as blinding Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of RUIN swirled over her skin, their might and pressure allowing her to put her hands on the Low Grade Armament of Extremity as the moment she fully grasped it...","BZZT!","The Infinity Scorcher let go of the Bow of Helios as it buzzed in her hands threatening to get out.","But her body only released a dozen more Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures that calmed the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Helios, her face carrying a look of accomplishment as she nodded towards the group of Extremities in front of her and walked back towards the portal pulsing with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","She was no longer only limited to 9 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures as after her existence was nourished and refined to a sufficiently powerful extent, she was able to move from the Zenith of the First Gradation of Extremity the moment a tenth Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture began to form.","It was then established that a minimum of 9 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures were required before an existence could touch upon the stage of a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity.","But Noah utilized the power of the Extremity he had forged under him to receive the shockingly powerful Hyperversal Bow of Helios, exchanging it for a treasure cache that held 10 Billion Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood Sources that when the will of the Infinity Scorcher passed over, he nodded in appreciation while waving his hands- his forces beginning to move out right after as the treasure cache disappeared!","10 Billion.","The Half-Forged Armament of Extremity was traded with 50 Million Blood Sources, but a completed one received so much more! This was just how much more precious a complete Armament was.","The number wasn't explicitly stated, but those in the surroundings could feel the breadth of hundreds of millions of Blood Sources as they drew sharp breaths.","They knew that with this...all of the prominent forces of the Infinite Extremity Inheritance were about to undergo an overhaul of strengthening and elevation as this Aeonic Inheritance would not be the same thereafter!"]},{"number":2719,"title":"Chapter 2719: Chapter 2718 The Hyperversal Bow of Helios! II","paragraphs":["Many eyes watched the pristine figures of the Infinite Extremity leave with billions of Blood Sources as when seeing such ancient inheritances make a move- they knew that the coming era would be dominated by those who obtained treasures like these.","If someone didn't obtain a Blood Source to acquire the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, they would be left far, far behind all others in the coming future!","While many began having these thoughts, they also began to closely look at the Infernal Havenly Commerce that was trading all of these Blood Sources.","They had seen how this behemoth had already taken in two Armaments of Extremity as they wondered...in the future to come, just how many more wonders would they take in?","Such a future was unknown, but many beings had already begun working on their behalf as there were now a few hundred Extremities who signed up to be Employees of the Infernal Havenly Commerce and spread their wares into the Nether Havens of Extremity!","As for those who couldn't even grasp these Blood Sources?","Their future was grim!","—","In the Nether Haven of Andromeda.","Within a major base of the Avernus Clan, in a cluster of Major Planes of Existence.","In a small hidden domain in a corner of this base that was known as the Thousand Plane Lilac Cluster, the figures of two beings were hidden within as their eyes carried immense wrath and trepidation!","These two figures were the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity who was formally respected and distinguished as Destruction, and the other was the past genius who was a disciple under him- Ahpuch!","These two beings stayed in a hidden domain and didn't dare to step out the past days as when they were actively moving about, they were receiving hateful gazes and even silent words from all those around them.","Everyone knew the conflict that Osmont had with them.","And they all knew that it stemmed from the actions of Destruction and his Disciple!","The gradual Deterioration of the Avernus Clan and their hegemony was at times placed on their shoulders as after the last day, Destruction and Ahpuch could not even bring themselves to leave their hidden domain.","They felt as if there was a massive blade hanging over their necks- this blade just waiting to swing down and use them as scapegoats for what had occurred.","They felt as if their very lives were on the line as any day now, the blame would be so much that they may just be killed in anger by the Avernus Extremity Overlord himself!","So these two once prominent Existences lived with trepidation as at this time, their fate seemed infinitely dark.","Meanwhile, the man they had initiated the conflict with had been getting many things ready for a stupendous transformation, with grand changes occurring in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven in the past half a day as these lands welcomed 23 more Hyperversal Extremities in addition to Xiaomi!","Each being was more prominent than the last as Noah had them reform their Vitalistic Clones soon after- this process taking much longer for them as Extremities as even until now, none had completed this task yet as it took a great deal of resources and their Hyperversal Extremity Authority to construct clones of equivalent power.","With the passage of the previous hours, Noah did not sit idly by as his will in the form of the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum had entered the Recorded History of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity to once more carry out Hyperversal Plundering.","This time, his target had been something that he almost failed to attain as it was halfway through being a completed product of Extremity.","His target had been the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity that he had already attained, and yet he tried Plundering it in the Recorded History as the result was now visible with the scene of two purple light years domains that sat side by side!","It wasn't something easy as it came with heavy restrictions, with the myriad of prompts that had come telling Noah how at his current stage, he could only plunder Half-Forged Armaments of Extremity, and such an act of Plundering could only be done once per object.","It was also outlined that he wouldn't be able to plunder genuine Armaments of Extremity until he himself attained Extremity!","But to him, this was only a matter of time and possibilities.","Because even as two field domains pulsing with Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Andromeda shone brightly in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, Xiaomi reappeared at this time thousands of light years above as her figure released the Low Grade Armament of Extremity from her hands- her figure weary and spent just from holding and reigning it in for a few seconds as the Hyperversal Bow of Helios roared out and released waves of Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Helios!","The Vassals that had just attained Extremity looked at this scene with wonder along with all others, Noah's figure rising up at this moment as he stared at the brilliant Bow of Helios.","Xiaomi came to float beside him looking weary as she spoke with a glimmer of excitement.","{When you grasp it, its details and capabilities begin to unveil themselves, do you want to know? It's utterly ridiculous...}","Her eyes were bright at the sheer majesty of the capabilities that the Hyperversal Bow of Helios showed!","Yet Noah shook his head while opening his palm, his voice ringing out gently.","\"I'll find out myself soon enough.\"","...!","There, in his hands, one could see a dazzling multicolored Seed.","A seed that radiated a pristine light of Quintessence as it had reached full maturity!","It was a Sporos III of Extremity that was ready to bloom into an Ash Tree III of Gradation.","One tool that would be used to scale the Unscalable Wall of Extremity was now in his hands.","The other was Apexification itself as the third Tool...was the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity that he had just obtained through Hyperversal Plundering."]},{"number":2720,"title":"Chapter 2720: Chapter 2719 Quintessential Apexification! I","paragraphs":["One of the tools to aid Noah in scaling an Unscalable Wall was the Plundered Half-Forged Armament of Extremity!","This was because after his first Vacuous Awakening, Noah had attained the {Hyperversal I Assimilation} authority that gave him a glimpse into the power of Vacuous Malignancies.","This feature was then elevated to Hyperversal II Assimilation as it allowed him to devour and assimilate treasures, existences, concepts...any Records laying before him as he could apply the authority of what he devoured towards the progression of his Realm, fortifying his foundation, or even towards the elevation of his concepts.","The reason for him to Plunder the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity even though he already had one...was to prepare the plundered one that he would devour and assimilate.","With all of these means, if he couldn't break through the Unscalable Wall of Extremity and forge a soul unlike any other across Recorded History...then nobody would ever be able to do such a thing!","HUUM!","Reality began to buzz as he threw out the Sporos III of Extremity in his hands, watching it land and become anchored near the plundered Half-Forged Armament of Extremity as it began to release waves of multicolored light- an ancient illusory tree beginning to emerge from it.","His main body then appeared beside the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity that he couldn't yet grasp as his visage then began to suffuse with a Quintessential light.","His breath was steady as he had brought himself to the precipice of a grand achievement.","The realm and progression of others were simple as they became Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and then sought and fought for Extremity.","Yet he had already grasped multiple parts of Extremity even before undergoing Apexification as he had Eyes of Extremity, and he could forge False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures en masse!","And on this day, after a great deal of preparations...","\"It is time.\"","BOOM!","His words thundered out across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as they meant many things.","First, an indomitable and breathtaking illusory tree appeared as its grandeur flashed across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven- the might of the Ash Tree III of Gradation making itself visible to as as streams of multicolored rivers of light made its branches that all began to flicker and surge towards Noah!","Second, his body began to give off an undeniable glow as Hyperversal II Assimilation was activated, a heavy pull surrounding the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity as it began to tremble!","And then....","SAA!","Space flickered as beside Noah's main body, another figure came to be.","It was none other than the recalled figure of Alexander King.","It was time for the Vitalistic Clone to rerun to Noah, along with the stupendous gains that had been made as he would be even greater fuel for a shockingly Quintessential foundation.","It was most definitely time!","Without a delay, the body of Alexander King turned into radiant verdant light that thundered into Noah's Aspects of Existence.","And at the same time...Noah's Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds flickered and boomed out as his voice reverberated commandingly.","\"Apexification.\"","...!","A Refulgence of light exploded.","An array of prompts danced around Noah!","As the might of the Ash Tree III of Gradation descended, the chosen Havenly Authority was determined to be Penumbra- the mighty tree towering over the Infinite Hyperversal Haven bathed and radiating obsidian tendrils of light within their branches that all sank into Noah's as if he was an ancient singularity.","{The Seventh Aletheian Haven is continuing its forging.}","He had Seven Aletheian Havens already established as the last one had a small portion of it completed with the Havenly Authority of Oceanus, with the other portion of the Seventh Haven now beginning to burst forth with an obsidian light as Penumbra came forth.","{The First Havenly Boundary Layer of Penumbra has been attained.}","{The Second...}","Prompts came and went, but some were more important than others as Noah classified them into separate quadrants, his eyes focusing on the ones that would determine his future path with intensity.","{You have completed the cycle of life and death by returning your Vitalistic Clone into your existence.}","{Your Clone achieved stupendous feats and enacted reality sundering Meridians!}","{The accomplishments and Records of the Vitalistic Clone are being assimilated into your foundation.}","There were the prompts of his assimilation of Alexander that came first as thereafter, there were the wonders of the Ash Tree III of Gradation, Half-Forged Armament of Extremity, and Apexification.","{Your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul has reached the highest peak it can before scaling the Unscalable Wall of Extremity.}","{The authority of the Ash Tree III of Gradation seeks a pathway as it cannot strengthen your soul any longer.}","{You are the 9th Existence to reach the highest possible level of the Soul recorded throughout history before attaining Extremity!}","His soul had been refined and strengthened so much that it could not undergo any more strengthening.","It had arrived and was knocking on the door of the Unscalable Wall of Extremity as if he could not overcome it, his soul could not grow stronger.","And thus....came his other prepared means.","{Hyperversal II Assimilation is grasping at the authority of the Andromeda Cleaver!}","The dazzling Half-Forged Armament of Extremity plundered from a Recorded History before him seemed to come alive with flames of unwillingness, and yet parts of it began to flake off and merge into Noah's body that seemed to be the center of a heavy storm within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven currently.","His people watched from a far distance as they were gobsmacked at the variety of authorities surging around him, each one with more intensity than the others as even when Xiaomi and other Vassals attained Extremity, it wasn't this wild.","And yet they knew...the True Emperor of Quintessence before them was only undergoing his Apexification at this moment.","What if his enemies knew what was happening?","What if the Tier 1 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities he had killed knew that they died even before he underwent Apexification?!","What if the Avernus Extremity Overlord and the few other Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities under this behemoth of a Clan knew that their force was being systematically broken down by an existence that was only now undergoing Apexification?","Their eyes would roll back as their souls may just fracture from shock and disbelief alone!","But none of this mattered to the being himself as after flakes of the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity began to flow into his body, his will made the decision.","{The target of Hyperversal II Assimilation has been determined to be the soul.}","{The assimilated authority of a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity is being directed into your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul!}","BOOM!","A heavy thud emanated from Noah's body that emanated across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, the souls of his people shuddering and resonating with this thud as they moved back in astonishment.","It was a heavy knock on the Unscalable Wall of Extremity that produced it as not too long after...","BOOM!","The explosive thud echoed out again as the True Emperor of Quintessence sought to break this wall entirely!"]},{"number":2721,"title":"Chapter 2721: Chapter 2720 Quintessential Apexification! II","paragraphs":["2720 Quintessential Apexification! II","A scene of Quintessential glory!","It was witnessed by a select few as if the True Emperor of Quintessence wished for it, even their eyes would be masked and not be able to gaze upon any part of his transformation.","But they had access to observe because they had to see what was possible.","They had to see that even the impossible and Unscalable could be made possible and scaled!","In the corner of the erupting domain field of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios that spread out its Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of HELIOS for thousands of light years, the visage of a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity could be seen.","Her identity was a simple one as she was a Shadow Guard under the moniker of Night, and she was one of the only beings who was recording down a record of what was currently occurring.","Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Scribe danced around her and formed into a golden pen that was constantly writing on a massive and ancient looking white gold tome- a tome that had as its title [The Quintessential Apexification of the True Emperor of Quintessence]!","Within it, The Scribe recorded down everything she saw as astonishing sentences could be seen constantly etched on this ancient looking book.","[...His body took the center point of multiple converging authorities as he swallowed them in with a pace that put Singularities to shame.","A celestial tree extended its branches into him and bathed him with indomitable might, his tower like Havens barely being discernable as the Seventh one was almost completed!","The Half-Forged Armament of Extremity that many of them couldn't even near a day ago was breaking off piece by piece- somehow being devoured by his existence as if a pristine item like this could only be something that could supplement and add to his glory.","And then to the shock and awe of all his people...his Meridian Seeds began to light up and bloom.","His Aspects of Existence began to be drawn into these blooming seeds as they were rising to become endless pillars of multicolored light that represented Hyperversal Extremity Meridians!","Wondrously, his body began to be drawn in as an illusory multicolored shell of light remained visible to all. His soul still pervaded across his existence as a part of it was taken into the Meridians, with the rest of it staunch and unmoving.","Even more drastic, an outline of his tower like Origin remained undaunted.","It didn't even move a single step to be taken into the blooming Meridians as its stature seemed far too pristine and unchanging!","And then...the blooming Meridians roared out in a fervent valor of majesty as...","No way...]","The Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Scribe trembled as the body of Night also trembled while she gazed forward.","Geniuses had at most 9 or 10 Meridians when they completed their Apexification. Even in their Infinite Hyperversal Haven, the highest numbers were upwards of 24 or 36!","Noah already showed 81 blinding Extremity Meridian Seeds blooming, but the scene that caused even Night's Hyperversal Extremity Authority to stutter in its recording was even more astonishing.","[...An unforeseen glory.","Before all of our eyes, in addition to the 81 blooming Meiridans within the body of the Tyrannical Emperor, another 81 bloomed opposite them in a moment that drew utter silence from all.","Silence for the immensity of the achievement.","Silent for the grandeur of the True Emperor of Quintessence!","Silence for those who chose to be his enemies.","For his enemies...their souls may not have a shred of hope or mercy after this!]","The Scribe continued to record.","Others continued to gaze at the transformation in shock!","And yet the True Emperor of Quintessence thundered forward to enact an unequaled Foundation!","The rest of his tools to scale an unscalable wall were utilized as while flakes of a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity entered his body and struck at the wall preventing his soul from getting any stronger, other parts of his existence were shimmering and undergoing even grander transformations as his blooming 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds came alive at this moment.","But...they weren't alone as after assimilating the existence of Alexander and other unknown factors, there were now 81 illusory Hyperversal Extremity Meridians standing opposite them!","162 Meridians!","The newly appearing 81 Meridians took in more of his soul to refine and transform it as paired with the assimilated essence of a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity and the waves of authority from the Ash Tree III of Gradation...","BOOM!","The explosive knock on the Unscalable Wall of Extremity was faced with a thudding sound as if it were now knocking on a hollow tree.","As if another few knocks would make way!","Noah could feel this in his soul as he felt like he was hammering away with multiple different tools, each one hitting different avenues of his soul as after being compressed and enriched over and over again, it could only continue its advent upwards.","BOOM!","The nearby thousands of light years of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven began to tremble with the boons of Noah's soul.","Those watching felt as if their own souls were booming as they scrambled back in shock and horror.","Noah felt the time nearing and coming ever closer as he couldn't take it anymore, Quintessence shining all around him as what remained of his illusory body clenched his fist and expanded his chest, breathing in like an abyssal singularity as his existence took in every remaining chunk of the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity- his whole existence illuminating like a multicolored sun as he bellowed out!","[OOOOH!]","A thundering bellow thundered out as the souls of all existences that had yet to reach Extremity were overwhelmed by the sheer pressure and immensity as their eyes rolled back and their consciousness was momentarily brought to a halt.","A few like Henry fell down to their knees as his pure Lineage held up his soul and prevented him from losing consciousness right away as a light from the very Infinite Hyperversal Haven enveloped him and others just as a security measure!","The 23 Vassals that had achieved Extremity felt their Hyperversal Extremity Authority shaken as it inherently trembled as if the advent of a much grander authority made their very concepts of Extremity want to kneel!"]},{"number":2722,"title":"Chapter 2722: Chapter 2721 Quintessential Apexification! III","paragraphs":["2721 Quintessential Apexification! III","A bellow that caused all those who weren't Extremity Lifeforms to lose consciousness with the exception of a select few!","Even beings in the depths of the Aletheian Havens millions of light years away heard it as they were overwhelmed by its sheer majesty and temporarily fell into a slumber.","On the bodies of the 23 Vassals that had attained Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity and on Xiaomi...they felt as if their concepts of Extremity were shuddering and bowing down at the oncoming oppression as...","BOOM...CRACK!","A door was breached.","A wall was smashed so many times that it couldn't help but begin to crack.","And once a single crack was established...","BOOM!","Everything else would be blown to oblivion!","At this moment, every authority came to a standstill.","For a brief instant.","Thereafter, everything raged in a controlled and systematic manner as finally, the dense waves of authority from the Ash Tree III of Gradation surged into his soul.","The waves of authority from a digesting Half-Forged Armament of Extremity surged into his soul.","And the process of Apexification continued and sought to transform his soul!","But...it had exceeded an uncrossable boundary.","It could not be categorized the same way that it was before as the processes that were happening and trying to alter the soul were all not accepted.","The authorities came to a standstill once more.","Noah's soul shone with brilliance as at this very moment, it had taken just a single tiny step forward that demarcated the level of the soul of a Non-","Extremity and an Extremity.","But for one to have an Extremity Soul...they had to have their existence swallowed up by the first Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture they forged!","The Rune Scripture would then alter their Soul and release an Extremity Soul thereafter.","Noah had watched this process himself twice a dozen times in the past day.","So without a genuine Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture...how would he have his Extremity Soul forged?","It was the question and conundrum that caused everything to come to a standstill at this moment!","And yet...booming prompts that foretold of the answers came.","[A Quintessential Achievement Unrecorded across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!]","[You have scaled a wall impossible for your level of life to scale!]","[Your soul has thoroughly stepped into a stage only those that have attained Extremity can achieve.]","[A monumental achievement that has yet to receive any honorariums in the eons of Recorded History!]","BOOM!","With the advent of these prompts, the space above Noah split wide open as Records were torn and ripped apart.","And from the torn records descended a shocking Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture that radiated pure milky white transparent light.","It read [VITALIS] and caused the Extremity Souls of Xiaomi and the other Extremity Vassals to entirely bend down and kneel!","It was massive and small in stature at the same time as it seemed to be towering over the forged Aletheian Havens below.","But before this shocking Rune Scripture could do anything, another booming sound echoed out as the torn records were spread out ever wider, a roar of glory and valor coming out as an inky black Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture reading [VACUOUS] also descended!","These two immense Scriptures hung above Noah and seemed to buzz with utmost glory, all other authorities remaining still as his soul began to be drawn up towards them.","[The Quintessential Achievement that is being recorded for the first time has allowed the Honorarium of Extremity Sanctification of the Soul by Hyperversal Havenly Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures.]","[The change and future ushered forth by this is unknown.]","...!","In equal proportions, half by half, his soul was taken into the Rune Scriptures of VITALIS and VACUOUS.","Everything was utterly silent until every shred of his soul was devoured by the blinding Scriptures.","In this instant of time, Noah felt like he experienced an indeterminate number of years.","He felt like he saw countless things, and yet saw nothing.","His soul buzzed as an instant later, this sensation faded as his soul was released onto the illusory shell that was his body and the vibrant Origin with Seven Aletheian Havens in it!","The instant it came out of the massive Rune Scriptures, everything changed as Xiaomi and the others sank evermore in their kneeling positions.","The instant that parts of his soul began to be released, the authorities that were at a standstill finally surged with fervor as they were now able to sink into it freely.","They were able to permeate across his soul and further strengthen it as...","[You have Scaled the Unscalable Wall of Extremity and come out of the other side with a unique Extremity Soul.]","[You have attained an Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul!]","[You are the first Existence in Recorded History to achieve a type of Extremity Soul before taking a Concept to Extremity!]","Glorious prompts came as above, the Rune Scriptures of VITALIS and VACUOUS receded into the folds of Records.","Two parts of Noah's soul had come from them and filled up a single body, everything coming together with brilliance and wonder as his soul filled his Body and Origin.","Subtle and not so subtle changes began across his existence as his body no longer remained illusory, a new body etched from his Meiridans and Soul as after a few short seconds...","HUUM!","His eyes opened wide.","He floated in space as around him, authorities were fully swallowed into his existence as in his Origin, a seventh Haven released glorious brilliance as an Eighth one began to be forged.","And his body...radiated such an intense aura that made even Xiaomi and the others feel suffocated!","The aura that he released was suffocating to even Tier 2 and Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities!","Why was this?","Both he and them now held Extremity Souls, but his was a unique one as he had undergone Extremity Sanctification of the Soul by Hyperversal Havenly Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures.","It was always Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","Yet now, the Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Extremity Authority descended and were the ones to allow the Extremity Sanctification of his soul!","They didn't glow gold, obsidian, or crims","on as they seemed out of these ranks entirely.","Achieving an Extremity Soul from these concepts...just what did it bring?"]},{"number":2723,"title":"Chapter 2723: Chapter 2722 Quintessential Apexification! IV","paragraphs":["Every shred of his soul had been taken into the dazzling Rune Scriptures of VITALIS and VACUOUS and was released as a unique type of Extremity Soul!","Every shred.","The different parts of his soul spread across the Vitalis Havens.","His Reified Source of Quintessence taking the form of a Vacuous I Entity. His body following the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity Titanosaurus who was leading him to a unique domain within the Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago.","His body that was situated in front of the Adjudicator of Dissolution whose gaze towards him changed greatly at this moment!","{You...have achieved Extremity?!}","She had felt the body before her become entirely empty as a moment later, it was filled with a shockingly abundant and powerful Extremity Soul that radiated a ferocious power that was only increasing with every passing second.","When the eyes of the clone before her opened again, his aura seemed distinguished and far above others as when his nine pupils landed on her, the Adjudicator of Dissolution felt a sense of discomfort!","What was this? She- an Adjudicator of a Haven at the Zenith of Tier 3, felt uncomfortable under the gaze of a being that had just become an Extremity?","She very soon realized that it wasn't that the Extremity Soul was more powerful than hers, it was just that its gaze felt particularly penetrative and authoritative compared to her own soul as this was the cause of the sense of uncomfortability!","His newly opened eyes blinked as reality seemed to become dimmer and brighter with every blink.","He seemed to be getting accustomed to his new soul and eyes as they were focused on the Adjudicator of Dissolution, his words emanating out with grand stature and authority at this moment as he replied to her question.","{No...not Extremity. I have merely undergone Apexification.}","...!","Words that caused the eyes of the Adjudicator to flutter boomed out.","What...the fuck did this even mean? His very being emanated the grandeur of an Extremity Soul, so of course he had achieved Extremity! Yet...why did his words not contain a hint of falsehood?!","As the mind of the Adjudicator of Dissolution buzzed, Noah's eyes that expressed the power of his new Soul continued to gaze at her as he tilted his head to the left as if he found something peculiar.","His voice echoed out soon after as his words were calm, but they felt like thunderous booms of life and death in front of the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","{Nevermind that though...why is it that you have inborn Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians, and your very existence seems to have as its source Vacuous Hyperversal Authority?}","{...!}","BOOOM!","The first display of what his new Extremity Soul was capable of.","He gazed at a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity and instantly saw something within her that was hidden at the very core of her existence.","He spoke words that caused the Adjudicator of Dissolution to shudder before a moment later, her veiled face of shocking beauty became utterly ashen as a dense number of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures erupted from her and covered everything in this domain!","And yet before her, the clone of the being expressing an Extremity Soul kept his utmost calm in the face of blooming Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures as his voice continued to ring out.","{If I wanted to expose you, I have many bodies stretched out across these Havens that can do so in a heartbeat. Vacuous or Vitalis...does not matter to me. All I have is curiosity...and your existence in the Senatus of Extremity and Curagulus of Extremity has made me very, very curious.}","His eyes glimmered with majesty as he spoke with a smile even under the blatant threat of a terrifying Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","An Extremity whose blooming authority slowly calmed with the passing seconds as in the next instant, the veil that always adorned her face was torn down, revealing an astonishing visage underneath!","—","What boons did achieving an Extremity Soul in the manner that Noah achieved it bring?","The answer was an Astounding one as Noah's nine pupils radiated a terrifying light of blankness as he took everything in!","{{Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul}:: An achievement Unrecorded in the eons of History that have passed. It is a type of soul gained before the True Emperor of Quintessence elevated any concept to Extremity, ushering the appearance of the Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of VITALIS and VACUOUS to descend as the Honorarium for such an achievement. Eight other beings have touched upon the Unscalable Wall, and the True Emperor of Quintessence was the first one to cross this wall before attaining Extremity. Under this type of Extremity Soul, all the concepts currently within your Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians are being elevated from Consummate to the ranking of Quintessential Zenith, with future concepts placed in your Meridians and nourished by your soul completing this process within a day. The veil between Havenly Extremity Authorities and Infernal Extremity Authority is now non-existent in your eyes as the secrecy and information that couldn't be accessed before within the Vacuous and Vitalis Annals of Extremity becomes accessible to your soul. The impossible task of taking Quintessence to Extremity has been made manageable by the Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul, with this concept currently being enriched as within the following days, it has a much greater chance of being elevated to Extremity....}","{... Utilizing other means on top of your Extremity Soul will only hasten this process as the path of waiting for your 9 Aletheian Havens to be completed is now not the only Quintessential Path of Extremity. Enough achievements have been stacked by your existence as if it were correlated to any other concept, it would have achieved Extremity a day ago. Furthermore, any Planar, Innate, and Consummate Boundaries can be feely taken to Extremity after bathing in the light of your Soul for Three, Six, and Nine Days respectively. With your Soul reaching the stage of Extremity and yet no concepts achieving this same stage, you are in a unique position across Recorded and Unrecorded Histories. The power behind Existences who have achieved Extremity lie in their Rune Scriptures, and yet you have no Rune Scriptures born from your soul. Such a reality leaves a lot of things in the realm of the unknown as it will require exploration to see just what you are capable of, with the limits currently unknown. With this soul, there only remains a word of caution as with it, attaining Extremity for you through lesser concepts at the ranks of Planar, Innate, or Consummate has become incredibly easy as it may occur in a passing thought. For the sake of attaining Extremity in Quintessence, it cautions you to stop the formation of any lesser Rune Scripture before it and halt the advancement of any concept towards Extremity before it- lest you jeopardize your advancement of Quintessence to Extremity...}","...!"]},{"number":2724,"title":"Chapter 2724: Chapter 2723 Quintessential Apexification! V","paragraphs":["Quintessence sought to be first.","It had to be first- it was in the name and distinction!","The last portion of the details of his Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul was actually commandeered by Quintessence to tell Noah that with his soul, he could achieve Extremity in lesser concepts as easily as just thinking.","If he found himself crossing the 17th Boundary Layer and going towards the Extremity Layer in any concept that wasn't Quintessence...he had to actually halt such a process as Quintessence had to be first.","To attain Extremity in this dead path, Noah had been stacking one Quintessential Achievement after another!","Scaling and Unscalable Wall was only another one of these grand achievements as it had brought him all that much closer, loosening the grand locks and restrictions around Quintessence as the means Noah could use to attain Extremity in it were expanded.","The main pathway was of course to establish all the 9 Aletheian Havens.","But...he could also try other methods like refining a Quintessence Planalith Krystallos!","His Achievements were grand enough.","He may just be able to do it! Then, there were the other wonders of his Extremity Soul that included an overabundance of things, but the most terrifying thing of all...was the fact that he lay on the realm of Recorded and Unrecorded Histories where his soul didn't have a lot of things to compare to, and so the limits of what it could do were unknown!","It was an Extremity Soul, and yet it didn't hold its own Extremity Rune Scripture.","When Noah's will now gazed at his surroundings with this new soul, he felt as if the secrets of Extremity were laying themselves bare before his very eyes.","His clone that was next to the Adjudicator of Dissolution had just opened its eyes when it saw across the veils of secrecy and found out the fact that the Adjudicator of the Haven that had begun the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification was actually a Vacuous Hyperversal Extremity!","When his main body gazed at the space of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven around him, he could see the myriad of swirling authorities and their ebb and flow.","He could see the branches of the Ash Tree III of Gradation give its last vestiges of authority unto him as it left behind a glimmer of a Sporos IV of Extremity.","He felt undulations of pristine authority within his Origin as the Seventh Aletheian Haven was completed...and the authority of the Ash Tree III of Gradation had enough remaining to even begin forging the beginnings of his Eighth Aletheian Haven.","He had to forge Nine Aletheian Havens, and he had already started on the Eighth!","Along with all this, his Apexification had brought forth an Unfathomable reality.","{You have attained 162 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians!}","{The concepts contained within are transforming into the rank of Quintessential Zenith.}","{Your Innate Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians are being bathed by your Extremity Soul and strengthened by the process of Apexification as they begin to transform.}","All parts of him advanced forward as he could feel Quintessence and all of his other concepts exceed the bounds of the Crimson Consummate level and achieve a stage that had Quintessence in its name.","Their Layers were further modified and elevated.","It also meant the Dynamis they made were even more elevated compared to before!","Of course, an advancement of concepts to the Quintessential Zenith level also meant the prominent layers of some particularly astounding concepts- like the concept of Quintessence itself...had its boundary layers elevated in a ridiculous fashion.","{The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of Quintessence has taken the reigns of the elevation towards Quintessential Zenith, allowing the immeasurable advancement of the Quintessential Hyperversal Ash Tree IV of Gradation that blooms from the Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos IV of Extremity to continue elevating and refining your Extremity Soul with half of its authority, while the other half of the authority can now be utilized to elevate your Aletheian Havens not just with the Havenly Authorities stemming from the Vitalis Havens of Extremity, but also the Infernal Authorities of the Vacuous Havens of Extremity. This process requires the penetration of Records far from your current location as it makes the maturity of Sporos of Extremity even more difficult...}","...!","A ridiculous authority came to be due to a myriad of factors.","The already astonishing effects of the Ash Tree of Gradation were further elevated as apart from the Havenly Authorities, Noah was going to pay a heavy cost to also gain access to Infernal Authorities.","It laid out the ground work for a glorious future as at this time, Noah continued to ascertain the changes within him as prompts continued to rise here and there, but what he truly wanted to do...was to tear the Limits of his Extremity Soul that even its description stated were unknown.","He would be the one to test them and quantify just what this Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul could do!","And when he arrived at such a thought, his eyes that were now flung wide open gazed all around him.","They passed over the kneeling Xiaomi and 23 other Extremities as the pressure radiating from his eyes only continued to become more maddening even to their souls, their heads unconsciously brought down as they couldn't meet his gaze straight on!","His gaze felt like that of an ancient emperor Unrecorded in eons past as he could see through the deepest secrets within their souls in a single glance.","After his gaze passed over his people, it came to land on billowing crimson gold Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of HELIOS that was being released from a single Low Grade Armament of Extremity.","Xiaomi had barely been able to hold it for a few seconds before she had to let go, and she was a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity with only Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures.","If Noah wanted to test the limits of his soul...what better way was there than grasping something that only Hyperversal Extremities could?","With a thought, his whole body pulsed with brilliance.","And an instant later, he bypassed the thousands of light years of billowing Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of HELIOS and appeared inches away from the terrifying Hyperversal Bow of Helios.","The blazing authority that used to give him pressure before...felt like a seaside breeze over his existence currently.","And the Armament of Extremity before him that if one clasped, it meant they had already achieved Extremity or were establishing their Extremity Layer...it felt like any other object before his Extremity Soul as his hand reached out!","His hand that was bathed with his Extremity Soul across every single atom.","KAA!","It's proximity to the Hyperversal Bow of Helios caused a fearsome cry to ring out from this Armament of Extremity, and yet the approaching hand swiped from right to left as with a glimmer of majesty and a booming glory, the hand bathed in Quintessence landed on the Armament of Extremity and clasped it tightly!"]},{"number":2725,"title":"Chapter 2725: Chapter ﻿2724 Appalling Might! I","paragraphs":["An Armament of Extremity could not be touched by those who had not achieved Extremity.","It was yet another unbreakable rule that on this day, the True Emperor of Quintessence violated.","His right hand reached out and grasped onto the grip of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios as this Armament of Extremity buzzed in his hands!","His Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul was bathing all of his being as changes continued to occur in his body, with his grasp on the bow before him being unshakable as the purest and densest waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Helios burned themselves on his stellar skin.","And yet his figure remained unfettered as after buzzing in his palm for another few seconds, the Hyperversal Bow of Helios calmed as Noah's Soul began to cover it entirely.","As his will entered it, it also returned a feedback of itself as extremely Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Helios danced and resonated with Noah's Extremity Soul.","[An astonishing feat!]","[Before taking any concept to Extremity, you have grasped onto an Armament of Extremity and dominated its will!]","[The Seventeenth Havenly Boundary Layer of Helios is taking great strides towards Extremity.]","[An infinitesimally small distance is left between the 17th Havenly Boundary Layer of Helios and the Extremity Layer of Helios!]","Grasping an Armament of Extremity meant that one was at this stage or was undergoing the changes to achieve it.","Millions of streams of information about Helios flowed into Noah's mind feely after grasping the Hyperversal Bow of Helios as it instantly took this Boundary of the precipice of Extremity.","It felt like if Noah concentrated just a little bit more...he may be able to take that infinitesimally small step and come out the other side.","But...","'Suppress.'","He had to actively stop this process as Helios was not the first Boundary he had to achieve Quintessence in.","His path was a stellar one.","What others considered Dead Paths and could never traverse- this was what he would take to Extremity first. It remained Quintessence!","So instead of focusing on the Extreme of Helios that the Bow of his hands was resonating, he instead focused on its information.","It no longer radiated the light years domain of Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Helios as the moment Noah grasped it, all of this power and grandiose might seemed to be contained within.","Its shape became clear.","It was a longbow that was nearly as tall as him, the limbs of the bow simmering with a crimson gold color as on its surface, Rune Scriptures of HELIOS could be seen constantly moving.","The grip at the center of the bow was near the arrow rest where an arrow would be knocked, with a Singularity of blazing gold etched at the very center of this grip as Noah's palm was centered on it- this being the area that would devour waves of resources to activate the Hyperversal Bow of Helios and knock an arrow!","The bow tips were curved like sharp mountains as it seemed like they could be used as spear tips for close combat, while the bowstring...it seemed so infinitely sharp that the fingers of even a weak Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity may be shredded if they tried to pull back such a bow string!","The whole weapon gave off a Havenly glow of gold and crimson as its details unveiled themselves before Noah.","[[Hyperversal Bow of Helios]:: A Low Grade Armament of Extremity that was formed naturally in the center of a Haven that bore the metalloid of Helionium. Due to a Havenly Authority being at its very core, an existence with Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures is most ideal in the usage of this weapon as an Extremity with the backing of only Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures cannot support its output of this weapon. Among the ranks of Armaments of Extremity, its purpose is to display and release the quickest output of the Havenly Authority of Helios, its speed being at the very top of Low Grade Armaments of Extremity. At its base use, knocking back the String of Helios will require 100 Extremity Soul Values and 100,000 Extremity Mana Values as this will form a [Hyperversal Projectile of Helios]- an arrow containing 9 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Helios at its core. The [Hyperversal Projectile of Helios] exceeds the bounds of spacetime continuum, reality, and existence as the selected target can be reached with 100% certainty regardless of their location in the Axis of space and time, or if they exist outside of it. If you are capable of observing their Records in real time, one can be selected as a target as this doesn't require any change in usage...]","[...If the target is pursued in Recorded or Unrecorded Histories, this will require ten times the Extremity Soul Value to enact a [Hyperversal Projectile of Helios] that can pursue an enemy in their Recorded or Unrecorded History. Once hit by a [Hyperversal Projectile of Helios], all 9 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Helios will radiate their Extremity Authority to decimate the core Records of the Aspects of Existence of the target. If all Records of the Target are successfully erased, the [Hyperversal Projectile of Helios] will use the force of the extinguished Records to undergo [Nirvanic Rebirth of Helios] and produce another [Hyperversal Projectile of Helios] that will chain to another intended target, and this chain effect can continue a total of 9 times if every selected target thereafter perishes due to each shot. If there isn't another intended target, the newly reborn [Hyperversal Projectile of Helios] will return to you and grant back half of its initial resource requirement. This only covers the rudimentary and base usage of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios, with advanced usage including the features of [Deadeye], [Infinite Helios], and [Ricochet]. An Extremity Soul that had been reinforced and refined by Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures will be best suited to utilize the advanced features of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios as the resource requirement becomes that much greater, and a weak Extremity Soul cannot bear it...]","...!"]},{"number":2726,"title":"Chapter 2726: Chapter ﻿2725 Appalling Might! II","paragraphs":["Noah's eyes squinted at the details of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios as the space around him shuddered.","It shuddered as if it was crying out in sorrow and despair for anyone who chose to be his enemy!","Noah's own soul perused across the details of the Low Grade Armament of Extremity hundreds of times in an instant as he understood its capabilities extremely well, his own soul buzzing when he read the details of the advanced features of [Deadeye], [Infinite Helios], and [Ricochet].","But the base reality of this weapon remained clear.","A single pull of its bow string would require 100 Extremity Soul Values and 100,000 Extremity Mana Values!","Now, with the advent of his unique Extremity Soul, Noah could see in his status panel the words Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values.","Not Extremity Soul Values- but an advanced form of these Values known as Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values! They were different from other beings as Noah innately knew that his were much grander, and just like the description of his soul stated- he would have to see just how much grander they were by testing his limits!","Currently, he could see that he had just barely broken the barrier of 100 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values, with this number rising in decimal points as the boons of the Ash Tree III of Gradation finished being swallowed up in addition to the assimilation of the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity and the effects of Apexification.","In addition to this, every part of his existence continued to change because of his Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul.","Under the effects of his Extremity Soul, his Mana Values were already being transformed into Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Mana Values- this process being arduous and time-consuming as over 1 million units of Mana were already transformed into Extremity Mana!","The task of transforming his Mana Values to Extremity Mana Values would be an endless one as they would continue to rise up to an extent they would be determined infinite.","HUUM!","His body buzzed as he grasped the Hyperversal Bow of Helios in his right hand tightly, his soul roaring out with majesty as he flung the bow from one hand to another as his left hand now grasped its center handle.","He straightened up in the starry space he floated in as his left hand rose, the bow in his hands pointing up!","Then, the fingers of his right hand rested on the terrifyingly sharp bow string that began to buzz as he...pulled it back.","....!","The instant he did so, the air around him entirely changed as a shockingly sharp aura erupted, an aura that caused the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities far below Noah to feel their Souls shuddering as if they expected certain death were this Bow to ever be directed towards them!","They barely raised their heads in their kneeling position as they saw Noah's glorious figure that was now bathed in a Crimson gold light- Scriptures of Helios emanating from the Bow bow circling the surroundings as they gave off a glow that made him seem like a celestial archer Unrecorded in eons past.","He pulled on the bow string.","And he unveiled and quantified yet another wonder of his Extremity Soul.","To pull back the bowstring and knock a single [Hyperversal Projectile of Helios], 100 Extremity Soul Values were required along with 100,000 Extremity Mana Values!","Yet as he pulled back the bowstring enough to have the Hyperversal Projectile of Helios be 10% completed, he found that only .1 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values and 1,000 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Mana Values were used up so far.","[...]","It foretold of the sheer ridiculousness of Noah's new Soul.","It meant that to fully knock the Hyperversal Projectile of Helios, he would only need 1 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values and 10,000 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Mana Values!","This shocking finding was quickly ascertained by Noah as he tracked down why soon after.","Since it was a unique type of Extremity Soul, the resource cost of Extremity Soul Values only required a tenth of Noah's Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Value to be paid.","Then, there was still the quality of his Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Mana Values that paid for a vast majority of the abilities he cast with his soul values.","His Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Mana Values that were still being changed at this moment covered another 90% of the resource cost as the cost of 100 Extremity Soul Values was cut down to 10, and then cut down to 1!","Meanwhile, the additional cost of Extremity Mana Values was cut from 100,000 to 10,000!","It was an astounding reality as still, this wasn't all.","There was the rate at which he regenerated his Extremity Soul Values.","Since he had barely spent any resources so far, Noah continued to knock the bowstring back to more accurately ascertain the rate of regeneration.","BZZT...KAA!","The reality around him buzzed as it began to melt, extreme heat permeating all around as after the heavy buzzing, a sharp cry boomed out as a crimson gold flaming singularity of an arrow formed between his fingertips!","The reality around him was melting, and yet his body remained unfettered as his Extremity Soul bathed his hand- the scorching heat not harming him in the least.","He continued to pull the bow string back further and further until he spent a full 1 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Value and 10,000 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Mana Values, the Crimson gold arrow between his fingertips buzzing and becoming completely formed as its arrowhead actually had two blinding Singularities open as if they were eyes, 9 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Helios burning throughout it and ready to be directed to their target.","It was an arrow that could cross Recorded and Unrecorded Histories.","An arrow that could traverse the Aeonic Annals of Extremity to reach an observable target in the current unfolding reality or non-reality!","Noah had fully knocked the arrow without yet choosing a target, with his soul gazing inward to affirm his rate of regeneration as he found an appalling scene.","In his body, his Innate Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Meridians had spread out as if they were innumerable vessels and capillaries- entirely connecting to all parts of him as they even had vessels stretching out across his Eight Aletheian Havens.","His 162 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians were the same as they stretched out across his existence!","Every flow and ebb of his Boundaries, every flow and ebb of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities...they now seemed to do so in every part of his being as he could feel them all simultaneously.","And all of these vessels of meridians...went on to connect to the utterly magnificent mountainous-looking Reality Passages that were stretched out across his Aletheian Havens, with some massive Reality Passages even connecting from one Haven to another.","Within the Havens, and between the Havens!","These Reality Passages looked like grand celestial mountains that pulsed and gushed out energy, with the flow of his Boundaries, Vitalis, and Vacuous Authorities coursing through his Meridians culminating within these mountains as on their peaks, they gushed out multicolored lava light of immeasurable waves of essence that just by pulsing across his existence once...","Caused a glow of Quintessence to flash within Noah as he found that the single Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Value he spent was already restored.","And...it had only been a tenth of a second that passed.","It meant that every second, Noah would recover 10 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values- and his maximum reserves were barely just spilling above 100!","And every shot of a [Hyperversal Projectile of Helios] that held 9 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Helios cost 1 Extremity Soul Value for him instead of 100 as if this single shot could theoretically wipe out a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity...","How many Extremities could he kill per second? If the 9 chaining effects of the Hyperversal Projectile of Helios were achieved, just how appalling would the things he planned be?!","DUM!","The booming and low sound of a drum began to beat in the surroundings.","The transformations brought about by an Extremity Soul were far from over as the interconnectedness of Noah's meridians, Reality Passages, and Origin brought about an unprecedented change as above him, spanning half of the whole Infinite Hyperversal Haven- an illusory mountainous Reality Passage pulsing with threads of his Extremity Soul began to form.","It billowed out majesty and ghastly cries of glory as it looked like an inverted mountain the size of multiple Havens pointing down towards Noah's line visage, its mountain top billowing out and erupting with endless waves of energy at this point as all of it began to gush down towards Noah in a dense steam of utter majesty.","As this process began, his status panel that showed his Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values and the quantified Units of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities he held...their numerical value became encased in brackets as next to these brackets, a +1 appeared.","With another tenth of a passing second this number once more changed, and the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values now displayed (100)+2.","And...it did not stop as from the massive illusory inverted mountainous Reality Passage half the size of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, even denser waves of authority continued to cascade down!"]},{"number":2727,"title":"Chapter 2727: Chapter 2726 Appalling Might! III","paragraphs":["The scene in itself was utterly outlandish.","When the illusory mountainous Reality Passage half the size of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven descended, it pulsed with so much essence and authority that the Vassals that had their consciousness shaken and fainted were gradually aroused, their souls feeling a sense of nourishment and immense as they blinked their eyes while ascertaining their current reality.","Gradually, they gazed up to observe yet another scene that they could never forget in all their Recorded Histories.","An entity with a golden crimson bow pulled all the way back, the reality around him warping and melting as an arrow blazing with golden flames was roaring out to be released.","And above this figure, the illusory stellar mountain shone with multiple colors as it gushed out waves of essence and authority unto his body- particles of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities being among the waves descending down!","It was utterly breathtaking for others to see, but under Noah's own gaze...it was only logical for it to be this way.","It was only logical that the Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul show this shred of power and might.","After all, it was transformed from the Extremity Rune Scriptures of VITALIS and VACUOUS! Authorities that weren't yet even close to his grasp.","And under his eyes, even more things were quantified.","{The Meridians coursing with Authority in your existence have intricately connected with your Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Reality Passages!}","{The Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Reality Passages aid in the rapid generation of authorities and resources, but they go past this to generate an additional Quintessential Reserve of all Authorities and Resources that matches your maximum values.}","{The intricate connection of your Innate Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians to your Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Reality Passages and Aspects of Existence will only further expedite the rate at which Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities enrich your existence, and this will expedite the rate of your Awakenings.}","Extremity came in different forms, but when it elevated an existence- many parts of what made them would be expanded upon to also reach their extremes.","Noah's Extremity Soul sought to overdo itself in this aspect as his Reality Passages were transformed and granted a terrifying power- this same power giving Noah the capability to do something dreadful that he was only theorizing of with every passing second!","Instead of requiring 100 Extremity Soul Values to pull back the bowstring and fall forth a Hyperversal Projectile of Helios, he only needed 1 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Value as the requirement of Extremity Mana Values was inconsequential at this moment- his transformation of this type of Mana already reaching 1 million from 100,000 after the tenths of seconds passed.","The main factor to how rapid his attacks would be lay in his Extremity Soul Values and how rapidly he recovered them.","By recovering 10 every second, he could release 10 Hyperversal Projectiles of Helios in a single second as his resources would remain unchanged.","And then...there were the advanced features of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios that were named {Deadeye}, {Infinite Helios}, and {Ricochet}. Out of these, Noah only breezing through their appalling details observed that he could utilize {Deadeye} since it cost 10,000 Extremity Soul Values to cast!","But first, he would see the effectiveness of the {Hyperversal Projectile of Helios}.","How did it fair against Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities?","With the bow string pulled to the utmost limit and the Hyperversal Projectile of Helios trembling in Noah's hands asking to be released, his main body closed his eyes.","And in his mind, the scenes of the deadly battle where millions of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms had perished and hundreds of Hyperversal Extremities had fallen on each side played out.","Uniquely, Noah's actions accounted for the vast majority of the death toll of the Vacuous Hyperversal Lineages as even Emperor Shao didn't exceed Noah in terms of casualties that he had caused.","This could be attributed to the fact that Shao was surrounded and keeping at bag multiple Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities, but it was a testament to Noah's own power that under his hands, more Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and Extremities had fallen than the number from a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity!","And now, he wanted to widen this gap even more.","His will gazed at the battlefield and came to lock onto dozens of Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities stretched out across different Savior's Arks.","He focused on those who weren't even affected by his Virions as his vision came to lock onto a single Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity in particular.","His visage displayed a humanoid appearance with six arms and two heads, his body brimming with 44 Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of {DESTITUTION} swirling across his existence.","An Extremity that had only brought a single concept to the extremes of what it could be.","After forging a single Golden Hyperversal Extremity Rune Scripture when they first attained Extremity, they worked hard to accumulate these to 44 currently as they were halfway to the Zenith of the First Gradation of Extremity.","Noah locked his will on such an Extremity that was currently wielding an Ax Relic in his hands while pushing back a Tier 1 Vitalis Extremity opposite him.","Vacuous and Vitalis Apex Aeonic Lifeforms battled around them as every now and then, some would erupt with great domains of Boundaries or Dynamis of Extremity to cause the true death of other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","Locked onto this Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity, Noah released the bowstring of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios for the first time.","When the fingers of his right hand released it within the depths of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity where he hid the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, the {Hyperversal Projectile of Helios} roared out as the moment it shot out, it disappeared as if it had never existed.","And then, within the span of an instant...","SAA!","Noah's Reified Source of Quintessence observing everything on the battlefield between Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Legions saw the arrowhead of the {Hyperversal Projectile of Helios} bloom in front of the face of the Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity.","Within the span of an instant!","It crossed innumerable records and distances as it ignored spacetime or the absence of spacetime to appear before its target right away.","The Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity didn't and couldn't even react in time!"]},{"number":2728,"title":"Chapter 2728: Chapter 2727 Appalling Might! IV","paragraphs":["The reaction time of the Extremity couldn't even compare to the speed of the attack!","His eyes only saw a blinding gold flash out of nowhere as Noah's will intensified its focus to understand just what would happen next.","Under his Extremity Soul, everything was zoomed in and played out in slow motion.","He saw that the moment the arrowhead of the Hyperversal Projectile of Helios came in contact with the first Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of Destitution that protected this being, the Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scripture of HELIOS at the very forefront burned the Golden Rune of Destitution as if it didn't even exist to begin with.","What was the Hyperversal Projectile of Helios?","It was an attack shot out from a Low Grade Armament of Extremity that even a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity like Xiaomi had trouble holding onto!","It stated in its description that an existence with Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures was most ideal in the usage of the weapon, and that an existence whose soul had been enriched with Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures would be best suited to use its advanced features of Deadeye, Infinite Helios, and Ricochet.","It wasn't a weapon that Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities could support the expenditure of.","And so the {Hyperversal Projectile of Helios}...was not something a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity could handle as the 9 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Helios within a single Projectile...Noah equated them to 9 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures!","Such a number of Rune Scriptures was what Xiaomi had when she reached the Zenith of Tier 1.","After gazing at Extremity so much recently, killing multiple of them to obtain their memories, and even observing the process of Extremity on his Vassals, Noah could confidently say that 9 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures were equivalent to 81 Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures- and this was the peak that Tier 1 existences had to climb to before they could try and enter Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity.","Within Tier 2, one would have to form up to 2,997 Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures if they sought to achieve Tier 3, or they simply had to have a powerful Concept of Extremity that granted them 333 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures before they could arrive at the Zenith of Tier 2 and try breaking into the stage of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity!","Noah didn't include Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures in these calculations as he needed more information on them.","So the single {Hyperversal Projectile of Helios} holding 9 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures within it was akin to 81 Golden Rune Scriptures smashing onto an entity who only had 44 Scriptures- these defenses not being worth anything as they were scorched one after another as they were the Records of Extremity of this being...and after they were extinguished, the rest of his Records were sought and scorched by the single Projectile of Helios!","All of this...was Noah observing it in slow motion.","But in real time, the scene that the awareness of many beings saw...was a golden line blooming inches away from a Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity, and an instant later- the massive obsidian body of this Extremity was pulverized as his body exploded into colorful multicolored light as if he were fireworks!","...!","It was appalling to see.","There wasn't the usage of a Virion or any underhanded means.","No False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER.","Just a pure, single attack shot out from a Hyperversal Bow of Helios.","A single attack, and Noah pulverized a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity!","Shocking cries erupted from the Vacuous Apex Lifeforms that had lost their pillar as the Vitalis Hyperversal Extremity who was fighting the now dead Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity gazed on in a stupor, his soul feeling prickles of horror as he felt like he was a breath away from death.","But...the most shocking thing had yet to bloom.","Because under the features of the basic attack of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios, it stated that if an attack by a {Hyperversal Projectile of Helios} was successful in eradicating them, it would undergo {Nirvanic Rebirth of Helios} and chain onto another target- for a total of 9 times if every target was successfully killed after the first!","And this fantastical reality was exactly what played out next.","From the ashes of the pulverized records of the Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity, crimson gold flames instantly came to life and formed into a blazing {Hyperversal Projectile of Helios} that disappeared where it stood, instantly appearing in front of a different Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity within the same domain of the Savior's Ark.","And this Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity faced the same fate as the one before it as before they could even react, a golden light appeared in front of them like a rising sun as in the next instant, their body exploded into tendrils of flames as their records were scorched and destroyed.","...!","The scene caused alarm to rise among the now less than 100 Vacuous Extremities within this arc as with shocking speed, yet another blazing crimson gold light flashed as in another area- a third Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities also became pulverized into tendrils of flames!","A moment later, it was the Fourth, then Fifth, and then Sixth!","It was all happening so fast that by the time a Tier 3 Vacuous Extremity roared out and released an obsidian domain, the 9th Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity was turned into a flicker of Ash and flames.","...!","{OOH!}","Bellows of rage and anger erupted out at such a quick massacre that even the Tier 2 and 3 Hyperversal Extremities within this Ark's domain could not prevent.","They all gazed around with utmost caution as they felt like such quick attacks had to come from a powerful Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity!","And yet, nobody claimed this glory as even the Vitalis Hyperversal Extremities that were fighting them seemed to be in a stupor as they gazed at each other- seemingly asking...was that you?","As for the being responsible, his eyes blazed with glory from afar as he saw the results of a single {Hyperversal Projectile of Helios} had produced such shocking results.","His tyrannical will surged and bubbled with Quintessence.","His main body within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven held the Bow of Helios within his left hand tightly as his Nine Pupils released rays of glorious light, prompts exploding before his eyes as he raised this bow up again!","While he did so, sensational words began to echo out from him.","{Let tyranny reign free once more.}","DUM!","A booming drum echoed out in the surroundings as if it were ushering in records of a glorious future.","Quintessence blazed with shocking brilliance around Noah's figure as his voice continued to ring out.","{Let Extremities perish as if they were mere dust in the Records of Extremity.}","DUM!","{Let Quintessence shine with glory.}","DUM!","{Let the spamming commence.}","...!","The booming drums caused the hearts of his Vassals to resonate as Noah pulled on the bowstring of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios for the second time, very quickly pulling it back as far as possible before he released.","And before a tenth of a second passed, his fingers had already drawn the bowstring again as another blazing gold {Hyperversal Projectile of Helios} was released.","And before another tenth of a second passed, another Golden arrow flew!","One after another, ten {Hyperversal Projectiles of Helios} were released within the span of a second as Noah's Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values remained unchanged, and his hands didn't stop going towards the bowstring a moment after he released it as flashes of crimson gold light continued to be released from him!","It was an appalling action that the True Emperor of Quintessence was taking, with the continued reality of this action bringing about irreversible changes to an already chaotic battlefield!"]},{"number":2729,"title":"Chapter 2729: Chapter 2728 Appalling Might! V","paragraphs":["2728 Appalling Might! V","Like a primal archer from eons gone, Noah's hand never stopped pulling and releasing the tout bowstring of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios as he did so 10 timed within a second!","It was a level of spamming that Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities would find hard to maintain for even half a minute with the requirements of 100 Extremity Soul Values for any common being.","A Low Grade Armament of Extremity was something that Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities could utilize with some efficiency, but it was truly Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities who could expertly handle such weapons and achieve devastating effects- with Noah getting a glimpse of this with the dazzling sword that Emperor Shao used to nearly bisect a Hyperversal Savior's Ark.","Other Extremities on the battlefield were expressing multiple other Low Grade Armaments of Extremity in their own way- with them being held by prominent Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities and above for the most part!","Due to his unique Extremity Soul, Noah was utilizing the Low Grade Armament of Extremity in his hands in a way that would even put Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities to shame.","The result obtained from this...was a mystifying and unfathomable reality.","At the densest cluster of Existences where Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Legions were fighting.","The brief burst of roaring flashes of 9 flaming lights that whisked 9 Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities caught the attention of the Tier 3 Vacuous Extremities in the surroundings, their wills spread out wide open to see if the hidden expert releasing such strikes whom they deemed to be someone at Tier 3 or above would show themselves!","But nobody rose amidst the increasing chaos as after a brief lull of mere seconds...","SAA!","A flash of flaming crimson gold light appeared once more.","But this time, it wasn't alone. Nor did it appear in the domain field of their Hyperversal Savior's Ark alone!","One after another, 10 dazzling streaks of flaming gold appeared in the faces of Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities from different domains of Arks who were instantly exploded into flames and ash, a [Nirvanic Rebirth of Helios] occurring for each one after they succeeded in decimating their targets as they flashed away to appear in front of another 10 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities.","If these 10 Projectiles of Helios alone managed to achieve their purpose by changing 9 times, this would be 90 Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities snuffed out of existence in a ball of fire and ash.","But it wasn't just 10.","In a continued and shocking fashion, another 10 Projectiles of Helios appeared after every passing second as they targeted other Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities!","Noah's most arduous task in all this...was making sure he had multiple beings marked as targets for the Projectiles of Helios to continue chaining after every kill.","10 Projectiles of Helios every second. Each set of 10 designated to reap the lives of 90 Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities. So in the passing of 10 seconds, 900 Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities could theoretically be turned into Ash and flames.","If Noah continued for a full minute with his constant spam and no interference, that would be 5,400 Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities he could extinguish!","It would empty out the Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities within the protective light of at least 100 of the massive spinning wheels of the Hyperversal Savior's Ark controlled by the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions.","[...]","Such a daring possibility did not escape Noah's mind.","And Quintessence sought to achieve it as in a startling turn of events, multiple Arks began facing attacks that extinguished their Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities into balls of flames and ash, the flicker of crimson gold beginning to light up the darkness of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority around them!","It very quickly caught the attention of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities within the domains of these Arks as they bellowed out.","[Defend!]","[Behind me!]","The movements of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities began to change as they sought to protect the Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities.","Those at Tier 2 weren't even fast enough as they couldn't do anything about it.","And the Vitalis Hyperversal Extremities did not sit still at this opportunity as their attacks against their chosen Tier 2 and Tier 3 enemies became all that much more ferocious.","It meant that the burst of Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities being popped like flaming balloons continued within 10 domains of nearby Arks for the next few seconds, the death toll instantly rising to a few hundred dead Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities!","[HO!]","At such a juncture, a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity bellowed out as he saw the Nirvanic Rebirth of Helios occur where a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity used to be, and the reformed flaming arrow instantly pointed its trajectory towards another Tier 1 a distance to his right as this being angrily twisted space to appear in front of the next target, but the moment he arrived...","POOF!","He was faced with a flicker of flames and ash.","His eyes billowed with typhoons of rage as his body pulsed a meant later, an Extremity Domain Expansion erupting from him an instant later as a dense number of Crimson and Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures covered it- with this Domain Expansion extending to cover nearly 50% of the domain of the Ark he was in as every Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity was covered!","His obsidian pupils shone with a fiery light at this as he bellowed out.","[Now what, coward? Will you face your attacks to those who can contend with you?!]","This Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity bellowed out such words, not knowing the enemy who was doing all of this...had yet to even take any concept to Extremity!","What an awe inspiring reality this was.","If the pristine existences here truly knew that an Entity who had yet to achieve Extremity was utilizing a Low Grade Armament to spam over and over again to achieve this result...the very fundamentals they understood about Extremity would be bent and broken!"]},{"number":2730,"title":"Chapter 2730: Chapter 2729 Appalling Might! VI","paragraphs":["2729 Appalling Might! VI","The Projectiles of Helios that had killed their targeted Tier 1s within the Ark that now protected all others with swirling Obsidian and Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures underwent their Nirvanic Rebirth of Helios at this moment as an instant later...they flickered out of existence.","They disappeared from the domain field of this Ark entirely as an instant later, they appeared in the Domain of the Ark to their left that already had Tier 1 Vacuous Extremity scrambling to put up heavy defenses and expand their Extremity Domain Expansions.","And...","POOF! POOF! POOF!","The scene of pristine and esteemed Extremities exploding into Ash and flames continued as if nothing had ever happened.","[...]","The face of the Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity and other prominent Vacuous Extremities in nearby Arks turned extremely sour at such a progression.","Deadly attacks that could extinguish Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities in an instant were appearing en masse as they actively avoided Tier 2 and 3 Hyperversal Extremities!","Only five seconds had passed as already, over 400 Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities had perished.","Such a loss in such a short period of time was devastating as even their enemies- the Vitalis Hyperversal Extremities in this region...watched on in a stupor!","Some of the veteran Tier 3 Vitalis Hyperversal Extremities instantly used this situation to their advantage as two grouped up to attack the Zenith Tier 3 Vacuous Extremity who had expanded an Extremity Domain to protect the Tier 1s under his Ark.","If he was using his Rune Scriptures to protect others, what was protecting him would be greatly reduced.","This caused the battle and chaos here to get even more intense.","And in the seconds that followed, more and more domains of Savior's Arks saw flickers of crimson gold flaming arrows turn their Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities to ash as their Tier 3s resorted to releasing Domain Expansions or other unique means of their Concepts of Extremity to lay out barriers and brilliant auras of protection around their Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities!","And during this whole time, they continued to search for which terrifying enemy was doing all of this as after Tier 3 Vacuous Extremities got involved in protecting the Tier 1s, the target of the crimson gold arrows would only move to other Arks and continue their rampage.","The scene was utterly devastating as with another 6 seconds passing, the death toll of Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities in this region exceeded 1000!","[AWOO!]","A Tier 3 Vacuous Extremity with a humanoid form had rage flowing out of his eyes as he bellowed out in indignation, his shout spreading out far behind him where Vacuous Hyperversal Authority swirled with dense mist obscuring everything.","[O Esteemed Infernal Emperors, please make a move!]","...!","After the drastic death toll of 1,000 Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities in the span of 10 seconds- a death toll that hadn't occurred in such numbers even in the span of the last day if they gazed at it from the perspective of the constraints of time that their enemies were bound by...they had to call out.","Because whatever dreadful enemy that was causing all of this could not be allowed to continue!","And the moment that the Tier 3 Vacuous Extremity called out such words, from the depths of Vacuous Hyperversal Legions that seemed to endlessly stretch from behind...the blazing aura of a Tier 4 Vacuous Extremity blared out and rose like a tide.","An existence adorned in the Vacuous Entity III Form appeared as they were made up of pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, their bodies shining gorgeously with five pairs of wings as they held a humanoid female body that showed off illusory curves of wonder and beauty.","Their face only had two obsidian Singularities spinning with glory as they gazed at the dozens of domain fields of Savior's Arks.","This terrifying Tier 4 Entity appeared as she locked onto the flaming authority that seemed too fast for many eyes.","Under her breath, she muttered.","[The Havenly Extremity Authority of Helios...]","WAA!","She could see the makeup of the dazzling arrows that were laying waste to so many of their people.","It wasn't that they were extremely powerful- they were average at best, at the level of Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures at most. The issue was their frequency and speed as they targeted so many Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities.","After this being analyzed these fantastical arrows of crimson gold flaming light, she thrust her hands made of pure Aurora of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as a dense number of Rune Scriptures erupted from her and disappeared into nothingness.","A second later, the barrage of the Projectiles of Helios continued as they were surging towards 90 targets at this moment when simultaneously, the moment that the blazing Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Helios at the top of the flaming arrows were about to come in contact with their targets...","BZZT!","A heavy friction bloomed as a Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture that read [PERDITION].","Perdition!","It was the Infernal Authority of Perdition from the Infernal Havens of Extremity!","It instantly bloomed in front of all current targets of the Projectiles of Helios as the clash was heavy and robust, instantly decimating the 9 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Helios within the Projectiles as they were rebuffed and eradicated soon after.","...!","Stark silence descended in this region.","SAA!","After another second, another 10 arrows of flaming light flashed towards other targets in Arks that were light years away, and yet when they were about to hit their targets...","BZZT!","The Crimson Rune Scriptures of Perdition bloomed as the means of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity were expressed.","She didn't make a move to protect all Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities or release an Extremity Domain Expansion that would cost a great deal, she somehow locked onto the signature of the particular Authority of Helios within the arrows blazing forth as an opposite Infernal Authority repelled them before they could hit any targets!","It was an austere and shocking development.","To counter Noah's brazen attacks, an esteemed Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity was mobilized from the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions.","An existence at the same stage as the leaders of the Seven Clans of the Nether Havens of Extremity.","Such a being had to step up to cancel Noah's attacks and stop the indiscriminate deaths of thousands of Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities!"]},{"number":2731,"title":"Chapter 2731: Chapter 2730 Unprecedented Glory! I","paragraphs":["The battlefield in the region where Projectiles of Helios clashed with gorgeous blood red Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of Perdition now became highlighted as another isolated battlefield where Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities were opposing each other.","The surroundings were extremely tense as the deadliest areas in the endless light years that the forces of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Legions were fighting in were those that had Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities fighting!","One of the more prominent ones was where Emperor Shao clashed against multiple Tier 4 combatants, but the area that. Just had over 1,000 Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities butchered now became the deadliest one.","Roars and bellows of battle rose as many wills watched and wondered.","How would the hidden Esteemed Havely Emperor react against the appearance and action of the Esteemed Infernal Emperor?","The means of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities were unique and Unfathomable as they were touching of a Gradation of Extremity that made it possible for them to entirely suppress those below them!","Their souls had undergone a level of change that all three prior Gradations combined could not achieve.","So many wills moved across the battlefield and watched with bated breaths.","The Tier 4 Vacuous Extremity gazed out as her eyes swirled with dense bloody red Rune Scriptures of Perdition, her appearance stopping the deaths of all nearby Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities as her power was displayed loud and clear!","Now...what about her enemy? What would his next move be?","—","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Noah's hands brought down the Hyperversal Bow of Helios briefly.","HUUM!","His body continued to buzz with change and elevation as his Extremity Soul dipped its majesty on all parts of him, with thousands of Prompts constantly flowing down his eyes as the achievement of decimating over 1,000 Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities was a Quintessential one.","The Loot obtained would be enough to make tremendous progress for the Sporos IV of Extremity- if not cause it to completely mature after Ruination multiplied all of this Loot!","But he wouldn't yet know until he began.","And this issue...was currently not the most pressing one.","His eyes swirled with the authority of Oraculum as the scene and action of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity replayed over his mind again and again.","He, before even attaining Extremity, had forced a Tier 4 existence to make a move and counter him.","Such a thing may make others proud or inflate their egos, but Noah remained unfettered as Quintessence seemed to say in his mind that the reality should of course be like this.","Of course, the True Emperor of Quintessence should shine with such unprecedented glory!","So after halting his bow ever so briefly, it rose up and aimed high once more.","How would he go against the means of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity? Many were asking themselves this question, but they didn't understand a crucial thing about Noah at this moment.","Vacuous Malignancies were not his only enemies that were moving within these chaotic battlefields.","His eyes pulsed with profound glory as with another set of targets in mind, his body billowed as tides of power rose from him and surged into the Hyperversal Bow of Helios within his hands as he called out!","{Deadeye}.","...!","His Extremity Soul buzzed as nearly everything it had was taken away.","100 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values instantly surged into the crimson gold bow within his hands as it instantly shone with a light that bathed the nearby millions of light years- a light that momentarily blinded his Vassals that had been watching from below!","Deadeye.","The only feature he could currently utilize as its cost was 10,000 Extremity Soul Values.","As for its details?","They were rather drastic!","{Deadeye}:: Among the Arsenal of the Hyperversal Bow of Helios, Deadeye serves as the bridge from ordinary to exceptional. Coming with a high cost of 10,000 Extremity Values and 100 Million Extremity Mana Values, this feature allows you to rain Helios Havenfire- a concentrated form of flames made from flames that have coursed through the Extremity Vein of Helios for eons, onto a group of targeted enemies. Deadeye will release a total of 2,500 Tendrils of Helios Havenfire, with each tendril being equivalent to 2 Hyperversal Projectiles of Helios. If a group of 500 targets is chosen, each one will face 5 Tendrils of Helios Havenfire. If 100 targets are chosen, each one will face 25 Tendrils of Helios Havenfire...and so forth. The minimum number of targeted enemies for this area of attack ability is 50. Depending on how this feature is used, a deadly result can be brought to fruition as the Hyperversal Bow of Helios seeks to cleanse all its enemies in a baptism of Havenfire!","A deadly attack.","It released Tendrils of Helios Havenfire as a single one was equivalent to 2 Hyperversal Projectiles of Helios! This meant that a single Tendril of Helios Havenfire held 18 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Helios.","Now, what if he were to attack 100 Extremities, and each one was faced with 25 Tendrils of Helios Havenfire that represented a total of 450 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures attacking a single being all at once?","Mind you, each Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scripture was equivalent to an Obsidian Rune Scripture!","The Advent of this ability...meant that his targets no longer had to be Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities.","This was because the upper tier of power of Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities was 333 Obsidian or 2,997 Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures before they could try entering the Third Gradation of Extremity.","And so, his next move unfolded from all of this information.","BOOM!","The Hyperversal Bow of Helios seethed as it released the blinding ball of Havenfire that had scorched the surrounding reality, causing it to disappear into the space before it.","It was a feature that would alter the landscape of the vast battlefield ever so slightly.","An action that would truly introduce the Tyrannical Emperor as he showed he wasn't bound to any sides- but instead bound to enemies and benefits.","Vacuous or Vitalis...did it truly matter at the end?","This question buzzed in Noah's mind as he understood the sheer gravity of his actions, and yet his reigning will of Quintessence took it regardless!"]},{"number":2732,"title":"Chapter 2732: Chapter 2731 Unprecedented Glory! II","paragraphs":["The moment he released the blinding {Deadeye}, Noah's eyes pulsed as he spoke out lightly.","{Let the conclusion of the War of Annihilation commence.}","The conclusion of the War of Annihilation.","He allowed this to commence with a single shot!","As his records buzzed with his grand achievements, a shocking scene bloomed in the battlefield of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Legions.","As the Tier 4 Vacuous Extremity waited to see how the hidden enemy would react, her eyes fluttered and spun like blazing singularities as she blinked in confusion, her head turning entirely opposite to where her will was clustered as she stared at the depths of the Vitalis Hyperversal Legions.","From confusion, her eyes then showed incredulousness and disbelief as she sensed the blazing signature of the Havenly Authority of Helios bloom once more...but it was in the Vitalis Hyperversal Legions!","In a massive Bastion of Vitalis!","More specifically, the records above the heads of Tier 2 Avernus Extremities stationed within and near a Bastion of Vitalis suddenly split open as tendrils of crimson gold flames instantly rained down on exactly 100 of them.","A large percentage of the forces of Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities stationed here!","...!","{Ah...}","Their souls instantly felt the indescribable sensation of True Death.","Far in front of them, the gazes of a few dozen Tier 3 Avernus Extremity changed rapidly as even further away, the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity turned around while he roared out in shock!","All beings paid attention to the prominent powerhouses and movements of the current battlefield.","The decimation of over 1,000 Tier 1 Vacuous Extremities within seconds was noteworthy as it had fallen under the eyes of many while they battled.","They knew the flashes of crimson gold light as the culprits that had decimated a portion of the Vacuous Malignancies as they cheered at the expert from their side!","So why...were even grander versions of these terrifying flames of crimson gold raining down on their own people?!","BLAZE!","A scorching storm blew in one hundred areas within the depths of the Vitalis Hyperversal Legions.","The Tier 3 and 4 Vitalis Extremities did not react in time as the targets of these flames were in an even worse state.","The over 400 Illusory Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Helios within the Tendrils of Helios Havenfire instantly decimated their less than 300 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures or their equivalency in terms of Golden Scriptures!","Instant eradication of their Rune Scriptures, and it was followed by the instant eradication of their Records right after.","By the time the Tier 4 Avernus Extremity reacted, his Authority only encapsulated nothing but ashes and flames.","{...}","He blinked with a blank gaze as all other eyes observed this situation in disbelief.","The Tier 4 Vacuous Extremity who was waiting to see how Noah would counter his move was dumbfounded.","This...","Just what exactly was this?!","Did the enemy not care whether he killed Vacuous Malignancies or Vitalis Malignancies?","Was he simply killing for the sake of killing?!","The reality of 100 Tier 2 Avernus Extremities instantly perishing settled in at this moment as such a loss was entirely devastating to the Avernus Clan.","How many Tier 2s could they produce over the years? How many more Tier 3s would stem from them?","All of them were powerhouses they had cultivated for an untold number of years as for them to be scorched and burned by the Havenly Authority of HELIOS from their very own Seven Vitalis Havens...","It caused such untold rage and anger to burn with the Tier 4 Avernus Extremity as he roared out while turning into a blazing inferno of purple flames.","{No loyalty to home or country...who are you?!}","The Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity bellowed out.","{Moved by bloodlust and malice...which Demon are you?!}","He bellowed out again.","{Not even daring to rise up and claim your actions? Worse than even a dog! A lowly Demon!}","The roars were resonant.","And yet there was no answer.","Why did this happen?","Why did it happen to their Avernus Clan alone and not others? Why would a prominent expert from their Vitalis Havens attack Vacuous Malignancies, but then turn his attacks towards only Avernus Extremities?","Such buzzing questions rose as this single phenomenon caused a startling change within the battlefield!","In a far corner of the battlefield, the gaze of Emperor Shao and other Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities became stern as they continued to repulse their enemies.","And opposite to them, within the depths of the obscured Vacuous Hyperversal Legions.","Far, far back within the dense armies of Vacuous Malignancies that had yet to even join the battle.","A domain of Pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that could only be set up by an existence that had undergone their Fifth Vacuous Awakening could be seen.","It obscured anything to be seen by others as within this domain, massive entities radiating Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities were gazing at each other!","{That wasn't one of ours...}","A man shrouded in Vacuous Hyperversal Authority spoke.","{No...no it was not.}","Another one nodded in a chilling light as thereafter, they all gazed towards an Entity that was grander than all of them.","This entity far exceeded the bounds of the Fourth Gradation of Extremity as seeing their gazes, he could see what they were thinking as he nodded.","{Very well. Activate your sleeper cells and let us have the war fully begin.}","...!","A single action.","And yet its effects were unprecedentedly profound.","The moment the entity exceeding the stage of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity spoke, the Tier 4s around him buzzed as their faces each turned towards the same direction.","One Tier 4 Entity in particular had a chilling light cross through his eyes as his thoughts were vibrant.","'Svetlana, my sweet child...the time has come for you and the others to show your worth.'","BOOM!","With a thought, the authorities of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities moved and tangled in a unique manner.","They were sending forth a signal for something grand to begin.","Something that would alter the current state of the war and usher forth much, much more brutality!"]},{"number":2733,"title":"Chapter 2733: Chapter 2732 An Unchangeable Destiny! I","paragraphs":["The landscape of the war was entirely about to be altered by a single decision that was brought forward in time.","It was all because of an action done by a single being against 100 Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities!","This single action had great significance as it expressed many truths for those paying attention.","One of these major truths remained what was happening around and within the Avernus Clan as at this moment, the woes of the Avernus Clan once more rose to the surface.","—","The Advent of the Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul was bathing and transforming all parts of Noah's existence.","And this...included his lineage.","His Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage that nearly all forces of the Nether Havens of Extremity were trying to get their hands on in abundance.","The changes that the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage brought were stupendous in nature as all those with this bloodline would feel it...but its sheer brilliance was actually expressed within the domains of the one Clan that was banned from attaining this Bloodline.","The clan whose Tier 2 Extremities were just decimated!","In the Nether Haven of Oceanus, within a Branch of the Avernus Clan that held connected Minor Havens.","Inside a Minor Haven towards the very center of this Avernus Domain that was known as the Iridescent Purple Peak.","On the base of a high mountain that had swathes of purple lilac trees waving in the wind.","Two Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities accompanied by 9 Tier 2s had faces full of rage as they circled dozens of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who were led by four Tier 2s and a single Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity.","But uniquely, those surrounded by currently giving off a scintillating glow of Havenly light as their new lineage was churning and causing their auras to rise evermore!","Those circling them became even more enraged at this as one of the two Tier 3 Extremities bellowed out.","{You all...deserve death for betraying the Avernus Clan!}","...!","These words still contained a sense of disbelief and rage as the ones being circled were members of the Avernus Clan that had sworn an oath to renounce these very lands and home that had helped them get where they were today, and they were silently departing these domains when the sudden bursting glow of Havenly light from their bodies gave away their position.","This...was all due to Noah's new Extremity Soul beginning to affect and elevate his Lineage as well. But they had no idea of this as the current reality came to be.","It also showed that a Tier 3 Avernus Extremity had fallen to the temptation of the Blood Sources as he now stood with an expression of conflicting emotions and distress as he did not want this situation!","But he just...could not give up the path the Blood Source offered. And as his Blood seemed to transform even more with the shocking boosts he had received information of being elevated, he further confirmed his path was right as now...he simply wanted to make an exit from the Avernus Clan without coming into conflict with those he knew as friends.","{You all...let us not do this. We each have our own destinies, we simply chose another path that-}","{Rubbish!}","...!","The aura of the two Tier 3s circling them blazed along with the 9 Tier 2s surrounding them.","{We've already sent word of your treachery. If you dare to move, your whole Purple Sun Family will be executed here!}","Purple Sun Family.","This was a prominent family within the Avernus Clan that had powerful a few Tier 3s leading them, and yet one of these powerful Family Heads had actually renounced the Avernus Clan and planned to leave with a portion of the beings to rock the Purple Sun Family.","{Who dares to destroy the foundation and livelihood of my Purple Sun Lineage?}","BOOM!","A booming voice rang out from above as the aura of a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity descended.","It was an Ancestor of the Purple Sun Family!","The faces of those encircled became lighter while the gazes of those encircling them became stern.","They gazed up to see the visage of the only Zenith Tier 3 Extremity of the Purple Sun Family descend from above and stand protectively around his people, gazing down and quickly understanding the situation occurring as his eyes flickered with an intense light.","The rage within the encircling Extremities did not die down as the foremost Tier 3 spoke towards the Ancestor of the Purple Sun Family.","{The Regent Avernus Extremity Overlord has already heard of their treachery and sent back the command for them to be crippled of their Foundation as a warning to any others who may take the same path as then. If they allow this to occur peacefully, their lives will be spared. If they fight back...they are to be executed on sight!}","{...}","The Regent Avernus Extremity Overlord.","The one residing above the matters of the Clan while the true Avernus Extremity Overlord was in the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","His command was actually so swift as hearing it, the eyes of the Zenith Tier 3 Ancestor of the Purple Sun Family flashed as he sighed and gazed at his people.","{They...they are my family. Their lives can not be decided on by a mere command...}","{They are not part of your lineage if they have tainted themselves with the blood of the enemy!}","WAA!","Emotions were high.","The encircling Extremities knew that their Clan was at a cricket juncture.","If more beings like these appeared, the disruption would be too great! They had to make an example of these treacherous individuals first to warn off all others who may do the same thing.","{The will of the Regent Avernus Extremity Overlord must be followed. Ancestor Purple Sun...even you cannot change this. For the greater good of our Clan, please step aside and let us abolish the foundations of these traitors.}","{...}","A stark silence descended.","This silence was extremely foreboding as the encircling Extremities didn't like what it foretold!","Onward!"]},{"number":2734,"title":"Chapter 2734: Chapter 2733 An Unchangeable Destiny! II","paragraphs":["The expression on the face of the Ancestor of the Purple Sun Family hardened.","His fists tightened as he seemingly came to a resolve, looking at those who sought to cut off his own lineage!","{I will not abolish the foundation of my own lineage, nor will I stand by as they are killed...so it seems I shall also become your enemy.}","...!","A shocking progression.","The faces of the encircling Extremities became somber as they moved back while blazing with Rune Scriptures.","The body of the Ancestor of the Purple Sun Family glimmered as from his hands, a Blood Source that his own Family had given to him that he had never taken appeared- his gaze full of conflict and shame as he looked at it. He did not want to.","His loyalty to the Avernus Clan was high as he had close relationships with many of the major powerhouses within.","And yet...events had progressed to the state they were currently in.","And yet...what had to be done had to be done.","With a flash, a vow was made.","The Blood Source in his hands was flicked into his mouth as the Avernus Clan was renounced.","And a Blood Source was swallowed!","The scene shocked all beings here as this...was a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity!","One of the pillars of the Avernus Clan.","BZZT!","And now, his aura began to soar with even grander power as he gazed around coldly.","{My Purple Sun Family shall make an exit from the Avernus Clan today...I do not wish to shed any Blood as I ask you to not stand in our way!}","A blazing aura more powerful than anyone here erupted from him as he spoke, a blinding purple light blooming here and spreading out for many light years.","This glorious light...was currently being seen in another location entirely as far from this Nether Haven, across great distances into the Supernal Haven of Dissolution- this scene was observed playing out on an illusory screen.","It wasn't the only illusory screen as there were multiple other illusory screens that showed Branches of the Avernus Clan in all Seven Havens, and each scene showed varying levels of conflict as from among their Clan, those who had taken Blood Sources and renounced the Avernus Clan were leaving en masse or fighting against those stopping their departure!","It was heartbreaking as it was the full onset of a civil war and blooming chaos.","In addition to this, there was a screen that showed the scene of 100 Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities which had turned into flames and ash near and within a Bastion of Vitalis.","All of these scenes played out slowly as a feminine voice echoed out.","{This...is what is currently happening all around the Avernus Clan.}","The voice was a cold and somber one as it stemmed from the Seer Amestris who displayed dozens of illusory screens that showed scenes from all branches within the Seven Nether Havens of Extremity...in addition to what had just occurred for their forces fighting the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions!","Beside her, an illusory body of the Avernus Extremity Overlord stood with an exceedingly cold expression as he spoke out.","{All of this...because of a single being?}","Could it truly be?","It was so outlandish that others may find it hard to believe!","And yet the Seer of Avernus nodded her head while replying.","{All signs point to Noah Osmont. The few Records I can discern say Noah Osmont. He may be a part of a terrifying force we do know of, likely connected to the Supernal Havens of Extremity. He may have Tier 3s and even possibly a Tier 4 supporting him. All our current misfortunes...all point towards Noah Osmont as his War of Annihilation with us!}","...!","These shocking words echoed out as the Avernus Extremity Overlord listened to them coldly.","They were currently in an isolated domain as on the side, the figure of a simmering Extremity Blue could be seen, along with Tier 2 and 3 Avernus Extremities who had their Records cleaved by Seer Amestris to save them from the Pathogenic Authority that was destroying them from within.","The gazes of many were blank as they sought to find their past identity and records.","The Avernus Extremity Overlord looked at all of this and came to a decision as he spoke with a stern expression soon after.","{See if you can set up a meeting. Involve the Senatus of Extremity if you have to. Me and Osmont.}","...!","An astonishing and unbelievable set of words rose from him as instantly, the figure of Extremity Blue who was fully stepping into the throngs of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity radiated a cerulean light of Lunacy as she bellowed out.","{What?!}","A daring question and opposition to the Avernus Extremity Overlord.","And yet this being....only continued to gaze at the many illusory screens showing the current state of the Avernus Clan as he didn't repeat himself!","—","Within the Nether Haven of Dissolution.","In an isolated domain where only two beings stood, with both being clones of their originals.","These two beings looked at each other as on the opposing side, a great change occurred with the Adjudicator of Dissolution!","Her veil had fallen off her face.","{Svetlana.}","Noah said the name while radiating a devilish smile as currently, with his Extremity Soul, he could glimpse at the details of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities and observe their names along with a few more details.","Her features became visible as her obsidian pupils were glazed with a pristine light of power, her fair skin giving off sparks of stellar light as a sense of otherworldly beauty settled on her face.","With full yet small red lips and tendrils of obsidian hair flowing freely, she seemed regal and untouchable by others as she adorned a frilly black dress inlaid with white gems!","Her eyes showed great power, and yet one could see immense sorrow and darkness within as the threatening Hyperversal Extremity Authority she had released against Noah entirely faded as she looked at him closely.","{If a moment like this has come, then it means what I have dreaded all of these years is coming even closer than I thought.}","She spoke, seeing that Noah's figure was seated while gazing at her as she did the same.","She saw his laid-back smile at her words as he tapped his chin while replying.","{What could the great Adjudicator of Dissolution dread? Since you stem from the Vacuous Hyperversal Lineages, are you dreading the purpose you were sent in the Vitalis Havens for? Have you had a change of heart after all these years? Or was it after joining the Curagulus of Extremity?}","{...}","His words were sharp as the eyes of the Adjudicator of Dissolution squinted.","{The way you speak easily arouses anger, you know? You can look at me and assume you know my whole story. You can assume to understand what I have been through and where I am now. But I assure you...it will not come even close.}","...!","A dark light flashed in her eyes as great waves of vicissitude and sorrow leaked from her, with her gaze being unfocused as she gazed up into nothingness while continuing!","{The day I was born, it was etched in my existence that I was absolutely nothing. In the years that followed, I was taught that I was worth nothing. After all these years, after all the twists and turns, what I truly want...}","With a gaze that was seemingly seeking the impossible, her hands rose up to the nothingness above as she continued.","{What I truly was is to-}","BOOOM!","The havens shook before her words could finish.","The explosive sound...actually emanated from her.","Her expression turned drastic as this Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity gazed towards her chest where a blinding singularity had bloomed- this singularity radiating extremely pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","{No...not so early, not yet!}","A sense of desolation and shock welled up within her as she spoke, a phenomenon blooming after something activated inside her very existence.","This phenomenon...she wasn't the only one experiencing it as across the Seven Havens, similar phenomena began to bloom at this very moment!"]},{"number":2735,"title":"Chapter 2735: Chapter 2734 An Unchangeable Destiny! III","paragraphs":["2734 An Unchangeable Destiny! III","Not so early.","Not yet!","These were the words she uttered as they could hold any myriad of meanings, but at this moment, the erupting singularity caused her expression to shift from shock to sorrow, to unwillingness, and ultimately indescribable resignation!","The singularity of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority only became more potent and immense as in front of her, Noah rose with a serious expression.","She stared towards him with a gaze of desolation as she clutched her chest and continued.","[I thought and calculated that I had more time. I thought I could alter my fate. I sent my main body into the Supernal Havens of Extremity to seek something to change my fate. To change my destiny...but it seems that for some of us, there always exists an Unchangeable Destiny.]","...!","Around her figure, a blaze of obsidian flames of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority rose as the Singularity on her chest caused it to cave in before it began to split wide open.","The unique Havenly Authority of Dissolution was shockingly then pulled into the Singularity on her chest as an unfathomable resonance bloomed!","Seeing this scene, her gaze became even more forlorn as she shook her head in desolation!","[In life, some Existences are given the opportunity to make their own choices. To choose how they want to live their lives. To pursue what makes them happy. Some of us...never had that option. And it seems that no matter how we try to change it...]","Her last words were left unsaid.","An abstruse phenomenon bloomed around her as in front of her, Noah's eyes that now burned with his Extremity Soul could see many things, and even he was astonished at what he was observing as he saw the Extremity Clone of Svetlana become anchored in space, the Singularity on her chest actually mixing with Dissolution before it began to split open- her very Lifeforce and Extremity Soul Values being used as ingredients for a shocking reaction!","At this scene, Oraculum buzzed in Noah's mind as it actually wasn't able to light up any paths for him to follow regarding this.","There was one possible flickering path that rose and fell as if even after pursuing it, the results would simply be unknown.","[I isolated it to my Extremity Clone in case it was ever activated, but my Main Body will follow soon enough to keep it steady and active.]","Whatever was occurring was becoming more and more irreversible as she spoke, her gaze coming to lock on Noah at this moment as she smiled with despondency and unbound unwillingness.","[You know, your eyes are truly similar to my Master.]","WAA!","[You gaze at me now as I'm sure you are thinking and discerning what you can do, but behind your eyes...I can see a level of apathy. You don't really care what happens to me...so I don't know why I even shared my woes with you. The most I see is you wishing to pay back the karma for the little help I've given you...but at the end of the day, I am nothing to you. Just like the Master had said over and over again, I will never be anything to anyone. Just a tool...","just a tool...]","As she said her last words, obsidian tears fell from her wide eyes that were becoming unfocused, Noah observing an intrusive foreign authority rising and encroaching upon her very soul as the Adjudicator of Dissolution was put in a numb state of existence!","Seeing this development, Noah's gaze became stern as with shining eyes, his figure shot forward at this moment as he stepped on the only observable path whose results remained unknown!","As he moved, his hands reached out as his palm split open, serene and pure waves of his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage Blood flowing out freely.","Not just a contained Blood Source.","But waves of his Blood!","If there was a foreign interference seeking to influence and usher forth something from Svetlana, he would see if his own interference could counter this and what result could be ushered forth.","But even as he did this, the reaction already initiated was unstoppable as after achieving a set level, the Singularity that was splitting her chest open entirely exploded as a brilliant light shot above them.","A light...that formed into a serene illusory bridge.","Yes- a bridge!","Its structure pulsed and was formed with Dissolution layered over Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, its mere appearance causing roaring booms to erupt in the surroundings as the very Haven itself seemed to reject this abomination.","But the mixture of Dissolution held the rejection at bay as thereafter, in the span of nothingness above them...a brilliant white light began to shine as another illusory bridge was seemingly reflected opposite to the obsidian one!","One bridge was anchoring itself within the Nether Haven of Dissolution, while another bridge was anchored elsewhere.","At this moment, these two bridges were brought together as Noah's will buzzed while taking in all of this information, many records being unveiled before his eyes as what he saw was quantified and stated!","[Havenly Bridge of Dissolution]","This was the distinction of the illusory Bridge that stemmed from the split chest of the Adjudicator of Dissolution, and the milky white bridge that was now burning with hellish white flames...","[Infernal Bridge of Anarchos]","...!","Anarchos.","An Infernal Authority from the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains!","Noah had observed Acheron, Perdition, and now he was gazing at the flaming white authority of Anarchos that represented an Infernal Haven within the Vitalis Domains that was bathed in hellish white flames.","The moment it appeared, the Extremity Soul Values and Extremity Vitality Values from the Extremity Clone of Svetlana became drained at a shocking speed as these two bridges pulsed, gradually turning from illusory to becoming real and filled with structure.","And the moment they gained even a semblance of stability...these two bridges actually had tendrils of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority connect them- the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos seemingly in its own spacetime continuum while the Havenly Bridge of Dissolution was within the Haven of Dissolution.","And at that moment...","HOONG!","A resonant horn boomed out as from the ends of the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos bathed in white flames...the aura of Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities rose as on the very end of the bridge, Noah's will saw Legions upon legions of Vacuous Malignancies stepping into the Bridge and making their way over.","...!"]},{"number":2736,"title":"Chapter 2736: Chapter 2735 An Unchangeable Destiny! IV","paragraphs":["2735 An Unchangeable Destiny! IV","[Well damn...]","Noah gazed at the two dazzling connected bridges of Havenly and Infernal Authorities as he marveled at their brilliance!","It was a glorious and terrifying move on the part of the Vacuous Malignancies as when he looked at the overall situation, he speculated that what was occurring here may also be occurring in other Havens.","But it couldn't be to the extent of what was happening here as unless there were other Existences similar to Svetlana in other Havens, what happened there should only be to a lesser extent.","The focus here remained on Svetlana as currently, her Extremity Clone was transforming into something else entirely.","When Noah gazed at her now, a new identity appeared above her head.","[Anchor of the Havenly and Infernal Extremity Bridges]","An Anchor.","If an anchor was destroyed, naturally whatever it was anchoring would also be destroyed with it.","SHAA!","Noah arrived before her visage that was at the very end of the Havenly Bridge of Dissolution, his gushing waves of blood splattering onto her torn figure as it radiation an extremely potent golden glow!","As Legions of Vacuous Malignancies traversed across an illusory bridge that was quickly becoming very real, Noah's Blood and Will began permeating the very crux of this new terrifying Construct as even he didn't know what result would come from it.","What he did know...was how distinguished his lineage had become after his Extremity Soul bathed over it and everything else within him.","This gave him a level of confidence in this endeavor.","Amidst this shocking unfolding reality, Noah's perception of time barely moved as he took an instant to observe the prompts that had come with the elevation of his Lineage.","[As the Progenitor of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, the 100,000% Increased Rate of Progression towards and past Extremity has been elevated by ten times due to your unique Extremity Soul, making this value 1,000,000% currently.]","[The feature of Illuminating Light of Quintessence has been elevated to allow you to take 45 Concepts that have attained Extremity and converge them into a single Dynamis of Extremity.]","...!","A brilliant feature whose words had to be read carefully was elevated.","It only allowed for Noah to take 45 Concepts that had reached Extremity and converge them! It was elevated so much that this upgrade didn't even affect Noah currently, with him truly being able to utilize this feature when his concepts attained Extremity.","At that time...what Indefatigable would be capable of doing...what Thanatos and Oraculum and all the other Dynamis would be able to do...it was heart-","shaking to even imagine!","Then, there was Havenly Quintessential Link- one of the sources of Noah's confidence.","[Havenly Quintessential Link has been elevated to the extent that you can now view the Recorded Histories of the members of your lineage, and you can even obtain or alter their Records, Extremity Authorities, or other forms of Authorities and Concepts of Extremity at the cost of your Extremity Soul Values.]","Havenly Quintessential Link.","With this feature, he was able to share the senses of those in his lineage along with being able to open a Havenly Bloodline Rift and appear anywhere within a thousand light years of the chosen target. Now, its power became even more obscene.","Lastly, there was Obfuscation.","[Havenly Quintessential Obfuscation has been elevated to the extent that as the Progenitor of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, you can now erase your records and existence passively and actively even against Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities. Your very records can be so expertly controlled and veiled to the extent that even if you were standing in front of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, they would not be able to perceive that you were there.]","Obfuscation gave a middle finger to the pristine authority of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities.","He could veil his records and fool their eyes with the distinction of Absolute Inscrutable II Existence, but he could not even stand in front of them...and they wouldn't know he was there.","It was heavy.","It was slightly overpowered!","But this was all just him.","His Lineage itself gained lesser versions of these features, but the most astounding ones was a set of new add ons that could very well alter the very power structure of the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","Noah gazed at the set of prompts that showed this.","[Any existence holding the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage can now be granted the authority of Quasi-Primitive Vitalis Manipulation, with a feature of Vitalis Gene Manipulation unlocked in their bloodline as threads of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority will be naturally absorbed in their Aspects of Existence until they undergo the First Vitalis Awakening.]","[Any existence holding the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage can now be granted the authority of Quasi-Primitive Vacuous Manipulation, with a feature of Vacuous Gene Manipulation unlocked in their bloodline as threads of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority will be naturally absorbed in their Aspects of Existence until they undergo the First Vacuous Awakening.]","[In a single entity, either the feature of Vitalis Gene Manipulation or Vacuous Gene Manipulation can be activated- not both.]","Among the many boons his Extremity Soul granted to his Lineage, Noah saw this one being the most impactful on a scale even he hadn't fully calculated.","One of the Main difficulties of the existences within the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains was how difficult it was for them to even undergo Vitalis Awakening.","With his Lineage alone...Noah may just be able to bridge this gap!","This was his Lineage after being bathed by his Extremity Soul.","It gave Noah a sense of confidence for what he was trying to do, his blood splattered on Svetlana's split figure and current existence as an Anchor as his Blood began permeating into her eroded soul.","At the same time, the booming horns became even louder as at this juncture, the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions coming from the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos reached the scaffolding of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority at the center of the bridge, crossing past it and stepping onto the Havenly Bridge of Dissolution as they pierced into the Vitalis Havens!","The authority of Obfuscation and Inscrutable II Existence flashed over Noah's body floating next to Svetlana as he remained right where he was, the fantastical fact that unless a being exceeding Tier 4 came from the Bridges before him- no other Extremities would be able to see that he was right here unless he wished them to.","This was how stupendous his power was becoming.","And as the situation became ever serious with his focus placed on Svetlana...","[Primogenitor, what the hell did you just do?]","[...]","The buzzing voice of the Seer of Sima buzzed in Noah's mind even though he had turned it down to the lowest.","[Primogenitor, did you advance another Gradation of Extremity? What your Bloodline can do now...Primogenitor, did you already calculate how massive an effect this is going to have on the Vitalis Havens? Oh, and what conflict is there for you to make guidelines that hurt the Avernus Clan? Are you actually connected to that Osmont waging war against them? Primogenitor? Can you really not hear me? Hello?]","Her will was carried forth as her words expressed a semblance of the profound changes and alterations to the scales of power about to bloom in the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","But...how would these very domains fare when for the first time in History, Vacuous Malignancies were arriving into the heart of these Havens?!"]},{"number":2737,"title":"Chapter 2737: Chapter 2736 You can’t even see me! I","paragraphs":["In the Nether Haven of Helios.","Above a distinguished domain known as The Chambers of the Senatus.","A single Minor Haven stretching for millions of light years stood tall as it was surrounded by hundreds of Planes of Existence, this whole Domain holding an innumerable number of quintillions of beings as it was a core area within the Haven of Helios!","Here, forces of all Seven Clans were stationed permanently as it was one of the areas where the ruling force of the whole Havens resided.","A core area where members of the Senatus of Extremity would at times meet.","Yet on this day, above this domain- the stellar space split apart as an illusory bridge burning with Helios and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority appeared, a scaffolding connecting it to a fiery obsidian illusory bridge of the Infernal Authority of Perdition also coming to fruition!","Others may not know, but the size and scale of this bridge was much, much smaller than the one that had already appeared in the Nether Haven of Dissolution.","And yet it formed quickly as by the time that dozens of Tier 3 Vitalis Hyperversal Extremities and three Tier 4 Entities rose from the Chambers of the Senatus, a blinding Obsidian light had already crossed the bridge from one end to another as they appeared protectively in front of the {Anchor of the Havenly and Infernal Extremity Bridges} that had initiated this shocking construct.","This obsidian light materialized to radiate a shocking aura of a Tier 4 Vacuous Extremity, an Entity who held the form of a Titanic octopus with thousands of massive tendrils of tentacles that burned with Perdition!","It stared at the incoming Tier 4s and Tier 3 Vitalis Extremities and roared out with malice and power, and on the illusory bridge that was gradually becoming more and more real...Legions of Vacuous Malignancies began to tumble forth.","The scene was unreal to observe as behind the Vacuous Legions, numerous Hyperversal Savior's Arks could be seen as the surrounding region had already become permeated by a field of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","A scene like this...was not isolated just to the Nether Haven of Helios. In the Nether Haven of Genesis, an illusory bridge also appeared in the space above another major important landmark as within moments, tendrils of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority began to spread out across the region- followed by the roars of Vacuous Malignancies surging in.","In the Nether Havens of Oceanus, Andromeda, Elera, and Penumbra...similar scenes such as these repeated as a move of immense power and might was played, existences that had been entrenched in the Vitalis Havens of Extremity being activated and making a move at this moment.","A move that was bound to be recorded in History and alter the landscape of what was to come!","—","In the billowing waves of Vacuous Hyperversal Legions outside of the Vitalis Havens of Extremity.","In the far, far back of these waves of Legions, within an isolated domain filled with potent Vacuous Hyperversal Authority- the voice of an existence who had managed to step on the Fifth Gradation of Extremity spoke as he received waved of feedback and records.","{Everything is flowing smoothly?}","His voice was booming and calming at the same time as around him, the voices of Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities rose in affirmation one after another.","{Yes, the Extremity Bridges are forming and stabilizing within all Seven Havens of Vitalis. Seeing them in action now...just how did he come up with this? Its crux is still a mystery even to me.}","A Tier 4 replied while seeing the scene of a glorious Extremity Bridge that connected their forces into the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","At his words, the existence of the Fifth Gradation of Extremity nodded with a smile as he nodded.","{Yes...it is a rudimentary application of the Records left behind by the Hero of Vacuous on his brief observation of the Ones Above Extremity, but it works wonders regardless. Now...the question remaining is what their response will be. The core lands of Vitalis were closed off until recently as this War...it cannot even be considered started until their so called Supernal Havens get involved. Until from them, others like me get involved. All of those that are entrenched and hidden from the current Records will gradually be drawn out as at that time...}","His visage was shrouded in waves of obsidian light as he could barely be discerned.","He didn't finish his last words as he seemed to gaze upwards at something even he didn't know.","He held a gaze longing and despondency.","Despondency!","On a Tier 5 Hyperversal Extremity!","It was a wonder what could make such an extinguished being despondent as he continued.","{...at that time, maybe a path will open up for us. We have to end this endless cycle of war and death by making this the very last War. When the dust settles, we can finally rest.}","...!","His words were filled with mystery as when hearing them, those around him felt their eyes shimmer with brilliance as they moved forward with their plans.","Far away from them, in the Nether Haven of Dissolution.","Tendrils of Anarchos and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority had spread out from the area where the Extremity Bridge was established as at this point, the auras of four Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities had appeared in front of the massive and many waves of Legions as throngs of Tier 3, 2, and 1 Vacuous Extremities came behind them.","At the end of the bridge, Noah placed his hands on the ruptured visage of Svetlana who had become an Anchor as he watched these beings appear with a cold gaze.","And then, the scene that occurred next expressed the glory of his own power as two of the Four Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities came towards his position, one having the figure that closely resembled a Four Armed Minotaur while the other held a bestial visage of a Four Winged Tiger whose wings were an Aurora of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","The aura of the Four Winged Tiger was the most potent as his thunderous voice echoed out while coming close to the Anchor and gazing at it while nodding!","{Spread out in this region and establish an impenetrable stronghold. Do not let a single Vitalis Malignancy step foot even a thousand light years within this region.}","...!"]},{"number":2738,"title":"Chapter 2738: Chapter 2737 You can’t even see me! II","paragraphs":["His words were undeniable as his whole figure pulsed with tendrils of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, the flames of Anarchos pulsing on his body and falling off like molten lava as this being and four others radiated terror.","Floating next to the ruptured body of Svetlana, Noah watched this powerful Entity and the others who took up different positions in this region.","They were beings he couldn't even touch right now as just this one before him held a dense number of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures- and these were just those visible.","He couldn't yet fight them.","And yet...he still held a power that even they couldn't see through as even at this moment, none of them knew or realized that he was floating right in their midst!","This was now.","In a day or two as he processed the immense gains from utilizing the Bow of Helios to decimate over a thousand Tier 1s and a hundred Tier 2s- how much closer would he be to them?","This question buzzed in his mind and caused him to look forward to the future as next, his rousing will of Tyranny rose as his voice began to ring out in the surroundings fearlessly!","{Not even a single Vitalis Malignancy can come close to the Extremity Bridge?}","His voice rang out in the surroundings.","The Tier 4 Four Winged Tiger dripping with white molten Anarchos heard it as he began to reply.","{Yes. Our goal-}","...!","His voice stopped an instant after.","His authority then blazed as a terrific Haki instantly descended on every nook and cranny for nearby light years!","This was because the Four Winged Tiger very quickly realized this voice did not stem from any of the Vacuous Extremities, and nor could he find its source.","This was an appalling discovery as it laid out the possibility of a powerful enemy they couldn't even locate yet.","{Cover all areas, encircle the Anchor!}","His voice thundered out as the pristine powerhouses who were closing off space in the distance retreated back into this region, their wills waving around madly as their powerful Souls searched for the unknown enemy!","And yet...they couldn't find anyone.","They could not sense anything.","And such a phenomenon only caused them to become more stern as only Tier 3 Extremities and below continued to move along with the continued flow of Hyperversal Savior's Arks that came out from the Extremity Bridge behind them.","The Tier 4s were ready to take action as the most powerful one spoke out coldly soon after.","{I was expecting a grand welcome and battle for finally arriving in the Vitalis Havens. I didn't expect my first host to be one who wouldn't even dare to show themselves and stand before me!}","WAA!","Imperceptible tendrils of terrifying Dynamis of Extremity rose up as these...were Dynamis formed from multiple Concepts that had attained Extremity.","Their power was Unfathomable as they could alter records and reality at will!","And yet even they couldn't overcome the absolute quality that was granted by Noah's Awakenings, Lineage, and Extremity Soul.","Such a grand accomplishment caused Noah to reply grandly as his voice seemed like it was coming from all around.","{It is not that I do not even dare to show myself...it is that you cannot even see me!}","...!","{You cannot even see me, and you expect to win this coming war?}","Stellar words that caused the Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities to turn somber while the Legions around them got ready for battle rang out.","The pride of the powerful Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities was struck at as Noah didn't stop, his voice echoing out with a sigh!","{It truly is a pity for you guys. When fighting for any cause or initiating any wars, you all should have done it years ago before I appeared. You were just unlucky to do all of this during my reign as now...your history and eons of accomplishments can only be a backdrop to my Quintessential destiny.}","DUM!","The surroundings of the nearby Haven boomed at these words!","Mere backdrops to a Quintessential destiny.","Quintessential!","This word caused the eyes of the Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities to flicker with brilliance as whether by coincidence or truly just pure chance, another heavy vibration echoed out at such a moment.","DUM!","This time, it had a source.","Eyes and Wills turned over to a certain direction.","In the distant skies of Dissolution, light years away from the position where the Havenly Bridge of Dissolution and Infernal Bridge of Anarchos had bloomed...there was the ever radiant obsidian Extremity Vein that stretched out endlessly into other Havens.","At this moment, the Extremity Vein pulsed and radiated a light of glory- a light that actually stretched out towards the shining Bridges in the distant space!","And a moment later...","RIIP!","Vein Rifts bloomed close to the dazzling Bridges and the Legions of the Vacuous Malignancies that were crossing through.","Vein Rifts!","The very same one that sparked off the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification of Dissolution!","They appeared one after another as they were massive in stature, vibrant auras beginning to rise from within these rifts.","And an instant later, from these Vein Rifts...an archaic air of life and abundance erupted as gigantic and pristine plants the size of Minor Worlds floated out, and in their midst, humanoid figures that seemed to contain features of plants could be seen.","Each of them shone with a powerful verdant light of Havenly power as they...were from the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages- the Hyperversal Havenly Plantae Extremity Lineage!","In the lead, a towering ancient Oak Tree with dense Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of {LIFE} moved, millions of roots anchoring themselves onto the space around this region as it will at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity seemed to exceed any others on this stage.","Noah gazed at the appearance of these existences as at this time, the forces of the Supernal Havens of Extremity...finally began to join the War.","And in the midst of all this Noah's eyes flashed as a myriad of prompts appeared before him- having finally made some progress after he drenched Svetlana's existence with his Blood.","{Your Lineage has entrenched itself into a portion of the Aspects of Existence of the target.}","{A foreign will of an indeterminate level of power comparative to yours is also pervading the soul of the target!}","...!"]},{"number":2739,"title":"Chapter 2739: Chapter 2738 Their Rise Tips the Scales! I","paragraphs":["2738 Their Rise Tips the Scales! I","He finally made headway into the Soul of a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","This action held great importance as the Adjudicator of Dissolution currently acted as the Anchor for the biggest Extremity Bridge established within the Vitalis Havens, and if Noah could gain control of the Anchor...","[The autonomy of the Soul will be required if there is a chance of altering the records of the target.]","The prompts continued to come as his Will felt like it was traversing light years of Records of the one known as Svetlana.","[Your Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage has latched onto the Source Records of this existence as your will spreads across their Records and towards their Main Body. Regaining Autonomy of her Soul in conjunction with your own power may allow the successful alteration and transformation of their Soul.]","...!","The prompts showed the uncertain path that Noah could try with the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","Her Soul was under the influence of an indeterminate authority as at this moment, Noah felt his will traverse across space and time to flow towards the Main Body of Svetlana that had entered the Supernal Haven of Dissolution!","Half of his will left behind the utterly majestic scene of powerhouses from the Hyperversal Havenly Plantae Extremity Lineage arriving from Vein Rifts and the War about to erupt against the Vacuous Malignancies here.","This will traversed across the Records of Svetlana as the scenes observed by this will gradually changed until...","WAP!","Records pulsed as his will carrying rivers of his Blood flowed across Histories to arrive into the main body of the Adjudicator of Dissolution that was within the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","Her main body was currently situated on a shattered Archipelago that seemed to have been in this state for thousands of years, its landmasses still holding a sense of power as they floated serenely while supported by tendrils of Dissolution.","Amidst the shattered landmasses, her figure was covered by a veil of Dissolution as her eyes were closed, her expression showing a sense of difficulty and pain as if she were fighting a great battle in an unconscious manner.","It was at this time that Noah's will carrying rivers of Blood began to flow freely into her body, her Aspects of Existence trembling as it seemed yet another force had entered her to vie for the hegemony of her very Existence.","And she could do nothing about it as already, she was losing her sense of self.","Yet at this time...","HUUM!","A shock boomed from the surging rivers of Blood that were entering her existence as her Soul was roused.","It flickered with light as it awoke ever so slightly, a trace of awareness within her opening its eyes as Svetlana found herself in a crimson gold world- everything around her painted with this color as in front of her, Noah's figure appeared draped with a crimson gold robe that pulsed with a Havenly glow.","Just like her, he sat atop a golden sea of authority as they seemed like the only two beings here.","His eyes rotated with Nine Pupils in a shocking manner of grandeur as his voice thundered out towards the sliver of awareness before him.","[I'd normally continue a discussion with you about your Unchangeable Destiny, your sad history, and how you can actually overcome all of that...but we just don't have time. So, if you actually want a chance to regain autonomy and control of your soul and break free of whatever shackles were holding you down before, I need you to cooperate and not just let my authority permeate through you, but actively help it in doing so.]","...!","His eyes glowed with awe inspiring power as he spoke, Svetlana blinking her own eyes as her awareness fully came to and she sensed the state of her existence!","A rueful expression bloomed on her face as she gazed at Noah closely for a second before she spoke.","[On the border of light and darkness, of good and evil...you don't actually consider yourself good, right? Some sort of hero or savior who aids the poor masses?]","At her words, Noah rose as the golden sea of blood beneath him churned, his figure instantly appearing before the sliver of awareness of Svetlana as his hand reached out to her.","[There's no need to analyze me. I'm no hero, and I'm no savior. The only reason I'm saving you now is for my own benefit. Just like the countless humans before me, I'm just a selfish being fighting for myself and those depending on me. So don't have any grandiose dreams about what I am...and decide now whether you grasp onto my authority, or perish into the eons of History.]","His words were low, and yet they felt like strikes of thunder as they resonated.","He knew every being he had killed, and he had killed far, far too many.","He obtained their memories and records- so he knew every single one closely!","He had destroyed countless civilizations and established powers since his rise- with them either being entirely extinguished or devoured by his Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","No, he was no savior.","He was only a man. A man with grand ideals and an unquenchable Quintessential thirst to understand the wonders that lay out there!","[Haha...]","Svetlana laughed while her fair hand reached out towards Noah's outstretched hand.","[...I wonder how big of a mistake this will be. It feels like I'm exchanging the control of my soul from one Demon to another. And you...seem to be a much more callous demon than my Master!]","Her face held traces of unwillingness and resignation that she erased entirely at this moment- two hands coming in contact as a moment after, the crimson gold world around them collapsed as rivers of extremely potent golden blood surged like snakes and barreled into Svetlana's awareness!","At the same time, Noah felt his Extremity Soul Values and Mana Values begin to drain rapidly as the Hyperversal Bow of Helios in his hands that was about to start sniping the Vacuous Lifeforms coming from the Extremity Bridge within Dissolution came down.","He would need every ounce of Extremity Soul Value for what was to come as it seemed he would be altering the records of a Zenith Tier 3 Vacuous Extremity while trying to erase the marks of a Tier 4 Vacuous Extremity and whatever he left behind on her!"]},{"number":2740,"title":"Chapter 2740: Chapter 2739 Their Rise Tips the Scales! II","paragraphs":["2739 Their Rise Tips the Scales! II","As a great battle of wills was about to unfold within the Aspects of the Adjudicator of Dissolution...an even more significant event was occurring elsewhere.","In the domain within the very depths of the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions outside of the Vitalis Domains where multiple Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities and an existence on the Fifth Gradation of Extremity were taking the lead in a lot of the movements currently occurring with the War.","[My Extremity Clone has secured the Extremity Bridge within the Haven of Oceanus. Only the auras of two Tier 4s are worth worrying about and approaching, but I have Diego for support...]","The situation within the Havens their forces had managed to pierce through was relayed at a quick speed as dense waves of information were brought in, analyzed, and processed quickly.","The Entity of the Fifth Gradation of Extremity oversaw all of this with a stern expression as there couldn't be any mistakes.","Since he was taking command at this point in time, he had to perform in a way that the others could not gain any ammunition to speak negatively on the course of this war!","And things were proceeding smoothly.","Exceedingly so at that as all Extremity Bridges were enacted without issues.","All that had to happen now was-","[You dumbfuck, look at that smug expression on your face when everything is about to start going wrong.]","...!","A new voice instantly erupted as from the folds of this domain, space warped while the image of an Entity with a terrifying aura appeared!","Her visage was reality shaking as it was a young woman in a light obsidian battle dress that radiated the aura of a Middle Grade Armament of Extremity.","Her lush hair flowed with black and gold strands of light as her fair skin shone with a lustrous glint. Her face emanated unrealistic beauty as on her forehead, a unique runic ecriture of indeterminate origins was etched.","[You...]","Her appearance caused the aura of the Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities to be reigned in while the Tier 5 Entity had his face become cloudy as he continued.","[Why are you here...and what do you mean?]","The Entity of the Fifth Gradation of Extremity who had been controlling the pace of the battle so far did not like the Entity that had appeared.","There were many reasons, but the first and foremost reason was...her foul mouth.","[Are your ears not fucking working? Everything. Is. About. To. Go. Wrooong.]","She spoke her last six words slowly and in a very demeaning way, the expression on the Tier 5 Entity becoming entirely dark as the Tier 4s acted like they weren't hearing this discussion at all- focusing on their work!","And yet even as his shoulder face became darker, he didn't erupt against this being as he reigned in his anger while asking calmly.","[What exactly did you find now? How will things go wrong when everything is currently flowing so smoothly?]","The newly arriving woman floated towards his shrouded figure with a stoic expression on her face, her nose wrinkling as if she could smell something that caused her great displeasure as even the slightest facial muscles only further expressed her unrealistic beauty.","[While you're already beginning to celebrate, another anomaly with the potential to derail your whole war has risen. His addition tips the scales as he should already start disassembling your moves soon. If he isn't stopped, all I've seen so far is a great deal of True Deaths, and one set back after another that will slowly take you further from your purpose in this war.]","Her words were shocking ones as even the Tier 4s turned grim when they heard them.","Just who could this enemy be? How terrifying was his expertise in the Gradations of Extremity that his addition in the overall picture would tip the scales so much to be capable of beginning to derail the whole war?!","The Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity had his expression become cold as he asked with somberness.","[Who is it? What Gradation are they in? Entities at our stage have not even begun to appear yet.]","Was it one of the prominent Vitalis Malignancies in the past who had veiled themselves in the eons of space and time? Did they already begin to move this early?","But at his question, the woman adorned in a Middle Grade Armament of Extremity shook her head with an annoyed sigh as she replied.","[That's the thing, he isn't even in the Gradations of Extremity yet. If you're too useless to erase him and stop his rise now before he advances into another stage of power...then you deserve the next loss. You can claim the title of Dipshit Infernal Emperor after that.]","...!","[What!]","Her anger inducing words that were stated last were entirely filtered out from his mind as he focused on the first set of words.","The enemy who would derail their plan and begin causing heavy problems in this War...wasn't even on the Gradations of Extremity yet? He hadn't even attained Extremity?","[Don't fucking scream what. Just take care of it, and don't alert the old assholes of Vitalis about him while trying to kill him, otherwise it will become a lot more complicated. Remember, his appearance tips the scales to heavily favor Vitalis- but he is still at a stage where he can be killed. You'll need to move yourself if you want to succeed in eradicating him, and you'll also need someone with access to the Vitalis Annals of Extremity to fully kill him. Do this quietly and quickly, and make sure every move you make counts.]","Her words only became more and more obscene to listen to as their content was utterly maddening.","The target was an existence that hadn't even achieved Extremity...and a Tier 5 had to be deployed?","The Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities had their wills buzzing in alarm as the shrouded face of the Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity only became more and more stern.","[You got it?] And yet, a nonchalant question was the only thing this demoness in front of him asked.","Silence reigned before the rough voice of the Entity rang out.","[Who...or what is he?]","What anomaly was this existence?","At this question, the woman with tendrils of black and gold hair smiled as the darker surroundings brightened up with a show of power and glory.","[An interesting guy seeking to open up a Dead Path, it seems. Even I wasn't able to discern too much after I discovered him through the effects of his actions- but his name is Noah...Noah Osmont.]","WAA!","[I would help you further by telling you where he is, but the effects of his actions are seemingly running across all Vitalis Havens as locking onto his position is hard. Give it your all and find someone else compatible in the Vitalis Annals of Extremity to track him down, otherwise...ah, you already know. Fall from glory, grace, power, and all that bullshit.]","[...]","After she said these words, her figure began to flicker as she was seemingly about to leave just as quickly as she had appeared.","[Wait.]","The Entity called out calmly as this terrifying woman before him tried to leave, his words continuing to ring out.","[Why don't you join me in seeking and eradicating him? With you, the chances of success should be near if not already at 100%. The others haven't even noticed him, but you have. With your aid...]","His words were calm and filled with reason, and yet...","[Give a guy an inch and he takes the whole fucking light year...I've already come here out of my own volition to help you, and you ask me for even more help? The fucking nerve...]","She shook her head with profound annoyance as the shrouded figure of the Entity remained calm, but they pulsed with a trace of anger!","His deep voice once more came out after a moment.","[Why would you not lend aid at such a critical moment? This war is meant to uncover the hidden and cultivated forces of Vitalis as we gain the information needed to finally take steps towards ending eons of fighting. With your authority, finding this Osmont shouldn't be a problem as I do not see a reason for you to not lend me your aid.]","[...]","A deep silence descended.","Her figure that was becoming wrapped in an obsidian spatial light reappeared briefly as her fair face full of shocking beauty was filled with annoyance, her voice echoing out once more.","[A reason? I don't need a reason. I don't care if this war is won or lost. You all can just continue killing each other over and over again and see where it brings you. Vitalis, Vacuous...at the end of the day, it's all bullshit. And most of you idiots will continue to live and die without ever knowing why. Fuck. It angers me just thinking about it. Anyways, good luck, and don't fuck it up.]","WAP!","With such words, this terrifying existence left as a stark silence was all that remained thereafter.","None of them cursed her out nor reacted negatively to what she said as even though her character and demeanor were the worst, she was one of the terrifying tools to arise within the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains in the eons that had passed!","An existence known as the Cimmerian Architect.","An Entity whose name was entrenched not just within the Vacuous Annals of Extremity, but also in the Vitalis Annals of Extremity!","And she brought forth shocking news of a newly rising enemy who would greatly tip the scales of war.","[Noah Osmont.]","The name thundered out from the Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity as his voice continued soon after.","[Find out everything there is to know about him from our contacts within Vitalis.]","As he spoke, his own eyes pulsed with a terrifying light as he thought for a little while before soon after...his will moved to contact someone who would be able to help!","The goal was a simple one.","To balance out the scales of war once again to their favor as for this...Noah Osmont had to die."]},{"number":2741,"title":"Chapter 2741: Chapter 2740 Their Rise Tips the Scales! III","paragraphs":["Noah Osmont had to die!","This truth was uttered within the mind of a Tier 5 Vacuous Entity as soon after, he moved with utmost caution- to the extent that he even masked his very own thoughts that were directed towards this being.","With the means of Tier 4 or Tier 5 Entities, one could easily feel when others had killing intent towards them as they could prepare.","This Entity didn't want Noah Osmont to even know that he was coming.","He didn't want this rising threat to prepare or have any means of retaliation under his belt!","He would be thorough.","He was the current Director of this War, but he could be replaced at any time.","BZZT!","At this thought, his shrouded visage flickered as an Extremity Clone formed of extremely potent Authority appeared beside him- taking his place as for this, his Main Body would be the one to make a move.","{Olga, Katia...with me. The rest of you, continue with previously assigned tasks.}","At his words, two female Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities pulsing with terrific waves of power rose and accompanied the Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity.","He was known by a few distinctions in the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains, being a leader of the Yog-Nyarvax Lineage- one of the Nine Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Lineages within the Vacuous Havens!","Yog-Nyarvax were Entities known for their Titanic worm-like bodies that were immensely hard to kill- especially so the further they traversed across the Gradations of Extremity.","They were also known as the Devours of the Olden Records.","They were Lifeforms who could uniquely traverse to the past Records of their enemies when they were weaker and begin devouring them from there- with the Primogenitor of their Lineage being titled the Prime Devourer.","The Prime Devourer!","The Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage!","Such a being had his main body flicker away while accompanied by two Tier 4 Vacuous Extremities, his thoughts already moving and sending communications to another Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity who would be able to aid him.","Thereafter, once they made their move...it would be a deadly one to end this rising threat that would tip the scales of War!","—","{Any other pertinent issues as we respond to the Legions of Vacuous Malignancies appearing within our Havens?}","A deep voice filled with an oppressive might of power rang out in a domain that couldn't be accessed unless one went through layers and layers of Records of Authorization.","Its surroundings flowed with pristine purple tendrils of Andromeda as minute white wisps of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority also flowed, with this region being filled with 81 thrones anchored in specific positions.","An impenetrable purple boundary then covered the periphery of these thrones as this...was one of the fortified Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity where its members could meet in a heartbeat!","The Senatus of Extremity was vast as its members were in the billions, but the core existences were an elected 81 Senatus Members who met and decided the fates of the innumerable masses of the Nether Havens of Extremity.","A Chamber like this was one that moved across the spacetime continuum as sometimes, it would be in Andromeda like today, or its location could be in Genesis, Penumbra...or anywhere else within the Seven Havens the next day.","Currently, all 81 Senatus Members were present to address the unfolding War and oppressive move from the Vacuous Malignancies.","They were all either Extremity Clones or traces of Souls of those holding seats in the Senatus of Extremity as their Main Bodies were already on the move to react and defend against the Vacuous Malignancies- very few Entities actually having their Main Bodies here.","Very few...but the existence that had spoken with a deep voice radiated an oppressive pressure of his main body as the aura he released...was that of the Fifth Gradation of Extremity.","He was known as The Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity!","The one who presided over their matters and spoke to control all discussions as he had to be listened to.","The other 80 Senatus Members on their own thrones circling in this domain wondrously held auras of Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","This was the collection of power of all Seven Clans and Major Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity of the Nether Havens as their accumulation and might over the years were deep!","{All of the Infernal Bridges that have appeared either have our forces surrounding them, or the forces of the Supernal Havens of Extremity. The figurehead of the Hyperversal Havenly Celestia Extremity Lineage- the one I met anyways, has promised more reinforcements as time passes.}","...!","The one to speak currently was the Extremity Clone of none other than Esteemed Thadeus.","The one who had led the procession of forces of the Senatus of Extremity into the Vein Rifts as a delegation to meet with the powerhouses of the Supernal Havens of Extremity!","His throne was surrounded by golden brilliance as his eyes pulsed with a gold light, strands of golden hair illuminating him and making him visible to all while many other thrones were shrouded by their own unique authorities.","His words garnered a nod from the Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity as another voice rose.","{I do have another issue that also relates to this War...and the power of our forces.}","The voice was calm and serene as it came from a throne surrounded by purple flames.","Flames that when they parted, the figure that was revealed was none other than the Seer of Avernus.","Seer Amestris!","The languid and gorgeous eyes of this clone blinked as many eyes turned towards her, her voice continuing to ring out.","{It deals with the weakening and gradual destruction of even our forces on the battlefield. The isolation of the Avernus Clan from means and treasures all others are partaking in, and the killing of our Extremities in a way that does not allow us to keep defending the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.}","...!"]},{"number":2742,"title":"Chapter 2742: Chapter 2741 Their Rise Tips the Scales! IV","paragraphs":["Her words caused the brows of many to rise as they already knew what she was talking about!","The pressure of the Rhetorician of the Senatus pulsed as he probed calmly.","{Oh?}","{Yes, Rhetorician.} Seer Amestris nodded calmly as she waved her hands to show many illusory screens that displayed the woes of the Avernus Clan over the last days!","{Isolation, chaos, deaths. All of these are things the Avernus Clan has faced over the last days as we have the highest death toll when counting all Seven Clans, with our lands currently burning in chaos. All of this stems from a Minor Conflict with this man here...}","She waved her hands once more as the visage of none other than Noah painted an illusory screen!","The eyes of 80 Tier 4s and the Tier 5 Rhetorician of the Senatus focused on this image as Seer Amestris continued.","{It is nothing new. The conflict began on the lower rungs of our forces and gradually grew, with the subject here- Noah Osmont, not revealing he was part of a force of supremacy connected to the Supernal Havens of Extremity as he wasn't treated like an associate or an Entity of the same standing as us. This has led to an unneeded conflict during this war that weakens all of us, with the forces he is connected to cutting off access to the rising Extremity Treasure known as Blood Sources, and our Extremities being butchered as if they were pigs for slaughter.}","WAA!","The sharpness in her voice wasn't contained as it spread out freely!","She gazed at all beings here on their respective thrones as she continued.","{The Avernus Clan is prepared to admit our initial fault in this matter as we seek to bring Noah Osmont to the table and discuss an end to this needless conflict. The woes of any members of the Seven Clans are the woes of the Senatus, and the butchering of 100 Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities by those from our own Havens is not something we can turn our eyes away from. All of them...were on the front lines fighting against Vacuous Malignancies for the Senatus when they were butchered by those backing Noah Osmont, some who may even be in this very domain.}","...!","A stark silence descended after her words as many of those situated on the thrones gazed at each other.","The Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity was calm as his domination figure was revealed.","It was a man built like a mountain, his size massive while sitting on the throne as halcyon threads of light swirled around his magnetic face.","Strands of golden hair fell freely as he spoke calmly.","{The Source of these Blood Sources are from the Supernal Havens of Extremity, none of us can aid you in that. But if the crux of it all is with this Noah Osmont, then we simply need to bring him to the table. Who here has a line of connection with this being?}","His authoritative voice echoed out as many beings silently looked at each other!","Nobody's voice rose for a moment as Seer Amestris spoke once more.","{He shares a connection with the prominent Scions of the Infinite Extremity and the Sima Clan. Some of his bodies have been verified to be within these domains.}","{Oh?}","Her words caused many eyes to turn towards multiple thrones that held the Extremity Clones of Entities from the Sima Clan and the Inheritance of the Infinite Extremity!","Receiving all of these gazes, a Throne representing a Tier 4 Ancestor of the Sima Clan vibrated before the voice of an old man emanated out.","{The one known as Noah Osmont is currently within one of the Domains of the Sima Clan as a guest of my grandson. I can pass on whatever message is decided on here towards his direction at most.}","These words caused a nod to bloom on the Rhetorician of the Senatus as he didn't seem to want to spend any more time on this issue, his voice thundering out.","{Very well, bring this Noah Osmont to the table and we will have the Avernus Clan and him bury the hatchet. What is next on the Agenda?}","The issue was brought up and resolved so quickly that the eyes of some Entities flashed with their own myriad of thoughts.","Days ago, a Representative of the Cult of the Endless Shadows had sought rectification from the Senatus of Extremity for the blatant attack and seizing of their Armament of Extremity, yet none of their complaints were brought to the floor as everything seemed to have been forgotten after the Vein Rifts bloomed in the Haven of Dissolution.","Yet now, the Avernus Clan brought an issue forward as it was already going towards a resolution!","What a difference in response.","What a difference in treatment!","One was an inconsequential Inheritance that didn't even have a single Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, while the other was one of the Seven Clans with a deep history and multiple of such Entities within their ranks.","Yet when watching such a reality play out, it was hard not to see the unfairness in this situation!","And as the Rhetorician of the Senatus tried to move past this issue, one of the thrones belonging to the Havenly Moon Clan shone as a feminine voice emanated from it {Well, another issue I wish to bring up may also be connected to this Osmont. It is the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Blood Sources that the Havenly Moon Clan has obtained in great abundance. We...are finding the power of those who assimilate with these Blood Sources go so far as to double or even triple, and even further advancement is occurring right now as the issue we bring forth is the procurement of these Blood Sources for the armies of the Senatus of Extremity in the front lines.}","...!","Her words were astonishing as Seer Amestris and other representatives of the Avernus Clan couldn't help but turn somber!","They didn't know that the Blood Sources they didn't have access to actually augmented one's power so much.","Other Clans were actually enjoying such boons? And their clan continued to be barred from them? This couldn't continue!","{The Infernal Havenly Commerce of the Supernal Havens of Extremity distributes these Blood Sources to...all who would pay a sufficient price, barring the Avernus Clan. Since their conflict with Osmont leads them to believe he may have a pull with the Infernal Havenly Commerce, we can also communicate with him and see if we can obtain more information on these Blood Sources, and what the larger plans of the Infernal Havenly Commerce are. Obtaining them for all of our forces...is equivalent to multiplying our power many times over.}","WAA!","The words held deep meaning to those who could truly understand the workings of things as the gaze of the Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity flickered with brilliance.","This was the second time the name of Noah Osmont was brought up in the agenda of the Senatus of Extremity.","This Entity had to be looked into!","{Very well, Melchior- simply invite this Noah Osmont to come for a briefing in the Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity.}","...!","A command was laid out.","One of the thrones of the Sima Clan shimmered as the aged Entity on it nodded and passed the message on!","At the same time, on a silent throne that belonged to one of the Seven Clans- an entity enshrouded in a dark light grasped a round pearl that pulsed with a gravitational force of millions of Singularities, her authority flowing into it as she sent a message.","—","On the end of a shimmering Extremity Bridge that held the Havenly Bridge of Helios connected to it, the scene of the Haven of Helios being visible in the far distance.","The spacetime continuum warped from existing to not existing as Vacuous Hyperversal Authority stabilized everything, with Legions of Vacuous Malignancies swirling protectively behind the Infernal Bridge of Perdition as in the next moment, their figures trembled while all Vacuous Entities Tier 3 and below bowed their heads respectively!","This was because the aura of three Tier 5 Infernal Emperors appeared above them with a dozen Tier 4s in tow.","At their forefront, the Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage could be seen as in the next moment, he pulled out a round pearl that pulsed with the brilliance of millions of Singularities.","From it, waves of information came through as the billowing waves of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority around this Prime Devourer pulsed, his voice echoing out.","{I have the possible locations of Osmont. We will gather more information before making a move as the moment we enter the Vitalis Havens, we will have seconds at most before their Havenly Emperors descend to oppose us. Before they arrive, every Record of Noah Osmont must be eradicated.}","...!"]},{"number":2743,"title":"Chapter 2743: Chapter 2742 Impending Danger! I","paragraphs":["2742 Impending Danger! I","A moment after their arrival, every record of Noah Osmont had to be erased!","This was the plan of an Entity that was in the Fifth Gradation of Extremity- an Entity that had brought two other beings of the same stage in addition to 12 Entities in the Fourth Gradation of Extremity.","What did it mean to traverse the Gradations of Extremity? How grander was one's power as they moved from one Gradation to another?","The workings of all of this were established and known as any existence achieving Extremity would step on the Gradations of Extremity.","The distinction of just how far they were on the Gradations depended on just what type of Concept they took to Extremity.","If they elevated a Planar Boundary- an average concept of a small standing to Extremity, they would only arrive at the First Gradation of Extremity as thereafter, they could start on the arduous task of elevating this concept across the Gradations!","It would only have Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, but if an Entity was powerful enough to transform their soul and elevate themselves across the Gradations of Extremity, even this concept could have its standing altered from Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures to Obsidian...and even Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures.","The simplest and most average concept of Extremity that was only at the Planar or Innate ranking...could theoretically be elevated to match even Consummate Boundaries that were taken to Extremity if one traversed across the Gradations of Extremity.","This was the Realm that Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities stepped on.","It mattered not what their concept was as even the most simple sounding one...was something that could release an output and authority as the most distinguished Concepts of Extremity!","It was even theorized that the further one went towards the Gradations of Extremity and neared the peak, the concept of Extremity they were refining...","may even be comparable to the unachievable Dead Paths.","This was a theory.","This was what some Entities discussed with each other as they pondered on the path they followed!","So a force including a dozen Tier 4 Entities and three Tier 5 Esteemed Vacuous Infernal Emperors...was not something that even another Entity on the Fifth Gradation of Extremity could handle.","If such a force moved against an existence, it would only mean certain death!","And to have a glimpse of their power, the Prime Devourer turned to his left where a woman shrouded in a black robe and a pointed hat stood serenely, her gaze piercing as she stared at the Haven of Helios in the far distance.","[The Annals Inquisitor...how quickly would your Will be able to traverse across the Vitalis Annals of Extremity and ensure the complete eradication of this being?]","...!","The Annals Inquisitor.","A Vacuous Malignancy...who had gained access to the Vitalis Annals of Extremity!","This was due to nothing but her Concept of Extremity and the grand achievements it had stacked up.","The Histories of Vitalis and Vacuous Malignancies were all respectively on their own Records, and yet they could kill each other and achieve True Death even if they didn't have access to the opposing Annals of Extremity.","After the Extremity Soul of a target was eradicated, the attack would follow their Records as 90% of the time, it would erase their Recorded History along with it.","Then, there was the small percentage where unique Entities with the power to deeply traverse and hide their Records in the Annals of Extremity existed.","Even if their Souls and existence were eradicated, only a portion of their Records would be erased with their death as if they hid their Records deep enough, a person would still survive!","And if the Records of an Entity in the Gradations of Extremity were still there, their Existence could always flicker into existence again from it.","In such instances, an Entity with proficient access in traversing the Annals of Extremity was required to make sure that no matter how deeply one had entrenched and hid themselves...all of their Records would perish.","Towards the question from the Prime Devourer, the Annals Inquisitor nodded with a sharp light in her deeply green eyes.","[Even if he hid his existence in Unrecorded Histories that have yet to occur, I'll be able to find him and extinguish him. All I need...is to grasp a portion of his Soul in my hands. After that...there will be no more Noah Osmont in any Recorded History or Unrecorded History.]","BOOM!","The words were filled with power and undeniability as with this assurance, the Prime Devourer nodded.","[Then I thank you in advance. The Vacuous Planalith Krystallos will be yours as soon as this task is completed...]","An air of mystery and somberness spread as these Entities spoke while waiting for the perfect moment to make a move.","They would confirm the location and then discern the best moment to strike with their own fantastical Concepts and Dynamis of Extremity.","And after they moved...a Tier 5 Entity would fall, much less a genius who had yet to even achieve Extremity!","—","[The Records of a foreign authority are being eradicated by your Lineage!]","[The target Entity is having their Records actively altered!]","In the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","Prompts rose before Noah's eyes in abundance as his Extremity Soul Values were already depleted, with his currently relying on the glorious Extremity Reality Passage shining above his main body as it gushed out and regenerated the little Soul Values he needed every second!","He had Vacuous Hyperversal Authority cover any other deficiency as his Lineage actually erased the History of a Zenith Tier 3 Vacuous Extremity- something he wouldn't be able to do at this stage as the only reason he was...","was because the Entity themselves was working with him.","Svetlana herself lowered all defenses and let him rampage in her existence as Noah sank his hooks in and burned away an immovable authority that had almost made itself part of her.","Her veins, arteries, Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians...every part of her body now flowed with austere golden blood that held traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within it, this Blood cycling into her Heart as the moment it pumped like an engine to spread this Bloodline across her very existence...","BZZT!","An obsidian smoke began to buzz as the skin on her head split open, devilish smoke leaking from it as if she were being purified and made anew.","It was only at this moment a foreign voice full of shock and disbelief boomed out from this devilish smoke that was being expelled.","[What!?]","...!"]},{"number":2744,"title":"Chapter 2744: Chapter 2743 Impending Danger! II","paragraphs":["2743 Impending Danger! II","A single word.","A word that questioned and also proclaimed.","The moment Noah heard it, his Lineage moved with an even more oppressive force as above Svetlana's figure in this region of a shattered Archipelago, an illusory inverted mountainous Reality Passage flashed as rivers of Quintessence surrounded by Vacuous Hyperversal Authority rained down and smashed into Svetlana's figure!","Whatever remnant Will that was branded into her existence this whole time...","BOOM!","Was extinguished and erased entirely at this moment.","A crimson gold light then flashed as the pained expression on Svetlana's face eased, her dark hair gaining a shred of gold at this moment as her fair skin radiated stellar light.","Her figure floated from the shattered landmass she was on as she felt the Blood currently pumping across the vessels and existence, an Unfathomable change beginning to echo out across her that she could barely follow!","[A Quintessential Achievement!]","[Your Lineage has erased the Bloodline Mark of a Tier 4 Vacuous Extremity and greatly altered the Origin and Source of an Entity from an entirely different Existential Authority.]","[Your reach into the Vacuous Annals of Extremity has increased substantially.]","[Your Lineage and Soul has begun to entrench itself into the Anchor of the Havenly and Infernal Extremity Bridges of Dissolution and Anarchos.]","...!","Yes.","Noah didn't just erase the authority of a powerful Entity from Svetlana, he also gained access to the Anchor that was required to stabilize the Extremity Bridge within the Haven of Dissolution that was currently allowing Vacuous Malignancies to cross into the Vitalis Domains.","He could feel Tendrils of himself spread from Svetlana and into the Havenly Bridge of Dissolution, slowly painting this part of the Bridge with his authority as ever so slowly, his will extended towards the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos!","He could feel a wave of possibilities in this direction as at the same time this began, the eyes of Svetlana flashed open while her pupils pulsed with a gold light amidst all the darkness.","And a moment after...her Soul buzzed as the dense Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures began to seethe, her aura slowly starting to advance further!","Too many changes were occurring.","Too many transformations were blooming all at once.","Back in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, Noah's Main Body that still held the Hyperversal Bow of Helios was experiencing even more profound changes as after his Lineage, his Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul continued to bathe over his existence as it elevated even more parts of him.","[Records of your Traits, Constructs, and Modus Operandi have been fully integrated into your Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul.]","[The effects of Infinite Mana, Samsara Universal Dao Origin, Protagonist, and the Infinite System have been taken to a Quintessential level.]","...!","The Infinite System.","The Infinite Forge that RUINATION had been recalled into so that she could fully enjoy Noah's elevation of the Soul.","Every single part of him took a step forward at this moment.","In his Infinite Forge, terrifying transformations were taking place as RUINATION took centerpoint, Noah's Extremity Soul painting over her as her hands held onto something at this moment.","It was...the Half-Forged Armament of Extremity remaining after Noah had already replicated it by Plundering one from a Recorded History and then devouring it to fuel the ascension of his Extremity Soul.","She actually grasped it at this moment as...","[RUINATION has culminated a great deal of achievements and multiplied Loot equivalent to the level of Extremity many times over.]","[Ruination is assimilating the Authority of a Half-Forged Armament of Extremity with the aid of your Extremity Soul and utilizing the influx of Loot Light to propel herself towards the stage of Extremity!]","A glorious advancement began.","Since Noah could wield an Armament of Extremity himself due to his Extremity Soul, RUINATION also used the power of his soul to grasp an Armament of Extremity and devour it for her own use.","This was just Ruination.","But because of Noah being connected to so many intricate things, there were many more things affected apart from just her.","There was also the Infinite Hyperversal Haven that Noah had an unbreakable link with.","[The Infinite Hyperversal Haven that you share a quintessential link with has also been influenced by the advent of your Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul.]","[The Backbone of an Extremity Vein has begun its construction in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!]","HUUM!","The Aletheian Havens trembled.","The authorities of the Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws churned.","The Decretum of Dreams, Avalon, Fantasia, Elysium, and all others rumbled.","Tendrils of all of these authorities...began to move and gather towards the midpoint of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as a terrific construct just barely began forming.","An Extremity Vein within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","All of these changes were triggered by Noah even though he didn't himself guide them to the destination they were going to.","And as everything sublimated and came together to propel him to a new form of life with all aspects of him elevating...","HOONG!","An influx of information arose and thundered into his being.","Information that caused his eyes to flash with waves of tyranny and Quintessence!","[Daring!]","His gaze changed as he instantly felt an unprecedented feeling of danger.","Not from Oraculum. Not from fate or destiny.","It was from the assimilated trait that was now part of his Extremity Soul.","It was a warning from the Protagonist!","[Forces that wish to end the Cycle of the Hero's Journey have appeared.]","[The assimilated feature of [I Am The Main Character] bellows out in anger at those seeking to end the Cycle of the Hero's Journey and seeks more authority!]","[The Boundary of the Protagonist is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The First Boundary Layer of the Protagonist has been attained.]","[The Boundary of the Hero is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The First Boundary Layer of the Hero has been attained.]","[The Boundary of the Villain is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The First Boundary Layer of the Villain has been attained.]","[The Boundary of the MacGuffin is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The First Boundary Layer of the MacGuffin has been attained.]","In quick succession, four more Boundaries were added onto Noah's tally as they were then placed into his Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians, their Boundaries seething and transforming as they were taken towards Quintessential Zenith while very, very quickly propelling themselves across the Boundary Layers."]},{"number":2745,"title":"Chapter 2745: Chapter 2744 They don’t know they’re fighting the Protagonist! I","paragraphs":["2744 They don't know they're fighting the Protagonist! I","The effects of the Extremity Soul fully pervaded all parts of Noah as their effects were stellar, to say the least!","But they weren't the only new Boundaries to be expanded by the Protagonist.","After this concept ridiculously took itself and Hero, Villain, and MacGuffin towards Extremity, it tyrannically roared out as if it wasn't done!","[The Boundary of Systems is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The First Boundary Layer of the Systems has been attained.]","...!","[The Boundary of Cheats is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The Boundary of Skill Trees is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The Boundary of Cultivation is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The Boundary of Plot is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The Boundary of Harem is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The Boundary of Ascendancy is being expanded towards Extremity.]","[The Boundary of Plagiarism is being expanded towards Extremity.]","DUM! DUM! DUM!","Fanfare erupted all around as with every expansion of an utterly ridiculous Boundary, this fanfare only became louder and more obscene!","The erupting symphony seemingly emboldened the Protagonist as it continued to test unfathomable boundaries, roaring out and wishing to establish ultimate glory as it sought to expand one more concept at this point in time, with other possibilities reserved for it at a later time.","With indomitable momentum, it sought to establish one more concept.","[The Boundary of Extremity is being expanded towards Extremi-]","BZZT!","The prompt never finished.","A spark came, tried to bloom, and fizzled out right after as Noah's immense Extremity Soul buzzed before a massive crack appeared at its very center- a grievous injury occurring at this moment!","[The Boundary of Extremity has failed to be expanded towards Extremity.]","[There is insufficient Authority to expand such a Concept towards Extremity as every time one tries to expand it and fails, a heavy injury equivalent to their current power may occur.]","[...]","The Protagonist slowed down.","It gazed at the heavy injury within its Extremity Soul as it seemed it had gotten ahead of itself, with some concepts actually still being far from its grasp at this moment!","But this was okay.","Apart from itself, Hero, Villain, and MacGuffin, the boundaries of Systems, Cheats, Skill Trees, Cultivation, Plot, Harem, Ascendancy, and Plagiarism were obtained.","As these concepts were added to his Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians and began their advancement across Boundary Layers while being elevated to the ranking of Quintessential Zenith, the huge crevice of his Soul began to heal rapidly.","Around his figure holding the Hyperversal Bow of Helios, Authorities of different colors surrounded him and swirled in a glorious manner as he seemed to be the center of a rotating stellar system!","And in an ever present grandeur....","DUM! DUM!","Drums and trumpets blared out in an upbeat symphony of new beginnings.","They wanted to cut short the advancement of the Protagonist.","They wanted to leave the Protagonist on the stage of Death and Rebirth...with him never undergoing Rebirth!","But they didn't know.","Oh, they didn't know!","[Mere extras that haven't even appeared before me, and yet they think they can put a stop on my glorious path?!]","Waves of wild Tyranny swirled as the True Emperor of Quintessence loudly proclaimed!","Mere extras tried to step on his Quintessential path, not knowing they were fighting the Protagonist!","They would learn.","They would come to understand!","BOOOM!","Explosive tendrils of utterly dreadful boundaries being taken across Boundary Layers rapidly exploded around his body, the swirl of authority around him turning into typhoons that were distorted and bent with the sheer pressure he released as a terrific and sensational transformation took place.","Far below his figure, towards the middle point of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, rivers of Dreams, Fantasia, Prana, Apollyon, Elysium, Avalon, Niflheim, and Quantum all swirled to begin forming a stellar backbone of something that was only termed an Extremity Vein at this moment.","But what type of Extremity Vein would it be? And just what wonders and purpose would it have?!","This would all be determined when the Extremity Vein was no longer a backbone- but the genuine thing that was fully completed.","Along with the Decreta of Dimensions, tendrils of Manadynamics, Entropy, Gravitation...all Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws flowed into the Extremity Vein as thereafter, the newly built Aletheian Havens of Helios, Genesis, Dissolution...they also began to make their way into the Extremity Vein in an ecstatic show of wonder.","The tendrils began to form a line from the middle point of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven- this line then began to increase in length as the backbone was gradually formed as its goal was to wrap around the whole Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","But this like...it wasn't straight at the center point relative to the whole Haven as it seemed to twist diagonally, and the more tendrils flowed into it to give it shape- the more clear it became as the Wills of Noah and his Vassals followed it to observe the line twisting and distorting space, gradually curving towards the ends of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as this Extremity Vein...","Was actually forming a lemniscate symbol.","A symbol of Infinity!","An Extremity Vein that wasn't a circular line curving and wrapping around Noah's domains- but one that took on the shape of Infinity.","It was an ecstatic beginning to witness as it would leave any beings breathless at the immeasurable wonder.","And beneath all of this wonder- of the forming Extremity Vein and of Noah bellowing out how mere extras dare to even think of stepping on his path...","there were his people.","Some of them were newer than others as being exposed to this scene after they observed Noah grasp an Armament of Extremity and shoot arrows from it that shook their souls at every tug, the current scene was just too maddening!","Aurelia was among the newer faces along with Orion and other Lerneans as her golden hair fluttered while she gazed with incredulity above.","\"What the hell is this...\"","She saw the clusters of authority exploding around Noah as they had all been watching over the last day, with all of their thoughts in line that he had undergone a tremendous elevation of his soul that was about to end soon as things calmed.","And yet...an even more explosive transformation seemed like it was just beginning as they wondered...would this being ever pause and take a breath?!"]},{"number":2746,"title":"Chapter 2746: Chapter 2745 They don’t know they’re fighting the Protagonist! II","paragraphs":["2745 They don't know they're fighting the Protagonist! II","Beside Aurelia and her dazed expression, the figure of Barbatos with her blessed stature appeared with a sympathetic expression as she patted the shoulders of this Golden haired being.","She would eventually be like the rest of them and gradually become numb to the shocking things they saw, but lately...it seemed that more and more ridiculous things were happening that even those who had been with Noah the longest still received shocks!","Their wills were being tested even now as with all this change occurring, space fissured and cracked to the far, far left and right of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","It was the polar opposites that seemed like where the ends of Aletheian Havens were, and in such locations, two massive structures began to rise and be constructed from chunks of nearby Aletheian Havens as above them- brilliant runic markings could be seen shining with glory.","To the left, a grand construct the size of a Haven was being built as the runic markings above it read simply...","[Hyperversal Havenly Blacksmith's Forge]","And to the right....","[Hyperversal Havenly Alchemy Hall.]","Two constructs that wanted to make themselves renowned rose with utter majesty!","[The Hyperversal Havenly Blacksmith's Forge seeks to become a forge where Armaments of Extremity can be forged.]","[The Hyperversal Havenly Alchemy Hall seeks to become a pavilion where Planalith Krystallos can be forged.]","...!","The transformations bloomed in abundance as they truly weren't limited to Noah- the effects of achieving his Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul spreading to all things connected with him.","These were the changes now when he had just attained an Extremity Soul.","So what would be the final product when he actually took his Concepts to Extremity, including the Decreta, Natural Laws, and Fundamental Natural Laws?","These questions would be critical ones for the future to come as for now...the first set of Boundaries taken forward by the Protagonist achieved a great height of power as they were propelled from the First Boundary Layer and all the way into the Seventeenth Boundary Layer in a short period of time.","Amidst the swirling storms of authority, Noah felt his mind buzzing as he received the details of the most prominent Boundary Layers.","[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of the Protagonist]:: The sublime control of the journey of the Protagonist begins to fall in your lap as the stages of your progression- namely the stages of [A Call to Adventure], [Aid and Cheats], [From the Known to the Unknown], [Challenges and Ordeals], [Point of Death and Rebirth], [Transformation], [Ultimate Boon], [Return], and [Master of Path] are now freely accessible to you up to the point of the highest stage of the cycle you're currently in. The rankings of Items, Concepts, or Entities who are embroiled and connected to you in any of these stages will have their Records and Information available for you to view for a set cost, no matter what height they have reached in the Gradations of Extremity- they will not be masked from the eyes of the Protagonist. The further an Item, Concept, or Entity is on the Gradations of Extremity, the less information is readily available, but information will be there nonetheless. If you can exceed this stage and attain Extremity in the concept of the Protagonist, it may then be possible for you to actively make alterations in the stages of Progression you're in, and even become capable of affecting the Items, Concepts, or Entities embroiled with you within the set stages...","[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of the Hero]:: The definition of a Hero can vary depending on where you stand. This Boundary Layer of the Hero stands to reward you Quintessential Extremity Loot of your choice whenever you gain enough recognition as a Hero by the vast majority of the Conscious Entities of the Reality around you, or when you perform acts deemed heroic by the vast majority of the Conscious Entities of the Reality around you.","[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of the Villain]:: Similar to the Hero, one can be defined as a Villain depending on which stance they take across their lifetime. This Boundary Layer of the Villain also stands to reward you with the Quintessential Extremity Loot of your choice whenever you gain enough recognition as a Villain or when you perform acts deemed villainous by the vast majority of the Conscious Entities of the Reality around you.","[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of the MacGuffin]:: A MacGuffin is a plot device utilized to propel the intricate reality around the protagonist forward. It is usually the cause of conflict or what sets off the journey of the Protagonist, and it could be an item, a concept, or an Entity. There may already be a single or multiple MacGuffins that are currently propelling your reality, with this boundary layer allowing you to choose one item, concept, or Entity and designate it as a MacGuffin. Once selected, unknown and unforeseeable alterations of reality will occur around this item, concept, or Entity. If you can achieve Extremity in this concept, multiple MacGuffins may be available for selection as their existence could cause the stories of all conscious entities around you to resolve around this plot device.","[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of Harems]:: You have a Harem of distinguished and beautiful Existences, but where are they? Why do they not share the spotlight with you and are left to collect dust in the background? This Boundary Layer of Harems seeks to change that as since no Entity can have a fast rate of progression that will ever come to match yours, this Layer goes a different route to provide a solution. At the current point in time, up to 9 Entities that are considered members of your Harem or the products between you and any members of the Harem- they can be selected to take the place of one of your Reified Sources of Boundaries as they can exhibit 50% of the total power of these Clones. If your concepts have attained Extremity or are much higher compared to them, this selection to have their Soul utilize the power of your Clones will rapidly aid them in going towards and past the Gradations of Extremity as they will feel like the tools they're wielding are their own. With this push, if the members of the Harem or their products between you and them still get left out of the spotlight, the Boundary of Harems can only give up and take a back seat...","...!"]},{"number":2747,"title":"Chapter 2747: Chapter 2746 They don’t know they’re fighting the Protagonist! III","paragraphs":["2746 They don't know they're fighting the Protagonist! III","The layers of the newly expanded boundaries were full of wonder by themselves, but their Seventeenth Boundary Layers were astonishing to look at.","The Boundary of Harems now allowed Noah to share a semblance of his power with a specific few beings, while the Seventeenth Boundary Layers of the Hero and Villain seemed to be two parts of a whole that would pull in a great deal of resources for him.","Whenever he moved, he was always a Hero to some and a Villain to others.","He would be getting both of the rewards for these two Boundary Layers as he navigated the Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Domains!","Then, there was MacGuffin.","It allowed him to choose an item, concept, or entity and designate it as a plot device that may become the center point of conflict or what moves the current reality around him forward.","For this...he has to ponder a bit more on as he could only gain access to doing this again after he attained Extremity in this concept.","There couldn't be any mistakes!","Lastly, there was the Seventeenth Boundary Layer of the Protagonist.","When gazing at it, Noah knew that this was the exact tool among the many that the Protagonist brought forth that he had to utilize.","And so without a delay, as a storm of multicolored authority swirled around him due to other concepts being taken towards Extremity, he activated the authority of the Protagonist.","HUUM!","And his surroundings buzzed as the raging essence in the surroundings calmed every so slightly, a golden light blooming from Noah's eyes and flowing upwards as an utterly massive illusory golden book came into existence.","His figure seemed like a grain of sand before this forming illusory golden book as it looked advanced with sleek margins, and yet it also gave a sense of ancientness as it didn't have a title.","Noah felt his Extremity Soul Values being used up as this book was flung open, his Vassals below him seeing this scene as Aurelia's jaw was fully flung open in shock, and Barbatos who was beside her trying to communicate and tell her she would eventually get used to all this also found herself staring upwards in a stupor!","The Golden book fluttered as bordered pages with the titles of [A Call to Adventure], [Aid and Cheats], [From the Known to the Unknown], and [Challenges and Ordeals] were all passed until a particularly bright page labeled [Point of Death and Rebirth] appeared.","When this page was flung open, the pages of this Golden book pulsed as a reality began to be etched on it.","Not any random reality- but the reality willed to play by the True Emperor of Quintessence that related to the Entities who wished to bring to a stop his glorious path!","The entities who wished to keep him forever in this cycle of a Point of Death and Rebirth.","He would be able to see them no matter what height of power they achieved so long as they were embroiled in his journey!","This statement from the description of the 17th Boundary Layer of the Protagonist remained true as at this moment, the golden page was divided into four separate panels that were currently blank.","As his Extremity Soul Values were drained more and more, the top most left panel began to be filled with colors as in an instant, it showed a scene of crimson gold Minor Haven that was torn from above, with the figures of Noah and Ayame seen at the peak of a Golden mountain as beside them, Ayame's grandfather was passing a Curagulus Mask towards Ayame.","This action was halted as the gaze of all three beings were turned up at this moment, the colored image showing them gazing at the culprits that had torn the Haven above them- three Entities that shone like blinding Obsidian suns!","Each one was shrouded by billowing obsidian smoke, and yet they thundered down like hellspawn bringing down apocalypse as these...were the Entities seeking to end Noah's path.","Noah's eyes flashed on their figures on this top most left panel of the page as with a glimmer, a few bursts of information began to appear above their heads.","[The Prime Devourer]:: The Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage, an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity. Due to the non-existent traces of the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Protagonist, no other information can be obtained.","...!","This was the information attained by the Entity at the very center among the three!","Noah's eyes pulsed with a grand light of tyranny as he realized the identity of his enemy.","[A Tier 5 Vacuous Extremity?!]","His eyes blazed with power and possibilities as after he discerned the identity of this being, he looked at the details of the Entities to his left and right.","[The Annals Inquisitor]:: An Extremity Clone of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity who is proficient in accessing both the Records of Vitalis and Vacuous Annals of Extremity. Her achievements make her extremely hard to kill by those at the same stage. Due to the non-existent traces of the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Protagonist, no other information can be obtained.","[Primogenitor of Talismans]:: A Hidden Identity of the Cimmerian Architect. She seems to be here just out of curiosity as those beside her don't know her true identity. Due to the non-existent traces of the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Protagonist, no other information can be obtained.","...!","The other two were also shrouded in a dark light as their figures couldn't be easily discerned, but Noah found his eyes drawn over to the entity on the right of the Prime Devourer.","An entity whose Identity was hidden even from the other two Tier 5 Vacuous Extremities around her! From this being, Noah felt the greatest level of danger, and she wasn't even here for the sake of killing him!","She was only here to satiate her curiosity.","Her curiosity of...him?","Noah's eyes pulsed as he arrived at this conclusion, his Extremity Soul Values leaking even more as they were used as the paint to color the next panel on the Golden page.","The next panel showed a terrifying scene of Ayame's grandfather torn and shredded into trillions of minuscule pieces, with Ayame herself entirely turned to nothing but ashes as the billowing figure of the Prime Devourer arrived in front of Noah!"]},{"number":2748,"title":"Chapter 2748: Chapter 2747 They don’t know they’re fighting the Protagonist! IV","paragraphs":["2747 They don't know they're fighting the Protagonist! IV","The second panel showed an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity right in front of Noah's visage!","And behind Noah, the Annals Inquisitor had her hand thrust out and grasping his head as she seemed to be seeking his very records, existence, and location of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Far above them, the Primogenitor of Talismans- the hidden identity of the Cimmerian Architect- she could be seen floating serenely as her hand was flung backwards, a dense cluster of multicolored paper talismans flying out towards the torn Haven as far, far in the distance, roars of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority could be heard.","It was the roars of a Tier 5 Vitalis Hyperversal Extremity that was rushing over!","All of it generated a shocking amount of information as Noah felt as if his soul was being squeezed dry at this moment, with the third panel not capable of forming any picture as his Extremity Values were entirely depleted.","[You do not have sufficient authority to view the progression of possible reality any further within this [Point of Death and Rebirth].]","[You have gained a glimpse of an Unrecorded History with entities at a tremendously high level of Gradation!]","[A Quintessential Achievement!]","Authority buzzed around him as his eyes were clear.","His Nine Pupils seemed to be rotating like nine abyssal Singularities as they remained on the massive book opened to a Golden page with four panels- continuing to stare at the two colored panels that depicted Entities actually hunting him.","Him!","In the war occurring between Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Legions, no Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity had even made a move yet.","And yet for Noah, three Tier 5s came to extinguish his raging flame?!","What did they find out that made them move with such urgency?","'My path is about to be so glorious that even the higher powers of the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions became worried?'","Tyranny and Quintessence flashed in his eyes as he began to compute and think about many things.","He had seen the situation at hand.","The Protagonist had elevated multiple tools as at this point in time, Noah should already have the solution to this insurmountable issue that he faced.","And insurmountable was right as this wasn't even an Entity like the Avernus Extremity Overlord who was at Tier 4 that Noah had to face- they were Entities who could crush those like the Avernus Extremity Overlord within a second!","He had to find a solution to this...and even use this nexus event to come out ever stronger.","So as authorities raged around him and his Extremity Soul finished its transformations on all parts of him, the True Emperor of Quintessence continued to stare at a massive opened book that depicted an uncertain future.","Far below him, his Vassals watched his figure and the Golden book that made them all feel as small as grains of sand, the scenes depicted within the single page being visible to all of them with extreme clarity!","The bodies of Aurelia and Orion trembled.","The owner of the Golden Forge felt as if reality was no longer making sense as her blessed chest heaved up and down.","\"He...he can see Unrecorded Histories this easily? What the fu-\"","Her words weren't able to finish as she was interrupted a moment after, Kazuhiko stepping forward and pointing to the panels of the golden book with incredulity as what amazed him the most was...","\"He can read webtoons of the future?!\"","...!","The very fabric of reality seemed to be getting violated around them as after these initial reactions, an angry voice rose as the visage of Barbatos blared with an aura of death.","\"That's not the most important thing! Who dares to come for the life of Little Fish? Which of those three bitches needs to die?!\"","Her eyes burned with interminable anger as she gazed at the three shrouded figures on the two colored panels.","A gaze of anger like this wasn't isolated to her alone as near the forefront, the figure of Henry gazed at his father who was shining with brilliance as he clenched his fists.","He was supposed to be the Son of Destiny. The Emperor of Destiny!","And yet what was he doing to aid his father?","This question caused the nails in his clenched fingers to dig into his palm until Golden Blood began to flow, tendrils of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowing into him at this moment as the Entity with the purest blood within the Lineage of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor began to express the newly expanded effects by an alarming degree.","In a different corner where the Vassals were clustered, Adelaide pulsed with coldness when looking at the panel where two terrifying beings surrounded her man left and right!","She never fought. She was never a combatant. But seeing this scene...it genuinely caused her Blood to seethe.","In another corner, Xiaomi's expression was one of utter coldness as around her, the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Ruin pulsed and began to run rampant.","In another corner, the Emperor Penguin waved its flippers in defiance!","The feelings of all Vassals here were the same as they looked at the scene above them- at the scene of Noah gazing at the future as he now planned how to navigate it all by himself.","They wanted power.","They wanted to take some of the weight off his shoulders!","To share just some of his burdens, however small!","But knowing the powers out there and their own level of authority...they couldn't help but feel stifled as they truly didn't know if they would ever be able to share any of his burdens.","—","In the Domains of the Sima Clan.","Noah was within a domain filled with royal purple auroras of light as the land beneath him was also made of pure light, his eyes gazing at the figure of Erikson who was finishing devouring the Extremity Treasures collected by the power of the Sima Clan that could take an Entity to the 17th Boundary Layer in multiple concepts with relative ease.","His body also pulsed with the glow of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage as he had taken a Blood Source days ago, with Extremity being something he sought sooner rather than later as Probability would be warped in any way he sought to achieve it.","Besides Noah, the figure of the Extremity of Foundation could be seen as with a grim expression, his voice came out slowly.","[The...Senatus of Extremity has called for your presence in their Chambers. I've received word that the issues of you and the Avernus Clan, as well as the Blood Sources and the Infernal Havenly Commerce, are the points of discussion.]","...!"]},{"number":2749,"title":"Chapter 2749: Chapter 2748 The True Emperor of Quintessence Gazes at the Senatus! I","paragraphs":["2748 The True Emperor of Quintessence Gazes at the Senatus! I","At the words of the Extremity of Foundation, arcs of light flashed from the eyes of Erikson in the distance as he was roused.","Noah himself was calm while hearing that the Senatus of Extremity was calling for his presence!","This was the Senatus of Extremity.","The governing body of the Nether Havens of Extremity!","The most prestigious Entities were a consortium of the Seven Clans and the most renowned and powerful Aeonic Inheritances.","There were 81 Seats currently active which made all the major decisions, and there were the figureheads of Legions of Vitalis Hyperversal Extremities who could be mobilized with a wave of their hands.","\"To be called before them would normally feel like a high honor, but why does it feel like something is off?\"","Erikson rose up while saying such words, his father giving a light sigh as even he knew there were too many things at work.","In the vastness of it all, he was only a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","He may be significant and full of power, gaining the awe of the vast majority, but when the governing power of the very Havens was involved, even he felt small!","He turned towards Noah who didn't seem to have any significant reaction to his words as he continued.","[It is not up to us to determine, but an Ancestor will be here soon to act as the bridge-]","[An Ancestor? Why do you make me seem so old?]","BZZT!","Space twisted and tore.","A white light flashed as from it, an old woman with a cane flickered into existence, her voice full of power and regality as every time she walked, her cane rang out resonantly!","Seeing her figure, Erikson smiled and walked forward to support her as he spoke with care.","\"Wise Granny, why are you getting involved in messy matters like this? It's not good for your heart, and we know you're only getting older.\"","The words were ones that even a Zenith Tier 3 Entity would not dare utter, but Erikson uttered them freely as the aged hand of the Seer of Sima moved to smack his hands away with a harrumph.","[My heart may have been getting old days ago, but it feels renewed with life and vigor after I got myself a new bloodline. A bloodline...that seems to be connected to our new friend here.]","...!","Her gaze became locked on Noah's clone, and Noah's eyes were calm as he looked back at this Entity!","The one who had been capable enough among those who had joined his Lineage to send messages to him across it, with her voice ringing out incessantly every now and then.","He now gazed at her face to face as he could feel his lineage brimming powerfully within her.","PA!","Her cane resonated on the Aurora of lights around them as she walked towards him.","Her figure was adorned in a white robe that matched her vibrant hair, a hazy white light pulsing on her skin that gave off a feeling of age and power!","Her face was that of a wizened old woman, and yet it still held a sense of impeccable beauty as she smiled while coming a few feet away from Noah.","[Is it you? The one I've been speaking at with no replies this whole time? Or is that too outlandish to even imagine?]","...!","Her first set of words were probing ones as Noah smiled while he replied without a trace of authority.","\"Whatever could the Young Miss mean?\"","[Hah! Young Miss? I've never been referred to as that for the last thousands of years!] The Seer of Sima laughed at Noah's words as her gaze turned even more piercing, staring at Noah silently as she continued.","[Well, no matter. Whatever the truth is will be revealed in due time. The busy little Senators are seeking to understand things just like me, and then there is your War with the Avernus Clan that they wish to discuss. Are you agreeable to appear before them?]","The figures of Erikson and the Extremity of Foundation off to the side gazed at each other with slight shock at the way that the Seer of Sima was talking to Noah.","She sought his opinion on whether he would appear before the Senatus of Extremity or not, as if he could say no and she wouldn't push it!","Since when was the Seer of Sima like this?","Facing her gaze, Noah's eyes flashed with interminable majesty as he placed his hands behind his back while replying.","\"Just because others call for me, does not mean I will scramble to go to them. I will not send even my clone to their Chambers as the most I can do for the Senatus of Extremity...is to send a sliver of my soul to listen to them.\"","Not his main body. Not his clones.","A sliver of his Will at most!","His words were filled with tyranny as the Seer of Sima nodded, her hands waving and causing a crack to appear in space as Noah's eyes saw a dense number of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures swirling with this single move.","[I'm here to act as the bridge connecting the two sides. With the authority I have, I can transfer your trace of soul directly into the Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity through Old Fool Melchior's Seat. As for how things will turn out after that...even I don't know.]","HUM!","The crack in space pulsed as it distorted space and time, forming a bridge from this location and towards the Haven of Andromeda where the Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity were currently meeting!","Noah gazed at this forming crack as a sliver of his will containing a small trace of his soul leaked out from his head, forming into an illusory figure of him that was draped in a white gold Emperor's Robe, his fair illusory skin shining with brilliance as his dark hair flickered with stellar streams of colors every now and then.","He thought of many things, Oraculum and even the Protagonist beginning to be put to use as he wondered what's gains or possible losses could be made from meeting the governing body of the Senatus of Extremity as after a moment, his illusory body composed of a trace of his soul nodded towards the Seer of Sima and stepped towards the spatial crack!"]},{"number":2750,"title":"Chapter 2750: Chapter 2749 The True Emperor of Quintessence Gazes at the Senatus! II","paragraphs":["2749 The True Emperor of Quintessence Gazes at the Senatus! II","Within a secretive domain in the Nether Haven of Andromeda.","Auroras of the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Andromeda flowed along with trace tendrils of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority within this enclosed domains, 81 Thrones that gazed at each other floating in space as 80 Entities at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity and one Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity had their auras burning brightly on these thrones!","At this moment, one of the thrones designated for the Sima Clan buzzed as the voice of Melchior emanated out.","[I hate to interrupt, but the Entity Noah Osmont that was called upon by the Senatus can appear before us now if we wish to address some of the prior issues.]","[Oh?]","The buzzing and authoritative voice of the Rhetorician of the Senatus rang out as his throne pulsed with golden light, his grand stature raising his right hand as the Chambers became quiet, and he nodded towards Melchior.","HUM!","Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures flickered from beneath his throne as a light shone from it- a light that then shot out towards the center of the Senatus of Extremity as a crack in space bloomed!","And from this crack, a unique aura stepped out.","Bathed with brilliance, the illusory form of the True Emperor of Quintessence stepped out of the spatial crack as he entered into a restricted space that very few Entities ever had the honor to gaze upon.","He stepped into the Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity as the moment he did so, the crack he came from dimmed as many eyes and Wills locked onto him!","And his gaze was of utmost brightness as his Will also spread out to observe everything around him.","The aura of powerful entities at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity was maddening to feel, and yet his soul didn't buckle under the pressure as his head remained high, the voice of the Entity who had aided in utilizing their authority speaking out with his arrival.","[I present the one that has named himself the True Emperor of Quintessence, Noah Osmont.]","The voice of the Old Man from the Sima Clan rang out resonantly as thereafter, he smiled lightly while gazing at Noah and continuing.","[Noah Osmont, you stand before the Senatus of Extremity, consisting of the representatives of the Seven Clans and Major Inheritances within our Nether Havens of Extremity. The issues that brought you here today deal with your conflict with the Avernus Clan, as well as the Infernal Havenly Commerce and any knowledge you can shed on their Blood Sources.]","...!","The Sima Clan Ancestor took the time to introduce the issue as the wills of extremely powerful beings swirled around Noah, with his Eyes of Extremity that were bathed with his Extremity Soul watching all 81 Senatus Members here closely as he learned of their names and identities.","Each of them emanated waves of tremendous power as they were all entities he couldn't even injure or touch at this moment, with the Golden haired Titan of a being sitting on the largest throne giving Noah the feeling of most danger as he felt like this being could reach him in the span of an instant!","Were anything to happen here, his guard was up for this Entity the most as he couldn't allow them to even get near him. For this, he had the simple means of dissipating this trace of Soul as none of his records would ever come close to being traced.","His gaze moved on from the most powerful Entity here as he continued to gaze around.","A moment later, his eyes showed a trace of surprise as he turned around to stare at a distant throne behind him where a figure shrouded in a dark light could be seen.","The identity of this being was particularly unique as towards them, Noah smiled devilishly.","[Ancestor Renee](Possessed):: An Entity on the Fourth Gradation of Extremity who has been possessed by a Vacuous Hyperversal Extremity. She stems from the Holy Church Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity as she was exposed to the trace soul of a Vacuous Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity during an important ritual...","An Entity with history and information appeared before him as Noah smiled towards them, the eyes and gaze of this being swirling with a trace of shock as they wondered why he was staring their way!","But he didn't linger on this being for too long as he turned back towards the myriad of other thrones here, glancing at them as he came to lock onto the throne that held none other than Seer Amestris.","The Seer of Avernus.","Seeing this entity with her throne wrapped in purple flames, he smiled while waving his hands towards her throne.","...!","An action that raised brows as it showed the utter lack of respect since these beings were still supposed to be enemies at this point!","The eyes of the Rhetorician of the Senatus rose as his face remained placid, his hands waving at this moment as a throne beside him took a spotlight- revealing a woman adorned in a sleek black power suit with gorgeous golden hair and a pair of glasses that buzzed with the authority of an Armament of Extremity.","She was the Speaker of the Senatus who took the lead on behalf of the Rhetorician of the Senatus when common matters were being dealt with!","She emanated pristine grace and beauty as she pushed up the glasses on the bridge of her nose while speaking out, the authority of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity pulsing from her.","[Noah Osmont. The Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity are a sacred place of power. This is your first time here, so-]","\"One second.\"","She had begun to speak, yet her words were interrupted as Noah stopped gazing around.","The eyes of the Speaker of the Senatus turned sharp as she and all others watched Noah's illusory figure snap his fingers, the space behind him beginning to buzz as a grand multicolored illusory throne bloomed into existence!","Adorned in illustrious runic etchings and cerulean lemniscate symbols, it looks like a throne rising up in the form of a resplendent multicolored mountain as only after it was enacted...did Noah's illusory figure sit atop it with majesty!","[...]","The action drew many sharp gazes as Noah's figure sat on his illusory True Throne of Quintessence unabashedly, a flaming multicolored crown appearing above his head as after he was seated, his voice rang out.","\"You all were seated in your high thrones as it just didn't feel right for me to not be on mine. Now, you were saying?\"","WAA!","A low yet resonant melody of tension and valor began to play in the background.","Imperceptible. Barely discernible. But it was the beginning of a symphony nonetheless!","The immensely powerful entities in these Chambers watched such a scene with shining eyes as no clamor erupted.","The eyes of the Speaker only became sharper as her glasses shimmered with brilliance while she continued.","[The Senatus of Extremity has manner and decorum. When given the space to speak, one speaks. Otherwise, all others listen. One of the issues at hand that brought you here is one that questions your connection to the Infernal Havenly Commerce stemming from the Supernal Havens of Extremity. That...","is a major reason for your wanton act just now to be allowed. Not because of you...but because of the power that stands behind you. Going forward, be mindful of this.]","...!","They could all be his trace of soul wasn't surrounded by any Extremity Rune Scriptures.","Truly, this being before them had yet to even achieve Extremity!","And for him to talk to them and address them as if they were peers?","When they were so advanced on the Gradations of Extremity and even Tier 3 Entities gazed at them with awe and respect? No others said this loudly, but the majority of Entities here expected such a form of respect towards them!","\"Oh?\"","Her words caused Noah to release a dazzling smile as the Speaker only gazed at him calmly before continuing.","[Yes. But the first and connected issue to address is one with the Avernus Clan. Senatus Member Amestris, go ahead.]","Her words were directed to none other than the Seer of Avernus, the throne of this being lighting up with authority as the purple flames around her throne parted to reveal her astonishing figure.","Her voice was succinct as she stared at Noah while speaking.","[Your conflict with the Avernus Clan began due to a lower-level Extremity belonging to our Clan and was escalated up from there. The Avernus Clan admits fault in this as the ones responsible will be punished, with the Senatus of Extremity bearing witness now to bring an end to this conflict. Whether it is you and the power behind you, or the Avernus Clan...none of us benefit from continued chaos and death. For the good of the Seven Havens, this conflict- this War...must end.]","For the good of the Seven Havens.","These words rang out resonantly as when he heard them, Noah's smile only became brighter as his gaze moved from Seer Amestris and towards the Speaker of the Senatus who stared back at him calmly as if waiting for his reply!","And his reply...","\"Oh, am I allowed to speak now?\"","...!","His reply was a taunting one.","Many wills buzzed silently once more as the eyes of the Speaker became ever sharper while speaking out the next set of words with blazing authority.","[You may speak.]","\"Marvelous\" Noah clapped his hands lightly at her words as he continued, \"I'm oh so happy to be allowed to address the great Senatus of Extremity in these trying times, and I want to start...with a question.\"","WAA!","As he spoke, the mocking smile faded from his face as while seated on the throne of Quintessence, his figure emanated glory and stoicism while he continued!","\"Days ago, the Avernus Clan took a shit on the Investiture of Extremity, attacking and massacring members of the Cult of Endless Shadows in the Haven of Penumbra as trillions of Lifeforms below the stage of Extremity were eradicated, multiple Extremities were killed, and an Armament of Extremity was blatantly stolen. The members of the Cult of Endless Shadows then raised their hands to the great Senatus of Extremity and called upon your endless power to rectify this matter...and yet were only met with silence as I don't recall hearing any Avernus Members questioned or brought to account.\"","Quintessence pulsed from his throne as tyranny began to swirl in his eyes!","\"Now, the Avernus Clan speaks once after feeling the beginnings of their own destruction as moments after, the respected parties are all brought together as the Senatus of Extremity...addressed this particular issue very quickly! So I came to wonder...just how exactly does the Senatus of Extremity enforce its governance? How does it pick and choose which rules to enforce, and why did the woes of the Avernus Clan get a hearing so quickly when the woes of the Cult of Endless Shadows were never even addressed?\"","BOOM!","Authority began to build up.","The True Emperor of Quintessence spoke with majesty as his voice rang out across the Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity!"]},{"number":2751,"title":"Chapter 2751: Chapter 2750 You are in MY Presence! I","paragraphs":["2750 You are in MY Presence! I","The Senatus of Extremity was a collection of wills and voices.","Of the major powers that reigned over the Nether Havens of Extremity!","The choices they made and how they led generations of Entities across the Gradations of Extremity...were never questioned.","Others may have their own opinions, but they would never dare to actually voice them.","Yet on this day, an Entity sat in the midst of Tier 4 Vitalis Extremities and before the gaze of the Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity as he questioned them!","He asked...why was it that when the Cult of Endless Shadows sought for help and recompense for what happened to them, there was no answer?","And why was it that the Avernus Clan's issues were being addressed so speedily?!","His words were resonant as a tense symphony played audibly, the eyes of the watching Senatus Members shining with brilliance at Noah's words as once more, no clamor erupted!","Noah fearlessly gazed towards the Golden-haired Speaker of the Senatus, his eyes even moving to land on the Rhetorician of the Senatus on the throne beside her as this Entity continued to watch on coldly.","The Speaker was unfazed by Noah's words as her glasses pulsed with brilliance.","[You ask why? Did you think such a question would expose something or make it hard for us to answer?]","WAA!","[The answer is a simple one, O supposed Emperor of Quintessence. The force behind you has allegedly eradicated over 100 Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities- a number that the Cult of Endless Shadows didn't have even a fourth of. So yes, the Avernus Clan is considered an issue of greater importance to address.]","[None of us are petulant children or Scions who gaze at the world as black and white. As good or evil. There are much, much larger forces for us to think and worry about. The answer that you think we would try and avoid saying...is that at the time, we truly did not believe that handling the Cult of Endless Shadows was worth our time. It was merely an Inheritance whose number of Extremities did not even exceed 50. This force added nothing to the overall picture of the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains, so why would we dedicate time for something irreversible done to it when we were at such a critical juncture? It was beneath us, so it was ignored. This was the choice that was made not just by a select few, but all Senatus Members here.]","Her eyes pulsed with a golden light as she pushed her glasses up the bridge of her nose again, her beauty increasing with every passing second as from her throne, she then began to point towards one force after another in different directions!","[The Havenly Moon Clan. The Inheritance of the Infinite Extremity. The Sima Clan...we all bore the responsibility of not answering the calls of the Cult of Endless Shadows as we considered them beneath our worries. That is the straight answer that you thought would be hard to get out of us. I mention the Sima Clan and Infinite Extremity to let you know that even the forces you associate with...also carry this same responsibility with them. Is that a sufficient answer to your question? Can we now be adults and move to resolve the truly important issues at hand?]","...!","Her monologue ended.","Stark silence permeated the surroundings as the veiled faces of the Sima Clan Ancestor holding seats among the 81 Senatus Members turned dark, other Entities becoming the same when they were given the same label as everyone else!","The stark silence did not last long as...","PA! PA! PA!...","The sound of clapping rang out as the True Emperor of Quintessence did so while seated on his throne.","As if he couldn't agree more with the words of the Speaker of the Senatus!","\"Precisely.\"","Quintessence shone around him as his voice rang out with a sense of magnetism.","\"Your words ring true. Just like how you all viewed the Cult of Endless Shadows, I also consider the Avernus Clan far beneath me. Hell, I was able to isolate and fracture the whole Avernus Clan with a single word as before me, what is such a Clan worth?\"","...!","\"Just like you all did not consider the Cult of Endless Shadows worthy of your time and attention to rectify the wrongs done to them...I also do not feel like the Avernus Clan is worthy enough for me to even think of rectifying their current plight. After all, from your own words...a mere force such as that adds nothing to my overall picture!\"","His words buzzed with fearless glory in the face of Entities on the Fourth and Fifth Gradations of Extremity.","The faces of all Entities connected to the Avernus Clan felt their gazes changing as those from other Clans looked at Noah with astonishment!","In their minds, they wondered just what power stood behind him for him to talk like this while under the authority of the Senatus of Extremity.","And such a thought seemed to be clear as day for some as finally...the Speaker of Senatus became stern as her voice emanated out with power, the might of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity moving with her voice.","[We have shown you courtesy on behalf of the force of the Supernal Havens of Extremity you may represent. But know and understand...you are still in the presence of the Senatus of Extremity. You are in the presence of Esteemed Emperors who have built the very backbone of these Havens. The Inheritors of Vitalis and the Rulers that have kept its order for eons! In the presence of such beings, there are things you can and cannot-]","\"I sit in your presence?\"","HUUM!","The words of the Speaker were interrupted yet again.","The True Throne of Quintessence buzzed as the Emperor atop it was roused.","His dignity seemed to have been set aflame as the pressure of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity actually bore down unto him!","The trace of his Soul here buzzed as such an action roused the billowing and suppressed Tyranny within his very core as he asked once more.","\"I sit in your presence?!\"","...!"]},{"number":2752,"title":"Chapter 2752: Chapter 2751 You are in MY Presence! II","paragraphs":["2751 You are in MY Presence! II","He was the one standing before the presence of an esteemed council? He should feel veneration and respect by being in the presence of the Senatus of Extremity?","Who did they think they were?!","Billowing waves of Quintessence pulsed from his throne as his voice thundered out into the cold face of the Speaker of the Senatus.","With his flaming multicolored crown spinning, Noah tapped on the armrest of his illusory throne as he uttered out coldly- and this time as he bore the pressure of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity on him, the power of his Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul spread out.","[No...I am not in your presence.]","...!","Authority.","His voice actually emanated Hyperversal Extremity Authority as it caused some Hyperversal Extremities to rise from their thrones!","Extremity Authority! But they could all very well see that this being's soul did not have even a single Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture as how was such a thing possible?","How could his voice carry the authority of Extremity if he hadn't brought any concept there?","Their questions weren't answered.","The aura around the illusory throne the True Emperor of Quintessence sat on only became more potent as this trace of his soul rejected the pressure from the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, his voice echoing out with majesty.","[I am most definitely not in your presence. You...are in MY presence! You stand before the Tyrannical Emperor. The Gazer of the Unscalable Wall. The Extremity Despoiler.]","WAA!","[You stand in the presence of the True Emperor of Quintessence. You stand before me as for you, it is the highest form of honor!]","...!","The moment these words ended, the multicolored illusory throne shone with blinding light as prompts cascaded over Noah's eyes.","[The Boundary of Tyranny is surging towards Extremity!]","[The Boundary Layers of Tyranny have been scaled at an unfathomable speed!]","Tendrils of purple lightning began to buzz around his throne.","Royal.","Regal.","Majestic!","It was the tendrils of profound Tyranny as his throne and figure very quickly became covered with them!","Surrounded by tendrils of such tyranny, he stared at the cold face of the Speaker that emanated even greater coldness.","Her fair skin and red lips pulsed with a trace of oppression as she uttered out coldly.","[Are you done?]","Her voice now buzzed with a threatening glare.","To her right, the massive throne of the Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity remained still as the golden-haired entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity stared calmly without reacting to any of the reality playing out!","Noah observed this scene and more as he shook his head while waving his right hand.","[No, I am not done.]","With a glimmer, his right hand produced an illusory screen of light that showed the scene of dozens of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, four Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities, one Tier 1, and a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity who were currently seated atop a purple vessel shaped like a celestial mountain.","[This is what remains of the Purple Sun Family that used to belong to the Avernus Clan before they renounced it and left in order to be capable of using the Havenly Bloodline Sources.]","Noah reclined back in his throne as the illusory screen to his right became bigger and bigger, the events within fully unfolding before everyone's eyes.","\"All of them are Entities who have attained the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage. Some have yet to even achieve Extremity. And currently, they are sensing some new changes that have occurred with this Lineage...\"","BZZT!","Around the bodies of the meditating Purple Sun Family, space buzzed as extremely thin tendrils of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority began to flow from the surroundings and enter their bodies.","...!","Noah had activated and granted the authority of Quasi-Primitive Vitalis Manipulation as within the bodies of these beings, the feature of Vitalis Gene Manipulation was unlocked.","And once activated, thin threads of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority continued to be drawn into their bodies as the moment this began, the Zenith Tier 3 Ancestor of the Purple Sun Family opened his eyes in utter shock and incredulity, and he was followed by all those around him as they felt the pristine and Havenly glow of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowing into all of them!","This reality playing out in the illusory screen Noah had conjured up caused even more Tier 4 Senatus Members to rise from their thrones.","While reclined in his, Noah calmly gazed at all of them before his gaze became locked with the Speaker of the Senatus.","[Vitalis Hyperversal Authority will continue to be drawn into the bodies of all Entities with the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage passively as after enough is contained within them...only a single thing will occur thereafter.]","...!","[Those with the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage can undergo their First Vitalis Awakening as easy as the passage of time.]","Seeing the scene before then and hearing the words of the True Emperor of Quintessence before them, many of the Senatus Members were astonished!","Because what they saw...was revolutionary.","It could alter the stage of power of the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains in a terrifying way!","Even the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages of the Supernal Havens of Extremity did not have such a terrifying capability.","On a distant throne, Seer Amestris rose as she could feel a billowing storm from the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, her gaze changing and becoming extremely sour.","A sense of great foreboding descended as Noah's voice continued to thunder out.","[The Avernus Clan will never gain access to the Blood Sources capable of granting the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage, I will make sure of this.]","WAA!","[All others around them will freely take them and elevate in power, Members of their own Clan like the Purple Sun Family here will continue to leave them as in the days and weeks to come, the Avernus Clan will continue to fracture until it disperses into dust.]","BOOM!","The words were thundering as they felt like a toll of death on one of the major Clans!","The True Emperor of Quintessence said this freely as while gloriously reclined on his throne, with tendrils of royal purple light of tyranny pulsing around him, he spoke words that even these powerful Entities would not be able to forget in their lifetimes.","[One of the glorious Seven Clans will fall without me having to lift even a single finger. This...I promise you.]","...!"]},{"number":2753,"title":"Chapter 2753: Chapter 2752 The Demon of the Seven Havens! I","paragraphs":["2752 The Demon of the Seven Havens! I","A promise.","This was what the True Emperor of Quintessence brought down as at this moment, the thrones representing Esteemed Havenly Emperors of the Avernus Clan burst into righteous purple flames of indignation.","The surroundings buzzed with power as multiple other wills and pressure from entities at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity descended on Noah!","But this was merely pressure.","They had yet to make a move on him with their authorities. And yet even under this pressure, Noah was undaunted as his Extremity Soul buzzed in response.","His soul was unique. It stood far apart from normal Extremity Souls as it was Quintessential!","So how could the pressure emanating from a Soul that had stepped on the Fourth Gradation of Extremity make him stand down? The only one he was cautious of was the Entity that had yet to make any moves or say anything towards him- the Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity.","A second passed.","The illusory scene Noah conjured stayed up for this second before it faded away as in this period of time, all Entities here computed and had millions of thoughts cross their minds.","The promise of this Entity seated on an illusory throne as well as the Blood Sources and his connection to the Infernal Havenly Commerce that allowed him to forcefully cause whoever the Primogenitor of this Lineage was to exclude the Avernus Clan...it showed that this being's standing and position in the Supernal Havens of Extremity was not low!","Seeing his Soul give off waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority when they couldn't see any Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures was another piece of the puzzle.","All in all, his demeanor and words, and whatever force stood behind him were one of the main things holding back an eruption of authorities at this moment.","Instead, the gaze of the golden haired Speaker became ever chillier as as her voice rang out.","[There are many paths we can take in our Records. Taking on a path of internal fighting and conflict...is not a wise decision. Those behind you should know this. The Primogenitors of the Nether Havens and the Primogenitors of the Supernal Havens have been protecting these lands over the eons that have passed together. Forces of the Supernal Havens never fought against our forces...nor did we kill each other based on vendettas that the other side is seeking to bury. The Avernus Clan seeks to bury this vendetta, this war ongoing between the both of you, and you would rather choose Annihilation?]","...!","She mentioned great secrets and the identities of beings far greater than any of those who sat here.","Of Primogenitors that Noah only knew a few of from the names of Legends they left behind.","Of Entities like Extremity Steel!","At her words, Noah shook his head with a smile while replying.","[How do you forget that this began as an Apex War of Annihilation? Before that War began, I warned all forces trying to exterminate me and my people. Some forces were wise and listened, and other forces chose to push forward. They made a choice then as this...is my choice now. The complete disbarment and Annihilation of the Avernus Clan.]","WAA!","His words were irrefutable.","Immense silence descended as the Speaker's eyes now pulsed with liquified golden light, her voice once more sounding out!","[Taking on this path of conflict with our own people makes you no better than the Demons we face every day. And yet you come from among us as even with all your self-proclaimed titles and distinctions...the only thing you will be known by will be as another Demon.]","Her voice was becoming piercing as she continued.","[Is that the Legacy you wish to leave behind as we start yet another great war with our true enemies? A Demon who is even worse than them- A Demon of these Seven Havens?!]","...!","Her piercing words clapped out like thunder!","And before any other voice could continue...","[Enough.]","HOOONG!","The booming voice of the Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity who had been silent this entire time rang out.","From his throne, a terrifying pressure rose as reality twisted and reformed from its mere eruption.","An interminable number of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures swirled around this Entity like an endless sea as under his thundering voice, the Speaker pulled back and sat down on her throne.","Nobody else uttered a word as at this moment, Noah raised his brows while coming to gaze at this being.","Emanating a sense of immense vitality and handsomeness, his golden hair danced on his head like rivers of reality as his eyes swirled with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","His eyes fully came to lock onto Noah at this moment as he spoke out slowly.","[Who are you to the Infernal Havenly Commerce? To the Primogenitor of the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage?]","...!","He didn't speak regarding the Avernus Clan, but on Noah's own Identity!","And Noah only smiled at this as he shook his head.","[Does it truly matter in the end? One way or another, I have the authority that I have, and I do what I want.]","His Will could not be swayed.","He made this known as in their minds, they still didn't ascertain his identity to the force that he himself has enacted in the Supernal Havens!","The gaze of the Rhetorician remained calm at Noah's reply as he spoke again.","[You can select the terms and price you wish with the Avernus Extremity Overlord to end this feud. The Senatus will guarantee whatever terms you have stated will be enforced.]","WAA!","A shocking set of words left his grand visage.","Words that caused the faces of the Avernus Esteemed Havenly Emperors to turn dark as they turned towards the Rhetorician in shock!","What was this? The True Emperor of Quintessence alone would be allowed to set the terms? The Avernus Clan alone would pay the price? And the Senatus would enforce it?!","Why did these words make it seem like the Rhetorician of the Senatus was conceding to this being after seeing his connection to the unfathomable Infernal Havenly Commerce?","[Esteemed Rhetorician, this is not-] Seer Amestris quickly rose to object as before she could even finish, the right hand of the Rhetorician rose as she was silenced.","His gaze remained on Noah.","He waited for see what choice would be made at this point in time!"]},{"number":2754,"title":"Chapter 2754: Chapter 2753 The Demon of the Seven Havens! II","paragraphs":["2753 The Demon of the Seven Havens! II","The Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity was different compared to Noah's initial conception of him.","This entity was very direct and to the point as the moment he spoke, his power and words made it so that a definite choice had to be made.","Noah's guard was already up to make a move at any moment he needed to, and he already had in mind what he needed to do for a seamless exit!","So when the Rhetorician of the Senatus offered him the choice to name whatever terms he wanted to the Avernus Extremity Overlord and have the Avernus Clan pay it to end their War...","[No.]","...!","Noah's voice was steady as he denied it.","He stably sat on his illusory throne as he spoke while gazing at the enclosed stellar domain filled with 81 thrones.","[We live and die by the choices we make, and some choices are irreversible. I promised that the Avernus Clan would fracture and disappear into the ashes of history, so this...can be the only outcome. For me to become a Demon by making that choice? I will bear that burden!]","WAA!","[Besides...] His illusory throne pulsed as for the first time, it rotated in space to turn towards the thrones behind Noah.","DUN!","A beat began to pick up in the surroundings again.","DUN!","Drums of coming chaos began to play as the True Emperor of Quintessence turned around while speaking a set of words that would throw everything into chaos!","[...I do not make deals with a Senatus of Extremity that claims to protect the sanctity of these Seven Havens from the Vacuous Malignancies when within their very ranks...]","His turned throne came to stare in a direction that had a single Entity that Noah had smiled at before.","He stretched out his words slowly as it was like a burning truth was slowly carved out!","His eyes came to land on a particular Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity as their eyes also locked onto him. Terrifying age and vicissitude flashed between their gazes as Ancestor Renee...watched him with a chilling light.","As if she knew what Noah was about to say exactly.","As if all of this time, she was waiting for it!","[Within your very ranks, you gleefully house Vacuous Malignancies. How can I trust such a Senatus?]","...!","BOOOM!","He said these words while staring straight at Ancestor Renee.","Her shrouded figure had released its authority as she was visible to all, her deadly curves expressed as if to show Noah the Entity he was exposing. She was pristinely beautiful, and right now...her eyes held tremendous coldness and apathy as her reaction said that she knew Noah would expose her all along!","In the surroundings, the thrones of the other Senatus Members creaked and bustled as finally, a clamor began.","On the highest and biggest throne, the visage of the Rhetorician of the Senatus was also filled with utmost apathy as a dense golden light erupted from him right away!","But the moment he did so, a blaring obsidian light unfurled from the small body of Ancestor Renee as extremely dense and pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority was released.","And whatever was triggered seemed to be in utmost abundance as its explosive points originated from over half of the 81 thrones in this domain- the one possessing Ancestor Renee having been very prepared at this moment.","After all, she had silently begun releasing her authority the moment Noah first gazed at her when he first arrived here!","Her eyes and body split apart as a pure Aurora of an Entity that had undergone their Fourth Vacuous Awakenings, eyes as dark as the Abyss blinking coldly as a serene feminine voice of an entity that was most definitely not Ancestor Renee emanated out while these eyes came to lock with Noah's.","[We will come for you. And we will come hard...this, I promise you.]","WAA!","The voice was magnetic.","It even repeated words that Noah had said to the Senatus of Extremity!","In response, Noah smiled at this Entity and nodded as his figure on the illusory throne had already begun to disperse before whatever chaos was about to unfold fully descended.","[Give it your best shot, and do it soon...otherwise, none of you will be able to even gaze upon a sliver of my Records.]","...!","The time he attained Extremity- many, many Entities would come to find that point and time to be a reality of tremendous change that would be utterly irreversible.","If they wanted to have any chances at Noah, they would have to do it before this as after it? The difficulty was something they couldn't fully fathom at this moment in time!","BOOOM!","Space distorted and deformed as from the possessed body of Ancestor Renee, a trace of an aura at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity erupted out along with a sea of gorgeous Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures.","It threatened to devour everything and everyone here as before it could even come close to Noah...","WAP!","His illusory figure and throne had entirely disappeared from the Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity.","He came, argued, and expressed his authority as after poking a sleeper operative implanted into the Senatus of Extremity, he left amidst a great unfolding chaos!","As for what would happen here? He would come to know soon enough!","—","In the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","At the depths of the Obsidian Havenly Saurischian Archipelago.","In an underground area, vibrant crystalline earth pulsing with tendrils of pure Dissolution lined up a descending stairway that was leading up to a massive spinning circle of light.","9 Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities floated beside the massive spinning circle of light as it was made of dense and intricate runic markings that intertwined to form a heart shaking power!","[Set up by the Primogenitor of Formations, this Havenly Spatial Formation is one of the many set up across prominent Obsidian Havenly Archipelagos as once activated, it can take you great distances. Some local within this very Haven, others vast to a connected network of the Havenly Spatial Formation in other Supernal Havens. This...will take you to the base where you can enter the Hyperversal Havenly Gauntlet of Gradation within the Supernal Haven of Helios.]","The Havenly Master of the Saurischian Archipelago, the Havenly Titanosaurus, spoke towards Noah's clone that nodded with a smile.","As they walked down, Noah casually voiced out towards this Tier 4 Vitalis Extremity.","\"Say, if I had an opportunity to set a trap to hunt Vacuous Malignancies at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity, which Ancestors can you connect me with to talk to?\"","...!","A question that caused the Havenly Master to stop in his tracks and gaze at Noah with astounding incredulity came out!"]},{"number":2755,"title":"Chapter 2755: Chapter 2754 The Demon of the Seven Havens! III","paragraphs":["2754 The Demon of the Seven Havens! III","The Havenly Master of the Obsidian Saurischian Havenly Archipelago stared at Noah with a dumbfounded expression as his steps came to a halt.","The crystalline earth in the underground area they were in lightly pulsed with Dissolution as ahead of them, the circular and intricately designed Havenly Spatial Formation radiated illusory light that warped space and created a unique reality around it.","[You...what do you mean hunt Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity?]","His words weren't dismissed right away by the Havenly Master as Noah smiled while nodding.","\"Just that. I have information on where three Tier 5 Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities will appear in the future to come, and I wanted to try making them stay...in a permanent sense.\"","BOOM!","He wanted to make Vacuous Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity to stay permanently!","Such daring words came from him as the Havenly Master saw he was entirely serious.","The fact that it was impossible for him to know this information or even have knowledge of experts at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity crossed through the mind of the Havenly Master as his eyes flickered with brilliance.","These were Entities that were extremely advanced in the Gradations of Extremity.","A single one of them making a move could alter the very makeup of the Seven Havens.","The Havenly Master thought of this and more as his eyes locked onto Noah seriously for the seconds that came.","He stared back calmly as after some time, the Havenly Master spoke seriously.","[I won't make it difficult for you, nor will I ask too many questions right now as if what you say is true, just discussing specifics of it will alert an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity. Hell, even thinking or concocting plans against such beings could have the Souls alert them. So...I will pass word to an Esteemed Havenly Emperor where you are going. They preside over the domain of the Nine Helios Extinction Mausoleum where the Hyperversal Havenly Gauntlet of Gradation. By the time you are propelled across space through the Havenly Spatial Formation, he would have received my word as you can go from there.]","The Havenly Master spoke as such.","And Noah nodded while looking at the buzzing formation in the distance, his mind filled with schemes and possibilities as at this moment, he was looking at whether it would be possible for multiple factors to come together and create a chance for him to finally break the wall of Extremity in terms of his concept at the time when Three Tier 5 Entities tried to erase his records.","He was calculating whether it would be possible to attain Extremity from the ambush and possible fall of Tier 5 Entities!","If everything fell into place at the same time.","When this thought came, he smiled.","Nothing ever coincidentally fell into place. For the truly powerful, they would make everything fall into place!","His mind was quickly made up as a possible golden path bloomed, and at the end of this path...he saw himself using this Nexus Event of Death and Rebirth to rise from the ashes and grasp his first Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture!","With such a thought in mind, he continued towards the Havenly Spatial Formation that would take him to the Supernal Haven of Helios.","To the Nine Helios Extinction Mausoleum!","—","Devastating battles were breaking out across all the Seven Nether Havens.","Vacuous Malignancies made their way in as constructs of the Hyperversal Savior's Arks spread out tendrils of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority into these Havens, Legions of Vacuous Malignancies crossed Extremity Bridges and spreading out mad destruction.","In such a reality, Legions of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages of the Supernal Havens of Extremity began to make their appearance!","Celestia! Animalia! Plantae! Riboviria!","Members of these Lineages appeared in some capacity to reinforce the forces of the Nether Havens of Extremity as their battles were bound to establish their power and show pristine glory.","In the midst of all of this, no sides knew that the True Emperor of Quintessence had taken control to influence one side of the Extremity Bridge within Dissolution that was allowing Legions of Vacuous Malignancies to cross.","No side knew his Will was trying to use the Anchor that was Svetlana to gain control of the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos.","No side knew his involvement in this part of the war...nor what he had done to spark off an even more disastrous conflict within the Seven Havens.","A conflict that took place within the very Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity!","Across the folds of time and space.","Within the isolated and movable domain of the Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity.","A catastrophic scene was observable as over 40 of the 81 Thrones of the Senatus Members lay broken and fractured, the Extremity Clones that used to reside on them not in their positions as across the stellar enclosed domains, the remnants of Extremity Clones still pushing with tendrils of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority could be seen!","It meant that deaths of Extremity Clones had occurred from the fallout as at the very center of this enclosed domain, there was the most astonishing scene.","The body of the Rhetorician of the Senatus floated grandly and with insurmountable majesty as tendrils of golden light of Extremity coursed over him, his stature looking over the body of Ancestor Renee below his feet that was split open vertically with the whole upper body fractured in multiple places.","Her chest revealed golden blood that pulsed with residues of Extremity, with the even more astonishing thing being the fact that her Blood and remnants of her whole being were rising up to form a heart shaking singularity above her!","The singularity was taking on the form of a multicolored fruit that released a sweet smell that tugged on the very Souls of Entities nearby.","It was the formation of a Hyperversal Gradation Fruit of Extremity that only appeared whenever an Entity extremely advanced in the Gradations of Extremity fell!"]},{"number":2756,"title":"Chapter 2756: Chapter 2755 The Demon of the Seven Havens! IV","paragraphs":["2755 The Demon of the Seven Havens! IV","The fall of any Entity at the Zenith Tier 4 or at the stage of the Fifth Gradation of Extremity was a rare and insurmountably difficult reality to come across.","When Entities of such levels did fall, their advanced progress in the Gradations of Extremity allowed what remained of their Aspects of Existence to form Hyperversal Gradation Fruits of Extremity- holy Panaceas that others only knew of in Recorded History but rarely came across!","They were extremely rare to even form as they required an impossible reality to occur, and their usage...could at the very minimum birth a Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture on any Entity.","Whether they had achieved Extremity or not.","A single Hyperversal Gradation Fruit of Extremity passed down a portion of the Inheritance of an existence that was extremely advanced in the Gradations of Extremity as after taking it, any Entity could be elevated to the Third Gradation of Extremity.","If their souls were unique and their existence was powerful enough, they could achieve an even greater result!","Such a Fruit formed above the shattered body of Ancestor Renee as a portion of the soul that possessed her was destroyed along with her- a heavy casualty occurring on this day as Ancestor Renee was one of the few who had their Main Bodies here.","The Rhetorician of the Senatus gazed at this scene coldly as his will surged to gaze at ten Senatus Members floating around him, and the fractured bodies of other Senatus Members who were caught in the battle that had bloomed here.","His will gazed at all of this as his voice rang out coldly.","[It is time to cleanse the Seven Havens of anything to do with Vacuous Malignancies. All Entities in seats of power will bring themselves before me and have their Soul analyzed for any connections with Vacuous Malignancies. Anybody who disagrees...will be executed on the spot!]","WAA!","His figure radiated a profound light of power as he spoke words of undeniability!","The gazes of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities around him changed at such a drastic response, but they couldn't refute it.","The golden hair on the Rhetorician of the Senatus waved with glory and majesty as he continued while gazing into the far distance.","[We are in a precarious time of war that may decide how the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains live for the eons to come. Drastic times require drastic measures as first, we will secure our own borders and forces. Evelyn...you first!]","The Rhetorician called out.","And from behind him, the Speaker whose visage emanated great beauty and grace stepped out and came to bow before him.","His massive hand reached out and grasped her whole head as a golden light flashed, the Records of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity being glanced at as an instant later, the Rhetorician nodded lightly as the Speaker moved to the side.","[Melchior.]","One name after another started to be called.","Great change began as the leadership of the Senatus of Extremity began to ensure that among their ranks, only those they trusted would be among them!","And in the midst of all this...","[What about my Avernus Clan?]","The voice of Seer Amestris rang out as billowing purple flames raged around her.","Grasping the head of Melchior, the Rhetorician glanced at her without a word as he called out another name!","Seer Amestris saw this scene as her gaze changed greatly.","[There is a Primogenitor stemming from the Avernus Clan out there. He would not sit still knowing that the Senatus that the Primogenitors set up did not defend the Avernus Clan in their time of need. That the Senatus allowed a Demon with unconfirmed backing and power to destabilize one of the Seven Clans!]","...!","Seer Amestris asked the Rhetorician directly.","And after a pause as another Tier 4 Entity was analyzed and cleared, the Rhetorician turned towards her and spoke coldly.","[Amestris.]","He didn't answer her question.","He only called out her name as this beautiful Tier 4 Entity gritted her teeth and warped right before the Rhetorician, feeling his hand land on her head as Records were scanned!","He looked down at her figure a moment after as he spoke coldly.","[The Senatus has already intervened on your behalf and did their duty. Seek to resolve this issue yourselves. Get on your knees and beg Noah Osmont or the Infernal Havenly Commerce he is connected to if you must. Your people began this conflict, your people will resolve it.]","...!","The eyes of Seer Amestris opened with incredulity as the Rhetorician continued.","[The Annihilation that Osmont seeks of the Avernus Clan is not death and destruction of all its Extremities- he wants to destabilize and break the identity of your Clan itself as some of your Extremities are already leaving the clan to assimilate the Blood Sources that are the cause of your chaos. For the overall picture, the Vitalis Domains will fairly have the same numbers of Vitalis Hyperversal Extremities protecting it, even if Osmont targets and kills a few more Avernus Extremities, those that do leave your Clan by assimilating Blood Sources will be more powerful than their prior selves as they will fill any gaps made. This..is the verdict of the Senatus of Extremity. The fate of the identity of the Avernus Clan lies in your own hands.]","WAA!","The words shocked many of the Entities here as their minds moved at extremely high speeds.","Was the capability that Osmont had displayed of the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage so obscene that it altered the mind of the Rhetorician so much? Or was there something else at play? The Infernal Havenly Commerce?","Many questions buzzed in their minds as by the time the majestic hand of the Rhetorician left Seer Amestris' head, her eyes scowled with clear anger as she talked back right in the face of this Entity without fear.","[The decision of the Senatus is to leave one of the Seven Clans to fend for itself? What use is it for us to be a part of the Senatus? And you all...]","Her gaze turned to the other Senatus Members who represented the other Seven Clans and Major Inheritances.","[What is to prevent Osmont from declaring war on any of your Clans and Inheritances and denying access to the Blood Sources for you all as well? What will the Senatus do for you then?]","...!","Her words were chilling as even before a second passed, Melchior of the Sima Clan sighed as he gazed up at the stellar chaos around them.","[The rest of us didn't start a War of Annihilation with him...]","Silence descended in the Chambers.","And a moment later...","[Dawn.]","The Rhetorician continued to call out the name of another Senatus Member as reality propelled itself forward.","The results of this meeting...were ones that nobody had expected going into it!","—","Time passed.","Seconds turned into minutes.","And with the mere passage of minutes, many changes and events took place as information was spread across the Seven Havens rapidly.","The new fronts of war in front of Extremity Bridges had their states determined, and what occurred in the pristine Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity became known by other members of the Seven Clans and prominent Inheritances.","From this event, the name of the Entity who was systematically destabilizing and destroying one of the Seven Clans spread.","Noah Osmont.","His identity was an enigma as the connections he held to the Supernal Havens were a mystery, and he held many distinctions as currently...the most pronounced one that was making its rounds was the one that the Speaker of the Senatus had called him!","A Demon of the Seven Havens.","Getting into a conflict with him meant facing Annihilation of your very Clan or Inheritance as even if the Senatus intervenes on your behalf, he would not stop his ways.","This was Osmont.","This rise of a new name and Entity that they had to be careful of, and yet from their intelligence and all the information they had recorded...this being had yet to even achieve Extremity!","As for the being in question himself...he remained in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as he prepared.","Before his eyes at this very moment, prompts continued to cascade.","[Your distinction as a Villain is rising quintessentially!]","[A Quintessential Extremity Loot has begun to be forged at the core of your Origin.]","[Your distinction as a Hero is rising greatly!]","The Seventeenth Boundary Layers of the Villain and Hero activated.","Noah gazed at the prompts serenely while feeling singularities blooming at the top of his Aletheian Havens.","He then placed the Hyperversal Bow of Helios in his hand down as he gazed in front of him where a Sporos IV of Extremity floated serenely.","It was a Sporos that now needed maturity after drinking the nutrition of over half of the 100 Tier 2 Avernus Extremities and over a thousand Vacuous Malignancies."]},{"number":2757,"title":"Chapter 2757: Chapter 2756 Fallout! I","paragraphs":["2756 Fallout! I","The Loot that stemmed from killing so many Vacuous Hyperversal Extremities and Tier 2 Avernus Extremities was abundant, and even more so once processed by RUINATION who was currently taking herself to the stage of an Armament of Extremity.","The Sporos IV of Extremity that was insurmountably hard to mature in subsequent stages couldn't help but mature quickly while fed with such premium loot as it truly was the equivalent of what made the core existence of hundreds of Entities that had attained Extremity.","And when this Spore matured into an Ash Tree of Gradation, his Eighth Aletheian Haven would be complete, and his Extremity Soul would undergo further elevation.","[The time nears...]","He spoke while staring at the dazzling seed going towards maturity as his mind gave out another command, the Hyperversal Bow of Helios falling from his hand as a domain of crimson gold Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority spread out from it.","He was about to undertake something of utter importance that would require a great deal of his attention and Will- something that should play a critical piece if he truly sought Extremity during the stage of Death and Rebirth!","His command was a simple one.","Tendrils of authority began to gather around him as...the Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art was activated!","When he used it to make a Low Grade Ruin Planalith Krystallos, Xiaomi had utilized it to propel herself to Extremity.","So when Noah activated this Refinement Art right now, his target was a single one.","[Quintessence.]","HUUM!","He wanted to forge a Quintessence Planalith Krystallos.","This was yet another achievement he wanted to add to his roster as this, paired with his 9 Aletheian Havens about to be completed, and surviving the point of Death and Rebirth against Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity...he knew that such achievements and accumulation would be enough to fully propel Quintessence to Extremity!","The forging of all 9 Aletheian Havens alone was a Quintessential Achievement that would pave the way there, but Noah innately felt like there should be more. That he should do more.","He couldn't quite express why he felt like this, but a vast majority of his soul was telling him to collect as many achievements as he could before Quintessence was propelled to Extremity!","And so...a singularity was born before his eyes as his Meridians buzzed.","Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities seethed along with his Extremity Soul Values and Mana Values as radiant, gorgeous, and pristine multicolored waves of radiance began to gather.","They were none other than Quintessence.","[The Refinement of an Authority that has never before achieved Extremity is being attempted!]","[The success and failure of such a Refinement is unknown as there has never been a Recorded History of it.]","[If successful, you will earn the distinction of a Hyperversal Refinement Pioneer!]","A glorious Refinement began as Noah prepared.","At the same time, his eyes breezed over the dazzling details of the next Boundaries to be elevated towards the 17th Layer as their means were astonishing!","—","Within the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","In an enclosed domain surrounded by Hyperversal Extremity Authority, the figures of the core members of the Avernus Clan were contained within.","Currently, the visage of Seer Amestris stood beside the illusory image of the Avernus Extremity Overlord with a grim expression- the reality that had occurred in the Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity being extremely clear to them right now as they seemed to be searching for the path forward!","Away from their figures in this enclosed domain, the scattered Tier 3 and Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities who had their Records cleaved by Seer Amestris to save them from Noah's Virions could also be seen, along with the figure of a woman surrounded by tendrils of blue light.","A woman who rose up and came to float before Seer Amestris and the illusory figure of the Avernus Extremity Overlord with sheer incredulity and a sense of madness on her face.","[Haha...you went to grovel before the Senatus of Extremity and Osmont, and the result was the Avernus Clan becoming alienated from even the Senatus as Osmont gave you the middle finger in front of everyone's eyes. How fucking funny is that?]","Her eyes pulsed with cerulean Lunacy.","Madness leaked from every corner of her being as hearing her tone, the authority from Seer Amestris leaked out powerfully as her figure appeared before Extremity Blue, her palm striking out to slap!","And yet...","HUUM!","Another authority opposed her as Extremity Blue stopped the slap from reaching her gorgeous yet crazy face by grasping onto Seer Amestris' hand.","[You see...I've given my soul time to be refined and elevated as I've fully stepped on the Fourth Gradation of Extremity.]","...!","Her visage pulsed with power as a myriad of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures swirled around her.","[I've walked less than you on the Gradations of Extremity, but we're at least on the same step now, O Great Seer of our Clan.]","With a glimmer, the outstretched hand of Seer Amestris buzzed and was released as she stared at Extremity Blue coldly.","And Extremity Blue wasn't done as a dazzling blue light of Lunacy fully began to brim around her existence.","[Our great Clan. The Avernus Clan was a name that demanded respect and reverence not all that long ago, where even when we destroyed an Inheritance and took an Armament of Extremity, nobody dared to even look at us. Yet look at us now...]","She pointed to the side where Tier 2 and 3 Extremities who were previously affected by the Pathogenic Authority of Osmont now lay with many of their Records cut out and their power in tatters.","[...our Extremities are demoralized, and even more of them are renouncing our Clan one by one for the sake of greater power. And all of this shit happened in a matter of days, can you fucking believe that? And the worst of it all, you choose to take it lying down!]","...!"]},{"number":2758,"title":"Chapter 2758: Chapter 2757 Fallout! II","paragraphs":["2757 Fallout! II","[You...]","Her gaze moved from Seer Amestris and onto the illusory figure of the Avernus Extremity Overlord.","Her eyes crazed with Lunacy seemed to hold immense disappointment as she continued.","[You are not the same man I chose to follow all those years ago. You took the Inheritance of a great Primogenitor and built the Avernus Clan into what it is today...where is that great man? Since when did you become so passive? So meek? You delegate everything to the Great Seer Amestris as look at where we are now. You should have been there confronting Osmont in the Chambers of the Senatus of Extremity! You should have taken the lead to eradicate him days ago! You...are the biggest fucking disappointment.]","BOOM!","Stemming from Lunacy, utterly disastrous words were uttered as profound anger blared from Seer Amestris' eyes while the visage of the Avernus Extremity Overlord turned to stare at Lunacy coldly!","[And look at that, only fucking glaring at me. The old you would have erupted with authority and beaten me down...how the times have changed. The Avernus Clan that I knew and followed was not this. Bowing down before our enemy? Diplomacy? Fucking laughable. Good look to however you all choose to face Osmont as from now on...I will move on my own.]","WAA!","A dazzling blue light erupted and covered her glorious figure as space began to warp and twist around her.","[I will let Lunacy guide me...and I will either grasp Osmont's Records in my hands, or I will lie dead before his feet. But at least...I will go down fighting.]","A flash of blue.","A glimmer of light.","And Extremity Blue was gone from this domain, leaving the illusory figure of the Avernus Extremity Overlord and the enraged Seer Amestris.","The Seer who had purple flames burning around her as she stared at the Avernus Extremity Overlord and asked coldly.","[What now?]","The illusory figure of the Avernus Extremity Overlord flashed as his figure gazed towards a certain direction, seeing something no other being could see as his eyes pulsed with mystery and power!","Light years away from the obscured domain they were in, still in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution.","Atop a brilliant Golden floating landmass radiating a light of Dreams, a bustling market that had the Infernal Havenly Commerce at its very center could be seen.","The frenzy of trading for the Blood Sources was greater than ever as the more time passed, the more the capabilities and power of the Lineage it granted became known as there was always a profession of beings coming and going from multiple locations of the Infernal Havenly Commerce across the Supernal Haven of Dissolution!","In this branch of the Infernal Havenly Commerce, an aged Noah with white gold strands of hair and a straw hat continued to make the trades as he sat on a simple throne, a crystalline gold table in front of him holding rows and rows of Blood Sources shining in the radiance of dreams all around as he made yet another sale.","But right about when everything was going to proceed as per normal...","HUUM!","The eyes of all Entities on this dreamy floating landmass had to rise up.","Even Noah squinted his gaze as from the skies, the authority of a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity reigned down.","From a vessel that looked like a flattened Singularity, a procession of Extremities led by an Entity at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity floated out.","They were adorned in blue and purple robes that depicted endless galaxies and singularity as on their backs, an ecriture pulsing with power read [Overseers]!","Such Entities descended as the one leading them was a man looking to be in middle-aged, his body robust and built as he also held a fan in his hand that made him look like a scholar.","The throngs of Entities at the level of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms or Tier 1 and 2 Hyperversal Extremity made from a myriad of Inheritances or Clans made way for them as they came to stand before Noah's simple throne and crystalline table.","Noah's gaze was calm at the appearance of this Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity and dozens of other Extremities behind him as he squinted his eyes, and the Entity at the forefront began to speak calmly while nodding his head towards Noah with recognition!","[The Singularity Overseers seek an audience with the Infernal Havenly Commerce to mediate with the True Emperor of Quintessence. We are prepared to pay a price to clear all misunderstandings and conflicts due to the matters of the past.]","...!","A procession of the Singularity Overseers Aeonic Inheritance!","The man before everyone's astonished eyes was the Singularity Overseers Overlord- his Extremity Clone actually coming in person this time as he sought to wipe out the conflict he had with the True Emperor of Quintessence that rose from the War of Annihilation their forces participated in!","They had seen what occurred with the Avernus Clan.","The True Emperor of Quintessence hadn't pointed his blade towards them as before this occurred, they actually came forward themselves to rectify the conflict before it could greatly escalate.","In the form of an old man, Noah smiled with a wizened gaze as he replied.","[You had a conflict with the Little Emperor of our Infernal Havenly Commerce?]","WAA!","The words uttered by him caused the eyes of all watching Extremities to shine with brilliance.","This whole time, there were only strong speculations that Noah Osmont belonged in some way to the Infernal Havenly Commerce, but they never received a confirmation of his position or to what extent!","But these words confirmed everything as after they were uttered, the Singularity Overseers Overlord nodded while waving his hands, two Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities behind him moving forward while pulling another Tier 3 Entity wrapped by chains swirling with Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, his face filled with maddening rage as he was actually dragged like a prisoner before everyone's eyes.","He!","It was the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring who was actually in chains!","[The one responsible for participating and promoting our forces into the Apex War of Annihilation was this being here. The Tier 2 and 1 Hyperversal Extremities involved in the attack after the war have been executed. All the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who participated in that war had their Origins shattered, and they will not recuperate for at least a hundred years. Their actions were spared somewhat since they were only following orders. With this, we hope to bury and leave behind any conflict between our two sides.]","...!","Extremities executed! Apex Aeonic Lifeforms had their Origins shattered!","The moves of the Singularity Overseers were decisive as after all this, they brought forward Devouring who participated in the conflict for the sake of obtaining Xiaomi and her Innate Pellucid Foundation.","Noah stared at this being in his veiled identity as even after all of this, he asked dubiously with raised brows.","[That's it?]","Words that caused the Singularity Overseers Overlord to pause momentarily, his purple eyes glowing with the light of innumerable stars as they flashed before he waved his hands- his mere motion causing space to fluctuate two blinding lights bloomed to his left and right.","The lights astonished those in the surroundings and caused them to move back as the voice of the Singularity Overseers Overlord emanated out.","[To fully clear the whole conflict, we are also prepared to pay the tribute of two Low Grade Armaments of Extremity.]","...!"]},{"number":2759,"title":"Chapter 2759: Chapter 2758 Fallout! III","paragraphs":["2758 Fallout! III","The Singularity Overseers Overlord looked like a refined scholar from ancient times as he pushed the two Low Grade Armaments of Extremity forward.","It was a move that astonished the watching gazes in the surroundings as in addition to executing all those involved and even putting up the renowned Extremity of Devouring in shackles that pulsed with vibrant Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures which suppressed his very concepts and Extremity Soul, even Armaments of Extremity were offered!","Noah's eyes were sharp as he stared at the two blinding lights before him closely.","One was a full body armor that shone with a deep blue light, his eyes quickly pulling up its identity as it was termed [Singularity's Carapace], its hard exterior swirling with Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Oceanus.","The other...was uniquely a weapon that Noah could only liken to a baseball bat, its name ridiculously being [Extremity Splitter]!","It shone with an obsidian hue as the bat seemed to be forged of an unknown crystalline material that pulsed with Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Penumbra.","Two uniquely powerful Low Grade Armaments of Extremity presented themselves before his eyes as Noah beckoned towards them while nodding his head, streams of his Extremity Soul wrapping around the two weapons as they passed behind his simple throne and disappeared!","They began traversing across endless records to reach into the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as after this, Noah's gaze in the form of an old man smiled while speaking serenely towards the Singularity Overseers Overlord.","[Consider the debt between our Little Emperor and your Inheritance paid. Furthermore...]","SHAA!","With a wave of his hands, the space before them glimmered as hundreds of millions of Blood Sources began to appear, Noah hiding his devilish smile as they all went towards the Singularity Overseers before him.","[Since there is no more conflict, let us all enjoy the treasures lying before us.]","With a wave of his hands, the Blood Sources proliferated as a shocking event took place in this Archipelago of the Infernal Havenly Commerce!","Need would soon begin to spread on what had just occurred here as the identity of Noah Osmont and his connection with the Infernal Havenly Commerce was confirmed, as well as the fact that currently...this Commerce had collected Four Armaments of Extremity publicly.","Their power...was not to be underestimated!","—","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Noah was in the process of refining a Quintessence Planalith Krystallos as the very reality was twisting and distorting before his eyes, his own body radiating most of the Authority of Quintessence that went into this Planalith Krystallos as it took every ounce of his soul to ensure that it's Refinement remained stable!","But...he could still spread out his will and gaze up to see the space above him split as after crossing a myriad of Recorded Histories, two dazzling Armaments of Extremity descended.","They pulled with glorious power as Noah's Eyes of Extremity flashed with brilliance, their details unfolding before him!","[Singularity's Carapace]:: A Low Grade Armament of Extremity born in the constant cycles of sprouting Singularities coming in contact with the core of a budding Minor Haven with Oceanus. The core was ultimately forged into this Carapace after millions of cycles as its hardness is extremely difficult to penetrate. Among Low Grade Armaments of Extremity, an Armor always stands on top due to its Innate protective nature even before the activation of its more basic or advanced features. When adorned, this Armament can show its glorious exterior as is, or it can be transformed to look like anything you wish. It covers your body and Records while protecting you innately with 81 Defense Extremity Rune Scriptures of Oceanus, and after actively feeding 1,000 Extremity Soul Values and 1,000,000 Extremity Mana Values into it, an Aura of Oceanus is adorned around you that layers another 81 Defense Extremity Rune Scriptures of Oceanus. Its more advanced features include [Bastion of Oceanus], [Impenetrable], and [Sacrifice]...","[Extremity Splitter]:: A Low Grade Armament of Extremity that was formed by the Extremity of Steel after he was inebriated by the Extremity Wine made from 9 Hyperversal Gradation Fruits of Extremity. A chaotic and explosive form of the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Penumbra lies at its very core as an existence with Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures is most ideal in the usage of this weapon as an Extremity. Its base attack only activates fully when aimed at the heads of one's enemies, utilizing 1,000 Extremity Soul Values and 1,000,000 Extremity Mana Values to release a concentrated burst of force into a single target that has an output of 81 Chaotic Attack Extremity Rune Scriptures of Penumbra, each one being equivalent to three Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures. Advanced usage of this Armament of Extremity includes features that greatly increase the focused single target damage output at the cost of much greater reserves of Extremity Soul Values, these features including [Smackdown], [Pulverizer], and [Reality Smasher]...","...!","The details of the two weapons were unique in their own ways as the Extremity Splitter in particular...this bat seemed extremely devious!","Even more so was the blacksmith that had designed this weapon- the name of Extremity Steel rising up once again as this time, the stellar concept of Hyperversal Gradation Fruits of Extremity rose.","Such Fruits were rare information from Noah's memories, only being records of rumors from the memories of Entities he killed as they were things that other Extremities couldn't even fathom getting their hands on.","And yet Extremity Steel became inebriated from the wine made from 9 Hyperversal Gradation Fruits of Extremity and forged this Low Grade Armament of Extremity as a consequence!","Where was this being now? What about all the other disastrously strong Primogenitors mentioned across the eons of time and space?","Even with these questions buzzing, Noah couldn't stop looking at the [Extremity Splitter] and the many shocking ways it could be used.","This was especially so if it was paired up with Noah.","His enemies up to the Fourth Gradation of Extremity couldn't even perceive him unless he wanted them to.","If he appeared behind them while swinging this obsidian bat on their heads that would decimate them with an indeterminate number of Rune Scriptures...","ah!","Thinking of it alone made Noah look forward to it!"]},{"number":2760,"title":"Chapter 2760: Chapter 2759 Fallout! IV","paragraphs":["2759 Fallout! IV","Reality had progressed in such a way that with the advent of the Infernal Havenly Commerce and the mere idea of trading his Blood Sources...had now brought Noah multiple Armaments of Extremity that the most powerful Clans sought.","The Sima Clan. The Havenly Moon Clan. The Avernus Clan. The Orientis Clan. The Ouroboros Clan. The Prometheus Clan. The Caecilli Clan.","Out of these Seven Clans that waded across the Seven Havens, Noah was systematically destroying one of them, and his fingers were reaching deep into the hearts of the other Clans through his Blood Sources.","Over the next few days, he expected more and more of them to join his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage as at this very moment, he continued to receive pure streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that would only propel his next Awakening to be ever closer!","The future Noah envisioned was a grand one as multiple pieces would come together to create an utterly beautiful whole.","He moved steadily, but not slowly as one achievement after another continued to unfold.","HUUM!","And this remained to be true as while two Low Grade Armaments of Extremity descended, a certain seed radiated a refulgence of light and began to bloom.","The Sporos IV of Extremity began to bloom into a grand Ash Tree IV of Gradation.","[The Quintessential Hyperversal Sporos IV of Extremity has sprouted into the Quintessential Hyperversal Ash Tree IV of Gradation!]","[A tremendous level of source essence went into manifesting such a construct as it is an achievement worthy of distinction.]","An eruption of authorities ensued.","And Noah remained steady as from the things occurring around him, even more streams of multicolored Quintessence flowed into the Planalith Krystallos in front of him- a massive illusory multicolored tree beginning to sprout across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","Noah's will gazed at this unfolding illusory tree calmly as after its authority was assimilated into him, he would fully finish forging his Eighth Aletheian Haven and start the Ninth and final one.","After that...there was only a single step that had to be taken!","—","HOONG!","Space was twisted and distorted all around his Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable- his clone that had stepped on the Havenly Spatial Formation that pulsed with intricate runic markings of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of [FORMATIONS].","His body crossed great distances from the Supernal Haven of Dissolution as among the Entities from the Nether Havens, Noah became one of the first to move from the Supernal Haven of Dissolution and into another Supernal Haven.","The destination this time was the Supernal Haven of Helios as here, the Havenly Hyperversal Gauntlet of Gradation was located- a unique but dangerous treasure domain that was born under the warping of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority and the nearby spacetime continuum!","Entities and Treasures from Recorded Histories appeared within this Gauntlet as due to an unfathomable nature, it was filled with great peril as only the most profound geniuses in the Second or Third Gradation of Extremity entered this Gauntlet to seek opportunities to traverse even faster across the Gradations of Extremity.","It was basically a way to accelerate their growth to not be in the thousands of years- at the expense of possibly losing their lives and Records within the Gauntlet.","Never in history...had an Entity who had yet to even achieve Extremity enter.","But...there were always firsts for everything.","WAP!","With one final distortion of space, Noah's visage felt a blazing crimson gold radiance unfold as he found himself in the center of another Formation, the auras of multiple Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities locking onto him right away as he gazed around the stellar scene before him.","The Formation he stood on seemed to be in the center of a burning sun as tendrils of molten heat of Helios circled all around, and an overabundance of stellar golden suns could be seen all around him in the far distance- and they were anchored in space as if they were domains to live in!","And they were truly just that as trillions of auras of Lifeforms could be felt all around them, with a single massive semicircular sun in the far distance acting like a golden floating Archipelago that pulsed with a crimson radiance.","A Crimson Havenly Archipelago in a heavily protected location within the Supernal Haven of Helios!","The Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities around Noah had humanoid forms, but their skins were painted with a bronze golden hue as on their forehead, two white wings fluttered serenely on each side.","They were adorned in white robes wrapped around their muscular bodies, the style similar to what Noah had seen in Recorded History of the Greek Humanoids and the Chitons they used to wear.","9 of such Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities locked onto Noah with scrutiny as before any communication could occur...","WAP!","Space fluctuated above them as a shockingly powerful aura descended.","Noah's eyes rose to observe an unrealistically beautiful and blessed figure of a woman with pristinely dark hair, her blessed visage adorned in a crimson gold robe-like chiton as her wide eyes held dual golden pupils that were radiating the light of genuine suns.","Her pupils...were genuine suns!","Her forehead held a pair of dazzling Golden wings that moved with utmost glory, her nose sharp as her lips radiated a crimson light.","A fiery heat swirled around her as the authority she gave off far exceeded Tier 3 or 4, her wide eyes becoming sharp as she motioned her hand into a fist while gazing at Noah, and both of their figures combusted into a flurry of golden flames as they disappeared!","[...]","The guarding Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities of the Celestia lineage breathed out again as if their whole existence was being suppressed before, one of the mighty muscular men turning to the other and speaking out in a hushed tone.","[Who is that? Why did the Ancestor come out to receive him personally?]","[...]","A heavy question.","And it was one that they would not have the answer to for some time!","For Noah, space warped and twisted once more as by the time he blinked, he was in an entirely different location.","Around him, crimson gold waves of Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Helios flowed in liquid form as if they were gorgeous rivers, the earth below him taking on the same form as he seemed to be surrounded by tendrils of Helios.","Directly in front of him, the dazzling entity adorned in a crimson gold chiton vibrated power at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity as she spoke with sharp eyes.","[The Little Dinosaur says you present an opportunity to hunt down Vacuous Malignancies at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity?]","...!","She got straight to the point as at such words, Noah could only smile brilliantly!"]},{"number":2761,"title":"Chapter 2761: Chapter 2760 Honorarium! I","paragraphs":["2760 Honorarium! I","A pair of golden wings fluttered on her forehead as her golden skin glowed with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, this entity of the Celestia Extremity Lineage gazing at Noah closely as her fist unfurled at this moment.","And with a single opening of her fist...","SHAA!","An array of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures erupted out like fluttering birds as they formed a circular domain of crimson gold light around them.","Each Rune Scriptures read dominantly- [VEIL]!","[With this, nothing should leak out even into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. Let's see...]","Her golden dual pupils shone as she stared closely at Noah, tendrils of Helios flowing around her crimson gold robe hiding her blessed visage as her unrealistically beautiful face showed a surprised expression.","[Noah Osmont...even finding your mere name while you're right before me took more effort and longer than when gazing at an Entity at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity. What veiling treasure do you obtain? Or is it innately a quality of yours?]","...!","Noah's uniqueness was shown based on her words, as well as his scope of authority and weakness as Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity could still attain Records of his name among other things!","He nodded lightly while his own eyes gazed at this being before him, the 17th Boundary Layer of the Protagonist putting in most of the work as he perused his current unfolding Recorded History to gaze at the identity of this being.","[Something like that...Extremity Solarium, is it?]","WAA!","The utterance of her identity caused her dual pupils to flash as she snapped her fingers, two thrones made of pulsing Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Helios forming behind each of them as she sat down naturally while crossing her legs, her expression thoughtful as she looked at Noah.","[The Little Dinosaur shouldn't have told you my identity, and he was sure that you were someone that hasn't even attained Extremity yet. And this...","seems to be true, and yet not at the same time.]","Her dual pupils were filled with thoughts as a moment later, they lit up with a trace of surprise as they looked at Noah closely once more!","[You...did you Scale the Unscalable Wall? Did you grasp Extremity in an Aspect of your existence before actually grasping Extremity of a concept?]","...!","The intuition of Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity was utterly deadly as the longer Noah spent in her presence, the more clues she was picking up about him as he waved his hands dismissively.","[It's nothing much. But we are here to discuss the possibility of ambushing and erasing the records of Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity, yes?]","He diverted the topic from himself and towards the matter that should occupy even greater interest currently.","And the Esteemed Havenly Empress before him nodded as she motioned for Noah to sit on the throne made of Helios behind him.","[So? What exactly are the details?]","With an air of majesty, Noah sat down while beginning to speak slowly.","[Within the next day, three Tier 5 Vacuous Entities will appear within the Nether Haven of Helios for a brief few seconds. I know when and where they will appear as I was looking to see if there were any Tier 5 Vitalis Entities who would be up to ambush these Infernal Emperors.]","...!","Noah spoke casually in a manner as if one was talking about the most inconsequential thing ever, but the gaze of Extremity Solarium only became extremely inquisitive at his words as she silently pondered before she replied.","[For the three of them to take the risk of appearing within the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains knowing they would be sensed quickly, they must plan to be here briefly before making their exit. Meaning they're here for something, or someone....is it you?]","Her dual pupils shone with a profound radiance as she seemed to arrive to conclusions naturally with the little information she held.","Noah naturally smiled at her question while shrugging his shoulders.","[Who knows. Maybe, maybe not. I just probed to see whether ambushing them was something feasible.]","[...]","Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Helios flowed like beautiful rivers between them as Noah naturally discussed with an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity as if it were no big deal.","Instead of replying to him regarding his question, Extremity Solarium gazed at him calmly and intently for a few seconds before she instead asked a question.","[What do you know about Honorariums?]","Her question was a probing one as when Noah raised his brows, she continued.","[Achievements, Feats. Astonishing accomplishments etched across eons. Achieving Extremity in a ridiculously short period of time, jumping across Gradations to kill higher Entities. Forging Armaments of Extremity, Refining Planalith Krystallos...grand Honorariums that are recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as those with a great enough distinction even grant a material reward.]","Extremity Solarium waved her right hand as multiple illusory screens depicting some of the things she mentioned played out, Noah looking at them intently while nodding.","[I know a thing or two about Honorariums.]","He knew!","After all, he had been stacking them one after another in the past days as he made his way towards Extremity!","The dual pupils of Extremity Solarium pulsed at his words as she continued.","[You may grasp something about them, but not the extent of what they truly stand for. Think of Honorarium as a form of Dignity, Glory, or Eminence. It is not something that can be easily seen around someone, but it is critical to a being and who they are. Those with a high enough glory have a profound destiny as traversing the Gradations of Extremity is easier for them, opportunities present themselves with more ease, and dangers are reduced or alerted to them before they arrive. The greater the glory or dignity...the grander the levels of Honorariums one has stacked, the more distinguished they are. Destroying an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity is impossibly hard as a being like this has accumulated a great number of Honorariums, but such a thing...would also award a tremendous level of Honorarium!]","...!"]},{"number":2762,"title":"Chapter 2762: Chapter 2761 Honorarium! II","paragraphs":["2761 Honorarium! II","Honorarium!","It was a type of dignity that transformed one's existence in imperceptible ways as their achievements actually affected the flow of Reality around them.","As she spoke about this, the Esteemed Havenly Empress before Noah's eyes reclined on her crimson gold throne of Helios as the golden wings on her forehead fluttered, her eyes gazing up above serenely.","[There are Primogenitors who have accumulated so many Honorariums that the moment they make a move, the whole reality unfolds in such a way as if they were at the very center of everything, and everybody else was just playing a minor part in their Records.]","...!","As he heard this, Noah raised his brows. It seemed that people with a great deal of achievements were actually trying to make themselves the centers of attention- possible main characters of the unfolding reality as those around them with lesser accomplishments would only serve as their extras!","It felt...like others were intruding on his playing field.","But he knew that before he appeared, in the eons of History that passed, there were of course Emperors and Entities who defined their Eras. Beings that shone brightly and held power to shift the very working reality of these Havens.","But now that he was here...","'You can all take a backseat...'","...!","His thoughts alone raged with tyranny as he looked expectantly into the future!","Extremity Solarium then refocused her gaze onto Noah as she continued.","[I see no falsehood in your words, even with the fact that you knowing something like this raises a lot of questions. A major one is what my Extremity Clone has been figuring out by going into the Supernal Haven of Dissolution and glancing at the newly enacted Records there. The Underdwellers are abuzz about you. Noah Osmont...let me ask you about something that has yet to reach my attention, but would have been brought to me soon enough. This Infernal Havenly Commerce...what do you plan to do with it?]","WAA!","A probing question that Noah expected down the line has brought itself much earlier as finally, a key figure in the Supernal Havens of Extremity locked onto his Infernal Havenly Commerce!","The Blood Sources sold from his Infernal Havenly Commerce were already transforming the Underdwellers from the Nether Havens as of course, the Havenly Extremity Lineages had gathered information about this and kept an eye on the Archipelagos he set up within Dissolution.","[The Records of the buzzing Underdwellers seem to think you are merely connected to the Infernal Havenly Commerce, but from what I'm gathering, you should be at its very core. So, you can obtain knowledge of the movements of Vacuous Entities of the Fifth Gradation of Extremity in advance, with you being critical enough or having something that would force them to make a move, and you have a Vitalis Lineage contesting with even the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages of these Supernal Havens. Everything about you points to an Entity that should be supported by pillars of Honorariums...you would greatly benefit from following the path of your predecessors and others like you by joining factions of Primogenitors.]","...!","Her dual pupils radiated waves of beauty and grace as she continued!","[Behind every one of the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages are Primogenitors. Even the prominent Lineages of the Nether Havens have their own Primogenitors among them. Join their cause and be under their light. Their Honorariums will mask yours. Enemies will not be able to easily discover your Records nor be able to plan to do whatever they're planning to do to you in the next day. Under the banner of honorariums and records of Primogenitors, you will have the time to cultivate your power until you rise to a sufficient level in the Gradations of Extremity where you can finally move alone, unhindered.]","Her words were like claps of thunder filled with simmering calmness as she proposed a pathway for Noah!","And yet the moment he heard it...he shook his head with a smile while denying such a path vehemently.","[I do not plan to bask under anyone's light. Such a thing would seek the budding Quintessence and Tyranny within me entirely!]","Tendrils of multi-colored light erupted around the crimson gold throne of Helios he sat on as he said such words.","And he continued.","[Even now, I move alone, unhindered. Many forces have tried to topple me before, and yet they were ground down to become ink that filled the pages of history. Their legends and honorariums faded into nothingness as in this unfolding eon, history will only repeat itself.]","...!","Quintessence freely blazed around him as he spoke.","The Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity gazed at him calmly, her dual pupils flashing with light as she ultimately sighed in the end and shook her head.","[Another crazy guy chasing dead paths. Even if you manage to overcome that wall, do you know how difficult a path you have ahead of you? Ah....no matter. If Infernal Emperors are entering the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains for something you possess or you yourself, then of course we shall partake in an opportunity to derail them. Of course, you won't be left empty handed as depending on the results, you can take 25% of the gains obtained from this opportunity.]","Her eyes flickered as she instantly got down to business.","25% of the gain.","Noah himself wouldn't be doing anything but provide the information, but he would attain 25% of the gains that may stem from this ambush!","He nodded lightly at such words as Extremity Solarium took his affirmation and continued.","[I will include two or three others to share in this opportunity right before it occurs- this leaves less of a chance of the Infernal Emperors being warned or alarmed of this ambush. Once something is Recorded and pondered about, it is easy for others to grasp it. But apart from this...you're supposed to be stepping into the Havenly Hyperversal Gauntlet of Gradation. I recommend you do this after you've grasped at least a single concept to Extremity and can freely utilize your own Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures. Apart from your clone dying within the Gauntlet, there is even a threat of complete eradication of your Records if you aren't careful enough. You will only truly benefit if you have already embarked on the Gradations of Extremity.]","Her calm words were inviolable as she leaned forward from her crimson gold throne, her eyes sharp as she spoke once more.","[Now, just how many more details can you give me about this? When and exactly where? And if you somehow have a grasp of anything to do with their identities, this will go much smoother...]","...!"]},{"number":2763,"title":"Chapter 2763: Chapter 2762 Cultivation! I","paragraphs":["2762 Cultivation! I","Unfathomable.","As Solarium watched the man before her release few but intricate details, this was the only word she could think of!","But of course, she didn't allow this to show on her face.","She was supposed to be an Ancestor of stupendous power and might- someone at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity.","When she faced Entities of the Fourth Gradation or below, they couldn't even fully raise their heads towards her!","This was all due to her glory.","Her accomplishments.","Her Honorariums!","It was to the extent that the achievements she held were much grander than any of her peers, and this formless power that existences couldn't perceive or see...it made it hard for those who didn't even come close to her achievements to even talk to her.","When she spoke towards Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities and below, most would be compelled to take her words as if they were commands- she didn't even have to utilize any of her Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","Such a level of power bordered on natural hypnotism as if she said a simple command to a Tier 1 or 2 Hyperversal Extremity, they would find themselves moving to accomplish this command before their soul even understood what was happening!","That was how powerful she was.","And then, this entity came before her.","His body was robust as it pulsed with waves of multicolored light, his face carrying a devilish charm as he...had not even grasped Extremity of any concept.","When Solarium realized this, she reigned in her shock to keep her stature in check as this being treated it like it was nothing!","But even this wasn't the crucial point.","It was the fact that since the very beginning...he looked straight at her.","His eyes observed her body freely, from the crimson gold robe she wore to her dazzling dual sun pupils.","He then talked to her...casually.","As if he was talking to just any other being. And it was more than this as within his gaze and eyes, Solarium could pick up a hint of surety of confidence from him that when he faced her- he didn't have an ounce of fear!","He could freely interrupt her pace of the conversation and even steer it to whatever he wanted to talk about.","She had realized an utterly horrific fact at that point.","This Entity before her...his mere existence did not care for the Honorariums that she- an Esteemed Havenly Empress at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity, had gathered!","It meant that this being before her had such a high level of glory and dignity- that he had collected enough Honorariums even before he had achieved Extremity in a Concept as he had surpassed her.","'...'","Such a reality was surreal.","She suspected that a large part of it had to do with him likely scaling the Unscalable Wall.","She had heard Records of others reaching this Wall. But none had scaled it as far as she knew. They all attained Extremity in a concept soon after as their Souls naturally entered the Gradations of Extremity.","So when she theorized this about the Entity before her, she wanted to ask and understand!","And yet...he dismissed it as if it were nothing and diverted her to other topics entirely.","She was flabbergasted by such a being, but her standing did not allow her to show such emotions as when facing this entity, she at the very least kept her regality!","But she knew.","The Vacuous Malignancies targeting him had grasped something about him that even they, at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity, seemed dangerous.","It meant that this being had to be protected as he would grow to be a terrifying force of the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains. And yet when she offered for him to join the banner of a Primogenitor and be based by their glory...he denied it right away.","He held that much confidence.","Solarium continued to gaze at him with a calm demeanor as he talked while he was situated on a throne she conjured as if it were the most natural thing, but her thoughts were abuzz trying to dig up any more information about this being from the little records of him she grasped.","An even more drastic task for her was understanding the Infernal Havenly Commerce connected to this being fully...and just how distinct the Lineage it was spreading out way in comparison the the Lineage she held- or the other three Extremity Lineages!","In the background, her Extremity Clone moved with haste as it collected information...","—","[Glory...]","Noah's main body uttered out this word as the branches of a multicolored Ash Tree IV of Gradation drooped onto his body like endless rivers from all directions, his body buzzing with authority as his soul was being refined while his Eighth Aletheian Haven was going towards completion- the light of Elera painting it gloriously as everything within his Origin came to life.","His Reality Passages swirled with interminable might as they seemed to be getting empowered ever so slowly, and in the midst of all of this, Noah thought about his conversation with Extremity Solarium.","He thought of the Honorariums he had amassed already, as well as those that would come from the dead paths he was opening up in abundance!","The more he saw them, the more he affirmed they were paths no other beings could walk on.","And nothing expressed this more than the other prominent concepts expanded by the Protagonist towards Extremity.","His eyes flashed as he glimpsed the details of one such concept.","[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of Plagiarism]:: Plagiarism comes in many forms, with the best plagiarists capable of taking someone else's work and passing it off entirely as their own- going even further to surpass the original. This Boundary Layer sees the countless concepts out there as it seeks to make them yours. At its current stage, you can plagiarize a Concept of Extremity that has reached the 17th Boundary Layer from a selected target visible to you, their concept that becoming etched into your Records as if it were yours to begin with, and that reality has always been this way. The target will have the selected concept entirely erased from their Records as truly, it was all yours to begin with- you never even plagiarized. When taken to Extremity, the Boundary of Plagiarism will allow you to plagiarize up to 81 Concepts of Extremity of targets with similar or lesser Soul Values, and the possibilities to plagiarize Items or even the very Records of Entities themselves become possible....","[...]","Yes.","The Boundaries expanded by the Protagonist continued to deliver the most shock!"]},{"number":2764,"title":"Chapter 2764: Chapter 2763 Cultivation! II","paragraphs":["2763 Cultivation! II","When a boundary like Plagiarism existed, of course Noah's Honorariums were bound to descend in large numbers!","And this was just one of many.","He had yet to utilize MacGuffin as Hero and Villain were actively working along with the Protagonist, and then, there were more.","[[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of Cultivation]:: What is cultivation? It is a process of development and improvement of nothing else other than oneself. Entities who have yet to awaken cultivate their body and money for less than a century before they die, and Entities who have grasped onto Mana and other forms of Authorities embark on a path to cultivate their Aspects of Existence before they perish. The major obstacles on the path of improvement and development of oneself are barriers and bottlenecks that one has to fight to overcome before one can enter a new stage of life. This Boundary Layer seeks to abolish the obstacles on the path of your cultivation as no matter what concept or authority you are cultivating, an absolute limitation does not exist does not exist for it. Once you reach a sufficient level in a concept or authority, it will naturally elevate to another level....]","[...An example is your Extremity Soul. You managed to overcome its absolute bottleneck and achieve the next level, and with the 17th Boundary Layer of Cultivation, you can now absorb any treasure capable of elevating the soul apart from the Ash Tree of Gradation to continue elevating the strength of your Soul. Of course, the treasure has to be sufficient enough to refine your current soul. Your Extremity Soul has permeated across your other Aspects of Existence and taken them a step forward, but you haven't officially attained Extremity of your Body and Origin- with your Soul only assimilating into them and reinforcing them with a shred of Extremity. Their bottlenecks no longer exist as the demarcation and ideology that you can only attain Extremity in the Origin and Body after you take a Boundary to Extremity is abolished. This Boundary of Cultivation will also be applicable to your Items, Authorities, or even forms of Awakenings you are undergoing. Currently, it also allows you to enter a state of epiphany termed [Quintessential Unity of Existence] nine times for an indeterminate amount of time, with such a state allowing you to experience a profound state of resonance with Recorded and Unrecorded Histories that allows you to easily elevate lesser concepts to Extremity, establish Dynamis of Extremity with utmost ease, guarantee success in Farming, Forging and Refinements, or comprehend things you had no knowledge of before. In this state, the rate of progress of your Cultivation is also elevated to a Quintessential level across all fields. If it ever achieves Extremity, this Boundary will allow you to abolish any limitations of cultivation imposed on yourself, concepts, Dynamis, and many more things as the possibilities are endless...]","[...]","Yes.","Another tool expanded by the Protagonist.","And it was truly a heavy one.","Noah had begun refining the Quintessence Planalith Krystallos with confidence due to this Boundary Layer, and the other possibilities that came with it were utterly disastrous!","His eyes flickered as he gazed at the massive illusory tree that seemed to be anchored into the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as he thought about the Boundary of Cultivation.","He felt the millions of illusory branches descending unto him and elevating his Origin and Soul as he had grasped the current rate of progression.","Now...it was time to put this Boundary to use and see just how profound its effects would be compared to what he was currently experiencing.","So while pondering on glory, boundaries, and refining...Noah's body which was surrounded by tendrils of multicolored light spoke lightly.","[Quintessential Unity of Existence].","...!","Everything turned still.","The barely forming Quintessence Planalith Krystallos halted its spinning.","Noah's floating figure came into focus as his fair skin glinted off a terrifying radiance, the very bounds of existence twisting at this moment as if one looked from a distance, they would observe that the Reality above Noah...had almost bent and curved like an inverted mountain as its peak formed right above his head and connected with him.","And the reality below his feet-space, the Aletheian Havens, and even his Vassals gazing on from below...everything felt distorted and curved on the spacetime continuum as another 'curved' mountain of reality pointed and connected to his feet!","And a similar scene played out to his left and right as it seemed like all of reality curved into focal points around him, his figure becoming the center of the Infinite Aletheian Haven and even the surrounding Records of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as he entered a profound state of epiphany.","He entered [Quintessential Unity of Existence]!","DUM! DUM!","A symphony of celestial drums began to beat as when he opened his eyes, everything resumed.","But...the still Quintessence Planalith Krystallos now began spinning at a rate far faster than even the fastest emerging Singularity.","And the millions of branches of the Ash Tree IV of Gradation...remained the same, but the authority they were supplying Noah ridiculously increased by a factor of 10.","...!","BOOM!","An explosion of utter might and majesty bloomed with his figure at the center as an influx of essence and authority of unimaginable levels thundered into him.","[A Quintessential Burst of Authority is flowing into you and overloading your Origin and Soul!]","A heavy prompt came as his soul buzzed, his Eighth Aletheian Haven rapidly becoming filled with Cosmos and light years of Elera as a moment after, his body buzzed with a roar!","[Your foundation cries out with hunger as the overloading authority is shared by your Body!]","[Your Origin has achieved stupendous accomplishment as on the Ninth Aletheian Haven, it will arrive before an Unscalable Wall.]","[Your Body has achieved stupendous accomplishment as with sufficient authority, your Foundation will arrive before an Unscalable Wall.]","[Due to the Boundary of Cultivation, the Unscalable Walls of the Origin and Body will be perforated as if they did not exist.]","...!","A shocking emergence of prompts.","Prompts that told of the glory of a Boundary exclusive only to Noah- of a Dead Path that was only granting him the level of power it held because he took it to Quintessential Zenith!","It wasn't a Planar, Innate, or Consummate Boundary- but a Dead Path elevated to a level exclusive to him across eons of History.","Quintessential Zenith!"]},{"number":2765,"title":"Chapter 2765: Chapter 2764 Cultivation! III","paragraphs":["2764 Cultivation! III","A factor of 10.","This was what the Quintessential Zenith Boundary of Cultivation elevated the amount of Authority he was absorbing from the Ash Tree IV of Gradation.","This single sprouting was supposed to be enough for Noah to finish forging his Eighth Aletheian Haven and even start his Ninth, and he would need to cultivate the Sporos V of Extremity and sprout it to become an Ash Tree V of Gradation in order to complete his Ninth Aletheian Haven.","Cultivating such a seed was bound to be the hardest one ever, but the increase of the authority he absorbed by a factor of 10 put into question whether the path of using the next level Sporos would even be required!","His intuition already told him that even though he would embark on his Ninth Aletheian Haven with the current Ash Tree of Gradation, it would not be enough to complete it.","The only question that remained...was just how close could he get towards the Ninth Aletheian Haven's completion?","HUUM!","Like a celestial Entity gracing reality from ancient times, he moved to actualize the theoretical possibility as he maintained his [Quintessential Unity of Existence].","It didn't state a specific timer that he could be on this stage as it may end in a second, a minute, a day, or maybe a year.","It stated it so in its description.","He could enter this state a total of 9 times so far, and he would remain in it for an indeterminate amount of time.","He couldn't hope to remain in such a shocking state for even a day, as this would simply be too obscene for even this Boundary at its current level. But seconds, minutes, or hours were a very real possibility.","And so, he would use them fully!","BOOM!","The Quintessence Planalith Krystallos he was refining spun so fast that the reality around it was becoming distorted.","His three aspects of Existence all took in the authority of the Ash Tree of Gradation.","His Body and Origin seethed as while the Havens of his Origin went towards completion, his already robust Foundation of his Body that had already been bathed by his Extremity Soul seemed to almost be close to the Unscalable Wall.","After his Soul, his Body would likely be next in scaling what others could not scale.","And as if to ascertain his thoughts...","[Your already indomitable Foundation has taken a step forward as it nears the Unscalable Wall!]","A prompt came as he could feel his trillions upon trillions of cells drinking the factored authority of the Ash Tree of Gradation.","[Good...]","Feeling the immense power of the state of [Quintessential Unity of Existence] and how things were proceeding, Noah wanted to put to use its other features as he gazed down at the Vassals below him.","One of the boons of being in this state of epiphany was the fact that under it, he could even elevate lesser Boundaries to Extremity!","Now...what exactly did lesser refer to?","To affirm this, his eyes quickly scanned the entities below him for those who held multiple of what he considered lesser concepts.","And very quickly, multiple candidates were selected as without any bias, he simply tapped his finger and selected a Vassals who had expanded the highest number of lesser concepts of Extremity.","And a moment later...","WAP!","The space beside him- within the very eye of the storm caused by the Quintessential Unity of Existence- the visage of none other than the Daughter of Hatred appeared.","Among all the possible Vassals below, it just so happened that after she achieved Extremity in Hatred through Noah's Writ of Extremity, she continued taking multiple other concepts that defined her towards Extremity!","This was the only reason she was currently here.","By pure chance, Lilith was selected as she stared at Noah's majestic figure with shock!","When she gazed at him at this moment, it didn't seem like she was staring at an Existence.","She felt...as if an emotionless cluster of records was gazing at her and seeing everything as she couldn't even hold eye contact with him for a second, her eyes gazing down as his voice thundered out.","[As the Daughter of Hatred, you took it upon yourself to expand Deception, Hellion, Sanguinity, Lust, Chaos, and Twilight.]","...!","His voice...it didn't seem like his normal voice.","When listening to it, one felt as if they were hearing the overlap of countless records coming together as the moment his words finished, Lilith realized that his hand had already landed on her forehead as he continued.","[What is Deception? At its core, it is falsehood and disinformation. To attain Extremity in it, one must even be capable of deceiving themselves...]","BOOM!","As he spoke, Lilith felt her soul surge as shockingly, her Boundary Layers of Deception instantly jumped and attained the 17th Layer.","The hand of the Entity who now grasped her forehead seemed to stir and churn it wildly as an influx of information about Deception surged in her mind!","What she didn't know...was that Noah's current state of epiphany allowed him to experience a state of resonance with Recorded and Unrecorded Histories.","At this moment, he focused on the concept of Deception as an influx of knowledge from written Records and unwritten Records flowed through him and into the mind of Lilith- Noah detaching himself from this process as his soul didn't expand this concept of Deception, and he simply took the concept of Deception within Lilith's soul towards Extremity!","His voice that vibrated with undeniable authority thundered in the mind of the Daughter of Hatred over and over again as after an influx of Records of Deception coursed through her...","BZZT!","A new Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture began to bud in her soul.","And before her eyes, prompts rose.","[You have been led towards the Extremity of Deception by a Great Entity experiencing a profound epiphany!]","[Through an influx of Records, you have forcefully comprehended the Extremity of Deception!]","...!","In a short moment, Lilith watched with utter shock and horror as an Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of [DECEPTION] formed in her soul!"]},{"number":2766,"title":"Chapter 2766: Chapter 2765 Cultivation! IV","paragraphs":["2765 Cultivation! IV","It didn't end here as an instant later, the entity before her continued to speak.","[Hellion...What is a Hellion? It is an inciter. An agitator that disrupts the order of reality to flow to their own liking. To attain Extremity in it, one must be capable of inciting even Reality to their will...]","While being utterly frozen at this unfolding reality, Lilith once more felt her Boundary of Hellion smash into the 17th Layer right away, an influx of Records barreling into her brain as before even a second passed...","[You have been led towards the Extremity of Hellion by a Great Entity experiencing a profound epiphany!]","[...]","A surreal reality unfolded.","An Entity had not attained Extremity himself in his concepts that were of pristine ranking and Tier, and yet he guided the Soul of another being in front of him to achieve Extremity in two lesser concepts within the span of mere seconds!","What a profound achievement.","What a Quintessential glory!","This...was Cultivation.","This was the development and improvement that no other beings could even come close to.","Noah tested its limits firsthand as fantastically, he was able to take Planar Boundaries expanded by the Daughter of Hatred and elevate them towards Extremity- even transforming them to become Innate Boundaries simply because they were tinged by a trace of his Records.","[A Quintessential Achievement!]","[You have successfully guided another Entity in achieving the Extremity of a concept while distancing yourself from said concept.]","[A profound achievement that shows you could achieve Extremity of lesser concepts at will, and yet your aim is much higher as you choose not to.]","[You have gained an even deeper understanding of Quintessence!]","[The more profound acts of Quintessence you continue to perform, the easier it will be for you to take the step towards the Extremity of this concept.]","[You have gained the distinction of Vanguard of Extremity!]","[Your Honorariums are accumulating their glory for an even grander reward at your time of choosing.]","The scene was ecstatic.","With the very workings of reality warping around him in for directions and millions of illusory tendrils of branches sinking into him, he grasped the forehead of the Daughter of Hatred and took one concept within her to Extremity after another.","[What is Sanguinity?....]","[What is Lust?...]","...!","One wasn't harder than the others.","To Noah, it felt like he was simply resonating with countless Records and sifting through them to access a database of information others could barely even imagine.","It allowed him within less than a minute to grasp the head of the Daughter of Hatred and take Deception, Hellion, Sanguinity, Lust, Chaos, and Twilight to form Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures within her soul!","Bustling waves of authority buzzed and exploded as he removed his hand thereafter, the dazed figure of the Daughter of Hatred opening her eyes to just gaze at Noah as...","She could only stare at his chest.","His eyes, his gaze...it felt too scorching to hold- too unfathomable to stare at!","And yet for him, he only tapped his finger in her direction once more.","And she disappeared, her visage warping and returning right where she was a minute ago as in her place, the glorious figure of the Emperor Penguin appeared.","[The First Spiritual Beast. You have expanded Vanity, Gold, and Ego towards Extremity.]","[What is Vanity?]","...!","An utterly ridiculous reality unfolded thereafter as while grasping onto the head of the Emperor Penguin, one concept after another touched upon the stage of Extremity.","And after Vanity, Gold, and Ego were taken to Extremity within the Emperor Penguin's soul, his figure was warped away as in his place, Kazuhiko appeared!","And within less than a minute, Kazuhiko was warped away with three different Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures forming in his soul, Orion taking his place soon after.","Then Aurelia, Katelyn, Maximilian....Noah first ascertained what he could do with Entities that had Planar Boundaries, and when he saw how he transformed them into Innate Boundaries when taking them to Extremity, he then began to choose those who had Innate Boundaries!","All of them...were considered lesser in his eyes.","After all, his boundaries stood at the Quintessential Zenith!","His Boundaries allowed for the current ridiculous reality to unfold.","And as he took his distinction as a Vanguard of Extremity to a ridiculous level...","HUUM!","An aspect of his that was already near the peak of possible power at his current level radiated glory, his fair skin blazing with a white gold radiance that caused the very surrounding space to tremble!","[Your Foundation has reached an unsurpassable level below the stage of Extremity.]","[You have achieved a Quintessential Foundation across eons of Recorded History!]","[Your Body gazes at an Unscalable Wall that stands before.]","Boundless waves of authority sought to continue elevating his Body, but they couldn't cross a wall.","A wall that wasn't meant to be crossed until after one took a concept to Extremity!","But then, his body suffused with profound light as the radiance of the Quintessential Zenith Boundary of Cultivation blazed around it.","And...","[Your body disdainfully gazes at the Unscalable Wall as it begins to crumble!]","He didn't have to prepare any tools to knock this Wall down as he did with his soul.","His Body simply gazed at it with disdain as it began to crumble!","DUM!","And the moment it did so, heavy drums began to resound as he tacked on yet another profound achievement.","Another glorious Honorarium!","As waves of prompts exploded, his Nine Pupiled Eyes that were filled with boundless records gazed up to see the reality above him split apart, a rift that held behind it unfathomable mysteries blooming as from it- two massive Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of VITALIS and VACUOUS descended.","[The Quintessential Achievement that is being recorded for the first time has allowed the Honorarium of Extremity Sanctification of the Body by Hyperversal Havenly and Infernal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures.]","The so called Unscalable Wall fell apart as tendrils of profound authority began to rain down from the massive Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures that had begun to spin above him.","[Your body is undergoing a profound transformation and elevation of your Tier of Existence.]","[The Quintessential Zenith Boundary of Ascendancy has been triggered!]","Yes.","In the midst of Noah's transformation, there was yet another Boundary that was expanded by the Protagonist which came into play.","Ascendancy.","It was something that would make Noah's transformations that were already obscene...just slightly broken!"]},{"number":2767,"title":"Chapter 2767: Chapter 2766 Just a little excessive! I","paragraphs":["2766 Just a little excessive! I","Ascendancy!","It was triggered at this moment as to understand what it was about to do, one had to know what its most powerful Boundary Layer granted.","[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of Ascendancy]:: The process of Ascension is always an important one as the self experiences an elevation of existence to a new tier, or a slightly elevated form of the current self. This boundary layer is strictly meant to further elevate you whenever you undergo transformations that drastically change your value or Tier of existence. Any possible result of a transformation will be elevated and enhanced further by 100% of what it was bound to be. When attaining the Extremity of Ascendancy, the factor of elevation will accordingly increase in addition to other unknown boons.","One of the shortest Boundary Layers among those recently expanded by the Protagonist.","And yet it was one of the more straightforward ones as its use was singular!","100% elevation and enhancement of whatever form of transformation of existence Noah was undergoing.","His body was taking itself into the stage of Extremity as the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of VITALIS and VACUOUS were the ones aiding him in this process since he didn't have Extremity Rune Scriptures of his own.","And now, this process was going to be enhanced even more!","DUM!","A booming drum exploded out as shockingly, it stemmed from his heart.","His golden blood churned and roiled like a celestial river coursing through countless vessels and Extremity Meridians as it devoured the authority pouring into it, his body becoming suffused with a magisterial glow as it cracked, splintered, and reformed all at once as he began to enlarge in size.","Yes.","Every part of him was enlarging and expanding to his very cells, the Boundary of Ascendancy combining with the ridiculous effects of the Boundary of Cultivation as the level of authority and transformation taking place was taken to an excessive level.","It was utterly excessive as within a second, Noah's body had already expanded to the size of a single light year.","\"...\"","And the elevation didn't stop, his body continuing to absorb obscene amounts of authority while being altered at a fundamental level!","This continued until...","[You have initiated the attainment of the Unrecorded Infernal Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Superius Physiology!]","...!","Unrecorded Infernal Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Superius Physiology!","When the prompt of this mouthful set of words came, everything went utterly bonkers as his body that had grown to a single light year exploded with grandeur and rapidly went to 10 light years....100 light years....a thousand light years!","All in the span of milliseconds.","All while he was in a state of profound epiphany, refining a Quintessence Planalith Krystallos, refining his Extremity Soul, forging his Eighth Haven, and breaking past the Unscalable Wall of his Body.","The scene was an ecstatic one to see as the entire Infinite Hyperversal Haven trembled, his Vassals being transported to far away distances as Noah's body was enlarging in stature and size to the extent he was gradually coming to be the same scale as the myriad of Aletheian Havens forged within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","It was an unforgettable scene that was bound to be recorded in the eons of History, and it wasn't the only thing that Noah was going through at this moment.","His main body had activated the stage of Quintessential Unity of Existence, but it could be accessed by any of his bodies that had traces of his Soul and Will.","With its activation, it also brought about a great change in another place entirely- in the Nether Haven of Dissolution!","—","The Adjudicator of Dissolution opened her eyes as she affirmed her current reality.","Her very existence was connected to the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos and the Havenly Bridge of Dissolution as she truly became an Anchor for this Extremity Bridge- one of the purposes she was supposed to play as a tool being achieved at this moment.","She didn't want it.","She didn't seek it.","She wanted to leave it behind a long time ago, but people like her didn't have the luxury of a choice.","And now, she joined the hands of another devil to break away from the original one as her soul felt his Lineage and Will that flowed through her- his will that already covered the Havenly Bridge of Dissolution and was seeking its claws into the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos!","What plans did he have by doing this?","What conflict would she now be in the center of from this Entity that she now knew she sorely misunderstood?","She wanted to have her questions answered as she while her Main Body was recuperating in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution, her Extremity Clone that was taking on the role of the Anchor still felt the hands of Osmont's clone entrenched into her at the beginnings of the Extremity Bridge.","His Clone was right there as there were two Hyperversal Savior's Arks surrounding and protecting this area, with two Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities releasing a cataclysmic Extremity Domain Expansion in this area while in the far distance, a battle was raging between them and Legions of the Havenly Plantae Extremity Lineage, with Legions of the Senatus of Extremity and Curagulus of Extremity also joining the fray in an assault that sought to reach and break the established Extremity Bridge.","And yet in the midst of all of this...the Adjudicator of Dissolution had no words at the reality that Noah's clone that was right there in the very center of the Legions of Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities- behind the tight encirclement of even two Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities...he remained floating freely as if they couldn't even see he was there.","They sought to protect the Extremity Bridge, not knowing that there was already someone right next to it who was seeking to gain full control!","How was it that Osmont could float freely and escape the tremendously powerful wills and souls of Entities at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity?!"]},{"number":2768,"title":"Chapter 2768: Chapter 2767 Just a little excessive! II","paragraphs":["2767 Just a little excessive! II","Such a ridiculous reality made Svetlana seek to know more and understand the devil she had allowed to pervade into her Records as even though she could feel her Extremity Soul being refined as she felt like she was approaching the Fourth Gradation of Extremity, what did it matter if she didn't even understand the entity who had altered and was currently altering her very records?","What if she had truly made an even grander mistake and enslaved herself to an entity even worse than her old Master? One who had the ability to make Tier 4 Entities not even know he existed right before them?!","She had to get a semblance of an answer as her main body in the Supernal Haven of Dissolution closed her eyes tightly and sank into her Records, her will manifesting into an illusory body that came in front of the manifested Will of the Entity she accepted the help of.","His manifestation was clothed in a simple gold robe with flowing dark hair, and she began to speak as soon as she saw his broad back and calm yet devilish face.","[Just what are y-]","BZZT!","Her words didn't finish.","Her whole soul trembled as her manifested Will within her backed off in astonishment as it felt a terrifying formless pressure erupt around Noah's manifested Will!","The Will...turned towards her as his gaze caused her to tremble- as if he could see absolutely everything she was made of.","His eyes...she tried to meet the gaze of his vibrant pupils as shockingly, her Will felt a sense of oppression as she could only gaze up to the tip of his nose.","She...could not meet his gaze.","'What the fuck?!'","She was a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity whose Hyperversal Extremity Authority was currently booming and being refined towards the Fourth Gradation of Extremity- all of this being a benefit from the Bloodline and Will of this Entity before her.","Dozens of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DISSOLUTION were being born in her Extremity Soul and elevating it even further as a being like her...couldn't even bring herself to gaze at the eyes of the manifested Will of Noah Osmont?!","It was a surreal reality as in her shock, she felt his inquisitive gaze go over her as his voice rang out.","His voice that felt like an overlap of countless records and ancient phenomena.","[The Soul Seed of a Zenith Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity was entrenched in you even before you stepped on the Gradations of Extremity, containing the construct that was able to initiate the formation of the Extremity Bridge apparent in the Nether Haven of Dissolution currently.]","...!","He spoke as if he was analyzing everything about her.","In the state of Quintessential Unity of Existence, many more things were laid bare before him!","[If I seek control of this Extremity Bridge, the most apt way of doing so will be through the Soul Seed containing the Source of this Construct that has the Will of the Tier 4 Vacuous Extremity erased. This seed should also be just a part of a whole as on the other side, there should be another Anchor with a similar signature Seed Within the Infernal Haven of Anarchos...]","WAA!","The moment she heard these words, Svetlana felt the space before her fluctuate as this Entity appeared in front of her, his right hand rising to grasp the forehead of her manifested Will as she felt the soul of this Entity begin to enter her Records once again with shocking speed!","His Will coursed through her and became centered on the Soul Seed that held the Source of the Construct of the Extremity Bridge displayed in the Nether Haven of Dissolution.","And his voice thundered out majestically.","[Since it is half of the puzzle, if its Records resonate with the other half...]","HUUM!","Svetlana felt her soul buzz.","In the Nether Haven of Dissolution, the gazes of the Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities protecting the Anchor of the Extremity Bridge had their gazes change as they turned around and felt the bridge behind them vibrate briefly!","Thereafter, it retained its calm.","But within the soul of the Anchor, Svetlana saw a devilish smile form on the manifested Will of the Entity before her as he spoke drastic words.","[Got you.]","HUUM!","She felt her soul buzz once more as shockingly, she felt a connection be established from the Source of the Construct in her soul...to another Source in an entirely different Domain.","Across eons of space and time.","Across regions that rejected space and time.","With the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as the pathway, a shocking leap was taken!","His will which had barely been making headway on the side of the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos instantly surged forward and covered light years of this bridge as on the other side, there was another Anchor.","In the span of an instant, from the depths of the soul of this Anchor, the Will of the True Emperor of Quintessence bloomed from a Soul Seed holding the other half of the Construct of the Extremity Bridge!","Svetlana felt the faint connection to the other Anchor solidify as with wild abandon, the will and soul of the Entity before her flowed into her Soul Seed and used this connection to traverse unimaginable distances into another Soul Seed- the True Emperor of Quintessence making a bid to fully control both the Infernal and Havenly sides of the Extremity Bridge!","Svetlana experienced all of this as her astonishment paved way to a trace of fear.","She felt the ever present will of the Entity she had grabbed onto the hands of as she truly questioned whether she had made the right decision.","Just who- no, just what is this Entity known as Noah Osmont?","A simple question.","But it didn't have a simple answer.","On the other side.","At the end of the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos.","Within the depths of the Soul of the Anchor of the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos.","Obsidian waves of light were the only thing filling up this Soul as the Entity taking on this role was in a state of deep slumber, but all of sudden...","BOOM!","A critical point within his soul exploded forth with a shocking Will as the Source of the Construct of the Infernal Bridge began to leak out rivers of illusory golden blood!","This Blood coagulated to form a devilishly handsome figure shrouded in a golden robe as he gazed at the Soul he had made a breakthrough in.","The soul of another Zenith Tier 3 Entity- a Vacuous Malignancy who was the other opposite Anchor to the Adjudicator of Dissolution!","The manifested figure of Noah gazed at it with a smile as his right hand motioned forward, the golden rivers of his will containing his Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage gushing out with even more fervor as they contained vibrant Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","They spread and pervaded into every space of this soul as at the center of it all, Noah gazed out into the darkness as his eyes shone with a chilling light, his voice light and being one that only he could hear.","[The Infernal Haven of Anarchos...]","...!","The words of the True Emperor of Quintessence were filled with authority as at this moment, his reach began to extend towards a far, far domain!"]},{"number":2769,"title":"Chapter 2769: Chapter 2768 Superius! I","paragraphs":["2768 Superius! I","With the depths of the souls of the Anchor of the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos, brazen seas of golden blood gushed out and painted over everything as the Source of the Construct- the Soul Seed implanted in this Entity fell under Noah's control in the same manner as Svetlana!","From the Soul, Noah's will pathogenically spread across all other aspects of Existence of this Entity who was gradually roused from his state of slumber.","In a short period of time, parts of his soul coalesced as his figure manifested, his eyes fluttering and open to gaze at a world of gold all around him.","And in the surging seas of gold, the visage of a man with his hands clasped behind his back could be seen as when the manifested soul tried to gaze at him, it felt like his eyes couldn't even rise above the chest of this being.","[Marlac...your destiny has changed entirely on this day as for now, continue to slumber.]","HUUM!","With these words, the Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity, Marlac...he felt his Records undergoing alteration as ever so slowly, a heavy veil fell over his eyes as he returned back into a deep state of slumber.","On the outside, the limbs of his form were outstretched as on his fractured chest, the structure of the Infernal Bridge of Anarchos began and only extended outwards.","At this moment, a will silently began to spread from his body as the situation of the other side was confirmed.","The surrounding area was filled with something white flames as at the very front of the bridge, a massive draconic Entity with flaming white scales and three serpentine heads floated with grand might at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity.","Around him, Legions of Vacuous Malignancies were being commanded and moving towards the Infernal Bridge as they entered the domain fields of Hyperversal Savior's Arks.","Noah gazed at all of this calmly as further behind them, waves of scattered Legions could be seen as their numbers were many!","Apart from the blazing white flames, particles of pure Vacuous Hyperversal Authority flowed serenely as they seemed to be in much greater abundance than in the Nether Havens of the Vitalis Domains.","And even further away, Noah saw the roots of a shockingly huge white tree stretching out for light years- its size alone being equivalent to a Minor Haven as when his gaze followed this tree, he saw 9 branches extending from it in different directions.","At the end of these 9 branches, the largest Planes of Existence he had ever seen shone with utmost grandeur- countless quintillions of entities having their life force shining brilliantly within!","This was the glimpse that Noah obtained when he first opened his eyes in the Infernal Haven of Anarchos.","Gazing at the Legions clustering towards the Infernal Bridge he had gained control of, his will flashed with brilliance as from it, small golden particles of unseen light began to be released.","They were further masked by the dazzling obsidian light of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as slowly but surely, they began to spread across the Legions of Vacuous Entities all around him!","—","Within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Noah's figure had ballooned to an indeterminate number of light years as he was far faster than a Cosmos or even a Plane of Existence, his sheer stature exceeding trillions upon trillions of light years as within his own Infinite Hyperversal Haven...he looked to be on the same scale as the Aletheian Havens constructed throughout.","Unfathomable.","Incomprehensible!","These were the only words that came to mind as even imagining such a thing wasn't easily done!","But the transformation occurred regardless.","His body was breaking past an Unscalable Wall as the result this time...was uniquely something that began with the moniker of Infernal.","His Lineage was the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage.","His Soul was the Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul.","Havenly.","It appeared over and over again for his most critical transformations.","It was all influenced heavily...by Vitalis.","After all, he was born in the Vitalis Domains as his lineage naturally took this path, and so did his soul.","Much of him was leaning and aligned with Vitalis as such a reality...the Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of VACUOUS took great offense!","It wasn't balanced.","And he...was no longer limited to Vitalis as he had now gained access to Vacuous Annals of Extremity and was proceeding smoothly with his Vacuous Awakenings. His Existence was now not limited only to Vitalis.","Since the last Unscalable Wall of the Soul that was torn down granted the Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul, the Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of VACUOUS took the lead this time and gushed such potent Authority for the refinement of Noah's body as the result...was something that had the moniker of Infernal.","The Unrecorded Infernal Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Superius Physiology!","In his state of Quintessential Unity of Existence, Noah gleaned some information when it came to Physiologies as unique ones could be attained when elevating to the stage of Extremities by special existences who had some form of a profound Extremity Foundation and unique accomplishments.","Something like undergoing Vitalis or Vacuous Awakening before Extremity. Something like forging a Dead Path to the stage of Extremity.","There were a myriad of possibilities, but Noah was attaining his unique physiology from multiple different avenues as his physique...was Unrecorded.","No other entity across Recorded History held it!","BOOM!","His size was an uncountable number of light years as it was as massive as the Dream Aletheian Haven, Avalon Aletheian Haven, and multiple other Aletheian Havens stacked on top of each other.","The Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of VACUOUS and VITALIS expanded to be even larger than him above his stature as they showered down glorious tendrils of authority.","It was...utterly ridiculous.","And after he reached such a brazen height and devoured all of this authority, Noah felt the phenomenal strength coursing through him as a moment later, he began to reduce in size as he felt the abundant authority within his body be compressed.","Compressed and made even more terrifying as at this moment, droves of information about this shocking physiology flooded his mind!"]},{"number":2770,"title":"Chapter 2770: Chapter 2769 Superius! II","paragraphs":["2769 Superius! II","[Unrecorded Infernal Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Superius Physiology]:: Your body underwent a profound transformation and elevation of existence through none other than the Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures, such an action prompting the rise of an Unrecorded Extremity Physiology. Upon further elevation by your own qualities, concepts, and prior Foundation, this was the unintended result. At its current stage of refinement, it approaches the resiliency and hardness of a Zenith Low Grade Armament of Extremity, with your skin coursing with and capable of outwardly manifesting an [Innate Extremity Superius Aura] that is capable of withstanding the equivalent attack of 243 Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, or 999 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, or 8,991 Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures. Your current physiology contains such a compressed cluster of pure Authority within it that it now passively releases 9 [Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction] that automatically and passively circle your body. These Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction can be controlled at will to target enemies as each one can descend with superius might to deliver damage equivalent to 243 Crimson, or 999 Obsidian, or 8,991 Golden Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures....","...!","BOOM!","The description of his new physiology never finished.","His compressing body went from the size of a Haven to the size of a Cosmos, very quickly compressing even further as within moments, he was the size of a Universe.","But in this compression, 9 terrifying rings of crimson gold light bloomed around him.","They formed from interviewing runic lines that swirled with Quintessence, Infinity, Protagonist, Manadynamics, Loot, Cultivation...all of Noah's fantastical Concepts seemed to hold the backbone of these forming rings of light!","All of it was layered with a trace of Hyperversal Extremity Authority that didn't have a source linked to any specific concept- but purely connected to the strength of his body.","A myriad of Infinity symbols formed within the 9 Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction, intricate lines forming across each of them as thereafter, tendrils of Pure Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority permeated across the rings of light.","Vacuous Hyperversal Authority was ringing in with much more abundance like sentient snakes, it layered over everything and granted these ecstatic rings of light a devilish light.","In the midst of all of this, Noah's body continued to compress as very quickly, he became the size of a galaxy.","He then became the size of a world as a millisecond later, he attained the size of an average humanoid that had yet to even touch Mana!","And his compression continued as he then became the size of a grain of sand.","HUUM!","The 9 forming Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction continued to swirl around him with immense glory as finally, his body compressed to become the size of an atom.","Imperceptible.","Immeasurably small!","And reality buzzed with grandeur.","A moment later...","WAP!","His body flashed as it grew to 4 meters.","About double the average size of an Entity taking on a Humanoid form as he seemed gloriously imposing, this form being returned by him as this...seemed to be the most stable.","BZZT!","His eyes opened to release rays of majesty as he gazed at the silently swirling Crimson gold Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction.","They closely remained around his body as with a thought, they became transparent and imperceptible to the extent that others couldn't see them.","He then motioned with his hand as all 9 rings moved across space under his command, their size changing according to his will as they could become as small as atoms or as vast as a Cosmos!","They were terrifying tools Innate to his body.","They could explode with the power of 999 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures each as what did this signify?","A Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity held a few hundred Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures within their Existence as their upper tier was 333 before they could try breaking past the wall of the Third Gradation of Extremity.","At the absolute peak, a Tier 2 could have 333 Obsidian, or 2,997 Golden, or 81 Crimson Hyperversal Extremity Rune Scriptures!","At this moment, with the strength of his body alone that held the hardness of a Zenith Low Grade Armament of Extremity or a single one of his 9 Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction, he could erase every single Rune Scripture a Tier 2 Entity held.","Then, you had Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities.","A weak one could have hundreds of Obsidian Rune Scriptures, with those at the Zenith of Tier 3 having an upper tier of 12,321 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures, 110,889 Golden, or 2,997 Crimson Extremity Rune Scriptures!","Of course, most Entities had a mixture of Golden, Obsidian, and Crimson Rune Scriptures as these numbers vary, but this was the absolute truth Noah had ascertained so far.","But even while gazing at these numbers...he had achieved a stupendous accomplishment so far.","Before even taking a concept to Extremity, the power of his body alone was equivalent to the power of an average Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","[...]","And this wasn't his limit.","His body could get stronger.","Even at this very moment, he had only discerned half of the description of his new physiology as grand changes had occurred with his Meridians, Bloodline, and more!","Apart from this, his Origin and Soul could also get stronger!","When his Origin also crossed the Unscalable Wall similar to his Body and Soul...Noah foresaw that this was the time that he would be ready to undertake the perilous trial of life and death.","Of the Death and Rebirth where Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity wanted to end everything about him.","At that time...Noah could see an Extremity of Quintessence.","After all, what was more Quintessential than an Entity who had yet to even step on the First Gradation of Extremity, but had scaled past the limits of all three of his Aspects of Existence...facing off and surviving the undeniable might of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity?","What could possibly be more Quintessential?!","When this Unrecorded History would take place, Noah in no way believed he would be at the same level as an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity.","No. But to attain the shocking feat of Quintessence, he simply had to survive against the methods of such a powerful Entity.","And for this...he was prepared.","After this event ended though.","After he overcame death and had a rebirth into an Entity that had attained the Extremity of Quintessence...he truly had no idea where his power would be!","Too many things would happen.","Too many concepts would also attain Extremity.","That moment...was bound to be an irreversible nexus event that would decide all the Histories to unfold!"]},{"number":2771,"title":"Chapter 2771: Chapter 2770 Superius! III","paragraphs":["2770 Superius! III","This was the general outline of the path he was trying to follow.","His Aspects of Existence attaining Extremity, and then taking the concept of Quintessence to Extremity right after!","HUUM!","Being 4 meters large, Noah's form seemed grand in stature compared to normal humanoid forms as the crimson gold Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction visibly swirled around him again, his skin shining with an iridescent glow as it pulsed with power.","Before him, the Quintessence Planalith Krystallos continued to spin madly as this process allowed it to be 70% completed, and the branches of the Ash Tree of Gradation had less than 50% of their authority left for Noah to absorb.","His right hand raised at this moment as he felt his new found body- his Meridians that were expanded as if they were wide and endless rivers of reality, and the Innate power he held that was all settling down and being quantified.","He then clenched his fist as he uttered calmly.","[Innate Extremity Superius Aura]","...!","THUMP!","His heart released a booming echo as the Havenly Organ beside it shuddered, a crimson gold aura rising from it and enveloping Noah's whole body as he seemed like a celestial entity covered by an utterly gorgeous and magnificent aura of crimson gold flames!","It blazed 1 meter around his body as with a motion of his will, it expanded outwards for miles gloriously before he retracted it to blaze around his body.","This was the Innate Extremity Superius Aura.","It could innately defend against 243 Crimson or 999 Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures!","In addition to the Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction that were supposed to be used offensively, Noah could also turn them into defensive tools as his current state of power...was extremely unique.","He could truly match Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities with the strength his body provided alone!","If he paired this with the False Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of DESPOILER among other tools under his grasp, he could truly begin butchering Tier 3 Entities.","[...]","The thought was a glorious one as all of this was brought about by scaling the wall of the Aspect of the Body.","And among its many effects, there were also unintended ones that Noah very much welcomed as he gazed up to see the massive Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of VACUOUS and VITALIS retreating, but within his Body...his Innate Vacuous and Vitalis Meridians were now expanded and surging with such potent Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities that in no time...","[The concentration of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities within your Aspects of Existence has reached a critical threshold.]","[Your Existence is embarking on the Third Vitalis and Vacuous Awakenings!]","When achievements came, they came in pairs.","In Noah's case, they came in quick succession as with his body at the very center, a contrasting wonder of black and white erupted to his left and right as it spread out for the diameter of a whole Cosmos.","He looked like he was at the very center of a black and white sun as the Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority oscillated around him like endless suns.","At the core of it all, his body was magisterially surrounded by the crimson gold Innate Extremity Superius Aura and 9 Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction as he truly seemed like an entity entirely out of some fantastical Unrecorded History!","And in the midst of all of this....","[The Eighth Aletheian Haven has been completed.]","[The Ninth Aletheian Haven has begun to be forged!]","His Origin radiated a profound multicolored brilliance as the tower-like structures of the 8 Aletheian Havens oscillated with each other, the final and 9th one beginning to be forged by the residual authority of the Ash Tree of Gradation that was being magnified by the Boundary of Cultivation.","[A Profound Achievement!]","[The Origin you are constructing has not yet been Recorded in History, with the final piece to complete it being extremely hard to accomplish before attaining Extremity!]","The final and last Haven.","Whenever Noah forged this Aletheian Haven to completion, his Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians would follow the will of his Origin to allow all Concepts with their Sources bound to him to be elevated to Extremity.","Completing it was a Quintessential Achievement.","This was why before the Ninth Aletheian Haven could be completed...","[Your Origin is nearing an Unscalable Wall!]","[At approximately 50% completion of the Ninth Aletheian Haven, your Origin will reach a level of profound saturation as to proceed further and complete its remaining 50%, the Unscalable Wall of the Aspect of the Origin has to be scaled.]","Yes.","This would have been the arduous and backbreaking task Noah had to overcome in order to complete his Aletheian Havens.","Their completion was locked behind scaling an Unscalable Wall!","Yet now...it was simply an inevitability due to the Quintessential Zenith Boundary of Cultivation.","The remnant authority of the Ash Tree of Gradation would do its best to get Noah as far as it could, but thereafter, he would need more Loot.","Thinking of this, Noah clenched his fist while calculating paths and looking at the many wars breaking out across different regions, as well as his enemies.","There was still loot remaining from the eradication of hundreds of Tier 1s and the batch of Avernus Extremities, and he could even use Hyperversal II Assimilation which would undoubtedly be upgraded to Hyperversal III Assimilation after his Third Awakenings to devour treasures directly in the case that cultivating the next Sporos of Extremity would be too arduous, and if he only needed a little more authority to complete the hardest Haven.","It all depended on how far he would get with the current Ash Tree IV of Gradation!","HUUM!","At this moment.","His body that was fully reaping the gains of the Unrecorded Infernal Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Superius Physiology caused a critical change to his churning Blood.","To his Lineage that was gradually connected to more and more Extremities across the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","All of it culminated into a shocking amalgamation of authority that at this moment...","CRACK!","Caused his forehead to split open ever so slightly!"]},{"number":2772,"title":"Chapter 2772: Chapter 2771 Superius! IV","paragraphs":["2771 Superius! IV","His forehead split as tendrils of golden blood flowed.","From the slit, a gorgeous crystalline multicolored nonagonal jewel rose as it pulsed with utterly pristine glory!","The moment it appeared, it pulsed with a hungry light of power as from all around, wisps of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority began to gather and speedily flow into it as if they were flowing in an endless abyss.","At the same time, prompts rose before Noah's eyes.","[The Unrecorded Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage has unlocked the Enneagonal Existential Jewel!]","[You have attained the Primogenitor Quintessential Enneagonal Existential Jewel!]","[The Vassals of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage have attained the Quintessential Enneagonal Existential Jewel.]","[The Enneagonal Existential Jewel is forged for the purpose of bringing Existences closer to Existential Authority. With the Quintessential Enneagonal Existential Jewel, Vassals of your Lineage will passively absorb Existential Authority based on the source of their Existence. If the Vassals of your Lineage have already attained Hyperversal Extremity Authority and stem from the Existential Authority of Vitalis, the newly formed Enneagonal Existential Jewel on their bodies will erupt with a one time Awakening Radiance that absorbs enough Pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority to allow one to attain their First Vitalis Awakening. If the Vassals have yet to attain Hyperversal Extremity Authority, the Enneagonal Existential Jewel will passively absorb Existential Authority, with their rate of absorption depending on the level of bloodline purity as in an indeterminate period of time, they will also naturally attain their First Vitalis Awakening. The Quintessential Enneagonal Existential Jewel acts as a reservoir for Existential Authority connected to one's Meridians whenever they form, and the jewel allows for Vassals of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage to recognize each other's signatures and establish a Bloodline Link that will allow them to instantaneously communicate with each other, teleport to each other's positions within the same Existential Domains, and even share authority from one Entity to another. As the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage grows, so will the capabilities of the Enneagonal Existential Jewel...]","...!","A shocking new construct was being formed as after Noah obtained his Primogenitor Quintessential Enneagonal Existential Jewel, his Vassals within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven also had their foreheads split as Quintessential Enneagonal Existential Jewels rose as well!","But theirs shone with a dim white gold radiance as the brighter the golden radiance, the purer their lineage was.","Among all beings far, far below Noah who were relocated due to his drastic increase in size before he reduced, Henry was undoubtedly the one whose jewel shone with the most golden radiance as at this moment, streams of pure Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowed into it.","The same scene but on a much smaller scale played out for Noah's other Vassals as with utter incredulity, Hyperion in humanoid form and Kazuhiko touched their foreheads that were now drawing in Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","The Kraken's tendrils of limbs rose to its head to feel a similar jewel and sensation as in amazement, Dr. Hall did the same thing.","\"Little Fish, what did you do to my perfect face?!\" Meanwhile, Barbatos' small but blessed figure touched her forehead in shock at the appearance of the jewel as a moment later, it turned transparent as if it weren't even there.","And with a blink of her eyes, the jewel reappeared in all of its glory as with it present, she glowed with a magisterial light of grace and power.","Noah gazed at this scene and many more as it wasn't limited to his Vassals here, but every single Entity who had taken his Blood Sources and attained his Lineage were undergoing this phenomenon as it wasn't just in this Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","But this wasn't the most drastic thing.","The most drastic thing was that on the bodies of Xiaomi, Kazuhiko, the Emperor Penguin, Lilith, and all those who had attained Extremity...their newly risen jewels shone with an Awakening Radiance.","The most dreadful and reality shattering capability of the Enneagonal Existential Jewels that had just risen with Noah's Bloodline.","The ability to grant the First Vitalis Awakening to any Entities of this Bloodline that had attained Extremity!","BOOM!","An explosion of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority bloomed far below Noah as his Vassals that he had elevated to Extremity...actually began to under their First Vitalis Awakening.","An awakening that was much, much harder than its Vacuous counterpart!","Within the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions, Noah saw powerful Commanders who had undergone their First Vacuous Awakening in large numbers.","It was easier for them.","But within the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains, there were many Extremities- even within the Supernal Havens of Extremity like Extremity Laeta of the Smilodon Lineage who had yet to undergo Vitalis Awakening!","It was a much more arduous process.","But, there were still proportionally many more Extremities who had undergone their First Vitalis Awakening in the Supernal Havens due to the Four Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Lineages.","Within the Nether Havens, maybe genius Tier 3 Entities and mostly Tier 4 Entities were the ones who had undergone their First Vitalis Awakening.","Yet now...Noah was going to revolutionize all of this.","He was about to change the very landscape and power structure of the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains as any Extremity who held his lineage felt a shocking jewel rising on their forehead at this juncture...before an Awakening Radiance shone from it as a glorious phenomenon befell them!","It was to the extent that not even a second passed that Noah's mind buzzed with a sharp old voice.","[Primogenitor, what did you just do?!]","The voice of the Seer of Sima echoed out as fantastically, away from the Infinite Hyperversal Extremity, and within the Domains of the Sima Clan where Noah's Clone that had sent the trace of his soul into the Chambers of the Senatus was floating next to the Extremity of Foundation and Erikson...","the gaze of this old woman with her cane locked onto him as she repeated the same words while gazing at Erikson and his father whose foreheads had split open just like hers to reveal white gold jewels.","[Primogenitor, what did you just do?]","...!","Right in front of his figure.","While staring at him straight in the eyes.","This was because this cunning woman had caught onto a simple fact in this single second.","While her forehead, Erikson's, and the forehead of the Extremity of Foundation split open to reveal white gold jewels, as streams of Vitalis began to surge towards them, with an Awakening Radiance flashing on the Extremity of Foundation...Noah's Clone had not released any fluctuations.","No jewel had formed on the clone's forehead.","It was...an unexpected oversight due to Absolute Inscrutable II Existence that did not release waves of the shocking transformations Noah's main body was undergoing!","But at this moment, paired with the advent of something even Noah did not foresee, this continued camouflage of his clone while it was next to a particularly inquisitive Entity who was already suspicious of him allowed her mind to buzz and connect many things.","The Noah Osmont who was affirmed to have a strong connection and backing with the Infernal Havenly Commerce wasn't showing the slightest bit of reaction while her and all others of the Havenly Hyperversal Emperor Lineage erupted with such shocking phenomena?","It could only mean a couple of things.","And the already suspicious mind of the Seer arrived to a single possible conclusion as right in front of Noah, she gazed at him again while unabashedly asking whether he was what she believed he was!","And at such a moment, Noah's eyes flashed with brilliance as he smiled.","A small oversight on the part of Absolute Inscrutable II Existence.","A small mistake.","Even he still made them every now and then!","But at this point, it didn't matter too much as he looked into the ancient eyes of this Tier 4 Entity- he gazed into the eyes of Seer of Sima as he replied with a devilish smile.","[What did I do? I merely released the latest round of blessings!]","...!","His body exploded with shocking brilliance and bloodline authority thereafter as the eyes of the Seer of Sima opened wider than ever before.","And off to the side, the jaws of Erikson and his father hung wide open at the surreal reality before them!"]},{"number":2773,"title":"Chapter 2773: Chapter 2772 I greet the Primogenitor! I","paragraphs":["2772 I greet the Primogenitor! I","Pristine liquified waves of purple liquified authority flowed below their feet.","An Aurora of lights swirled above them in this domain of the Sima Clan as Noah's figure radiated the unadulterated Bloodline authority of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage!","He did this while on his forehead, a glorious Quintessential Primogenitor Enneagonal Existential Jewel blazed with multicolored brilliance, looking much grander and holding much greater weight than the Quintessential Enneagonal Existential Jewels that had risen on the foreheads of the Seer of Sima, the Extremity of Foundation, and Erikson.","Yet all three stared at Noah in a dumbfounded manner at this moment as even the Seer of Sima seemed dazed at her hunch being correct.","Her aged figure that seemed young and in her prime at the same time grasped her cane tightly as it tapped on the liquified authority under their feet and proceeded forward, coming to stand before him as in the next moment...","A shocking action was performed.","The Seer of Sima had her dazed eyes gradually develop a profound sense of calmness as this Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity appeared in front of Noah...her head tipping down in a bow of respect towards him as her voice serenely echoed out as she closed her eyes and spoke.","[This old one greets the Primogenitor.]","...!","WAA!","An unimaginable action.","This was a Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","This was the Seer of Sima!","For her to bow her head to someone...she wouldn't do so even if she were in front of the current Rhetorician of the Senatus of Extremity!","And yet...she truly bowed her head in recognition and respect as off to the side, Erikson and his father turned towards each other in utter incredulity to make sure they were both watching the same unfolding reality.","Yet a moment later, in her slight bow, the Seer of Sima opened her right eye to see their dazed figures as the cane on her right hand quickly struck out twice to smack the heads of Erikson and the Extremity of Foundation while her sharp voice rang out.","[You buffoons are still just standing there in a daze? Pay the man his respects!]","...!","Both father and son were smacked on the back of their heads with the cane in the hands of the Seer of Sima that was a Low Grade Armament of Extremity, the pain waking them out of all incredulity as much greater strength was placed on the Extremity of Foundation.","He stepped forward, still filled with a sense of incredulity as he dazedly spoke out.","[I...I greet the Primogenitor.]","The words felt foreign and right at the same time as the Jewels on their foreheads shone with majesty.","Besides the Extremity of Foundation, Erikson also stepped forward as his tan skin pulsed with a vibrant radiance.","At this scene, Noah turned towards this confident Scion who always saw him as his peer with a slight smile.","As for Erikson himself, he seemed to barely see this smile as his emotions were tumultuous.","He was a distinguished genius.","He held the capability to alter Probability!","Yet in front of a being such as this...he was coming to realize that they truly were not the same breed of peers!","Maybe they were in the past. Maybe then. But not now.","'Ah...'","Erikson shook his head in a daze as the voice of the Seer of Sima rang out again while she observed this scene and Noah's smile.","[Don't make it too hard for them, O Primogenitor. They do not understand things in the same way that I do.]","As she spoke, she raised her head to gaze at Noah fully, especially the dazzling jewel on his forehead as she continued while feeling the immense weight she had to bear just to stare at him currently- a weight that wasn't there before!","[Each of the Seven Clans has a Source of a Primogenitor behind them, with most of them having not appeared before us in the eons that have passed as they all seek grander aspirations of the Gradations of Extremity. Of course, there are Records of other Primogenitors not connected to any Clans or Inheritances as they are even more carefree.]","Her aged figure gazed up as she spoke- as if she could see in immense reality in the far bounds of the unknown.","[The last time a Recorded Primogenitor of the Sima Clan appeared, he just talked with the Sima Extremity Overlord of that time as I barely caught a glimpse of him. He left behind a few Armaments of Extremity and disappeared soon after. You see...Primogenitors don't tend to live and stay among us, much less do they have a Lineage like yours that you are spreading freely.]","Her raised eyes came down again as she tried to lock onto Noah and hold her gaze steady.","[Across the veiled Records, I know of the Primogenitor of Steel, the Primogenitor of the Sword, and Primogenitor of Boxing among a few that have taken their distinctions extremely far in the Gradations of Extremity. I have yet to know of your full distinction...and what your purpose may be among us, Primogenitor.]","The cunning old woman looked at Noah closely as she waited for his reply.","At her words, Noah couldn't help but smile as he thought to himself.","His purpose? His distinction?","His figure shone with a multicolored glow as calmly stood and basked in brilliance, the jewel on his forehead pulsing as it sent information about itself in his soul as Noah spoke calmly.","[Though it's a bit early to say it, but my distinction is one you have heard before. The True Emperor of Quintessence. The Primogenitor of Quintessence! But...I have not arrived at the place where I can comfortably take on this distinction as for now, I am only the True Emperor of Quintessence.]","WAA!","They knew of the distinction of the True Emperor of Quintessence!","But the grander distinction of a Primogenitor of Quintessence...Noah could not take it yet as he had yet to even achieve Extremity in Quintessence.","Not yet, but the time would not be too far away!"]},{"number":2774,"title":"Chapter 2774: Chapter 2773 I greet the Primogenitor! II","paragraphs":["2773 I greet the Primogenitor! II","His words caused the Seer of Sima to open wide with light as he continued with a smile.","[As for my purpose? There isn't any grand design. I am not here to empower others to fight in some holy war between Existential Authority, nor do I seek recognition or veneration.]","[Just like all others before me, I have my gaze on the Gradations of Extremity. I have my eyes on Quintessence...on Infinity, and much more. What I seek the most is to see them at their absolute extremes. Any wars, vassals, allies, or enemies that appear before me on this path are just that, and nothing more.]","...!","As she heard these words, the Seer of Sima became extremely quiet and contemplative.","Noah gazed at her calmly as his mind continued to be fed with bursts of information on his ongoing transformation.","In the surroundings, the effects of his words remained just as potent on the Seer of Sima and others.","He was on his own path!","Any glory, veneration, or alteration of the very reality he was in was merely a consequence that occurred on this path.","A consequence of his existence.","The Vitalis Hyperversal Domains may get stronger due to his Lineage.","But this wasn't his true purpose. What he did, he did for himself. For his own path of Quintessence.","Noah knew this well as he wouldn't think any other way!","But yes. His existence...did have truly terrifying results and consequences on the landscape around him!","—","Across the Nether Havens of Extremity.","Millions of Awakening Radiances shone as a phenomenon that would go down in History bloomed.","In the Nether Haven of Oceanus.","Before the Havenly Bridge of Oceanus, droves of Hyperversal Savior's Ark entered this domain as Legions of Vacuous Malignancies spread out in large numbers, a grand war being carried out as opposing them- Legions of the Havenly Moon Clan, the Prometheus Clan, and the Ouroboros Clan could be seen.","Hyperversal Extremity Authority burst around in mad wonder as every single Extremity involved showed why the concept they took to Extremity deserved to stand on top.","On the side of the Havenly Moon Clan, the silver glow of the Extremity of the Moon overflowed as like endless meteors, silver moons thundering with power rained down towards the Vitalis Malignancies!","The battle was in a deadlock as supporting both sides were two Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities, with dozens of Tier 3s and thousands of Tier 2s and 1s battling against each other.","In such a deadlock.","In such a ferocious war...","HUUM!","The bodies of all of the Extremities of the Havenly Moon Clan began to glow with pristine wonder as their foreheads split open, a dazzling Enneagonal Existential Jewel revealing itself as thereafter...","BOOOM!","An explosion of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority bloomed.","[Ah!]","[HO...!]","Bellows erupted from the Legions of Vacuous Malignancies before them as many were knocked back as if they were singed by holy flames.","And to the astonishment of the members of the Havenly Moon Clan, they felt their Lineage churn as streams of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority flowed into their existence as they...underwent an Awakening right here and now.","Their First Vitalis Awakening!","...!","The two Tier 4 Vacuous Malignancies were astonished as the Esteemed Havenly Emperors from the Havenly Moon Clan were even more so, but as they affirmed the glow of Vitalis around all of their Extremities...","[Attack!]","WAA!","[Bathe everything under the cataclysmic light of the Havenly Moon!]","They erupted with shocking momentum to command their forces as the hands of the two Tier 4 Havenly Moon Clan entities thundered down, dozens of massive silver moons now painted with a milky white light of Vitalis tumbling down as they were followed by hundreds of smaller moons conjured up from other clansmen.","The domain fields of the nearby Savior's Arks were scorched as with undeniable might and tyranny...","BOOOM!","A cataclysmic attack rained down on the Legion of Vacuous Malignancies that the Havenly Moon Clan faced as 8 Savior's Arks were instantly shattered, hundreds of Vacuous Extremities perishing.","...!","The scene was utterly astonishing as the other sides of the battle paused momentarily.","From the Prometheus Clan and the Ouroboros Clan, a few of their Extremities flowed with the Enneagonal Existential Jewels, but nowhere near the number of the Havenly Moon Clan that had traded even an Armament of Extremity with the Infernal Havenly Commerce to attain large numbers of Blood Sources!","At this moment, their investment showed its results in a terrifying fashion that even surprised them, their Esteemed Havenly Emperors using this momentum as they cut towards the Havenly Bridge of Oceanus carrying Vacuous Legions over.","But at this moment, the very flow of battle had changed as there could only be a single result.","Such a scene occurred in Oceanus.","And also in Helios, Elera, Penumbra...and all locations that held Entities with the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage.","Vitalis Hyperversal Authority bloomed in concentration and number as the effects of this single phenomenon would echo out across Recorded History!","And the cause of it all...was a single entity.","An Entity that had unlocked the Quintessential Enneagonal Existential Jewel for others as for himself...he had attained the Quintessential Primogenitor Enneagonal Existential Jewel!","What did such a thing grant him?","Across eons of Recorded Histories. Within the Record veiled in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity that the Infinite Hyperversal Haven was hidden in.","Noah's main body touched the multicolored jewel on his head as his mind was illuminated by a great deal of information","[Quintessential Primogenitor Enneagonal Existential Jewel]: A construct born from a lineage spearheaded by you- its potential and breadth within the vastness of Extremity still unknown. At its most basic form, this Enneagonal Existential Jewel serves as a reservoir for Vitalis and Vacuous Existential Authority as after a passive and automatic accumulation of these authorities to a sufficient level, you will naturally be capable of expanding Vitalis and Vacuous Existential Authorities towards Extremity- you do not need to wait for your Fourth Awakening before this expansion. In addition to being a reservoir, it also acts as an Existential Engine that cycles and assimilates Existential Authority into your existence at an extremely rapid rate, allowing for your future Awakening to proceed at an even smoother and faster rate. The Primogenitor Enneagonal Existential Jewel is also intricately connected to your Lineage as it allows you to call upon and warp Vassals of this Lineage across any respective Existential Domain, and it can forge a Backup Existential Record for you and any Vassals that will automatically be sacrificed if their True Existential Record is ever about to be erased- granting then another chance at the continuation of their Records. Other features of the Enneagonal Existential Jewel are still unfolding as it stabilizes and entrenches itself onto your lineage....","...!","A simple and yet grand description.","It was also one that paved the pathway for Noah...to be capable of expanding the Concepts of Vitalis and Vacuous towards Extremity!"]},{"number":2775,"title":"Chapter 2775: Chapter 2774 All Three Aspects Scaled! I","paragraphs":["2774 All Three Aspects Scaled! I","From the description of the Quintessential Primogenitor Enneagonal Existential Jewel, it was expressed that Entities had to attain the Fourth Vitalis or Vacuous Awakening before they could even try expanding said concepts towards Extremity.","Noah didn't have to wait for this as even while he was undergoing his Third Awakenings at this very moment, the Fourth ones were far away.","The Enneagonal Existential Jewel stepped in to solve this issue as he could innately feel that within a matter of days, the accumulation of Existential Authority would reach the required level and grant him the right to expand these concepts!","This in itself was a terrifying capability.","Even more terrifying was that in mere days, he had truly progressed from the First Existential Awakenings and he was already on his Third.","Other Entities took thousands or millions of years.","And yet over the past days, he had been bathing in so much Existential Authority as in his point of view- it still seemed like it was taking too long!","In addition to all of this, the Enneagonal Existential Jewel could actually make a backup of his Records and the Records of those within this Lineage.","It meant that for those of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage...they would always have a safety net at least once in their lives to ensure that their Records would not be entirely eradicated and lost in the eons of History.","[Hoo...]","His breath was turbid with power as he breathed out Quintessence, taking stock of all that was happening around him as far below him in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, apart from Xiaomi and other Extremities undergoing their First Vitalis Awakening...there was his son.","The one with the highest level of purity of his Lineage.","His Quintessential Enneagonal Existential Jewel also shone with a profound radiance as even though he didn't grasp Extremity, his bloodline purity allowed his Jewel to amass such a dense concentration of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that he was currently undergoing his First Vitalis Awakening.","Such a reality meant that his son had successfully accomplished one of the things required if he sought to attain an Extremity Physiology!","But this phenomenon was unique to his son.","No other Entities that had yet to grasp Extremity with his lineage jumped to have their First Awakening yet, and after Noah's will affirmed how things were going with all of his bodies stretched out across Havens- he turned his attention back to himself as he had to hurry.","The period of time that the entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity would target him was nearing as yes, it was variable.","They would make a move at the most opportune time, and Noah could act in a way to create such an opportune time.","But he couldn't deviate too much when it came to how the events would have played out as one of the major changes he would make in the future to unfold...were the lives of Ayame and her Grandfather who would inadvertently perish just from being near him!","But even for this...a solution had just risen with his Quintessential Primogenitor Enneagonal Existential Jewel.","Noah smiled at the thought as his mind fully focused on himself.","On his Ninth Aletheian Haven being forged as the millions of branches of the Ash Tree IV of Gradation began to disappear, their authority gradually becoming used up.","And his Origin went ever closer towards completion as with the Boundary of Cultivation, the boons of the Ash Tree had taken the Ninth Aletheian Haven close to 40% completion already!","Then...there were the Innate Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians coursing within Noah's body- constantly dispersing waves of these two Existential Authorities as Noah looked like an entity bathed in white and black.","At certain times, his vibrant form almost disappeared into the flash of black and white as he seemed to be assimilated into Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities!","It was a sign of his Existence getting ever closer to them as in no time, two radiant beams of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities shot up with Noah at the very center as the heavy swirling of these magisterial authorities came to a stop.","[...]","And the prompts washed over Noah's eyes.","[You have completed your Third Vitalis Awakening!]","[You have completed your Third Vacuous Awakening!]","The two Existential Authorities brimmed throughout his existence as their respective Meridians had branches of their vessels entrenched into Noah's body, origin, and soul.","His Soul attained Extremity with the moniker of Havenly as it was more geared towards Vitalis, and his Body attained Extremity with the moniker of Infernal as it was more geared towards Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","At this moment, he saw that his layers of Aletheian Havens were tightly entrenched in both Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities as their Meridians wrapped around everything.","It foretold...what distinction and side that his Origin may take very soon!","[Your distinction as an Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable II Existence has been elevated to Absolute Hyperversal Inscrutable III Existence.]","[The discernment of your History, Realm, Authorities, Dynamis, or anything else about you is now veiled and masked against Entities that have only just stepped on the Fifth Gradation of Extremity- Entities whose Existence has only traversed less than a fourth of this Gradation.]","...!","A prompt that revealed a semblance of the shocking power of Tier 5 Entities came.","With the advancement of his distinction as an Inscrutable III Existence, Noah should have been able to veil his Records even against Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity.","And yet...it seemed their might was too astounding.","The breadth of authority they commanded was too vast!","It was to the extent that after going through his dual Awakenings in both Vitalis and Vacuous, he could only mask his records against Entities that had newly been traversing on the Fifth Gradation of Extremity.","But...even this was astonishing of a feat on Noah's end as he had yet to even step on the First Gradation of Extremity, and yet he could veil himself against weak Entities on the Fifth Gradation!","In Recorded History, who else could claim such an achievement?!"]},{"number":2776,"title":"Chapter 2776: Chapter 2775 All Three Aspects Scaled! II","paragraphs":["2775 All Three Aspects Scaled! II","His History was veiled from the eyes of weak Entities in the Fifth Gradation of Extremity. With this reality affirmed, his gaze went on to the other prompts that explained the surging Existential Authority flowing across his body.","[Transformation into the Vitalis Havenly II Entity is now possible!]","[Transformation into the Vacuous Infernal III Entity is now possible!]","[Your Manipulation of Existential Authority has increased substantially.]","[Hyperversal II Assimilation has been elevated to Existential Hyperversal III Assimilation.]","[Existential Hyperversal III Assimilation]:: The Sources and Origins of other Entities containing Existential Authority can now be desired and assimilated while granting 100% more Existential Authority. Furthermore, you can now choose to devour Concepts of Extremity bound to you or others for the purpose of traversing across the Gradations of Extremity at a faster pace. At its current stage, Concepts of Extremity that have only arrived at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity in power and below can be devoured...","...!","His eyes flashed sharply as he saw the description of the newly elevated Hyperversal II Assimilation into Existential Hyperversal III Assimilation.","Theoretically...he could now devour and assimilate the very Concepts of Extremity others held to empower his own.","This was somewhat similar to what the Boundaries of Plagiarism could do once elevated to Extremity- but it only stole the Boundaries of others and granted them to him as they wouldn't be devoured to empower other Boundaries.","These were the gains made from his Third Awakening as his body brimmed with Existential Authority!","One of the heavier gains was the capability of Inscrutable III Existence, and as he gazed at this distinction, Noah also perused through the information of his elevated lineage and its capability of Obfuscation which was another feature that only supplemented his ability to veil himself before others.","His golden blood pulsed across his vessels like thick molten stellar Panaceas of existence as the information bloomed in his mind soon enough.","Havenly Quintessential Obfuscation had been elevated to the extent that now, Noah could erase his existence passively and actively against weaker Entities on the Fifth Gradation of Extremity! It was along the lines of Inscrutable as with Obfuscation, now could not be standing inches away from an Entity that had traversed less than a fourth of the Fifth Gradation of Extremity as they...","would not be able to see him.","They would not be able to even perceive that he was standing right there!","All of these capabilities had set the stage for what was coming up as now...","there was only one critical piece left.","And just as his Soul came to focus on it...","HUUM!","His Origin pulsed with multicolored light as it devoured over 95% of the Authority of the Ash Tree IV of Gradation.","It was the hardest Haven to forge and it only took more and more resources the closer towards completion, but his Boundary of Cultivation truly elevated the authority he obtained to an obscene level as currently, 48% of the Ninth Aletheian Haven was completed!","The illusory branches of the Ash Tree seemed like evaporating rivers of reality as they released every last shred of authority they held, Noah seeing clusters of fantastical royal cosmos of Elera forming as the number jumped from 48% to 49%.","[...]","A second passed.","Branches of the illusory Ash Tree of Gradation disappeared one after another as when there were 5 branches left, the rate of completion reached 50%.","HUM!","His Origin pulsed with tense authority as prompts arose.","[You have reached the Unscalable Wall of your Origin!]","As if there was an insurmountable barrier that could never be crossed, the point came where before the completion of the other half of his Ninth Aletheian Haven, Noah would have to exceed the absolute limit of the Aspects of the Origin!","This was the only possible way that the ridiculous capability of taking the Sources of Boundaries linked to his Origin to Extremity could have been achieved.","And yet what should have been an arduous thing before...","[The Boundary of Cultivation flashes with quintessential glory at a barrier that seeks to impede your progress!]","[Your Origin mocks the Unscalable Wall and begins to tear it apart!]","WAA!","His very being was filled with unbound waves of tyranny.","His Origin laughed at the appearance of the Unscalable Wall as it continued to absorb the authority from the Ash Tree of Gradation as if this wall didn't even exist!","And in the span of an instant...","BOOM!","An explosive burst of a storm of authority erupted with Noah at the very center.","The wall demarcating Extremity and Non-Extremity of the Origin was torn down.","The last of the branches of the Ash Tree of Gradation disappeared as a blinding Sporos V of Extremity appeared in their place like a burning multicolored sun!","And Noah's Ninth Aletheian Haven...reached 51% completion.","...!","His Origin began to pulse and oscillate as all his Havens oscillated in a fantastical fashion.","A deep, ancient, and billowing might of Hyperversal Extremity Authority began to rise from the First Aletheian Haven and spread wildly upwards!","[You have gone past the Limitations of the Origin before attaining Extremity within a concept.]","[A Quintessential Achievement!]","[Your Origin is transforming into a uniquetype of Extremity Origin!]","Within his Origin, Quintessence overflowed as Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities began to turn extremely active.","Above him, reality shattered as massive Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of VACUOUS and VITALIS began to descend!","Just like his Soul and Body, his Origin took the step forward.","And due to this...","HUUM!","Noah found his Origin, Body, and Soul releasing a shocking light of resonance.","He felt his Aspects of Existence resonate and pulse with such a terrifying might that culminated into a terrifying set of prompts.","[All three of your Aspects of Existence have scaled the Unscalable Wall of Extremity before you attained Extremity in any concept!]","[An Achievement Unrecorded in all of History!]","[Your Aspects of Existence are undergoing a Resonance of Extremity as the Boundaries of the Body, Origin, and Soul are at the breadth of Extremity.]","[With your say so, the Boundaries of the Body, Origin, and Soul can be taken to Extremity!]","....!","A phenomenal achievement.","And it came with a phenomenal reward as since his Body, Origin, and Soul had all attained Extremity- why wouldn't the Boundaries associated with them not be capable of taking this step?!","But...","[No.]","HUUM!","Noah's booking voice filled with authority echoed out as the permission was not granted.","He had already made up his mind in the last day when he stopped the advancement of multiple concepts towards Extremity.","His sights were set on a much grander path.","His sights were set on Quintessence as the first!"]},{"number":2777,"title":"Chapter 2777: Chapter 2776 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! I","paragraphs":["2776 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! I","His Aspects of Existence all emanated Hyperversal Extremity Authority as Noah could choose to take the Concepts of the Body, Origin, and Soul to Extremity!","But these weren't the options Noah wanted to define himself with as for the most profound glory, it truly had to be Quintessence.","So he denied once more taking a step naturally to achieve Extremity.","And his Origin buzzed as it drank the Existential Authority stemming from the Extremity Rune Scriptures of VITALIS and VACUOUS that were spinning like grand engines up above for the third time.","Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority was filling Noah's Origin as all of his Aletheian Havens pulsed and became even more glorious- with the forging of the Ninth Aletheian Haven even being continued as the incoming Existential Authority was used as a fuel!","As all of this occurred, Noah retained his state of Quintessential Unity of Existence as he observed the profundities occurring within and around him.","He came to focus on his Origin that had taken a step forward as he asked himself.","How could he complete his Origin in a truly Quintessential manner?","How could he equalize the Havenly Authorities within and even add more?","The answer to this dazzling question...led Noah to look at the new construct whose backbone was forming in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","The answer he currently has in his mind for the equilibrium of his Origin...","was the concept of an Extremity Vein.","...!","Yes.","Something that could bring harmony to the authorities within him as well as provide a path forward after all 9 Aletheian Havens were built!","His will gazed at the current state of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","The backbone of the emerging Extremity Vein in the shape of an Infinity symbol as fully entrenched itself within and around Noah's home, with the upper layer of the backbone of the Extremity Vein being far above Noah, and the lower bound being below the Dream Aletheian Haven!","The center point of the symbol of Infinity showed a melding of many different authorities crossing and interacting with each other as they included Decreta, Natural Laws, and Havenly Authorities.","This...was what Noah was thinking of enacting for himself.","This whole time, the Infinite Hyperversal Haven was waiting for Noah to complete his Origin, attain Extremity in the many Natural Laws, Decreta, and Havenly Authorities as after that...the transformation that the Infinite Hyperversal Haven would undergo would be a Quintessential one!","Its Extremity Vein would be distinguished and be fully forged then.","So Noah didn't see why he couldn't enact his own Extremity Vein to circulate and equilibrate all of the Authorities within his Haven.","With such a thought in mind...he guided the ongoing change as the transformation of his Origin now followed his Will- the incoming waves of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority beginning to act as building blocks for a backbone of an illusory Extremity Vein!","And what would fill this not even formed Extremity Vein...would be an overabundance of Quintessence.","[The Quintessential Zenith Boundary of Ascendancy has been triggered.]","HUUM!","His body turned into an abyssal void that devoured all incoming authority as at the same time, Ascendancy was activated!","[Your own will is guiding the attainment of the Unrecorded Quintessential Existential Hyperversal Extremity Superius Origin!]","...!","Not just Havenly.","Not just Infernal.","It was Existential!","It contained both Vacuous and Vitalis as his Origin wasn't isolated to a moniker of Infernal or Havenly!","With such a grand distinction, it began to advance and transform as Noah's stupendous work and plans neared their Culmination.","—","At the same point in time.","Within the Supernal Haven of Helios.","The eyes of Noah's clone had only become more unfathomable as from the throne borne of Helios below him, his figure rose while staring at the Aurora of crimson gold light all around.","[The time nears.]","...!","His words were simple ones, and yet the expression of Extremity Solarium was filled with a blinding light of authority as the wings on her forehead flapped with glory.","Her figure at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity also rose as behind her, a dazzling Golden pair of wings erupted from her back- their color being many times denser than her skin as they seemed to expand over the horizon!","Her red lips moved with calm as she seemed to sense some fluctuations around Noah's existence that she either could not believe or simply chose not to show anything about it.","[I've looped in the relevant parties- with as little information as possible of course. All they know is to be at a certain location when I give them a signal. They've already come to their own conclusions and are prepared to act at a moment's notice as with this...the risk of the Vacuous Malignancies at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity being alerted is very, very low.]","Yes.","When some beings were sufficiently powerful enough, even uttering their names or discussing their history may turn their gaze towards you as any malicious intent could very quickly be locked onto!","Extremity Solarium knew a lot more information than others as even with all of this, she still held a slight worry for the Entity in front of her.","For everything she had seen from him, his life must be preserved for the eons to come!","[Are you sure that you will still be there when this goes down? You may be underestimating the power that an entity in the Fifth Gradation of Extremity holds. Even if an existence teleports from a location and seconds pass, Entities such as I can easily trace and follow your moving Records across Havens. And we wouldn't even need a millisecond to entirely erase all the Records of even an Entity at the Third Gradation of Extremity. If the enemy gets his hands on you...]","...!","The warning of the Esteemed Havenly Empress in front of Noah was a grave one as she sought to instill caution within him.","And yet at her words, Noah only shook his head with a smile as he thought about what he had planned.","[Even against an Emperor at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity, I can handle myself.]","WAA!","Words of tremendous confidence.","Words that made it clear that Noah was absolutely ready for the shocking play about to unfold!"]},{"number":2778,"title":"Chapter 2778: Chapter 2777 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! II","paragraphs":["2777 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! II","As she stared at Noah's unbreakable confidence, Extremity Solarium continued to gaze at him calmly and silently for a full 10 seconds before she nodded.","[Very well. Let the hunt begin!]","Her pairs of wings flapped.","A terrifying radiance unfurled as they beckoned the events about to unfold!","Far away from the Supernal Haven of Helios where Noah's Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable was standing next to Extremity Solarium.","Within the Nether Haven of Helios outside of the Extremity Vein of the Seven Havens.","In the domains of the Inheritance of Infinite Extremity.","The surrounding reality held floating mountains that seemed like stellar bodies of suns stationed in space, their numbers reaching a few hundred as atop each golden mountain...Aeonic Treasures of Extremity were forming.","The golden mountains were akin to starry floating islands that dripped with waves of Helios onto an endless sea of Helios before.","Near one particular mountain, the figure of Ayame and her Grandfather could be seen inspecting the Enneagonal Existential Jewels that had risen from their foreheads- Vitalis Hyperversal Authority swirling around them!","[I shall send all of this information to the Curagulus...it seems we need to obtain these Blood Sources for every single member of the Curagulus of Extremity.]","As he spoke, the Extremity of Flames turned towards Noah to see a similar jewel rising up on his forehead as at this moment, his gaze was a pondering one.","[Noah Osmont...it's been established that you share an intricate connection with the Infernal Havenly Commerce, I wonder if...]","His words drifted off as he felt the air around the entity before him change.","He seemed to have arrived at a conclusion or made up his mind as his gaze turned towards them, his eyes revealing an interminable light of mystery as his gaze locked onto Ayame.","Ayame whose genius had already dipped itself onto the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as at this moment, her soul felt a sense of unprecedented shock as her gorgeous face rose to the entity in front of him- Records telling her he was about to do something unbelievable!","But at this moment...it was no longer like before.","This time, when she raised her eyes to try and meet his, she felt a shocking sense of majesty and pressure as her line of sight could only stop at his mouth.","Like a veil was lifted as his true majesty unveiled itself!","And with a voice that seemed to resonate with the very Aeonic Annals of Extremity, his voice echoed out.","[Those who have helped me on my path, whether on a small scale or large scale, will always have this favor of karma repaid. For you...I shall give you a glimpse of Infinity.]","...!","HUUM!","His words were utterly shocking ones to hear as his figure moved, his hand suddenly appearing on her head as Ayame's visage became stiff when she felt her Oni Horn on her forehead become covered by his magisterial hand.","It felt like the weight of a Haven had landed on her as to her right, her Grandfather stared incredulously as his words continued!","[You have expanded the concepts of Heat and Flames as you seek the Aspect of Infinity from them. While this is a viable path to glimpse and get closer towards infinity, it is not the right one. Nonetheless, a glimpse can still be obtained. What is the Extremity of Heat? It is the calefaction and incandescence of anything one touches. If you seek to arrive at an Aspect of Infinity with Heat, you will need to be capable of emitting enough heat to power a Major Haven for millions of years. Your current Lineage paves the way for this as Heat...can be taken to Extremity.]","....!","Ayame's soul buzzed as she trembled in shock.","She could feel the Golden Consummate Boundary of Heat that she had taken to the 17th Layer actually break apart its shackles and take a step forward- a step she didn't even think of taking this early!","His words felt like commandments as the moment he spoke, this concept with her reacted as from his hand...he felt an endless blue light flow into her existence.","\"This light is...\"","Her sweet voice was hoarse as she couldn't finish her words.","The light emanating from him...didn't hold a trace of Infinity.","It was genuinely the light of the concept of Infinity!","He...was truly taking on this path that none of them could embark on towards Extremity!","BOOOM!","Around Ayame's figure, crimson gold searing light of heat erupted as her golden horn shone with a crimson radiance, the surrounding reality melting from the heat as from her- the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Heat began to rise.","Heat!","This wasn't a Planar or Innate Concept.","This was a Consummate Concept, that even if it was the lowest tier within this ranking...it was still Consummate!","And yet at this moment, Noah took such a concept within the body of Ayame and forced it to take a step towards Extremity.","[The further you walk across the Gradations of Extremity and focus on the Aspect of Infinity of Heat, you may eventually be able to grasp Extremity itself. But this will be long and arduous as in the near future, just simply change your path to Infinity itself...and not an Aspect of it.]","WAA!","His words shook her to the very core as she could feel her Aspects of Existence begin to change.","Her eyes were dazed as she tried to turn her head up to look into the eyes of this being she thought she understood, but she couldn't!","Beside her, her Grandfather question the unfolding reality as before they could even express any response, Noah's right hand moved from Ayame and folded into a fist as the Enneagonal Existential Jewels on their foreheads shone with a brilliant light, their figures beginning to forcefully disappear from this space.","[Practice well, and I will show you a glimpse of the true Extremity of Infinity soon enough.]","...!","WAP!","With a glimmer of golden radiance, their figures disappeared.","Now, it was just Noah's figure in this whole Domain, surrounded by stellar floating mountains glowing with a light of treasures at their very peak.","Within this Minor Haven, Noah floated serenely as a moment after, an illusory True Throne of Quintessence formed behind him as he sat down on it with majesty!","He chose the place.","He chose the time.","With shocking brilliance dripping from every part of him, his voice rang out calmly.","[If you do not try it now, there will be no other chance.]","...!","His words were seemingly to nobody, but Noah knew he had an audience.","And this audience...would have no choice but to show themselves and do what they came here to do as just now- they watched him expand a concept of Extremity not even for himself, but for another being entirely!","[...]","There was a moment of silence.","And then...the top of the Minor Haven fractured into absolute nothingness!"]},{"number":2779,"title":"Chapter 2779: Chapter 2778 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! III","paragraphs":["2778 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! III","The Minor Haven was filled with starry crimson gold mountains.","Its skies were a hazy Aurora of gold and red authority of Helios as at this moment, it splintered into nothingness as if it were mere glass.","Noah's words had brought this forth as he stupendously took Ayame to achieve Extremity, and then a moment later...he sat on his illusory throne while voicing out a provocative comment!","And those watching could not just still after it.","Those watching were doing so with great purpose as after seeing his actions, what they wanted to do- what they had to do was further reinforced as they made their move!","Now...what gave Noah the confidence to do what he was currently doing?","What gave him the confidence to provoke the very Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity who sought to eradicate him?!","The answer actually lay in something Noah had attained when his boundaries reached the level of Quintessential Zenith.","Quintessence was elevated as it produced the Sporos of Extremity and the Ash Tree of Gradation, yes.","But there was also Infinity.","Another Boundary of immense quality and standing that already had a terrifying 17th Boundary Layer!","And it was elevated even further.","This...was one of Noah's reliance.","[The Seventeenth Boundary Layer of Infinity]:: The concept of Infinity is a terrifying one to ever bring to Extremity as very few existences can withstand its meaning... Infinity leaves a path open that may just aid you in attaining Extremity- depending on how it is utilized, and it can only be utilized once in your lifetime. For a second, you can make any Resource, Authority, or Record within your Aspects of Existence infinite...","A few simple changes had appeared on this boundary.","Before, it used to be an instant.","He could activate this shocking capability for an instant as after this Boundary became Quintessential Zenith, this instant was stretched to a second!","And in addition to this capability being applied to Resources and Authorities, one more thing was added.","This...was one of the bases of his confidence.","This was why he remained seated on his throne as up above, the fractured space revealed the dawning and descent of three obscene auras of authority that caused reality to tremble!","DUM...!","A low symphony began to resound.","Time slowed and congealed.","For a moment, it seemingly halted and came to a stop entirely as extremely potent and dense Vacuous Hyperversal Authority flooded down.","And from above, a shocking scene unfolded as Noah stared at it head on!","Three Entities were at the forefront.","They were ones Noah had seen a glimpse of before through the Protagonist!","[The Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage]","[The Annals Inquisitor]","[The Primogenitor of Talismans]","Two were here for a singular purpose- the complete and utter eradication of his records.","The other...was the hidden identity of an Entity known as the Cimmerian Architect who seemed to be here out of sheer curiosity!","The Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage- the Prime Devour...he was a burly figure surrounded by billowing obsidian smoke as he looked like a burning obsidian sun.","To his left, the Annals Inquisitor was a robed woman veiled by waves of Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures of VACUOUS!","To his right, the Primogenitor of Talismans was also covered by a similar obsidian glow as her whole figure was a hazy configuration of light, but her hands were the first to move as trillions of square paper talismans had already erupted and were covering everything in the surroundings as if the veil of the night was coming down.","Even before an instant passed, a semicircle was already formed as talismans pulsing with Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures had nearly covered everything!","The first order of business that was seeking to be completed as soon as they appeared- the complete isolation of this current space as it would disappear from the very spacetime continuum itself.","It wouldn't even be within the Nether Haven of Helios anymore.","This was the first action done.","The other...was the only Entity here with his main body.","The Prime Devourer.","His figure had already moved akin to a billowing black sun as before an instant even passed, his grand visage had already crossed half the distance and seemed to be a breath away from Noah's throne!","His mere presence emanated death and destruction as the surrounding reality was being absorbed by him and disappearing into nothingness.","In this moment of stopped time.","BOOM! BOOM! BOOM!","Three consecutive explosions bloomed as a valiant voice cut into existence, with spacetime warping as the destination of incoming figures was forcefully changed due to the dense talismans that nearly covered half the space already.","[YAA!]","The voice boomed out from below as space cracked to reveal three dazzling crimson gold figures.","Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of HELIOS burned all around them as the very forefront, a woman ladened with golden skin and dazzling pairs of wings on her back and forehead cut forth at the very center!","Near her, a golden Willow Tree flung open space and hundreds of thousands of branches shot out like innumerable rivers of reality.","A distance away, an astonishing visage of a Three-Headed Emperor Lion could be seen as his mane and fur pulsed with golden grander, his eyes shooting out molten flames of authority as each of the three newly appeared beings...emanated grand auras at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity!","And they...were of the source of the Existential Authority of Vitalis.","Opposite them, there were also three Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity as their Source was the Existential Authority of Vacuous!","The figure of the Entity from the Havenly Celestia Extremity Lineage was bellowing out valiantly with anger at this moment as she realized...Noah had given her the time and place, but he had given her a time that was a millisecond less.","A mere millisecond.","But this mere millisecond was costly as it guaranteed their enemies who had made a move first would reach him first!","And the moment they reached him, it was over.","So why?","Why would he give the wrong time and guarantee a terrifying Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity would reach him?!"]},{"number":2780,"title":"Chapter 2780: Chapter 2779 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! IV","paragraphs":["2779 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! IV","It was a buzzing question in the mind of Extremity Solarium as she churned her Extremity Soul like an engine, half of her mind trusting that this mysterious Entity who had come to her knew what he was doing...but the other half understood the power that beings like her wielded!","They didn't even need a millisecond.","All they needed was an instant, and the records of anything Tier 3 and below could be erased.","Tier 4s would maybe take longer.","Above them, the Prime Devourer seemed to know this with surety as well as even with the appearance of Extremity Solarium and two other Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity, he didn't seem to pressed.","As if he had somewhat expected this.","The target he sought to kill was one that could alter the very course of the current war.","Of course, he was someone prized and protected as in seeking to kill him, he expected to have forces of Vitalis swarm into this location!","But all he needed was an instant.","All that the [Annals Inquisitor] behind him needed was an instant.","And in this time, the Primogenitor of Talismans would protect and veil them as the entities who had responded first and arrived here would be the only ones to deal with.","And that...his main body could handle.","Even now, he was ever closer to his target seated on the throne as all Esteemed Emperors here knew a foregone conclusion!","That this entity on the throne...was about to perish with his records entirely erased!","The Prime Devourer knew this.","Extremity Solarium knew this.","So her visage moved like a crimson gold meteor as she hoped Osmont knew what he was doing enough to at least last an instant in the hands of the Vacuous Entity who was already more than halfway towards him as thereafter, she would save him!","She would-","Triing~! Triing~!","Her will and the will of all beings here instantly became immensely sharp as they...heard a melody, nay- a symphony.","On his throne, even Noah's will buzzed and spread out as the low symphony that should have been emanating from him...was commandeered.","It wasn't his symphony echoing out at this moment.","And the source was instantly locked onto.","On the far right side- within the bounds of the obsidian field of isolation being enacted by a dense number of talismans.","A fantastical scene of another Entity could be seen.","His visage was humanoid...with his skin being filled with lustrous white fur.","His hands were closer to paws as on his rear, a dazzling white furred tail pulsed with might and mystery as his head showed an enigmatic figure of an entity that had the features of...a monkey.","Lustrous white fur covered him all around except for his limbs and face as this Entity had...an instrument radiating the aura of a terrifying Armament of Extremity in the form of a Harp!","And around him, there was another instrument that looked like a mandolin, along with a Lute that also spun around him and began releasing a hymn as both of them were also Armaments of Extremity!","...!","This new Entity was an anomaly for all beings here, Noah included, and as his fingers passed over the Harp while the Mandolin and Lute played off the beginning of a shocking symphony, this Entity seemingly felt everyone's gazes.","He gazed up calmly- at Noah first before his gaze speedily traversed towards all others as his voice rang out.","[Don't mind me as I will not be interfering. I am but a humble Bard appearing through space and time. The event occurring here today seems to be a significant one as I couldn't help but come to see which Symphony would be born from it.]","...!","His words were akin to a bomb to 6 Entities here apart from Noah.","Their eyes flashed in shock as they finally dawned in realization.","The Vacuous Esteemed Infernal Emperors knew him because it was their job to know every mysterious and powerful Entities Recorded within the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","The Vitalis Esteemed Havenly Emperors knew him because he was an unconfirmed Primogenitor whose legends were sparse, but they appeared here and there!","Legends of the Extremity of Symphonies.","He appeared across the eons of time throughout major events or battles, a symphony being enacted by him at that time as it was always something that would be etched on the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","The time that the Extremity of Steel finished forging 81 Armaments of Extremity, this Entity had appeared.","The time that the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification of the First Haven began...he was there!","The time when the Investiture of Extremity was first enacted, he was there.","The Bard of Vitalis.","The Extremity of Instruments!","The White Monkey!","DUM! DUM! DUM!","From him, a shockingly resonant beat and symphony began to resound.","His words and legends passed in the minds of all beings here as for the Prime Devourer, his figure moved down with even grander indomitable might as he arrived inches away from Noah.","And yet behind him, the veiled figure of the Primogenitor of Talismans- the hidden identity of the Cimmerian Architect...this veiled entity pointed her hands towards the Bard of Vitalis as laughter echoed out from her!","[Haha... it's fucking you! For you to be here as well...]","...!","Her words didn't finish.","At this moment, since the fracture of the Minor Haven above, an instant had passed.","And after the passage of this instant...the Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage arrived before Noah.","His eyes were akin to an endless abyss as his massive obsidian hands were right above Noah, seeking to devour everything about him.","Noah gazed up at such a figure descending before him as his soul and very existence buzzed at this arriving danger!","And yet, he was fearless.","He was the massive hand descend as from it, terrifyingly scorching Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures of VACUOUS and DEVOURING were working in conjunction as even before he fully came in contact with him...Noah could already feel parts of himself disappearing.","And all that this Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity had to do...was have the power to trace and locate where his records were hidden as within the span of less than a millisecond, he could erase everything!","And at this moment.","At this time where Noah felt parts of himself already beginning to disappear.","He gazed at the unbearable entity before his eyes as he uttered calmly.","[How can you eradicate something that is infinite?]","WAA!","A dazzling set of words erupted from him as at the same time, the 17th Boundary Layer of Infinity was activated.","For a single second, Noah made something within his Aspects of Existence infinite.","And he chose...his Records!"]},{"number":2781,"title":"Chapter 2781: Chapter 2780 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! V","paragraphs":["2780 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! V","DUM! DUM!","Heavy beats resounded out with an ever-increasing frequency..","The reality playing out was an astonishing one as the figure of the White Monkey buzzed with even more activity- the musical instruments around him, increasing by one as the moment the Prime Devourer placed his hand on Noah's visage- a golden horn appeared in the hands of the White Monkey, and he blew on it!","HUUM!","The booming sound of a horn as if it was the end of the world.","But it was ushering in something grand as a Tier 5 Hyperversal Extremity had gotten their hands on an entity that had yet to even condense a single Extremity Rune Scripture.","The result was already set in stone.","The history was over and done with. The ink had dried!","And yet with this unchangeable reality and knowledge they knew of...they were in for a surprise.","Records.","This was the thing that Noah chose to turn Infinite.","For what he wanted to do...for what he sought to accomplish- it could only be his Records that were taken towards infinity!","What he aimed for was something so utterly unfathomable that not a single other entity within the Vitalis Domains or the Vacuous Domains should have ever attempted it.","What he was gazing at was something Quintessential!","Now, what did it mean to turn one's Records infinite? What were Records?","They were a collection of everything that made up an existence. They were what had to be destroyed if one wanted to grant an existence True Death.","Records were one's history and memories.","Their very existence.","BOOM!","The moment Noah took his records towards Infinity, a phenomenal change took place as the Prime Devourer would be the first one to experience it!","1 Second for his Records to be infinite.","Within this one second, phenomenal change would occur as after it, nothing would be the same!","The moment the burly hands of the Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage filled with billowing smoke grabbed onto Noah on the throne, his power unleashed freely as thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures descended like a tide, devouring and eating up Noah's very existence as behind him- a purple light had already been established between him and the Annals Inquisitor behind him.","This light flowed from his hands as it isolated and directed his force directly onto Noah's records- burning with a blazing light that pierced into the Vitalis Annals of Extremity!","Part of the vision of the Prime Devourer changed as he saw his black flames devouring a golden line hiding itself through layers and layers of records, and he followed its destination as he could sense with the aid of the Annals Inquisitor that it was linked to multiple bodies across different regions.","Now, he just had to burn all of these records along with the main body as one millisecond was more than enough for this!","He followed and devoured the golden light that became wider and wider until it turned into a river.","And from a river, it expanded into a vast golden sea.","The first thing the Prime Devourer noted was that it was a sea of records vaster than any distinguished Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity.","But it didn't matter.","BLAZE!","His will containing thousands of blazing Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures then unleashed its might fully as the entire golden sea appearing before the vision of the Prime Devourer became scorched and disappeared.","[Now...the only thing remaining is the link to the main bod-...!]","After the vast golden sea of records was scorched, the will of the Prime Devourer buzzed as before it, he didn't see a like leading back to the main body of his target as...an extension of a golden sea far vaster stretched out before him.","And it only seemed to be getting larger!","His will flashed with brilliance as an instant later, his billowing obsidian flames boomed and changed from, a Titanic amalgamation of an Infernal Worm representing the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage appearing.","It held a hundred pairs of flaming wings on its back and molten slime fell and scorched all nearby records- its head being made up of a circular spinning jaw with trillions of swirling obsidian teeth as the moment it appeared, a light of singularity flashed within the center of these jaws!","[Infernal Devouring]","...!","And the vast sea of golden records before him and what stretched out in the distance all disappeared as if it had never existed.","The main ability of any accomplished Entity of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage.","And from the hands of the Primogenitor of this Lineage itself, it was utterly deadly as it could eradicate the Records of multiple Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities all at once!","The vast seas of golden records before the Prime Devourer faded in the face of the illusory Infernal Worm, and yet...the Will of the Prime Devourer buzzed again.","The swathes of golden seas of records...seemed like they kept going.","...!","It didn't seem like they diminished one bit.","[What!]","He bellowed out and prepared to continue devouring everything, but...","A millisecond had passed.","And he wasn't alone in this outside domain.","The valiant cry of an Esteemed Havenly Empress rang out in the outside reality.","[Celestia's Havenly Protection]!","BOOM!","A brilliant Golden light flashed around Noah's figure seated on the throne as a scorching pair of illusory wings appeared above, the burly hands of the Prime Devourer being rebuffed and pushed away as a sea of golden light filled with thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures unfolded!","The figure of Extremity Solarium finally appeared as with a grave expression, her will came to gaze upon Noah's figure on the throne.","She wasn't the only one as the wills of the two Esteemed Havenly Emperors she brought, the Annals Inquisitor, and the Primogenitor of Talismans behind the Prime Devourer all focused on Noah as shockingly...they still saw him sitting calmly on his throne!","The light in his eyes never dimmed.","The grandeur he released was not devoured and extinguished.","They were astonished, but none of them were more astonished than the Prime Devour who bellowed out a booming roar while his body transformed into that of a massive Infernal Worm!","His roar affirmed many things for them.","It told them that even after this Tier 5 Entity had his hands on Osmont seated on the throne, he wasn't able to eradicate him within the breadth of a millisecond.","This...was utterly unbelievable!"]},{"number":2782,"title":"Chapter 2782: Chapter 2781 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! VI","paragraphs":["2781 A Moment of Infinity, A Leap of Quintessence! VI","How?!","How did he survive when he was in the hands of a terrifying entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity?!","Such a question buzzed in the minds of all, and as if to answer them- the very cognizant will of Noah seated on the throne boomed out with a voice of utmost regality.","[You cannot extinguish that which is infinite.]","...!","BOOM!","Surrounded by[Celestia's Havenly Protection], Noah uttered such heavy words as around him, reality congealed and shuddered as the Extremity Souls of Tier 5s expressed themselves on this domain, a shocking battle now about to unfold.","The Three-Headed Emperor Lion of the Havenly Animalia Extremity Lineage appeared before the Annals Inquisitor, his head releasing molten flows of time-space as he uttered coldly.","[Spacetime Continuum Desolation]","Space warped and distorted as the surrounding reality began to change.","Before the Primogenitor of Talismans, millions of branches of the Golden Willow Tree shot down, the reality below Noah's throne having already been altered as a shocking Domain Expansion unfolded from below seeking to cover everything!","[Domain Expansion- Life]","...!","The lower end of the Minor Haven was entirely erased as verdant stellar rivers of light shot out with the massive Golden Willow Tree at the center and snaked above to cover everything.","And yet the body of the Prime Devourer continued its bellow as from above...","[9 Infernal Hells of Damnation!]","BOOM!","Thousands of Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures were burned as the top of the Minor Haven shattered entirely and no longer existed, pillars of obsidian crimson damnation and illusory Havens filled with obsidian flames appearing and layering themselves above!","This whole reality was entirely changed.","The pristine golden mountains within this Minor Haven of the Inheritance of Infinite Extremity became scorched and erased above while below, a few floating ones became filled with the verdant aura of life.","Forces above.","Forces below.","All at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity.","And at the center of it all was Noah who was covered by [Celestia's Havenly Protection], a dense number of prompts appearing before him at this moment!","[You are under the effects of the Celestia's Havenly Protection]","[You are immune to all attacks at Tier 4 and below for the next second.]","[You can resist 80% of all attacks of at Tier 5 for the next second.]","[10,000 Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of CELESTIA surge around and protect you for the next second!]","Prompts of the shocking capabilities of Extremity Solarium were unfolding as even more prompts about the Extremity of Life expanded below were about to come, but Noah tuned them all out.","He focused on the prompts about him as his very existence was currently feeling an unprecedented change!","[Your Records are stretching towards Infinity for the next second.]","[An unimaginable feat with unknown consequences!]","He felt all his Aspects of Existence buzz.","His soul, body, and origin obtained a sense as if they were being stretched out endlessly as he...couldn't truly describe this sensation.","His Origin that was forging the backbone of an Extremity Vein pulsed with ever grander fervor as the Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of VITALIS and VACUOUS above his main body within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven continued to rain down their authorities, the completion of his Ninth Aletheian Haven now reaching 90% as it didn't waste this chance!","And in the midst of all of this...all of the Loot multiplied by RUINATION that was leftover flowed into Noah's Origin to act as fuel.","He didn't channel it towards the Sporos V of Extremity.","It would not be enough to mature this seed, but it would be enough to aid for the last percentages of the Ninth Aletheian Haven that was urging its completion by refining and assimilating Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority- by establishing itself as the Unrecorded Quintessential Existential Hyperversal Extremity Superius Origin!","[An Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity has pervaded into your Records and sought to extinguish your very existence.]","The prompts continued to come.","[A Profoundly Quintessential Achievement!]","[The might of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity failed to erase your records!]","A blinding light of Quintessence overflowed within his soul.","It was so bright and potent that it gushed out of his main body, and the dazzling spinning singularity of the Quintessence Planalith Krystallos that he was refining this whole time...devoured these massive waves of overflowing Quintessence before a moment later- its rotations came to a halt.","...!","A multicolored crystalline stone now lay before Noah's main body as around it, Reality began to brighten up and become filled with shocking awe as all swirling authorities came to a momentary halt.","All authorities.","Vitalis and Vacuous included!","They all came to a stop at the birth of something so Quintessential.","[The Middle Grade Quintessence Planalith Krystallos has been successfully refined.]","[An impossible and unrecorded feat even for Entities that have stepped on the Gradations of Extremity!]","[Within the Quintessence Planalith Krystallos lies a Quintessential Seed of Extremity.]","...!","It was a crystal like stone about 9 inches wide.","It held processed, refined, and purified authority of Quintessence...that contained a semblance of Extremity.","[Your proficiency in the Modified Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art has increased by 10%!]","Not a Low Grade Planalith Krystallos.","Noah brought forth a Middle Grade Quintessence Planalith Krystallos in an unprecedented fashion due to an influx of achievements and waves of Quintessence, in addition to being in a state of Quintessential Unity of Existence and having his Records stretch towards Infinity!","[The Middle Grade Quintessence Planalith Krystallos is the second refined Krystallos from the True Emperor of Quintessence, and it has attained an impeccable level of grandeur as it is 100% effective in aiding the elevation of the Extremity of Quintessence across the First to the Fifth Gradation of Extremity, with its effectiveness fading greatly within the Sixth Gradation of Extremity. Forging something like this is an impossibility with the Golden Hyperversal Planalith Krystallos Refinement Art, and yet such a product was produced in your hands.]","[It's forging was an impossibility as when devoured only by the True Emperor of Quintessence, its fuel is theoretically enough to aid you in taking the step forward and arriving at the Extremity of Quintessence.]","...!","Another millisecond had passed.","Within a second, there were 1,000 milliseconds as so far, three milliseconds had passed since Noah activated the 17th Boundary Layer of Infinity.","Time seemed to be moving so gloriously slow as at this moment, Noah's main body grabbed the Middle Grade Quintessence Planalith...and he threw it into his mouth and devoured it completely.","A Planalith Krystallos with a semblance of Extremity...of Quintessence.","HUUM!","His Aspects of Existence buzzed as a terrifying multicolored light exploded with immeasurable intensity.","His advancing Origin churned as trillions of Royal Cosmos were forged, the booming multicolored light of Quintessence flowing into it as the backbone of the Extremity Vein being forged was bombarded by the heavy multicolored light of Quintessence!","So much of this multicolored light flooded into it as another millisecond passed.","And...","[The Extremity Vein of Quintessence is being born.]","[The Ninth Aletheian Haven has reached 99% completion!]","...!","Everything was coming to a close.","His Origin was about to be completed as thereafter, it promised the Sources of the Boundaries within it to achieve Extremity.","The Middle Grade Quintessence Planalith Krystallos was forged as within it lay a semblance of the Extremity of Quintessence.","And then...there was infinity as his records were being stretched towards it.","In this glorious coalescence of factors and time...Noah's will moved as at this time, he called forth the rewards of all Honorariums he had accumulated so far to be released.","[...]","THUMP!","The booming sound of a beating heart resounded, but it wasn't from Noah's body.","It stemmed...from the endlessly vast Infinite Hyperversal Haven around him as at this moment, this very Haven began to undergo a tremendous change.","[The forming Extremity Vein of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven is resonating with the Extremity Vein of Quintessence within your Origin.]","[A tremendous amount of Quintessential Feats and Honorariums have been accumulated over the last days.]","[Every single Quintessential Honorarium has only elevated itself from the last as with so many feats and actions of Quintessence, the Boundary of Quintessence can no longer deny it.]","[Your Body reflects Quintessence.]","[Your Origin radiates Quintessence.]","[Your Soul manifests Quintessence.]","An unimaginable radiance of multiple colors erupted from his main body freely as it began to travel towards his many clones.","Within his soul, this light was concentrated the most as at this moment, a Rune Scripture sought to form.","The light that surrounded it...was not crimson.","Nor was it obsidian.","Nor was it gold.","[You have opened the doors of an Unprecedented Path.]","...!","The surrounding reality flowed once more as now, utter wildness flowed with it.","DUM! DUM!","Booming drums began to resound.","[The Vitalis Annals of Extremity shudder at your achievement.]","[The Vacuous Annals of Extremity tremble at your path!]","[The Aeonic Annals of Extremity herald your achievements across it.]","WA! WA! WA!","A terrifying crescendo began to build as within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, a low chant began to echo out.","The chant...echoed out Noah's name.","OSMONT!","...!","Like a boom, it spread out far and wide.","Across Recorded History.","Across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","Within the Nether Haven of Dissolution.","OSMONT!","The chanting of a devilish name began.","Within the Nether Haven of Genesis.","OSMONT!","The chants continued.","An unprecedented reality began to unfold as across innumerable records, his distinction spread as his achievements were revered!","Within the Nether Havens of Extremity.","Within the Supernal Havens of Extremity!","And...even in the far away Vacuous Domains of Extremity!","His name was being heralded across eons as before his eyes, a glorious affirmation rose.","[You have attained the Extremity of Quintessence!]","...!"]},{"number":2783,"title":"Chapter 2783: Chapter 2782 The Extremity of Quintessence! I","paragraphs":["2782 The Extremity of Quintessence! I","OSMONT!","The chants were like a neverending chorus.","Across the Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Domains, they thundered out!","In the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","Within the folds of Records, across the vast Vitalis Annals of Extremity.","An isolated domain existed that had a floating landmass the size of a small world pulsing with Vitalis Hyperversal Authority, with transparent white grasslands waving gloriously alongside tall oak trees radiating Vitalis.","In such a place, the figure of a woman adorned in a white robe and silver hair could be seen floating with her hands outstretched- Vitalis Hyperversal Authority gathering under her gestures as it flowed into a forming Vitalis Planalith Krystallos!","In such a critical period of time during her Refinement...","OSMONT!","A booming chant exploded out from the Records all around her that instantly destroyed her concentration and flow of Vitalis in the surroundings.","[Motherfu-]","OSMONT!","...!","Her head rose and gazed out into the endless records with a glimmer of anger that soon turned into somberness.","The chants echoing out across the Annals of Extremity didn't stop!","Within the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","The Main Body of the Avernus Clan Overlord and Seer Amestris had gotten together as at this moment, their faces turned extremely dark as around them...","OSMONT!","A name was being chanted over and over again.","It was a chanting that showed a shocking level of honorarium that was heralded across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, and it didn't stop after a few chants.","In the Supernal Haven of Dissolution, near the Obsidian Saurischian Archipelago where Noah's clone used to be.","The visage of the Tier 4 Extremity Blue heard the same chants as all others, her face shining with even more madness and Lunacy as with every chant, her eyes only became more crazed!","And then, outside of the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains- within the region where Vacuous and Vitalis Malignancies had endless Legions currently clashing against each other.","In an area filled with overlapping Domain Expansions of different concepts seeking Hegemony, Emperor Shao turned his head up while surrounded by rotating white pillars of Vitalis that were defending against chains of Infernal Authorities in the distance.","He and all others in this region could hear...","OSMONT!","The chanting of a glorious name.","It caused their gazes to change as their Wills probed out around them!","Far away from the clashing Legions, within the Vacuous Hyperversal Domains.","Inside the Infernal Haven of Perdition.","Within a Minor Haven made out entirely from the bones of a Titanopillar Species.","A man shrouded in a blue robe floated before the massive figure of a Vacuous Extremity that seemed to be in a deep slumber.","Three women floated a bit further away from him as they were devouring the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Perdition coalesced into crystalline bone mountains around them.","The man floating in front of the slumbering Vacuous Extremities was infusing his will and soul into such an Entity as he attempted to scale an unbelievable wall of subjugating such an Entity- this man being none other than the Great Usurper, Noah Eckert.","At this moment...","OSMONT!","A glorious chant split open the Aurora of authority above them as his head and the heads of the three women near him rose.","The cerulean eyes of Eckert flashed with tendrils of blue light as the shock within them couldn't be veiled, his voice echoing out a moment after before it was drowned out by more chants!","\"Are you serio-\"","OSMONT!","With booming glory.","A chorus continued.","As for the Entity responsible for it all?","He was experiencing something new that even he didn't fully know what exactly would come from it.","[An Unprecedented Path has been brought to life under your lead!]","[Your very existence burns with Quintessence.]","[You have taken a step forward and embarked on the Gradations of Extremity, with Quintessence showing the way forward.]","...!","The prompts just came as thereafter, all light faded.","His consciousness seemingly came to a halt and became entirely dark as after the passage of an instant, he finally came to once more.","He was no longer gazing at the reality of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven or even the scene of the shocking battle within the Nether Haven of Helios.","He found himself...in what looked like a murky, dark, and extremely suffocating body of water that stretched out endlessly!","When his awareness came to, he began to see his surroundings better as he saw his figure anchored in this murky body of water, its tendrils wrapping around his body on all sides as if they were chains holding him in place.","And inches away from his illusory figure, he could see other figures all around him- their bodies showing dim glowing Golden or Obsidian Rune Scriptures on their chests as their glow...pushed away and even dissolved some of the many chains wrapping around them!","Innately, his eyes were drawn a distance away where he saw the illusory visage of Kazuhiko.","His figure was wrapped tightly by countless chains of murky light, and the dim glow of DARKNESS on his chest had shaken off some of these chains as his struggling figure was ever so slowly rising up across the murky waters.","His awareness turned elsewhere as he saw the devilish figure of Lilith, her face filled with the same struggling expression as everyone else- with the dim glows of HATRED, LUST, and a few more Scriptures on her chest cutting off the murky chains as her figure also rose a little higher in an extremely slow pace!","A far distance away, he recognized the illusory figure of Ayame whom he just elevated to Extremity.","A distance away, he saw the figure of the Kraken, Orion, and Aurelia!","The illusory images of Entities Noah could see weren't all on the same level as some floated higher than others, their bodies showing a constant expression of a struggle as they fought against the murky tendrils holding them in place- the glows of the Rune Scriptures on their body emanating light and slowly dissolving some of these chains as their bodies rose slightly higher every time!","None of them seemed to be cognizant of what was happening.","All they had was the same struggling expression.","None of them were like Noah, whose expression seemed calm and cognizant as his eyes and will gazed at the shocking scene of illusory figures around him!","Their numbers....were innumerable."]},{"number":2784,"title":"Chapter 2784: Chapter 2783 The Extremity of Quintessence! II","paragraphs":["2783 The Extremity of Quintessence! II","Noah's vision then gazed below him as past his feet, he saw the murky body of water end as further down, there was a congealed earth.","A solid state of matter as within it...the astonishing scene of trillions upon trillions of illusory figures could be seen entrenched on this earth- their hands raised up in a struggle as they sought to climb into the murky body of water!","He could see his son among the illusory figures with their hands raised high.","He could see Adelaide.","He could see a great number of people with their faces showing great torment and struggle as they just sought to grasp onto a line of demarcation that many would never cross!","HUUM!","At this moment, a glow began to radiate from Noah's chest as a flood of affirmations and information flowed in his mind.","Below him in the congealed earth that stretched out endlessly were Entities who had never grasped Extremity.","The further down they were, the lower they had achieved in their Boundary Layers.","Those close to the line of demarcation with their hands outstretched had arrived at the 17th Boundary Layer as they sought to enter the murky waters!","As they sought to enter the First Gradation of Extremity.","Noah retracted his gaze into this murky body of water once more as he saw the glow that began emanating on his chest...and it was the glow of Quintessence.","The moment it came to fruition, the countless murky chains holding his body in place began to burn and fall apart at a shocking speed!","When he gazed at his chest, he saw a Rune Scripture being into existence that read [QUINTESSENCE].","And this Rune Scripture...was colorless.","It almost seemed transparent as if it didn't exist.","Its radiance was much more domineering and tyrannical as while all other figures around Noah with their golden or obsidian Rune Scriptures had managed to destroy a decimal percentage of the chains holding them down, Noah's murky chains were falling apart from his body at such a shocking pace that within moments, his upper body held no more chains.","And as the transparent glow of Quintessence continued to spread over his body, he felt a shocking sense of freedom and power erupting out as with a flash of brilliance...","HUUM!","He felt great and irreversible changes occur as his whole body was covered by the transparent glow.","And at this moment, no chains were attached to him.","Like dried and dead roots, they all flaked away!","His figure stood there, unbound by any of the chains that countless other illusory figures were bound by.","[You have stepped on the First Gradation of Extremity!]","[The First Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE has formed, its immensity helping to constantly refine your Existence and acclimate it across the higher Gradations of Extremity.]","Prompts buzzed in his mind as he felt his Extremity Soul cheer the bathing of the Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE, his Body and Origin also burning with excitement as after becoming bathed by this light...they began elevating in power and might!","[The Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture is a type of Rune Scriptures that is unknown across Recorded History, with its capabilities and features only being written down after you test its limits.]","WAA!","Another glow began to bloom on his chest.","After the first Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE formed, another one also came to form as the intensity of the transparent light around Noah only became more potent!","His eyes radiated a shocking light of tyranny at this moment as he gazed around the other illusory figures bound down by their countless murky chains, while his body that was free of all chains...began to rise.","BOOM!","Like an erupting torpedo or missile.","While others seemed to be taking a snail's pace and moving a thousandth of an inch upwards, his body instantly shot up while surrounded by an immense transparent light as he crossed miles of the murky waters in an instant.","Around him, countless struggling faces were passed as the extremely murky waters only ever became slightly clear, with his speed being so fast that within a moment, he arrived at another line of demarcation.","The Line that demarcated the First and the Second Gradation of Extremity!","An innumerable number of souls were stopped below this line as when Noah gazed around him, he could see millions of Vitalis and Vacuous Lifeforms.","All of them struggling as one.","All of them seeking to find the same path.","All of them seeking to cross into yet another Gradation of Extremity!","Noah stopped below this line of demarcation briefly before his figure decisively shot upwards again.","HUUM!","Like an impenetrable layer, it stopped his advancement forward.","A great weight was pressed into his illusory figure that seemed to deny him entry- as if he didn't have enough authority or his Existence was not strong enough!","But the moment the second Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE was finished, the transparent glow around Noah only became more intense as his existence received another round of feedback and refinement- the demarcation that stopped him buzzing as he broke into it a moment after.","...!","The Second Gradation of Extremity.","The pressure here was more intense.","The waters were slightly less murky.","But in the surroundings, there were still a great number of illusory figures wrapped by many chains trying to move up ever slowly.","Noah continued to move up freely, but his speed had slowed down.","There seemed to be an active pressure pointing down unto him as unless he held more Rune Scriptures and held a stronger Extremity Existence, he would only get slower and slower as he climbed up.","But then...","HUUM!","A third Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE began to bloom as he resumed his shocking speed once more.","But this wasn't all.","Around his chest, over a dozen Colorless lights bloomed in the next instant and sought to come to fruition as their strokes...did not read QUINTESSENCE.","One stroke trying to come to fruition began with TYR!","Another stroke began with PROT.","Another stroke began with LOO.","Another stroke began with ASCE!","Different Rune Scriptures representing other concepts began to light up with immeasurable grandeur around Noah's chest, his illusory figure becoming bathed with an intense transparent light as against the pressure pressing down on him...he shot up at an even faster pace!","At the same time, his Will became more cognizant as he could feel the rest of his existence once more, his soul coming back into awareness of the outside reality once more as at this moment...10 milliseconds of the 1,000 milliseconds of his Records being infinite had passed.","The unfolding reality around his main body was utterly baffling to look at as away from it...the Infinite Hyperversal Haven was even more terrifying to gaze at.","Erupting seas of authority were booming all around as each of them...carried a trace of Extremity.","A maddening light of Manadynamics.","A burning glow of Entropy.","A halcyon glow of Dreams!","The Aletheian Havens shook and tumbled as immeasurable changes bloomed across them, the forming Extremity Vein that passed through all of them radiating a profound light at this moment as a myriad of colors began to flow across the infinity symbol that was this Extremity Vein- as if an engine was now becoming fully functional and cycling shocking might!","And the man responsible for this all...","His main body was surrounded by three swirling massive transparent Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of QUINTESSENCE, a fourth one beginning to form as in his immediate surroundings- similar lights of Scriptures just like this has bloomed by the dozens.","This was occuring because...","[Your Nine Aletheian Havens have been completed.]","[The Extremity Vein of Quintessence within your Origin cycles and equilibrates your Authorities.]","[After the elevation of Quintessence, the rest of the Concepts with their Sources bound to you are elevating towards Extremity!]","...!"]},{"number":2785,"title":"Chapter 2785: Chapter 2784 The Extremity of Quintessence! III","paragraphs":["2784 The Extremity of Quintessence! III","After Quintessence, all others would follow!","The Concepts of the Body, Origin, and Soul that Noah stopped before rushed towards Extremity.","Manadynamics, Entropy, Gravitation, Dreams, Avalon...all Natural Laws and Decreta surged towards Extremity!","And there was something unique every time a Rune Scripture formed and with Quintessence....","[The Fourth Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE is being formed.]","Prompt after another came regarding the Scriptures of Quintessence.","They were termed Existential.","But for other Rune Scriptures...","[The First Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scripture of CULTIVATION is being formed.]","[The First Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scripture of MANADYNAMICS is being formed.]","[The First Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scripture of LOOT is being formed.]","Every single one thereafter, without a doubt...was not Havenly, or Infernal, or Existential.","The Rune Scriptures of those from the Vacuous Domains had the moniker of Infernal.","The Rune Scriptures of those from the Vitalis Domains had the moniker of Havenly.","While Vitalis and Vacuous themselves...formed a type of Existential Rune Scriptures for those who could truly bring out their power!","Noah's Quintessence was termed Existential as every one of his Boundaries that followed was neither Havenly nor Infernal, instead taking on the state of [Quintessential].","Every single one...was influenced by Quintessence.","As countless computations surged within Noah's mind, he knew that the reason every other Rune Scripture that came after Quintessence was Colorless...was simply due to Quintessence.","But what did the Colorless distinction actually grant?","He had already discerned one thing as he viewed the murky endless seas of the Gradations.","Other beings could not see them.","When Xiaomi or any of his Vassals stepped into the First Gradation of Extremity they saw nothing like this.","They didn't even have access to such a scene!","All of them...held looks of desperation and struggle as they tried to move up.","Meanwhile, Noah was cognizant of such a shocking scene as all the shackles that bound him were torn, and he affirmed at this moment that he...could freely traverse across the Gradations without a worry.","[...]","The moment such a thought rose in his mind, all other thoughts came to a stop.","Why...would he be able to traverse back and forth across the Gradations?","Why did the Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE grant this capability?","What he saw greatly changed again.","The vast majority of his vision came to see the murky endless sea he was crossing the Second Gradation of as his figure stopped.","Around him, one Colorless Rune Scripture after another continued to form as when he looked around him, he still saw throngs of Entities of all races bound by dense murky chains, only portions of their bodies freed by Golden or Obsidian Rune Scriptures as they crawled up slowly.","His gaze turned down as far, far in the distance, he could see the struggling figure of Xiaomi.","With his eyes flashing with brilliance, he stopped going up and began to descend as with a thought...","WAP!","His figure actually crossed the Gradations as if they were a movable space and teleported right beside Xiaomi.","And then, just by following his intuition...his hand bathed in the transparent glow rose as he tapped on Xiaomi's figure.","An instant after, one of his Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of QUINTESSENCE pulsed with light before it dimmed just a little, but on Xiaomi's figure...","HUM!","Hundreds of murky chains among the countless ones burning her down were destroyed as her figure instantly rose up, moving a few miles above!","In the outside Reality, Xiaomi's figure that was floating far below the astonishing visage of Noah's main body like all other Vassals suddenly felt her existence tremble, and her power began to rise as within her soul, more Obsidian Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of RUIN began to forged.","...!","Back in the scene of the endless murky sea, Noah's eyes shone with brilliance as prompts rose before him.","[One of the features of the Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE has unveiled itself.]","[The Feature of the Quintessential Gradation Guider has been Recorded!]","Quintessential Graduation Guider.","He...could seamlessly traverse across the Gradations of Extremity in any direction as what he could do thereafter...","He turned his head even further down.","Past the demarcation between the First and the Second Gradation of Extremity.","Past even this, he came to stare at the face of his struggling son below the Gradations of Extremity.","His soul buzzed.","He felt like he could do more.","So while staying in place...his finger tapped out towards the far distance below.","And another one of his Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of QUINTESSENCE released a blinding radiance before dimming as around his son...thousands of murky shackles snapped and shattered as his hand that was right at the demarcation bellow the First Gradation of Extremity...climbed up and passed through a long with the rest of his body.","[...]","His son...who held Crimson Consummate Boundaries.","The highest Boundary Noah had taken to Extremity in his unique state of Quintessential Unity of Existence was a Golden Consummate Boundary of Heat belonging to Ayame.","And yet with a single tap from him now...","HUUM!","His vision shifted again.","He gazed far below him within the changing Infinite Hyperversal Haven as he saw his son's figure radiate a blinding light...and a Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scripture of DESTINY began to form above him as he stared at it in shock and stupor.","This...was what Noah could do!","His vision shifted again.","His gaze mainly returned back into the endless murky waters as after affirming what he could do, he got back to himself as his figure stared up again.","This time, he looked at the furthest distance his vision could grasp in this unique space as he didn't even resume going back up like before.","He merely...","WAP!","His figure disappeared in a flash of brilliant light as he instantly came to arrive at the demarcation between the Second and Third Gradation of Extremity!","He felt a heavy pressure come down all around, and yet he acclimated to it instantly as many more Colorless Rune Scriptures now surrounded him, and his figure didn't halt for even an instant as he pierced right through this demarcation.","BOOM!","His existence buzzed.","His Body, Origin, and Soul vivaciously ate up the colorless light being released from his many Rune Scriptures as all of his Aspects of Existence were strengthened, with Noah taking a few milliseconds to acclimate to the Third Gradation of Extremity!"]},{"number":2786,"title":"Chapter 2786: Chapter 2785 The Extremity of Quintessence! IV","paragraphs":["2785 The Extremity of Quintessence! IV","It was an utterly ridiculous reality.","Others were stuck on the First or Second Gradation of Extremity all of their lives as it took others hundreds, thousands, or even millions of years before they could cross these Gradations.","Noah....took a few milliseconds to arrive at the Third Gradation of Extremity.","And as he acclimated to the slightly less murky waters of the Third Gradation of Extremity, he saw tens of thousands of illusory figures with the same struggling faces all around him and continuing to stretch out into the endless sea.","Some with the Source of their existence within Vitalis, others within Vacuous.","Noah's vision spread wide as he gazed at the many Entities around him, his Will seemingly about to stumble into something when...","HUM!","Around his chest, a Runic Scripture reading ASCENDANCY happened to finish its formation.","The moment that the Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scripture of ASCENDANCY was fully formed, a blinding golden sea of light erupted from the depths of Noah's existence!","[The Extremity of Ascendancy seeks to exert its might after it has achieved Extremity.]","[Ascendancy seeks to elevate the transformation of the Extremity of Quintessence occurring due to his Ascendancy into the Gradations of Extremity!]","[The Feature of Quintessential Extremity Ascendancy has been born under the Extremity of Ascendancy.]","...!","The very extremes of Ascendancy exerted their might as the details of the newly enacted feature weren't even fully ascertained before a grand change occurred in Noah's surroundings.","His body that was covered with a transparent light of utter majesty this whole time erupted with a golden light that actually attracted the endlessly murky waters and tendrils of chains all around Noah towards him- and this murky authority of the Gradations of Extremity was then devoured by the halcyon light of Ascendancy released from the Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scripture of ASCENDANCY and turned into a source of energy that...","Actually caused the Rune Scriptures around Noah to finish forming even faster as new ones began forming at an even faster rate!","The new feature of Quintessential Extremity Ascendancy seemed to actually take the bindings of the Gradations of Extremity and utilize them to further elevate Noah's transformation as while an influx of information entered his mind, Noah's eyes released a bright light.","He once more gazed down.","His vision crossed the Third and Second Gradations of Extremity as he arrived in the first, gazing at the figure of his son who had just begun to rise within this Gradation as when he locked onto him, he spoke out with a tyrannical authority.","[Quintessential Extremity Ascendancy].","...!","A blinding golden light erupted around Henry as his transformation into a Hyperversal Extremity was vastly enhanced and elevated by the Extremity of Ascendancy!","Thereafter, Noah's gaze retracted into himself once more as he calmly stayed right above the line of demarcation of the Third Gradation of Extremity.","Climbing up was not an issue.","He was analyzing and making sure he wasn't missing any major things that were blooming with every Concept taken to Extremity as when he arrived at this thought, his eyes turned towards a concept that had not yet taken the step towards Extremity out of all the concepts he had.","And it was the one that he utilized as a fiery match to set things in motion- with a grand choice made from its 17th Boundary Layer due to his expectations for it!","He wanted to see whether a mere theory he held- whether a mere possibility he only imagined...could be achieved.","And as he basked in waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Quintessence, he wanted to make his theory into a reality even if he had to do it forcefully!","So he looked deep within himself and stared at the source of the concept lying quiet and silent even as all others advanced.","[What are you doing?]","His booming voice was directed to none other than the concept of Infinity.","Its light was boundlessly vast as it continued to stretch his Records, and Noah fully turned the light and might of the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Quintessence unto the Concept of Infinity at this moment!","Such an action was like a path being illuminated.","Akin to fuel being added to an ever raging flame.","It tipped the domino that began a shocking chain reaction as a moment later...","RUMBLE!","All of Noah's existence shook as the source of it...was his connection to the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","His Records stretching towards Infinity flooded across this channel of connection as his infinite records began to resonate with the Infinite Hyperversal Haven itself!","[An Unfathomable and Unrecorded Quintessential Resonance is taking place between extremely unalike Entities.]","[The Records of the Extremity of Quintessence stretching out towards Infinity are basking and flooding into the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.]","...!","The immeasurably vast Infinite Hyperversal Haven shook.","And a moment later, it stabilized with ease as this construct...had truly grown to a Quintessential level.","The formed Extremity Vein within it pulsed as the incoming records of Noah stretching towards Infinity were wondrously directed into this Vein in the shape of an Infinity symbol!","Thereafter...these records were cycled across as even though they were stretching towards Infinity, the Infinite Hyperversal Haven could handle them!","And at such a moment.","At the point that exactly 36 milliseconds of the 1,000 milliseconds of Noah's records being stretched towards Infinity passed...","BOOM!","His Extremity Vein of Quintessence and the Extremity Vein within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven pulsed with a multicolored light that went on to cover every stretch of this massive construct.","And thereafter...","[The vast Records of the Extremity of Quintessence are circulating across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.]","[The phenomenon has caused the Infinite Hyperversal Haven to actualize an unimaginable potential of itself as a Reservoir of Records!]","...!","The moment he saw this prompt, Noah knew.","What he theorized...may no longer just remain a passing thought of glory within his mind.","And so, he put all of his cards forward.","[The Will of the Extremity of Quintessence surges with determination!]","[The Infinite Hyperversal Haven resonates with his Will and moves forward.]","[The Infinite Hyperversal Haven seeks to utilize the Records stretching towards Infinity as the basis to construct the backbone of an entirely separate Reservoir of Recorded and Unrecorded Histories outside of the Vitalis and Vacuous Annals of Extremity.]","[The Infinite Hyperversal Haven moves to construct the Quintessential Annals of Extremity!]"]},{"number":2787,"title":"Chapter 2787: Chapter 2786 Decimating the Scales of Power! I","paragraphs":["2786 Decimating the Scales of Power! I","[The single use of the 17th Boundary Layer of Infinity is going on to forge an unfathomable construct.] [A glimpse of Infinity is being utilized and possibly stretched into permanence!]","[The Boundary of Infinity has reached a profound extreme and enters into the Gradations of Extremity!] Too many ridiculously important and reality altering things were happening all at once as Noah observed them all with utter care and scrutiny.","First, there was an idea.","An idea he held while looking at the Vitalis and Vacuous Annals of Extremity that were encompassed under the umbrella of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","He dared to think...what if he could enact his own Annals? His own library of Recorded and Unrecorded Histories?","To achieve this, he turned towards Infinity and the expansion of his Records- which should have theoretically affected the Infinite Hyperversal Haven that he was intricately connected to!","He just didn't think...it would work out so spectacularly.","At this moment, the Quintessential Annals of Extremity had begun its construction with Noah's endlessly stretching records as the building blocks.","And the work was far from being done.","Many things could happen as even something as grand as this could fail","After all...no other existence had even attempted such a ridiculous thing!","[And all of it...was made possible by a Spiritual Land from an insignificant world...]","While surrounded by dozens of swirling Colorless Hyperversal Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures, Noah's voice boomed out as it traversed across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","This construct...truly had humble beginnings.","And its current stage was an unbelievable one as at this moment, Noah saw the cycling authorities within the forming Extremity Vein of this construct rapidly increase their speed- a manifestation of Records in the form of countless Illusory pages erupted out and spread across these vast lands.","While this scene occurred, Noah once more focused on himself- specifically...on a brand new Rune Scripture that began to form within his Existence.","The concept that was causing the current changes in conjunction with Quintessence as even after Quintessence took the lead to Extremity and others followed it, this concept stayed still!","Noah now gazed at Infinity once more as after its actions of allowing a glimpse of Infinity were making way for something more permanent- something like the Quintessential Annals of Extremity, it was stepping into the Gradations of Extremity.","The strokes of a blinding Rune Scripture began.","And they...were not colorless.","With an astonishing cerulean glow as if it stemmed from an endless sea, a gorgeous blue erupted from this Rune Scripture and blazed out of Noah's existence!","A gorgeous blue that went on to cover and paint the stretches of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven and even the illusory manifestation of Endless pages erupting from its Extremity Vein.","It was so blinding that the visage of Henry entering the Gradations of Extremity had to avert his gaze and will.","It was so glaring that all other Entities within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven turned their heads down as if the brightness would scorch their existence!","Such a blinding light originated from Noah as the first Rune Scripture of Infinity twisted and turned, its strokes somehow forming the Infinity symbol before it branded itself into Noah's soul.","[The First Cerulean Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of INFINITY has formed, its immensity helping to constantly refine your Existence and speedily traverse the higher Gradations of Extremity.] [The Cerulean Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of Infinity is a type of Rune Scripture that is unknown across Recorded History, with its color chosen by the concept of Infinity itself as its capabilities and features only written down as you test its limits.] ...!","The Rule Scripture of Infinity did not get shaded by the grandeur of Quintessence.","It did not obtain the moniker of a Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scripture like all others that followed Quintessence as it was also its own Existential Extremity Rune Scripture!","And it chose its own color and distinction as it went with an ultramarine hue that was so blinding- to the extent its initial burst of light forced all others to turn their gazes down.","As soon as it formed...","BUZZ!","It radiated a domineering ultramarine light that pulsed and clashed with the dominant Colorless light of Quintessence!","...!","Noah's soul buzzed as his eyes turned somber.","[The Existential Authority of Infinity burns with endless glory!]","[The Existential Authority of Quintessence burns with unfathomable majesty!]","His Existence received a massive shock as these two Existential Authorities seemingly came to clash, with Noah's eyes releasing a light of Tyranny as before such a phenomenon could get out of control, his Existence pulsed with undeniable power that grasped on the Sources of both of these concepts that he controlled.","[The One Who Led Quintessence and Infinity exerts his undeniable authority.]","HUM!","The One Who Led Quintessence and Infinity.","This was his distinction as both of these Existential Authorities came to be because of him!","He expanded their first Boundary Layers all the way to the Seventeenth Layer.","He bound their Sources as no matter their brilliance, they were ultimately his tools!","He reigned in their sources as their blinding lights and brilliance melded into his soul silently, the single Cerulean Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of INFINITY glaring silently and with glory at the now Nine Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of QUINTESSENCE.","Their brilliance found their respective as thereafter, the Rune Scripture of Infinity did not sit still.","It turned its gaze towards the unfolding phenomenon of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as while stirred and directed by Noah's Soul... [The Cerulean Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of Infinity is acting as the Architect of the Quintessential Annals of Extremity.] Infinity flashed with splendid brilliance as simultaneously...","[The Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE is acting as the Architect of the Quintessential Annals of Extremity.] ...!","The backbone was already being built by the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Now, both the Existential Authorities of Infinity and Quintessence led as the architects of these astounding Annals of Extremity!"]},{"number":2788,"title":"Chapter 2788: Chapter 2787 Decimating the Scales of Power! II","paragraphs":["2787 Decimating the Scales of Power! II","Both Infinity and Quintessence led the way as the Architects of the Quintessential Annals of Extremity.","And instantly, the trillions of illusory pages being released from the Extremity Vein became all that much more solid- and they melded and fused into the reality of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as a moment later...immense silence descended all around as if all noise was cut off.","As if all senses were momentarily cut off.","And only before Noah's will did a burst of information pass.","[The Records of the Extremity of Quintessence are his own.]","[The Records of the Quintessential Annals of Extremity are distinct and separate as any Recorded and possible Unrecorded Histories of the Extremity of Quintessence and those associated with him are being stricken off from the Vitalis and Vacuous Annals of Extremity!] ...!","A phenomenal prompt came.","A prompt...that had tremendous repercussions and long lasting effects.","-","Within the Supernal Havens of Extremity.","In the furthest reaches of the Supernal Haven of Genesis, austere white liquified Havenly Extremity Authority of Genesis floated into streams and circled a circular singularity of light that was the size of a grain of sand.","This singularity seemed to always twist and distort space as it was currently within the Supernal Haven of Genesis, but days ago, it was warped into the Supernal Haven of Penumbra!","Its exterior was covered by hundreds of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of Havenly Authorities, such a dense yet silent convergence of power being enough to ground even an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity with a mere exertion of pressure.","And within this singularity, an astonishing scene could be observed.","As if entering an entirely new record of Reality, a paradisiacal space filled with rising flames of Havenly Authorities surrounded a massive obsidian Blacksmith's Forge that looked like an ancient castle unseen even in the olden times.","And this Forge had at its very center a crimson gold hammer that was currently smashing down by itself- its target actually being a miniaturized Minor Haven that was clustered together with a metalloid giving off waves of Extremity Authority!","Tens of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures of FORGING and SMITHING swirled around this hammer as it pounded down ever so often.","Around this austere forge, one could see a few hundred Armaments of Extremity displayed on its walls or floating around it with serenity- ranging from Armor, Helms, Axes, Spears, Swords, Vessels, and more.","One particular Armament was held in the hands of the only Entity within this domain, his burly brose hands grasping a Chalice radiating the glow of a Middle Grade Armament of Extremity as it shone with a golden light of Helios.","The Entity holding it was humanoid in his current form as his figure was a robust and sizable one, his arms thick from constant work as rolling muscles were powerfully hidden within.","His face carried a sense of age and mystery, as well as profound calmness and power as his dark hair messily arrived at his shoulders.","His upper body and its bulging bronze muscles were laid bare as black briefs radiating the glow of a Middle Grade Armament of Extremity covered his lower half.","This being was currently staring at the golden chalice within his hands as the Halton liquid within it was buzzing due to no other fact but... OSMONT!","The chorus of veneration and honor that bellowed out the name of a single being over and over again with a booming symphony.","The Eyes of the Extremity of Steel were calm as he listened to the chorus around him, his gaze complex as he seemed to be thinking about something else as he sighed.","[One more to add to the tally...but what difference does it make?]","Words holding great age and mystery echoed out from him as he listened to the profound symphony, comparing it to others he had heard in the past as... OSM-","...!","His head rose.","He looked around.","He listened.","And...he heard nothing.","The booming chorus of honor and glory along with the chanting of the name had suddenly been cut off.","And this Entity knew it was forcefully cut off as he felt the very Records of this chanting disappear- as if they never existed!","His eyes blinked with a trace of surprise as he peered deeper.","Hundreds of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures swirled around him from just a few concepts as he sought the Records of what had just occurred.","And his eyes went from surprise to astonishment as he...couldn't find any records of the glory and honorarium that was just being chanted.","As if it had never even existed!","[What...]","What had caused the chanting to cease? What happened to even the Records of this that even he could not find them?","Across the Vitalis and Vacuous Annals of Extremity, there were truly very little that he could not access.","HUUM!","His burly hand formed into a fist at this moment as around it, a dense cluster of Polychrome Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of VITALIS bloomed as he uttered out a name.","[OSMONT...]","The name that was being honored and glorified just moments ago.","He knew of this being as the Vitalis Annals of Extremity whispered traces of the happenings of the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","He knew of Noah Osmont and other rising figures amidst the Last Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification.","But he never actively sought information and records of this being before...until now.","And as he did so...","[....?]","He couldn't find anything.","He couldn't locate even a trace of Records...of Noah Osmont.","Not that his records were veiled by some fearsome power, or somehow hidden in the furthest reaches of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity that even he could not access.","He turned his head to the Vacuous Annals of Extremity as even there, he received the same feedback.","That Noah Osmont...did not exist.","There were absolutely no records of him!","It was a finding that caused this powerful Primogenitor to turn entirely somber!"]},{"number":2789,"title":"Chapter 2789: Chapter 2788 Decimating the Scales of Power! III","paragraphs":["2788 Decimating the Scales of Power! III","What the Aeonic Annals of Extremity were telling the Primogenitor of Steel...was that the Records of Noah Osmont did not even exist.","As if this being had never moved across the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","As if he hadn't intricately interacted with multiple entities within it as his actions gradually caused shifts on a large scale!","And the Primogenitor of Steel...was not the only one.","Within the Domains of the Sima Clan.","The adulations and choruses of Noah's name were ringing within its walls as the visage of the old Seer of Sima gazed at him with shock, but with mere milliseconds passing...these adulations of his glory were suddenly brought to a halt.","Around the figure of Noah's clone, blinding light has only just begun to shine, but before the eyes of the Seer of Sima, Erikson, and the Extremity of Foundation...every trace of authority and aura around him receded and was entirely erased!","And in the next moment...the Seer of Sima gasped as her ancient eyes shook.","She had felt many shocking things in this very instant as the biggest one caused her to gaze towards Noah's visage with a trace of shock and dismay.","[Primogenitor...I cannot feel you anymore.]","...!","She could feel a faint sense of connection this whole time through her lineage as through it, she had been able to send communications to whoever lay at the top of this Lineage- the being she now stood in front of!","Yet currently, she couldn't feel this connection at all as she felt a sense of loss and isolation, and yet at the same time...she could feel her blood churning and boiling as the Lineage from this Primogenitor should have been getting her another elevation.","But even as this was happening, she still felt a sense of grand loss.","As if she was partly included in a great lineage, but something so tremendously significant had occurred as at the same time, she felt entirely cut out of something unfathomable.","This feeling that the Seer of Sima felt close at hand...was something that all holders of the Havenly Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage would gradually come to feel as the Records of the Extremity of Quintessence were stricken off entirely from the Vacuous and Vitalis Annals of Extremity, and yet his footprints still remained within these domains as unless they completed the transition and stepped foot into the Infinite Hyperversal Haven... They would forever feel this sense of loss.","As if they were part of something grand, and yet they didn't have access to it, and nor could they obtain more information about it!","Even now as the Seer of Sima gazed at the visage of Noah's clone, it felt like he was enshrouded in a hazy light as if he would disappear right before her eyes any second.","This was what she experienced.","Far from the Sima Domains, within the Nether Haven of Helios where a conflict had begun in and yet currently...it was taking place in a spacetime continuum veiled within layers of Records and Talismans that other entities could not even access.","In such a domain, the Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity and the uninvolved White Monkey- the Bard of Vitalis...were all gazing with scrutiny at Noah's figure that was seated on the throne calmly while around them, his veneration and adulations had been ringing out!","When the symphony of his name began to echo out, the Bard of Vitalis had stopped playing as he closed his eyes and listened to the playing symphony- this shocking entity being in his own groove.","Extremity Solarium was entangled with the Prime Devourer as a Titanic armored celestial form was taken by her that pushed back tens of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures surrounding the Infernal Worm of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage that only continued to blaze with power with every passing millisecond.","The Plantae and Animalia Fifth Gradation of Extremity Entities were entangled with the Annals Inquisitor and the Primogenitor of Talismans as undoubtedly...portions of their wills were focused on the Entity still seated on a throne amidst their shocking battle as they could feel something grand from him!","The moment that his name began to be sung in adulations, his body had erupted with a Colorless light that actually...caused the Crimson Hyperversal Havenly and Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures swirling around each of them to buzz with a sense of oppression.","[...!]","Yes.","This was what caught their attention the most as they were truly powerful beings that knew a great deal of things.","When they asked themselves what kind of authority- what kind of power could show a sense of oppression against Crimson Rune Scriptures...there was only a single answer.","That answer was Existential.","But this...was a power reserved by powerful Primogenitors that could truly bring out the true extent of Vacuous and Vitalis!","It was reserved for beings who had undergone more than Five Existential Awakenings as far as they knew!","So how did this Entity before them who should have just been stepping into the stage of Extremity show a glimpse of such a power?","Was this the reason for his adulation?!","These buzzing questions rose in their minds as before they could be answered, an equally terrifying Cerulean light also flashed from his body ever so briefly as it caused their Crimson Rune Scriptures to feel the same sensation, but a moment after that... OSM-","WAP!","All of this light faded.","At the same time, the symphony of Adulations stopped.","The aura Noah had just begun to reveal entirely disappeared as on his throne, his eyes opened as for the first time, he began to rise.","...!","The moment the symphony of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity was cut off, a light of surprise flashed on the eyes of the Primogenitor of Talismans who was the veiled identity of the Cimmerian Architect.","And right after the abrupt end of the chorus of his name...the Bard of Vitalis opened his eyes once more as an obsidian gold guitar emanating the profound light of a Middle Grade Armament of Extremity appeared in his hands, his human like fingers instantly landing on their chords as he began a booming beat!","HUUM!"]},{"number":2790,"title":"Chapter 2790: Chapter 2789 Decimating the Scales of Power! IV","paragraphs":["2789 Decimating the Scales of Power! IV","The chords of the guitar were resonant!","The Bard of Vitalis had his monkey like visage radiate a profound light as around his white fur, a few hundred thousand Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures began to swirl as the symphony he was creating right after Noah's ended seemed to affect him at a fundamental level.","At the same time, his head began to bop up and down as around him, illusory golden drums appeared as a heavy and victorious beat joined the symphony of the guitar.","It was a beat that seemed to be welcoming the rise of the Extremity of Quintessence from his throne as he gazed at the Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity before him with a sharp gaze!","His Records were retracted from the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","His existence was veiled and hidden from all others as they didn't even know about the existence of the Quintessential Annals of Extremity that were being forged right now!","If they couldn't even access these records...what would they be able to do to him?","Even the Tier 5 Entities before him that seemed like an insurmountable wall would not be able to kill him- even if he didn't have the state of his Records stretching out towards Infinity.","At the same time, as he fully stepped into the Gradations of Extremity and slowly became familiar with the many concepts arriving at their extremes...he wondered something.","Just like his wonderings and musings of the Quintessential Annals of Extremity, he would see if he could make this musing into a reality.","So on the mark of 45 milliseconds after his records stretched towards Infinity and the Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage attacked him, he rose from his throne without a single trace of aura or power as he gazed up at the apocalyptic reality above under the influence of a Domain Expansion...and his voice echoed out.","[I wonder...what will be enough before I can put you at the heels of my feet, O Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax.]","...!","What would be enough?","How many Colorless and Cerulean Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures did he have to attain? What Gradation did he have to reach before he could look at the terrifying being and power above him...and then thoroughly suppress it?","This was a daring question that the moment it was uttered out, the visage of the Infernal Worm above pulsated with utmost glory and offense.","The Prime Devourer did not like the flow of the current reality.","Things were taking too long, and the one involved was showing a great deal of mystery!","It had to end, and it had to end quickly.","So the countless swirling teeth on his worm-like body churned and cut apart reality as his thundering voice echoed out.","[Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Descent.]","HUUM!","So his power as a Primogenitor unfurled.","He called upon his Lineage and all the power he held that he spearheaded.","Behind him, the illusion of trillions upon trillions of worms flashed with a light of apocalypse as they descended unto the current reality, all of them coming to fuse from trillions of illusory lights until two massive illusory Infernal Worms with a hundred pairs of obsidian flaming wings and heads that had countless swirling jagged teeth.","The expression on Extremity Solarium changed drastically as these two Infernal Worms instantly bypassed her left and right, her figure that was surrounded by a celestial image of a Havenly Celestia Extremity trying to turn unsuccessfully as the main body of the Prime Devourer thundered down with indomitable might and tens of thousands of swirling Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures!","It momentarily tied her up as in the reality below, two massive and interminable illusory figures of Infernal Worms called upon by the descent of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage itself...thundered down from Noah's left and right sides.","Two forces emanating power at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity came for him from two separate directions as...could the Extremity of Quintessence be capable of doing anything against it?","The gaze of the Extremity of Quintessence was a cold one as while gazing at these coming attacks, an unseen colorless brilliance began to wrap around his body as...his vision changed.","He viewed himself once more in the murky waters where he had arrived within the lowest bounds of the Third Gradation of Extremity.","He had yet to move a single step upwards, and yet around his body, scintillating Colorless Hyperversal Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures were blazing in abundance as after over 100 Concepts were taken to Extremity...the number of Rune Scriptures formed in the last few milliseconds reached 999!","This wasn't to mention the 9 Cerulean Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of INFINITY that were forming at a faster pace than all others- coming to match the rate of formation of the Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of QUINTESSENCE.","His Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures were grander than the common Crimson, Obsidian, or Golden Rune Scriptures that other beings held.","He didn't know by how much, but the rulings of how many Rune Scriptures demarcated the different Gradations of Extremity...were not applicable to him as he had to set his own rules that respected his Rune Scriptures!","So after he saw them spill over 1,000, his eyes rose up again as he stared out into the expanse of murky waters around him.","Tens of thousands of shackled beings could be seen all around him as even though they had broken and torn off some of the murky chains, they were still bound.","They were still not free.","In such a space, a blinding Colorless and Cerulean light blazed from Noah as he took a single step upwards, and his figure disappeared.","BOOOM!","An explosive book reverberated out as the waters where he was just at churned, his visage actually warping across the Third Gradation of Extremity as when he reappeared... BUZZ!","His eyes stared at a buzzing layer of heavy obstruction and uncrossable authority that was...the Demarcation between the Third and the Fourth Gradation of Extremity.","[...]","A single step.","This was all it took for him to go from the early stages of the Third Gradation of Extremity and to its Zenith.","The same stage that the Adjudicator of Dissolution was at when Noah first met her.","The same stage that was right at the cusp of another layer of brilliance that many never crossed in their lives!","HUUM!","As he arrived at the Zenith of the Third Gradation of Extremity, Noah felt the Extremity of Ascendancy once more devour the authority of the murky waters around him greedily as even more Rune Scriptures formed on his body, and his Body, Origin, and Soul continued to be refined and elevated by them as his Existence acclimated to this level of the Gradation of Extremity!","And as he peered ahead into the Fourth Gradation of Extremity that he had to cross the line of...","[You have come across the first Major Gradation of Extremity that many Entities with lesser Concepts of Extremity cannot easily cross.] [The Demarcation of the Fourth Gradation of Extremity seeks to test the worthiness of your Concepts of Extremity!]","A heavy light of pressure and majesty barreled out and tried to descend into his body.","The moment it did so...","[The Extremity of Cultivation gazes with endless disdain at the bottleneck seeking to hinder your Ascension!]","A blinding light of brilliance shone!"]},{"number":2791,"title":"Chapter 2791: Chapter 2790 Decimating the Scales of Power! V","paragraphs":["2790 Decimating the Scales of Power! V","It was a blinding light of brilliance that disdained the first Major Gradation of Extremity!","This Demarcation actually sought to test Noah's concepts as Quintessence and Infinity didn't even have to reveal their brilliance as Cultivation came forth.","[The Extremity of Cultivation denounces any bottlenecks in front of you.]","[So long as your Existence has achieved a sufficient level of refinement under the Gradations of Extremity, it will naturally bypass any bottlenecks under the authority of the Extremity of Cultivation!] There was a flash of brilliance.","The pressure descending unto Noah as if to test him of his worthiness was shattered as 9 Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of CULTIVATION blared grandly, Noah's very Existence experiencing a continuous round of Refinement and elevation as his body began to rise!","And as he crossed the Zenith Third Gradation of Extremity, every inch seemed to grant his existence bursts of an influx of power as his illusory figure hungrily devoured the murky seas of the Gradations of Extremity- his Rune Scriptures exploding in number as they instantly doubled to over two thousand in the next moment.","The blinding light around his figure only became more brilliant as by the time he came to touch the line of demarcation of the Third and Fourth Gradation of Extremity...the number of Rune Scriptures around him buzzed and tipped over 3,000.","His fair fingers wrapped in this brilliance touched the Major Gradation ahead as in the next moment, as if it weren't even a barrier... POP!","Like a bubble popping, he slid through to instantly arrive into the Fourth Gradation of Extremity.","[...]","Tier 4.","The stage of true powerhouses and even Extremity Overlords that spearheaded Clans and Major Inheritances.","On the 46th Millisecond after he stretched Infinity towards Extremity, Noah arrived at such a stage.","Within a mere fraction of a second- in its 46th Millisecond to be exact, he jumped from Tier 1 to Tier 4!","He didn't wait for hundreds, thousands, or millions of years- he truly only took milliseconds.","Which Extremity could compare?","Which other being could claim such honorariums?!","[A Quintessential Achievement!]","[You set the Records of the Quintessential Annals of Extremity as every action you take will be considered a baseline for others to look up to and be compared against.] [The more that others cannot come close to your accomplishments, the grander their Honorariums become.] [The Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of QUINTESSENCE is gaining more glory and standing.] [The more breadth and identity it gains as an Existential Authority, the more its standing will rise in comparison to other Existential Authorities!] Prompts came.","Noah's will breezed over them as the moment he arrived into the Fourth Gradation of Extremity, he saw the waters around him being much less murky.","There was now some clarity.","Around him, he could still see shackled figures, but their expressions were no longer struggling as they all held contemplative faces.","As if they had arrived at a grand stage and were much more advanced than others below them.","And yet...even they were still chained.","But Noah didn't even have the luxury to pay attention to them as the moment he arrived in this Fourth Gradation of Extremity, he was met with an influx of these less murky waters along with a terrifying pressure that caused hundreds of Rune Scriptures to emerge from his existence.","His total number quickly doubled to 6,000 before continuing their ascent upwards!","7,000.","8,000!","9,000!","9,999!","...!","When he achieved 9,999 Colorless and Cerulean Hyperversal Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures, they stopped multiplying in abundance as their light became concentrated and compressed into him.","It was the sign of yet another elevation.","[You live and breathe Quintessence and Infinity as they course through you.]","[You control Quintessence and Infinity as you are the one at the forefront of elevating their authority as for you, Quintessential and Infinity Awakening is not a true concept as it is merely your milestones.] [You have arrived at a milestone that after it is crossed, it will allow you to obtain the Quintessential Infinite Entity I Form!] WAA!","A milestone and a challenge appeared.","While it did so, Noah felt like he had also arrived at a crucial enough place to be capable of reacting and replying against the attacks thrown his way in the battle with multiple Entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity that he bore witness to Yes!","He, at the cusp of 9,999 Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures and at only the Fourth Gradation of Extremity...felt like he could actually respond against the attack of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity!","It was an intuition.","It was a challenge for the Extremity of Quintessence as he sought to utterly abolish the established norms and Scales of Power.","It was a known and established Reality that Entities of lower Gradations could never compete against those of higher Gradations.","After all, being higher in Gradation meant many more Extremity Rune Scriptures as the concepts one took to Extremity...were that much more powerful!","An Entity in the Fifth Gradation of Extremity utilizing the concept of Heat and an Entity in the First Gradation of Extremity utilizing this very same concept would produce dramatically different results.","This was the norm.","But then, there was Noah.","He held Extremity Rune Scriptures of different Colors entirely.","He held concepts that were distinguished as Existential and Quintessential!","Would they not allow him to violate some of these established norms?","HUUM!","With a glimmer of light, his vision moved once more as the scene before the horrific attacks of the Prime Devourer played out.","To massive illusory Infernal Worms with a hundred pairs of obsidian flaming wings and heads that had countless swirling jagged teeth thundered from his left and right as each one carried a collection of Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures that added up to approximately 100,000.","Each!","They weren't attacks meant for Entities at the Fourth Gradation.","They were attacks meant to heavily injure Tier 5 Hyperversal Extremities!"]},{"number":2792,"title":"Chapter 2792: Chapter 2791 Decimating the Scales of Power! VI","paragraphs":["2791 Decimating the Scales of Power! VI","Extremity Solarium was fully under the oppression of the Primogenitor of one of the Nine Infernal Extremity Lineages as even with her tremendous power, she was still stopped from aiding the being below her who faced a deadly attack.","He still had her Celestia's Havenly Protection around him, but she knew this wouldn't be enough!","At such a phenomenon, she gritted her teeth while calling out.","[Protect him!]","...!","Her words caused the minds of the Prime Devourer and Annals Inquisitor to buzz with care as their wills spread out to look around, while the Primogenitor of Talismans smiled as if she had known something all along.","And extremely close to the Annals Inquisitor, a deadly ray of verdant obsidian light holding 100,000 compressed Crimson Hyperversal Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures shot out, its appearance causing the surrounding reality to melt as its source...was a hidden and veiled Tier 5 Entity who had never shown themselves this whole time!","The weapon that Extremity Solarium brought as she intended to use this chance to truly make a Tier 5 Vacuous Extremity fall.","She stemmed from the Extremity Lineage that was given the moniker of Extremity Assassins.","The smallest Entities in existence.","The Havenly Riboviria Extremity Lineage, it was a distinguished Ancestor known as the Havenly Assassinator- Bunyavirales!","Her visage wasn't even perceived as the Annals Inquisitor bellowed out in rage, dazzling obsidian scrolls pulsing with Rune Scriptures burning around her body as they defended against the surprise attack filled with a venomous verdant light that held Rune Scriptures of SEPTICITY, CONTAGION, and DISEASE.","The Havenly Assassin then flickered towards Noah's figure to protect him from the incoming attack of the Prime Devourer.","But...this was when Noah made a move himself.","He gazed at the illusory Infernal Worms representing a heavy power behind an Infernal Lineage as among the many tools he held, his mind quickly moved as he chose a single concept of Extremity.","Unseen by others, 99 dazzling Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures of PLOT flashed over his body.","Along with it, the dense Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Plot bloomed around Noah gloriously for the first time!","The Extremity of Plot.","Its usage was endless while observing a tremendous capability.","[The Extremity Layer of Plot]:: After traversing lesser layers for an extremely short period of time, Plot has ascended to the extreme as with enough Extremity Soul Values to activate a sufficient number of its Rune Scriptures, you can actively rewrite the unfolding plot of the reality around you. After crossing the Gradations of Extremity and growing sufficiently powerful enough, you can even edit the plot of Recorded and Unrecorded Histories yet to unfold, with the only limitation being how far forward or backward in time the plot is. The cost of Soul Values and the required number of Rune Scriptures to be activated will mainly be determined depending on what unfolding plot you are trying to alter, and to what extent... A fairly simplistic description.","But its means...were best expressed in action as Noah spoke out serenely.","[These illusory amalgamations of your Extremity Lineage...will always be getting near me, and yet never reach me.] ...!","His words were undeniable and thunderous.","The moment he spoke, the 99 Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures of Plot radiated a profound light to alter reality to how he directed it!","They gauged what opposed them as seeing the hundred thousand swirling Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures within each Infernal Worm coming left and right, they judged that they needed more power.","But so far, there were only 99 Rune Scriptures of Plot.","And it was at this point that one of the qualities of the Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures unveiled itself.","The thousands of Rune Scriptures hidden within Noah's body- Quintessence included, all surged and pulsed as their Hyperversal Extremity Authority backed Plot.","And the brilliance of Plot supported by over 9,000 Rune Scriptures unfurled.","Before the eyes of all beings, nothing had happened.","There were no fluctuations of power around Noah as his Rune Scriptures and power were only visible to him.","He only spoke and asserted the reality that the illusory amalgamations of the Infernal Worms would always be getting near him, and yet never reach him!","And in the next moment...","...!","The Havenly Assassin that was coming to aid Noah stopped in her tracks.","Her small form was revealed as she looked like a devilish fae adorned in a verdant humanoid dress, with a cute face that currently blinked in shock!","She wasn't the only one as the other entities at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity felt the same thing- with the Prime Devourer feeling it the most as it was his attack that was directly involved!","In the distance, the chorus and beat from the Bard of Vitalis slowed as only the beat of the drums echoed out, even his eyes opening and watching the scene closely.","They all saw a fantastical phenomenon where the terrifying illusory Infernal Worms conjured by the Prime Devourer surged towards Noah's figure.","And they continued to roar out and surge towards Noah's figure.","[...]","They got near him.","And they got near him again.","But...they could never seem to reach him.","Visually, they felt and seemed like they were getting close to him and about to have a heavy impact, and yet...they never reached him!","In the distance, the Annals Inquisitor bellowed out in rage as she withstood the sneak attack that the Havenly Assassin had sent out.","A millisecond passed.","And another passed.","And the Infernal Words never got any closer.","And the head of the Extremity of Quintessence rose as he coldly gazed at the Prime Devourer above.","10% of his ever increasing Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values that were being altered to an even greater level right now were utilized in conjunction with all of his current Extremity Rune Scriptures to do it.","But he did.","He stopped an attack of an Entity from the Fifth Gradation of Extremity from reaching him- an attack that collectively held 200,000 Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures while he...only held 9,999 Colorless and Cerulean Hyperversal Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures!","So he gazed at the Primogenitor of one of the Nine Infernal Extremity Lineages.","And his voice thundered out as the Bard of Vitalis resumed his chorus at this very moment.","[I can already stop your attacks, O Prime Devourer.]","...!","HUUM!"]},{"number":2793,"title":"Chapter 2793: Chapter 2792 Decimating the Scales of Power! VII","paragraphs":["2792 Decimating the Scales of Power! VII","He could stop the attacks of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity!","At the same time, he had just stepped into the Fourth Gradation of Extremity.","The Entities he faced were a whole Gradations higher as their Concepts of Extremity should have been more refined.","They should have been able to suppress him and make sure that under their glory, Noah couldn't exert any power!","And yet...","It was the absolute opposite as even though he was a whole Gradation lower, the Concepts he held were of much, much greater quality.","The foundation he had been building was unequaled across Recorded and Unrecorded History as it was now all erupting together at once to propel his power.","He held Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures of much grander quality when comparing to his enemies ahead as even though within their Existence there were ranges of a few hundred thousand Rune Scriptures while he only had 9,999...he felt like he could match them.","The only thing he had to do now...was to test his limits.","Just how ridiculous were the Dead Paths he opened? Just how profound had the other Concepts he influenced become?","He could only find out by pushing and then exceeding the absolute limits. He could only find out by going wild!","And so...","HUUM!","His body began to buzz as after the passage of a mere millisecond, the 10% of his Extremity Soul Values that were required to halt the attack of a Tier 5 Entity were entirely recovered.","The cerulean glow of Infinity seemed to be entirely behind this as while gazing at the Primogenitor of an entirely Lineage who was currently bubbling with even greater power, Noah turned to the depths of his soul as he sought which concepts to use and test.","There were many.","Some were better for certain situations, others were more tyrannical, while others were a bit of both.","He...leaned more towards Tyranny as his will came to land on the Extremity of Plagiarism.","Its 17th Layer was ridiculous enough, but the 18th and final Extremity Layer...it just further added onto this maddening concept as what he could not do before, he could very much do now!","And so, he began by testing its limits.","And before he did so, he had to ensure that his enemies would not have any possible route of return.","So a part of his mind also turned to Quintessence as he did multiple things simultaneously- this time pulling up on the Records of the Extremity of Quintessence as he affirmed another feature brought forth by this concept.","It related...how Extremities could expand their concepts into domains.","But for him, he could do something absolutely crazy.","Without a delay, his voice began to thunder out.","[Quintessential Extremity Domain Expansion...]","...!","Not a normal Extremity Domain Expansion. Not yet the expansion of the Dynamis of Extremity that he needed to verify the convergence of before utilizing.","It was Quintessential.","[...Dreams.]","HUUM!","[Quintessential Extremity Domain Expansion- Apollyon.]","He uttered out twice.","After the first time, a golden light flashed as above was a hellish Infernal domain and below was a domain of life from the Tier 5 Entity of the Plantae Extremity Lineage.","But a moment after, a golden sandy glow erupted all around as it seemed like a shocking Domain was being expanded!","Another instant later, a crimson glow of hellish Apollyon also flashed as yet another supposed domain was overlapped.","But the reality causes the eyes of the Tier 5 Entities to shine as when their wills observed what was happening, they showed somberness.","They came to the conclusion that what was spreading out was no mere Extremity Domain.","It...looked extremely real.","What was unfolding was so profound that all of them in their hearts affirmed that at this very moment, two new genuine Havens were being formed!","A Haven of Dreams, and a Haven of Apollyon.","And as sandy gold mountains began to appear along with hellish crimson mountains and cosmos, the Tier 5 Entities came to realize these Havens had their backbone intricately stabilized by an uncountable number of foreign Natural Laws that would make it extremely hard if not impossible for others to leave them!","Such an action astonished them as it meant the Entity who had cast them wanted to keep everyone here.","As if he- who hadn't even achieved Extremity milliseconds ago, was not locked in this space with them.","That they were locked in here with him!","And as if to confirm this, the tyrannical will of the Extremity of Quintessence rang out again as unseen by others, over 100 Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures of Plagiarism flashed around his body.","[These amalgamations of your Extremity Lineage hold a decent power.]","His will was locked onto the massive illusions of the Infernal Worms still coming towards him and never reaching him as he continued.","[It would be a shame if such an authority was never yours to begin with.]","...!","HUUM!","The very extreme of Plagiarism buzzed with his existence.","And it was then backed by all of his other Rune Scripture as he felt immeasurable droves of Mana and now, 9% of his total Extremity Soul Values be used up!","But an instant later, the dozens of pairs of wings on the backs of the massive Infernal Worms shuddered as from their spinning jagged teeth, a Colorless light flashed.","The Runes of Devouring, Perdition, and Vacuous buzzed before another authority was imposed on them.","A Colorless light tinged with a hue of Cerulean grandeur commandeered them as a moment later, all the 100,000 Rune Scriptures within each Infernal Worm became docile as if they had lost their identities.","Thereafter, the Extremity of Quintessence pointed with his hands upwards.","And the massive amalgamations of the Lineage of the Prime Devourer...","Turned up with his beckoning as their ferocious spinning mouths filled with innumerable jagged teeth turned their target to the same being that had called them forth.","Their target changed to the being who had called the very descent of his Lineage to bring them forth!","[...]","It was cold blooded!"]},{"number":2794,"title":"Chapter 2794: Chapter 2793 Decimating the Scales of Power! VIII","paragraphs":["2793 Decimating the Scales of Power! VIII","An utterly disrespectful move was made on Noah's part as since he chose to go wild, he began moving rapidly.","While genuine Havens of Dreams and Apollyon were being forged to restrict this space, his figure breath out as his right hand pointed forward, one of the Infernal Worms shooting up and passing the figure of Extremity Solarium as it thundered onto the massive worm like figure of the Prime Devourer.","At the same time, his left hand turned into a fist as the Worm to the left felt a shocking pressure wrap around it, the Colorless and Cerulean light wrapped around its 100,000 Rune Scriptures exerting a reality altering force as the Extremity of Quintessence voiced out with confidence.","[The authority of these Extremity Rune Scriptures was always mine to begin with.]","...!","The moment his words ended, the massive Infernal Worm to his left was reduced by half in size as 50,000 Extremity Rune Scriptures of Devouring, Perdition, and Vacuous disappeared in a blinding light that was concentrated and brought into Noah's own existence.","WAP!","A domineering light flashed thereafter as a few prompts rose before him.","[You are in the process of stealing the Source of Extremity of Four Concepts.]","[When their original holder cannot stop the Extremity of Plagiarism from stealing the concepts within his Existence, they will become your concepts...as they always were to begin with.] [You have devoured a tremendous quantity of Hyperversal Extremity Authority!]","He devoured 50,000 Rune Scriptures.","Their Tier was Crimson as the light of all of these Scriptures acted like a battering ram as they were gradually turned from Crimson and into a Colorless and Cerulean light, and within Noah's body... BOOM!","The limitation of 9,999 Rune Scriptures was instantly broken as he jumped to 14,999.","And his body began to feel the resumption of the elevation of his might and power as he felt like he could do even more!","Up above...","CRACK!","Reality split as the Prime Devourer bellowed while clashing with what should have been his own power.","The impact was maddening as a burst of pressure pushed the Infernal Worm back, causing tens of thousands of Rune Scriptures to disperse as the moment they did so, a Colorless and Cerulean light covered them as they turned into a light that Noah absorbed and assimilated!","His recent moves were a shocking marvel as he was about to continue, but he wasn't alone on this battlefield.","The symphony of the Bard of Vitalis picked up in the background as a wondrous voice filled with femininity and power echoed out.","[You were an interesting one as I expected.]","The voice stemmed from the Primogenitor of Talismans as she stared at Noah with shining eyes, her hands snapping as she continued.","[Let's test just how interesting you are...]","With her snap, over ten thousand talismans appeared and burned right after as space twisted.","And a moment later, Noah's face turned cold as above him, a massive palm covered by tens of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures appeared.","To his left and right, two other palms appeared as below him, a fist manifested and came as he faced attacks on both sides- attacks that seemed to guarantee those contained in their circle would be hit and die!","And yet Noah's words rang out again as the Extremity of Plot flashed.","[I was never here.]","...!","His visage disappeared.","BOOM!","A heavy impact reverberated as it hit nothing, the wills of Tier 5 spreading out quickly to look around as they quickly discovered Noah's figure.","He...had appeared above the heavily breathing visage of the Annals Inquisitor who was wounded by the surprise attack of the Havenly Assassinator, Bunyavirales!","He moved unpredictably as the moment he appeared, the face of the Annals Inquisitor changed as she heard drastic words.","[A tenth of your Existence is already mine.]","BOOM!","Plot and Plagiarism erupted out.","The capability to alter reality and the capability to steal the very reality of others mixed together, supported by Noah's ever increasing number of Rune Scriptures as he tested his limits!","He could say what he just did, but he couldn't say something like 'Half of your existence is already mine' or 'All of your existence is already mine'.","Not yet.","Not against Tier 5 Entities.","But what he said was enough to cause a huge gash on the head of the Annals Inquisitor, her veil being torn as an exceedingly beautiful woman with bronze skin became clear to all, her eyes burning with anger and pain as the light of her very existence escaped from the huge gash on her forehead and assimilated into Noah's figure!","His Rune Scriptures went from 14,999 to 24,999 right away.","Before he could make another move, the Annals Inquisitor clasped her hands as from her, obsidian pages fluttered out that covered everything around her, causing her to be wrapped in a tight cocoon!","Before Noah could react to this...","SHIING!","The aura of a Middle Grade Armament of Extremity appeared from this cocoon in the form of a sharp fan.","The Annals Inquisitor was angered and insulted so greatly that she pulled out all the stops, the fan enlarging in size and threatening to cleave the records of the existence above her as seeing it, Noah's eyes couldn't help but shine with brilliance!","He had utilized 30% of his Extremity Soul Values collectively in the last few moves as when he looked at the appearance of this Middle Grade Armament of Extremity he couldn't help but want to be even wilder.","So he spoke out shamelessly.","[What are you doing using my own weapon against me?]","...!","His words caused astonishment to rise from the Tier 5 Entities around him as the Annals Inquisitor felt a foreboding sensation.","And an instant later, a brilliant light flashed as Noah expanded over 50% of his Extremity Soul Values to activate the might of 24,999 Extremity Rune Scriptures!","When the light faded, the black cocoon around the Annals Inquisitor was untouched, but her own weapon that she had branded with her very own soul and existence...she felt a searing pain as she gazed above to see the ridiculous Entity grasping an obsidian Fan in his hands.","It was her Middle Grade Armament of Extremity.","He unfurled it with a nod as he caused it to disappear a moment later, his mind already sending it to the depths of his soul into the transforming Infinite Forge where RUINATION would gain yet something else to devour to grow her!","His figure then looked around like an extreme menace as his recent actions caused the Tier 5 Entities to be astonished at his means and concepts of Extremity.","Weren't they...just a little too broken?"]},{"number":2795,"title":"Chapter 2795: Chapter 2794 Unshackled Tyranny! I","paragraphs":["2794 Unshackled Tyranny! I","The concepts of Extremity one held defined who they were as an Existence.","A single concept taken to Extremity and focused upon as one arduously climbed the Gradations of Extremity could take one extremely far, with a simple flaring of their concept oppressing all others!","The Esteemed Havenly and Infernal Emperors who had achieved the Fifth Gradation of Extremity knew this.","They had seen many concepts throughout their lives, but the level of concepts this one being displayed right now as they freely rebuffed multiple Tier 5s...they didn't seem normal whatsoever!","So what exactly did he expand towards Extremity?","BOOM!","The questions came and went rapidly as a battle at their stage of power was too fast.","Within the span of less than a millisecond, a move could be made.","As Extremity Solarium, the Three-Headed Emperor Lion, the Havenly Assassinator, and the Willow Tree Esteemed Havenly Emperors fully joined the battle against the Prime Devourer, Annals Inquisitor, and the Primogenitor of Talismans...all of these beings fought to of overpower others with their own concepts of Extremity.","They sought to assert their dominance as Noah's appearance...asserted his own dominance amidst all of them as he withstood attacks from all three Esteemed Infernal Emperors!","DU! DU!","The beat of the drums from the Bard of Vitalis was booming.","The bear was picking up pace.","Looking at the incredulous figure of the Annals Inquisitor who had lost her Middle Grade Armament of Extremity, Noah's eyes shone as he called upon yet another concept of Extremity.","He was already forming a sandy Haven with it all around as now, his eyes saw many possible paths he could take as he came to confirm one.","So he pulled up on the very Extreme of the concept of Dreams as he turned into a luminous golden sandy sun, this light bathing over fluttering obsidian pages forming a protective cocoon around the Annals as a moment later...these obsidian pages filled with tens of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures of VACUOUS, ANARCHOS, and DEFENSE began to change color.","They turned from Obsidian to gold gradually as the three extremes of Vacuous, Anarchos, and Defense actually became painted by a sandy gold light of dreams as they seemingly turned lethargic and sleepy- as if their very authorities were taken to the realm of Dreams!","With them in this state...Noah simply floated down as the cocoon protecting the Annals Inquisitor incredulously fluttered its now gold pages and opened up for him.","[...]","The Annals Inquisitor watched with a ferocious and burning expression as the gash on her head where 10% of her existence of her Extremity Clone had been taken away pulsed with injury, and yet her gorgeous unveiled face remained just as enticing.","As one ascended across the Gradations of Extremity, their beauty and existence only became more pristine as it was hard to find someone who wouldn't be the downfall of nations of common men!","Yet at their current stage of power, very few paid attention to looks.","To them, all that mattered was Extremity.","The enticing Annals Inquisitor gazed at Noah's visage as he seamlessly broke into her cocoon and came to float in front of her, his eyes radiating an intense sense of tyranny as even keeping her eyes on him actually gave her a sense of pressure!","His eyes were cold and calculating as she knew why this Entity was now before her.","She could sense it after the words and abnormality of the Primogenitor of Talismans recently.","She was the weakest one among the Infernal Emperors here.","This was why this Entity had appeared before her!","And after he came inches from her, his hand rose and formed into a fist as the cocoon closed, the slumbering tens of thousands of Rune Scriptures that she had called out being controlled by him to form an impenetrable Miniature Haven that was supported by a golden light in her eyes- but a Colorless light within Noah's eyes.","At the same time, 9 rings of light erupted from Noah and flashed to reinforce this Miniature Haven as both he and the Annals Inquisitor did not make a move against each other even though they were inches away!","Noah instead gave a momentary look to the far away Primogenitor of Talismans and the Prime Devourer who were facing the attacks of the Four Esteemed Havenly Emperors with Extremity Solarium in the lead before he came to focus on the Annals Inquisitor once more.","His Existence was getting strengthened, and so were the capabilities of his Body and the Nine Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction.","They were now bathed with the Colorless light of his ever increasing Rune Scriptures as their full might was yet to be quantified!","With them, the Miniature Haven of Dreams, and the tens of Thousands of Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures from the Annals Inquisitor that were now slumbering and following his commands, nobody would be able to break in for the next few milliseconds.","It was enough for him to proceed on the path he foresaw.","With a gash bleeding golden blood on her head, this Entity brought her hands down as her obsidian dress shimmered with the light of a Low Grade Armament of Extremity.","Her gaze was a cold one as she spoke.","[You are many times above what the Prime Devourer stated, and I understand why he came to try and kill you as soon as he could. Pity he failed...so let me be the first to congratulate you on your advancement and welcome you to the Gradations of Extremity.] ...!","Her gaze seemed free and unfettered as she was a being who had seen too much in both the Vitalis and Vacuous Annals of Extremity.","Noah gazed at her calmly as his body was building up power, a light she couldn't see gathering around him as for the first time since he entered the Gradations of Extremity, he was about to utilize his Soul Values and Rune Scriptures at the highest possible levels."]},{"number":2796,"title":"Chapter 2796: Chapter 2795 Unshackled Tyranny! II","paragraphs":["Seeing his demeanor, the Annals Inquisitor gave a smile while wiping the Blood away on her gash that slowly healed.","{What, did you expect me to panic at the power you portrayed? You're powerful, yes, but that's it. I am here with my Extremity Clone as even if you are capable of erasing its Records, it won't matter much to me in the end- it's an injury I can heal from within a few hundred years. But after all this...you will become known.}","WAA!","{In the upper echelons of both Vitalis and Vacuous, you will be known. You will become a target for those even more powerful. Over the next few years, I may even get to watch someone as pristine as you with all of these fancy concepts of Extremity stripped of everything before my eyes.}","...!","Her words were scathing as she was truly angered by Noah's actions of taking her Middle Grade Armament of Extremity and a tenth of the existence of her Extremity Clone!","And yet at her words, Noah shook his head as the power he had built up was enough.","{You will not get to live for another few Milliseconds, much less years.}","HUUM!","His words were utterly disrespectful ones as the Annals Inquisitor scoffed, her red lips forming into a rageful smile as she replied.","{Hah, go ahead and show off your power. I came here with an Extremity Clone knowing of the dangers as losing it is not-}","{What are you talking about?}","Her words didn't finish as Noah was looking at her quizzically as if she was confused.","And he continued as the light of the Extremity of Plot reached an unprecedented level, backed by thousands of Colorless and Cerulean Hyperversal Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures that had now broken past 29,999.","{You were never here with your Extremity Clone. You were here with your Main Body- the very vessel that contains the core of your Existence.}","....!","The smile on the Annals Inquisitor was wiped away so very quickly.","Incredulity and a sense of disbelief dawned on her face.","{Impossibl-}","BOOM!","Reality twisted and tore.","Noah felt his own existence shudder as all at once, over 70% of his Extremity Soul Values that were continuing to scale upwards exponentially these past milliseconds were used up.","All of his Rune Scriptures flashed maddeningly as they supported the utmost extreme of Plot!","And the result was that after a reality distorting flash of light, the scene before Noah now showed an unblemished visage of a woman adorned in a white battledress radiating waves of a Low Grade Armament of Extremity, her dark hair fluttering with awe as she was in a seated position with her hands outstretched.","In front of her, a slowly spinning Vacuous Planalith Krystallos came to a halt and fractured, its Refinement failing as the one who had been refining it- the Main Body of the Annals Inquisitor...gazed around with incredulity and a sense of dawning horror!","Her...her main body!","It was located in layers of veiled Records within the Vacuous Annals of Extremity as now...it suddenly appeared right in front of this terrifying existence!","The expression on the face of the Annals Inquisitor became utterly dreadful as she was no longer so calm, her body exploding out as her outstretched hands instantly conjured a flaming Low Grade Armament of Extremity in the form of an immeasurably sharp sword- tens of thousands of Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures of Anarchos burning with blazing white flames around this Sword as while being inches away, she shot its tip onto the chest of the terrifying entity before her.","His upper body was instantly set aflame as his adornments fell, the tip of the sword going towards his chest as it was about to pierce into it when...","BZZT!","The blade top trembled as if it had met an immovable and impenetrable object.","The tens of thousands of Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures of Anarchos burned out with power and cried out, and yet even they could not pierce even an inch close into the skin of this being!","His upper chest was laid bare as his muscular visage shone with brilliance.","Imperceptibly around his skin, the Innate Extremity Superius Aura blazed.","It was the Innate Extremity Superius Aura of his Unrecorded Infernal Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Superius Physiology!","Before he attained Extremity, it could protect him against up to 243 Crimson Hyperversal Infernal or Havenly Extremity Rune Scriptures.","Now as tens of thousands of Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures covered his existence and elevated everything...what his Physiology could innately defend against had grown to a shocking level.","He affirmed that tens of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures would not injure him.","Furthermore, he could feel from the strength he was borrowing from his main body that currently, his body was no longer equivalent to a Zenith Low Grade Armament of Extremity!","His body...had reached the stage equivalent to the hardness of a Middle Grade Armament of Extremity.","{...}","Middle Grade!","And it was only becoming stronger as time passed as...how could a Low Grade Armament of Extremity pierce it?","HUUM!","His right hand rose as he grabbed the sharpened edges of the Low Grade Armament of Extremity with ease.","The white flames of Anarchos did nothing to him as before the Annals Inquisitor could react, Noah's left hand flew out and clamped down onto her neck.","He gazed at her as he looked into her eyes which were losing their incredulity and slowly developing a sense of horror.","After all, her Main Body was now here.","This unfathomable Entity before her seemed to have uncountable means as she truly didn't know the extent of his capabilities!","And now as his eyes locked onto her, she felt the tyranny and coldness within them as his voice echoed out while immense pressure descended from him.","{You...will be the first.}","...!","Unfathomable waves of tyranny buzzed.","60 Milliseconds after Noah expanded his Records towards Infinity.","At this point in time, for the first time in his Recorded History...the Extremity of Quintessence caused an Entity in the Fifth Gradation of Extremity to feel a sense of fear."]},{"number":2797,"title":"Chapter 2797: Chapter 2796 Unshackled Tyranny! III","paragraphs":["Extremity Solarium and the others were fighting their own battles as when they saw the scene playing out in the cocoon of now golden pages, their shock regarding this Entity around them only rose.","His body took a direct hit from a Low Grade Armament of Extremity which was wrapped with tens of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures, and he was unfettered.","And a light of the distortion of reality occurred as paired with his words...he had somehow pulled upon the extremes of a concept to transfer the Main Body of the Annals Inquisitor here!","What a shocking capability.","What a breadth of power and battle.","When Noah went further to clasp the neck of the Annals Inquisitor, they knew a crucial moment had come as a question would soon be answered.","He showed tremendous power, yes.","But was it so obscene that he could threaten the Records and Existence of a Tier 5 Hyperversal Extremity?","Entities whose very records were veiled in layers and layers of secrecy?","Such a profound question would have shocking implications.","Other beings...did not want to see the results of such an implication.","{OOOH!}","The Prime Devourer bellowed out in his large worm like form as the very Extremes of Devouring were activated by him.","He was staking his concept and how far he had taken it towards Extremity as with him at the center, everything back to be swallowed and devoured by him as Extremity Solarium and the Havenly Assassinator changed their gazes and moved back.","In the distance, the Primogenitor of Talismans shook her head at this scene as with a contemplative gaze, she tapped on her forehead as if she was unlocking something.","As if she was setting something free.","{Mmm...I very much liked this identity...}","Her words were cryptic as a long with them, her surroundings instantly changed to become devoid of space, time, and reality itself.","And such a scene only began to spread further as around her, Rune Scriptures of VACUOUS began to dance around her en masse.","But...they weren't merely Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures.","They shone with a myriad of colors.","They emanated the grandeur of existence.","They were Polychrome Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of VACUOUS!","It showed that the power of this Entity had taken the Existential Authority of Vacuous far and even elevated it further than others like the Prime Devourer and Annals Inquisitor!","With such an unfolding might, everything around her began to change as the Three-Headed Emperor Lion and Willow Tree moved back while bellowing out, the millions of branches of the Willow Tree and her domain of Life being wiped out rapidly with the expansion of the obsidian light.","This light and the light of Devouring from the Prime Devourer all barreled towards the cocoon of golden pages reinforced by a Minor Dream Haven and 9 terrifying Wheels whose power was yet to even be unveiled.","It was a light that didn't prefer to see what results Noah would have as he had a few milliseconds at most before it arrived!","Within the cocoon, he grasped the neck of the Annals Inquisitor as if he were holding onto a molten sun, his hand constantly faced friction and bursts of power.","His left hand holding the Low Grade Armament of Extremity- the blade of the Sword she had tried to kill him with...it buzzed heavily as she still sought to reclaim its authority!","Yet Noah clamped on it tightly as its sharp blade edge...even began to bend and distort.","His thought body...was even bending and distorting a Low Grade Armament of Extremity!","This scene was utterly terrifying as with a primal howl of rage and s sense of fear, the Annals Inquisitor bellowed out while calling onto the extremes of all her Concepts.","Everything she had.","In addition to the dim Extremity Rune Scriptures she had already utilized the power of, a shocking 250,000 Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures flashed around her body to protect herself as her voice hoarsely rang out.","{Hold on. We have no life or death enmity between us, I...I have a connection with a Primogenitor exceeding the Sixth Gradation of Extremity, if you leave things as they are now, he will give you a reward- I lay my life on it!}","...!","The Annals Inquisitor had scoffed at his abilities milliseconds before.","She didn't do so now.","She realized what a terrifying predicament she was in as she instantly pulled this card!","But Noah only shook his head as after 3 milliseconds, he felt the close to 70% of his Extremity Soul Values actually fully regenerate and bring him to his peak power- their numbers even expanding upwards as more and more Rune Scriptures were formed within his existence.","{You do not have to lay your life anywhere. I will just take it now.}","HUUM!","A Colorless light flashed and converged on the Annals Inquisitor.","Her struggling body let loose and became even more frantic as her Scriptures ran wild!","But the Extremity of Dreams flowed in as instantly, tens of thousands of these Rune Scriptures began to dim and fall to slumber.","This was followed up by the Extremity of Entropy as tens of thousands of other Rune Scriptures began to rust and age, very soon becoming devoid of any identity as they actually turned into dust!","Then, the very extremes of Apocalypse and Armageddon shone.","And as if she had received a reality ending shock...","BOOOM!","The rest of her tens of thousands of Rune Scriptures defending and protecting her existence simultaneously fractured as if they were experiencing the very extremes of the End.","{Ah...}","Her eyes dimmed with an incredulous light.","The shattered and dim Scriptures began to flow out of her and sink into Noah's body as she now lay in his hands defenseless.","Her mind buzzed with shock and dismay as now...she could only rely on her means as the Annals Inquisitor as she had hidden her Records in both the Vitalis and Vacuous Annals of Extremity!"]},{"number":2798,"title":"Chapter 2798: Chapter 2797 Unshackled Tyranny! IV","paragraphs":["2797 Unshackled Tyranny! IV","She could only hope that he didn't have concepts of extremes relating to Records yet as he wouldn't be able to entirely scorch her existence or locate everywhere where she hid herself!","But...this hope in her mind was shattered the next moment as she felt this being grasp onto her records...and multiple terrifying, unfamiliar extremes began to appear one after another to track down her Recorded History.","Noah's eyes were callous as he breezed through the steps of decimating a Tier 5 Hyperversal Extremity for the first time.","First, incapacitate their defenses, then locate and erase their records.","For this...the Extremity of Providence flashed as like a virus infecting a database, Noah began to very quickly spread and discover everything that existed about the Annals Inquisitor.","She was someone along the same stage as the Seer of Sima or Seer of Avernus where they specialized in the Annals of Extremity.","Killing such beings was heard as parts of their Records may even be hidden in multiple different places.","But for Noah...","Apart from Providence, the very extremes of Destiny, Karma, Fate, and Fortune flashed simultaneously.","[Ah!]","And the Annals Inquisitor cried out sharply as she felt Noah's soul permeate across her records at such a fast pace that her soul and existence hiding within the Records of the Vacuous and Vitalis Annals of Extremity...were instantly located and laid bare.","Parts of her were located in Records of Wars within both Vacuous and Vitalis Annals.","Other parts of her were hidden in the depths of the absence of reality and time within the Vacuous Domains.","And yet, every single part was found within the span of a millisecond as five foreign extreme concepts pressed down on her existence and found utterly everything.","[Ah...]","An unbelievable sense of despondency and disbelief dawned as truly....this was not even close to anything she had imagined when accepting the job from the Prime Devourer.","She looked at the man holding her records and very life in his hands as she spoke out blankly and without power.","[Please...]","[This...this is my whole life. My whole existence. Millions of years of work. Please.]","Her Esteemed Existence and exceeding gorgeous face pleaded at Noah as he grasped her neck ever tighter.","Even with such a regal and honored Entity filled with beauty pleasing for her very life before him, the Extremity of Quintessence was unfettered as from his eyes, the very Extremes of Devouring and Loot activated from him.","[You grasp the entire Recorded History of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity in your hands.] [The Extremity of Devouring will absorb and assimilate this whole Record into your Existence to empower yourself even more!] [The Extremity of Loot flashed with brilliance.]","[The Devoured Records of the target will be enhanced and elevated as you will obtain 2x the equivalent True Records of the selected entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity.] ...!","The vast Records of the Annals Inquisitor- her very existence...it began to be pulled towards Noah in a shocking fashion as his Rune Scriptures danced wildly.","They...were about to greatly increase in number.","And yet, this wasn't all.","[The Extremity of Life and Death are triggered simultaneously.]","Within his existence, the Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures of Life and Death also came at the forefront.","[The Records of the Devoured Target are being made a copy of as after they complete the cycle of True Death, there lies a slim possibility to reactivate and bring to existence a lesser version of their Recorded History and Existence.] ...!","A terrifying progression came.","But even this was only the tip of the iceberg as within Noah, a silent but heavy concept rose as it seemed filled with emotions and indignation.","[The Extremity of the Protagonist disdains the means of Life and Death.]","WAA!","[The Extremity of the Protagonist activates its authority and imposes the feature of the Quintessential Protagonist's Bookmark.] [After a Record has had their Recorded History completely devoured, a copy of their whole existence will be generated as any Entity devoured and by you will have their existence Bookmarked as a Quintessential Extra. Quintessential Extras have all of their Records and memories before their untimely demise as based on their records, an artificially intelligent Lifeform loyal to you can be summoned and utilized.] ...!","An utterly horrific capability rose.","And yet, things were still not done!","[The Extremity of Conquest and Ascension shine with Quintessential brilliance.]","[All conquered Quintessential Extras will experience an elevation of power in comparison to their devoted Recorded History, undergoing a metamorphosis when they are first brought to fruition.] [The cost to activate and carry out the true usage of the feature of Quintessential Protagonist's Bookmark has risen to an extreme level!] It was a glorious scene.","His Concepts of Extremity were working together and overlapping their extremes to produce shocking possibilities as something as obscene as the Quintessential Protagonist's Bookmark arose.","And Noah's own actions didn't let up as after he had scored across both the Vitalis and Vacuous Annals of Extremity and obtained the Recorded History of the Annals Inquisitor, he was devouring everything and using it as fuel for himself!","The number of his Colorless Hyperversal Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures was rapidly increasing, currently exceeding 60,000 as 30% of the Recorded History of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity was devoured.","At the same time as he devoured and assimilated all of this, these very same Records were being stored as if they were a database under the feature of the Quintessential Protagonist's Bookmark.","It was a shocking process as at the same time...","BOOM!","The cocoon outside trembled.","The golden pages fluttered and began to be drawn towards the devouring light of the Prime Devourer, Extremity Solarium and the Havenly Assassinator working together to push back this devouring light of this Primogenitor as the cocoon stabilized momentarily, but the encompassing obsidian light of the Primogenitor of Talismans overwhelmed the Three-Headed Emperor Lion and Willow Tree as it reached the cocoon.","The slumbering authority within the golden pages fluttered as it began to burn.","The Minor Haven of Dreams buzzed as an Existential Authority clashed with it!","And Noah's 9 Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction began to circulate and buzz in an effort to keep away this shocking Existential Authority of Vacuous as his Colorless Hyperversal Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures blared with brilliance.","Existential Extremity Authority clashed with Existential Extremity Authority as what the hidden identity of the Cimmerian Architect revealed was extremely potent, Noah feeling a sense of repulsion as Quintessence and Infinity were slightly pushed back!","Just slightly.","But they acclimated soon after.","After all, they were two Existential Extremity Authorities facing off against one particularly potent one that has been raised for eons!","And during this short period of time, inside the cocoon, the face of Annals Inquisitor drained of all color and Lifeforce as in such a reality where she was truly having all of her Records devoured, she could only laugh in despair as her gorgeous face still couldn't believe she was in this Reality.","There were so many dreams and plans ahead of her.","So many grand ideals!","But her accepting the request of the Prime Devourer...had actually led her here!","Ah!","In the blink of an eye, her Body, Origin, and Soul that was supported by her Records and Existence began to fade as everything about them was drawn into the body of the Entity in front of her.","Unbound tyranny was all she could see in his eyes that at this moment, she couldn't even meet.","They were too pristine.","Too glorious.","The eyes of this being continued to watch as all life faded from her existence, and even in her last moments, the Annals Inquisitor didn't see any change or remorse as she welcomed a sudden end to her long life.","In her end, she was able to see a fantastical Colorless light of Quintessence.","A vast and endless cerulean light.","Thereafter, her Record came to an end.","The Records of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity came to an End at the hands of the Extremity of Quintessence who was within his first second of achieving Extremity!"]},{"number":2799,"title":"Chapter 2799: Chapter 2798 Unshackled Tyranny! V","paragraphs":["2798 Unshackled Tyranny! V","[The Extremity of Tyranny radiates profound glory.]","[The Extremity of Quintessence pulses with ever increasing majesty!]","[As an Entity at the Fourth Gradation of Extremity, you have devoured the Records of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity!] [The concepts they had forged to Extremity have their Sources saved and recorded as you can seamlessly embark on their path of Extremity.] ...!","Devouring the records of another Entity meant many things.","For Noah, it was akin to giving him premium fuel to stoke his flames as waves of Rune Scriptures were born one after another, his Existence only becoming more and more refined from this single action!","After all, it was a grand one.","The intensity of the Colorless and Cerulean Rune Scriptures only became more intense as Noah began to fully digest the Records of an Esteemed Infernal Empress!","At the same time...","[Quintessential Protagonist's Bookmark has sensed a fully devoured Recorded History and activated.]","[The Extremity of the Protagonist seeks your permission to utilize the required resources to realize and actualize its tremendous feat!] Protagonist sought to shine.","Its brightness was blinding as the capability of Quintessential Protagonist's Bookmark was so obscene in what it sought to do that its cost would be more than even when Noah brought the Main Body of the Annals Inquisitor here.","And the answer to the Protagonist came from another Concept entirely.","[The Extremity of Manadynamics pulses with glorification and gives free rein to all abilities from this point onwards.] [Every possible cost of abilities or features will be covered by the Extremity of Manadynamics by 99%, and Manadynamics will go further to manage the usage and efficiency of the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Soul Values to ensure to best possible results.] ...!","At the same time as his upper values increased exponentially, his Extremity Soul Values began to drain freely as even with the intervention of Manadynamics, the cost was still bound to be astonishing!","At the same time this process has begun...","BOOM!","The barreling power of the Polychrome Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scriptures of Vacuous shredded the golden cocoon of pages, the Minor Haven of Dreams also being pushed back as the power of the hidden identity of the Cimmerian Architect was a terrifying one!","Her action allowed them to see the scene within the destroyed cocoon clearly.","The scene that showed Noah's figure standing alone grandly while the visage of the Annals Inquisitor...was turning into stellar dust while in the spot she used to be, three shocking Hyperversal Gradation Fruits of Extremity Were blooming.","The emergence of the Hyperversal Gradation Fruits of Extremity affirmed everything clearly as only when truly power Zenith Tier 4 Entities or higher fell would something like this appear- and not one, but three Fruits of Extremity were born from the death of the Annals Inquisitor!","Seeing such a shocking scene, the melody in the surroundings turned somber and filled with a sense of loss and sadness.","After all, this was the fall of a Tier 5 Entity.","Being such as this were rare.","For those who clearly saw the lines between Vacuous and Vitalis, they could only see it as a loss!","While staring at such a scene, the visage of the hidden identity of the Cimmerian Architect held sharp eyes as her voice echoed out with contention and certainty.","[You attained an Existential Extremity Rune Scripture.]","HUUM!","Her words were filled with confidence and certainty as they caused Extremity Solarium and the other Esteemed Havenly Emperors to blaze their auras in shock.","At the same time, the Will of the Prime Devourer barreled forth with majesty to appear near the visage of the Primogenitor of Talismans, his main body in the form of the Worm like figure still devouring everything around it as an illusory humanoid form came to float near the Primogenitor of Talismans while voicing out.","[I wonder which Primogenitor is utilizing the identity of the Primogenitor of Talismans?]","His voice was calm, but one could still sense the urgency in it even with the calm facade he portrayed outwardly.","The Primogenitor of Talismans sneered while gazing at him calmly.","[Does it matter?]","Who did it matter what she was? This answer caused great disappointment in the eyes of the Prime Devourer as he nodded and continued.","[You're right, it matters not. Since this threat from the Vitalis Domains has grasped the Polychrome Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture of Vitalis and will alter the course of the ongoing war, is Primogenitor able to clear a path for me to devour him, or eradicate him yourself? He seems to only be exerting greater means of Extremity as time passes...] ...!","The Prime Devourer actually sought direction and answers from the being he invited, because he could now obviously see they weren't who said they were!","And yet the Primogenitor of Talismans didn't answer, her gaze going towards the 9 brilliant Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction and fading Dream Haven that was keeping her Existential Authority at bay.","Her reply came a millisecond later as a change began within the cocoon she couldn't yet pierce into.","[You...are asking the wrong questions.]","WAA!","Her words were cryptic as the Will of the Prime Devourer focused on the visage of Noah in the far distance, seeing an oppressive and heavy singularity beginning to form in front of him as this singularity...seemed to hold deep history and Records- records stretching for eons!","After he waved his hands and caused the Hyperversal Gradation Fruits of Extremity to disappear, the whole figure of the Extremity of Quintessence seemed focused on this forming singularity as the voice of the Primogenitor of Talismans rang out coldly to cause the Prime Devourer to turn somber.","[The question you should be asking and wondering...is whether you will even make it out of this ordeal alive.] ...!","A heavy response from the hidden identity of the Cimmerian Architect.","And one that caused the Prime Devourer's mind to buzz with possibilities!","His purpose here was to stop the advent of a being that would steer the war to an unfavorable direction.","If he couldn't do so...why would he continue to risk his life?"]},{"number":2800,"title":"Chapter 2800: Chapter 2799 Unshackled Tyranny! VI","paragraphs":["2799 Unshackled Tyranny! VI","The gaze of the Primogenitor of the Yog-Nyarvax Infernal Extremity Lineage became firm.","His worm like main body in the distance redirected it's devouring force from the broken cocoon and Esteemed Havenly Emperors as he turned up, gazing at the solid walls of forming Havens as he began to devour space, time, and reality itself.","The very extreme of Devouring was pulled upon as time seemed to be moving back before the Dream Haven was enacted, and anything that was already formed was steadily being broken down and devoured.","The Prime Devourer...was seeking to make a run for it!","At the same time, the singularity before the visage of the Extremity of Quintessence became extremely potent as within a moment, it transformed into an illusory humanoid figure.","When it appeared, even the eyes of the Cimmerian Architect opened wide.","Extremity Solarium and all the others were the same.","The Bard of Vitalis had his symphony gradually change from a somber one and into a low string of tense times as his monkey like figure also watched on closely.","They all watched and were surprised because the illusory outline stemming from the singularity that was becoming more real...looked extremely close to the visage of the Annals Inquisitor that had been granted True Death and even had three Hyperversal Gradation Fruits of Extremity from over her perishing!","It was an ecstatic scene.","And before Noah's eyes, prompts rose and fell as even with the Extremity of Manadynamics jumping in, the fuel to power the Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures of The Protagonist required 80% of his ever changing Extremity Soul Values as Conquest and Ascension sought to affirm their majesty on what was coming to fruition as well!","[The feature of Quintessential Protagonist's Bookmark has chosen Tatiana Nikolaievna, the Annals Inquisitor, as the target Quintessential Extra to summon.] [A great cost has been paid.]","His Colorless and Cerulean Hyperversal Existential and Quintessential Extremity Rune Scriptures pulsed and radiated waves of glory as they circled around his existence, the devouring and assimilation of the Records of a Tier 5 Entity boosted by the Extremity of Loot currently causing these Scriptures to approach 99,999 in totality.","Their power unfurled freely as with a glimmer of tyranny, the illusory figure born from a singularity gradually became more real!","-","[GAH!]","As if waking up from an endless dream, Tatiana Nikolaievna gasped from the depths of her soul and breathed heavily, her Records distorted as she came to.","The last she could remember...was everything about her fading.","Everything about her existence coming to an end.","And yet now, here she was again.","She could feel her record.","She could feel her existence.","What was she?","Who was she?","And her purpose was...","[Ah...]","Her mind buzzed and finally came to as she opened her eyes.","The scene around her was chaotic as a flood of information came rushing in, her eyes seeing 9 wondrously spinning Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction along with a glimmer of a golden Haven as she finally remembered her purpose.","BZZT!","Around her figure, tens of thousands of Crimson Hyperversal Infernal Extremity Rune Scriptures began to gather as she felt within the depths of her soul, a Colorless Hyperversal Quintessential Extremity Rune Scripture and a Colorless Hyperversal Existential Extremity Rune Scripture shining with utmost brightness.","She knew who they belonged to.","As the aura of an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity unfurled from her, its pressure and potency being something that even her old self could not compare to, Tatiana Nikolaievna turned around.","And she saw the Entity that had called her out here.","Seeing him, her eyes gained immense clarity as her exceedingly gorgeous figure very quickly fell to her knees.","Tatiana Nikolaievna, formerly known as the Annals Inquisitor, an Entity at the Fifth Gradation of Extremity...fell to her knees and bowed her head respectfully as she called out.","[I greet my Master. I greet the Extremity of Quintessence.]","HUUM!","She knew who she was.","She was merely an Extra in his grand tale.","A Quintessential Extra who came to be simply to listen to his orders!","So she paid her respects as 9 crimson gold Infernal Superius Wheels of Extinction swirled around them, the wills of Esteemed Havenly and Infernal Emperors seeing this progression as they couldn't help but watch gobsmacked!","At such a juncture, Noah's visage emanating endless brilliance waved his hand as his voice rang out.","[Rise.]","...!","With a glimmer of brilliance, Tatiana Nikolaievna, the first Quintessential Extra, rose and came to stand in front of the Extremity of Quintessence protectively.","Her body glowed with glory and power as she pulled upon the Concepts of Extremity from her Records, as well as the gradual changes occuring within these concepts and her very existence as a Colorless light began to spread from her very core!","With such an entity standing before Noah, his gaze remained calm as he looked out towards the distant Prime Devourer and the veiled identity of the Cimmerian Architect.","His work...was not done!","And his work was not just limited here.","There were many things for him to do- many wrongs for him right, and many paths he needed to close.","At this moment, his other bodies moved to close off certain paths.","-","Outside of the Vitalis Hyperversal Domains.","In the reality and non-reality of a war that seemed to only be the continuation of a conflict across endless eons, light and darkness clashed.","Reality and non-reality clashed.","Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Legions clashed as each force seemed ready to expand the lives of endless millions for their cause, the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms being the ones constantly ground down like ants as occasionally, those who had achieved Extremity would perish!","Across the battlefield, there were areas isolated where powerful Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremities held cataclysmic battles, the light of Armaments of Extremity spreading around madly as small squadrons of elite Extremities led by Zenith Tier 3 Entities also moved and clashed.","It was a war that by all means would last an innumerable period of time, with the rulings on just who would be the victor being hard to establish.","In such a battlefield.","From one of the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions led by a Hyperversal Savior's Ark, the devilish form of an Apex Vacuous Lifeforms began to break out of rank as he floated towards the Vacuous Hyperversal Legions in the distance.","[Aleksandr! Fall back in line!]","His actions were quickly seen by a Vacuous Extremity who bellowed out, but he was paid no heed as at this moment, the form of a Vacuous Entity adorned began to fall off, gradually revealing the visage of devilishly handsome Emperor with a dazzling cerulean robe etched with infinity symbols draping over him!","His hair was dark as it held countless mysteries within, his eyes blazing with Nine Pupils as his face was one that a decent number of Entities from the Vitalis Hyperversal Legions had seen or heard about recently.","It was the grandeur of the True Emperor of Quintessence unveiling itself freely without fear as immeasurable waves of tyranny were about to be let loose.","On the 100th millisecond after Noah stretched his Records towards Infinity, he genuinely and truly appeared in the battlefield between the Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Legions.","And his sharp gaze...seemed to be directed against a portion of the forces within the Vitalis Hyperversal Legions!"]}]);
